Integração com Git","Gerenciamento de commits eficiente","Suporte a múltiplos repositórios","Interface de usuário intuitiva","Suporte a comandos CLI"],"ru":["Интеграция с Git","Эффективное управление коммитами","Поддержка нескольких репозиториев","Интуитивно понятный интерфейс пользователя","Поддержка команд CLI"],"ar":["التكامل مع Git","إدارة Commits فعالة","دعم مستودعات متعددة","واجهة مستخدم سهلة الاستخدام","دعم أوامر CLI"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用git-commit-helper","什么是git-commit-helper","git-commit-helper替代品","git-commit-helper vs GitKraken","git-commit-helper安装","git-commit-helper设置指南","AI工具","Git提交","开发效率"],"ja":["git-commit-helperの使い方","git-commit-helperとは","git-commit-helperの代替","git-commit-helper vs GitKraken","git-commit-helperのインストール","git-commit-helperの設定ガイド","AIエージェント","Gitのコミット","開発の効率"],"ko":["git-commit-helper 사용 방법","git-commit-helper란","git-commit-helper 대안","git-commit-helper vs GitKraken","git-commit-helper 설치","git-commit-helper 설정 가이드","AI 도구","Git 커밋","개발 효율성"],"es":["herramientas de git","git-commit-helper","automatización de commits","optimización de commits","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo","git commit message","git commit template"],"fr":["outils de git","git-commit-helper","automatisation des commits","optimisation des commits","développement de logiciels","outils de développement","message de commit git","modèle de commit git"],"de":["git-tools","git-commit-helper","automatisierung von commits","optimierung von commits","software-entwicklung","entwicklungstools","git commit meldung","git commit vorlage"],"pt":["ferramenta de commit Git","como usar ferramenta de commit Git","o que é ferramenta de commit Git","ferramenta de commit Git alternative","ferramenta de commit Git vs GitKraken","instalar ferramenta de commit Git","guia de configuração da ferramenta de commit Git"],"ru":["инструмент для коммитов Git","как использовать инструмент для коммитов Git","что такое инструмент для коммитов Git","инструмент для коммитов Git alternative","инструмент для коммитов Git vs GitKraken","установить инструмент для коммитов Git","руководство по настройке инструмента для коммитов Git"],"ar":["أداة Commit Git","كيفية استخدام أداة Commit Git","ما هي أداة Commit Git","أداة Commit Git alternative","أداة Commit Git vs GitKraken","تثبيت أداة Commit Git","دليل إعداد أداة Commit Git"]}},"owner":"jyje","repo":"cluster","repoPath":"jyje/cluster","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.037Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"git-commit-helper","description":"Generate descriptive commit messages by analyzing git diffs following the projects specific policy. Use when the user asks for help writing commit messages or reviewing staged changes.","bodyPreview":"# Git Commit Helper\n\n## Instructions\n\nWhen the user requests a git commit or help with a commit message, follow these steps:\n\n1. **Analyze changes**: Review staged and unstaged changes to understand the scope and purpose of the work.\n2. **Determine Domain**: Identify the primary component or domain affected (e.g., `(nfs)`, `(open-webui)`). Use lowercase and kebab-case.\n3. **Select Type & Gitmoji**: Choose the appropriate type and its corresponding gitmoji from the table below.\n4. **Search git lo","body":"# Git Commit Helper\n\n## Instructions\n\nWhen the user requests a git commit or help with a commit message, follow these steps:\n\n1. **Analyze changes**: Review staged and unstaged changes to understand the scope and purpose of the work.\n2. **Determine Domain**: Identify the primary component or domain affected (e.g., `(nfs)`, `(open-webui)`). Use lowercase and kebab-case.\n3. **Select Type & Gitmoji**: Choose the appropriate type and its corresponding gitmoji from the table below.\n4. **Search git log**: Once the type is chosen, search git log for (1) the last 10 commits and (2) the last 10 commits of that same type (e.g. `feat`, `fix`). Use the results to keep wording and style consistent with recent history.\n5. **Draft Message**: Create the message in English using the required format.\n\n### Format\n\n```\n<gitmoji> <type>(<domain>): <title>\n\n<description>\n```\n\n- **Title**: Concise, imperative mood, lowercase after the type.\n- **Description**: Optional, explain \"why\" or provide context.\n- **Co-Authored-By**: Do **not** add a co-author line in the message. Cursor adds `Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>` automatically when the agent runs `git commit`; adding one in the message causes a duplicate.\n\n### Gitmoji & Type Mapping\n\n| Gitmoji | Type | Description |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| 🔧 | `chore` | Routine maintenance or minor corrections |\n| 🛠️ | `fix` | Intentional functional configuration changes |\n| ✨ | `feat` | New features |\n| ✏️ | `typo` | Fix a typo |\n| 🐛 | `bug` | Fix a bug |\n| ⬆️ | `dep` | Upgrade dependencies |\n| 🔐 | `security` | Add or update secrets |\n| 🗑️ | `remove` | Deprecate or clean up code |\n| ♻️ | `refactor` | Refactor code |\n| 📝 | `docs` | Add or update documentation |\n| 🎨 | `style` | Improve structure / format |\n| ⚡ | `perf` | Improve performance |\n| ✅ | `test` | Add, update, or pass tests |\n| 🔨 | `build` | Add or update development scripts |\n\n- **Skill updates**: When committing changes to this skill (e.g. under `.cursor/skills/git-commit-helper/`), do **not** use `docs`. Use `chore` for routine updates or `fix` for behavior/instruction corrections.\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. **Propose message**: Present the drafted message in a markdown code block.\n2. **Request confirmation**: Ask the user if they want to proceed with the commit.\n3. **Commit & Push**:\n   - Only execute `git commit` after explicit user approval.\n   - After committing, ask if they want to push to the remote.\n   - Only execute `git push` after receiving explicit user approval.\n\n## Additional Resources\n\n- For concrete usage examples, see [examples.md](examples.md)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:21:07.572Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing streamlined git commit message generation and analysis.","zh":"非常适合需要简化git提交消息生成和分析的开发代理。","ja":"開発エージェントがgitコミットメッセージの生成と分析を簡素化する必要がある場合に最適です。","ko":"git 커밋 메시지 생성 및 분석을 간소화해야 하는 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollo que necesitan una generación y análisis de mensajes de commit de git optimizados.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin d''une génération et d''une analyse de messages de commit git rationalisées.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungssagenten, die eine optimierte git-Commit-Nachrichtengenerierung und -analyse benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de uma geração e análise simplificada de mensagens de commit do git.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым требуется упрощенное создание и анализ сообщений коммитов git.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء التطوير الذين يحتاجون إلى إنشاء وتحليل مبسط لرسائل commit في git."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to analyze changes, determine domains, and select appropriate git commit types and gitmojis, utilizing kebab-case and lowercase for consistency, and integrating with git protocols for seamless version control.","zh":"赋予代理分析更改、确定域、选择适当的git提交类型和gitmojis，使用kebab-case和小写以保持一致性，并与git协议集成以实现无缝的版本控制。","ja":"エージェントに変更を分析し、ドメインを決定し、適切なgitコミットの種類とgitmojisを選択する権限を与え、kebab-caseと小文字を使用して一貫性を保ち、gitプロトコルと統合してバージョン管理をシームレスに行う。","ko":"에이전트가 변경 사항을 분석하고 도메인을 결정하고 적절한 git 커밋 유형과 gitmojis를 선택할 수 있게 하며, 일관성을 위해 kebab-case와 소문자를 사용하며, git 프로토콜과 통합하여 버전 관리를 무중단으로 수행합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes analizar cambios, determinar dominios y seleccionar tipos de commit de git y gitmojis adecuados, utilizando kebab-case y minúsculas para la coherencia, e integrándose con protocolos de git para un control de versiones sin problemas.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''analyser les modifications, de déterminer les domaines et de sélectionner les types de commit git et les gitmojis appropriés, en utilisant kebab-case et minuscules pour la cohérence, et en s''intégrant avec les protocoles git pour un contrôle de version sans accroc.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Änderungen zu analysieren, Domänen zu bestimmen und geeignete git-Commit-Typen und -gitmojis auszuwählen, wobei kebab-case und Kleinbuchstaben für Konsistenz verwendet werden und eine nahtlose Integration mit git-Protokollen für eine reibungslose Versionskontrolle erfolgt.","pt":"Capacita os agentes a analisar alterações, determinar domínios e selecionar os tipos de commit git e gitmojis apropriados, utilizando kebab-case e minúsculas para consistência, e integrando com protocolos git para um controle de versão contínuo.","ru":"Позволяет агентам анализировать изменения, определять домены и выбирать соответствующие типы коммитов git и gitmojis, используя kebab-case и нижний регистр для единообразия, а также интегрируясь с протоколами git для беспрерывного контроля версий.","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من تحليل التغييرات، وتحديد المجالات، واختيار أنواع commit و gitmojis المناسبة، باستخدام تنسيق kebab-case والأحرف الصغيرة للتنسيق، والدمج مع بروتوكولات git للتحكم في الإصدارات بسلاسة."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating git commit messages with accurate domain identification","Generating commit messages based on staged and unstaged changes","Standardizing commit types and gitmojis across repositories"],"zh":["使用准确的域识别自动执行git提交消息","根据暂存和未暂存的更改生成提交消息","在存储库中标准化提交类型和gitmojis"],"ja":["正確なドメイン識別を使用してgitコミットメッセージを自動化する","ステージングされた変更とステージングされていない変更に基づいてコミットメッセージを生成する","リポジトリ全体でコミットの種類とgitmojisを標準化する"],"ko":["정확한 도메인 식별을 사용하여 git 커밋 메시지를 자동화하는 것","暂存 및 暂存되지 않은 변경 사항을 기반으로 커밋 메시지를 생성하는 것","저장소 전반에서 커밋 유형과 gitmojis를 표준화하는 것"],"es":["Automatización de mensajes de commit de git con identificación de dominio precisa","Generación de mensajes de commit en función de cambios con y sin stage","Estandarización de tipos de commit y gitmojis en todos los repositorios"],"fr":["Automatisation des messages de commit git avec identification de domaine précise","Génération de messages de commit en fonction des modifications avec et sans stage","Standardisation des types de commit et des gitmojis dans tous les référentiels"],"de":["Automatisierung von git-Commit-Nachrichten mit genauer Domänenidentifizierung","Generierung von Commit-Nachrichten auf der Grundlage von geänderten und nicht geänderten Änderungen","Standardisierung von Commit-Typen und -gitmojis in allen Repositories"],"pt":["Automatização de mensagens de commit do git com identificação precisa de domínio","Geração de mensagens de commit com base em alterações staged e unstaged","Padronização de tipos de commit e gitmojis em repositórios"],"ru":["Автоматизация сообщений коммитов git с точной идентификацией домена","Создание сообщений коммитов на основе проиндексированных (staged) и непроиндексированных (unstaged) изменений","Стандартизация типов коммитов и gitmojis в репозиториях"],"ar":["أتمتة رسائل commit في git مع تحديد دقيق للمجال","إنشاء رسائل commit بناءً على التغييرات staged و unstaged","توحيد أنواع commit و gitmojis عبر المستودعات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to git repository and commit history","Limited to git version control system"],"zh":["需要访问git存储库和提交历史","仅限git版本控制系统"],"ja":["gitリポジトリとコミット履歴へのアクセスが必要","gitバージョン管理システムのみに限定される"],"ko":["git 저장소 및 커밋 기록에 대한 액세스가 필요함","git 버전 관리 시스템에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere acceso al repositorio de git y al historial de commits","Limitado al sistema de control de versiones de git"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au référentiel git et à l''historique des commits","Limité au système de contrôle de version git"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf das git-Repository und die Commit-Historie","Begrenzt auf das git-Versionssystem"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao repositório git e ao histórico de commits","Limitado ao sistema de controle de versão git"],"ru":["Требует доступ к репозиторию git и истории коммитов","Ограничено системой контроля версий git"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى مستودع git وسجل commit","يقتصر على نظام التحكم في الإصدارات git"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"f3df32dbc7ea88aadface0d25fe5473099dbe7f159eef50b93cdd77d5e43affd","qualityScore":43}');
