","ko":"reka-ui는 오픈소스의 AI 코치와 통합된 피트니스 대시보드로 개발 효율을 높여줍니다","es":"reka-ui es un coach de IA de código abierto y un tablero de fitness unificado para ayudarte a alcanzar tus objetivos","fr":"reka-ui est un coach d''IA open source et un tableau de fitness unifié pour vous aider à atteindre vos objectifs","de":"reka-ui ist ein KI-Coach mit Open-Source-Code und ein einheitliches Fitness-Dashboard, um Ihnen bei der Erreichung Ihrer Ziele zu helfen","pt":"O reka-ui é uma plataforma de treinamento de IA aberta e unificada para fitness, projetada para ajudar você a melhorar sua rotina de exercícios.","ru":"reka-ui - открытый ИИ Агент и единая панель фитнеса, предназначенная для улучшения вашей тренировочной программы.","ar":"reka-ui هي منصة التدريب الاصطناعي المفتوحة والموحدة لللياقة البدنية، مصممة لمساعدتك على تحسين نظامك الرياضي.","en":"Your open source AI coach and unified fitness dashboard."},"definition":{"en":"Your open source AI coach and unified fitness dashboard."},"features":{"zh":["开源的AI教练","统一的健身仪表盘","支持多种开发语言","易于使用的CLI接口","可扩展的插件系统","强大的开发效率提升"],"ja":["オープンソースのAIコーチ","統一されたフィットネスダッシュボード","多種の開発言語をサポート","使いやすいCLIインターフェース","拡張可能なプラグインシステム","強力な開発効率の向上"],"ko":["오픈소스의 AI 코치","통합된 피트니스 대시보드","다양한 개발 언어 지원","쉽게 사용할 수 있는 CLI 인터페이스","확장 가능한 플러그인 시스템","강력한 개발 효율성 향상"],"es":["Entrenador de IA personalizado","Tablero de fitness unificado","Seguimiento de progreso personalizado","Integración con herramientas de fitness","Código abierto y gratuito"],"fr":["Coach d''IA personnalisé","Tableau de fitness unifié","Suivi de progrès personnalisé","Intégration avec des outils de fitness","Open source et gratuit"],"de":["Personalisierter KI-Coach","Einheitliches Fitness-Dashboard","Personalisierter Fortschrittsverlauf","Integration mit Fitness-Tools","Open-Source-Code und kostenlos"],"pt":["Plataforma de treinamento de IA aberta","Painel de controle unificado para fitness","Integração com ferramentas de treinamento existentes","Personalização de planos de treinamento","Análise de desempenho e progresso"],"ru":["Открытый ИИ Агент для фитнеса","Единая панель управления для тренировок","Интеграция с существующими инструментами тренировок","Построение персонализированных планов тренировок","Анализ результатов и прогресса"],"ar":["منصة التدريب الاصطناعي المفتوحة لللياقة البدنية","لوحة تحكم موحدة للتدريبات","التكامل مع أدوات التدريب الحالية","تخصيص خطط التدريب","تحليل الأداء والتقدم"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用reka-ui","什么是AI教练","reka-ui替代品","reka-ui vs 其他AI工具","reka-ui安装","reka-ui设置指南","AI开发工具","开发效率提升"],"ja":["reka-uiの使い方","AIエージェントとは","reka-uiの代替","reka-ui vs その他のAIツール","reka-uiのインストール","reka-uiの設定ガイド","AI開発ツール","開発効率の向上"],"ko":["reka-ui 사용법","AI 에이전트란","reka-ui 대체","reka-ui vs 다른 AI 도구","reka-ui 설치","reka-ui 설정 가이드","AI 개발 도구","개발 효율성 향상"],"es":["cómo usar reka-ui","qué es un agente de IA","reka-ui alternativa","reka-ui vs otros entrenadores de IA","instalación de reka-ui","guía de configuración de reka-ui","entrenador de IA de código abierto","tablero de fitness personalizado"],"fr":["comment utiliser reka-ui","qu''est-ce qu''un agent d''IA","alternative à reka-ui","reka-ui vs d''autres coachs d''IA","installation de reka-ui","guide de configuration de reka-ui","coach d''IA open source","tableau de fitness personnalisé"],"de":["wie man reka-ui verwendet","was ist ein KI-Agent","reka-ui Alternative","reka-ui vs andere KI-Coach","Installation von reka-ui","Einrichtungsanleitung für reka-ui","KI-Coach mit Open-Source-Code","personalisiertes Fitness-Dashboard"],"pt":["como usar reka-ui","o que é reka-ui","reka-ui vs outras ferramentas de treinamento","guia de instalação do reka-ui","configuração do reka-ui","treinamento de IA para fitness","ferramentas de treinamento de IA","plataformas de fitness abertas"],"ru":["как использовать reka-ui","что такое reka-ui","reka-ui vs другие инструменты тренировок","руководство по установке reka-ui","настройка reka-ui","тренировка ИИ для фитнеса","инструменты тренировки ИИ","открытые платформы фитнеса"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام reka-ui","ما هي reka-ui","reka-ui مقابل أدوات التدريب الأخرى","دليل تثبيت reka-ui","إعداد reka-ui","تدريب الاصطناعي لللياقة البدنية","أدوات التدريب الاصطناعي","منصات اللياقة البدنية المفتوحة"]}},"owner":"hdkiller","repo":"coach","repoPath":"hdkiller/coach","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.085Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"reka-ui","description":"Use when building with Reka UI (headless Vue components) - provides component API, accessibility patterns, composition (asChild), controlled/uncontrolled state, virtualization, and styling integration. Formerly Radix Vue.","bodyPreview":"# Reka UI\n\nUnstyled, accessible Vue 3 component primitives. WAI-ARIA compliant. Previously Radix Vue.\n\n**Current version:** v2.7.0 (December 2025)\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Building headless/unstyled components from scratch\n- Need WAI-ARIA compliant components\n- Using Nuxt UI, shadcn-vue, or other Reka-based libraries\n- Implementing accessible forms, dialogs, menus, popovers\n\n**For Vue patterns:** use `vue` skill\n\n## Available Guidance\n\n| File                                                     | Topic","body":"# Reka UI\n\nUnstyled, accessible Vue 3 component primitives. WAI-ARIA compliant. Previously Radix Vue.\n\n**Current version:** v2.7.0 (December 2025)\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Building headless/unstyled components from scratch\n- Need WAI-ARIA compliant components\n- Using Nuxt UI, shadcn-vue, or other Reka-based libraries\n- Implementing accessible forms, dialogs, menus, popovers\n\n**For Vue patterns:** use `vue` skill\n\n## Available Guidance\n\n| File                                                     | Topics                                                              |\n| -------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **[references/components.md](references/components.md)** | Component index by category (Form, Date, Overlay, Menu, Data, etc.) |\n| **components/\\*.md**                                     | Per-component details (dialog.md, select.md, etc.)                  |\n\n**New guides** (see [reka-ui.com](https://reka-ui.com)): Controlled State, Inject Context, Virtualization, Migration\n\n## Usage Pattern\n\n**Load based on context:**\n\n- Component index → [references/components.md](references/components.md)\n- Specific component → [components/dialog.md](components/dialog.md), [components/select.md](components/select.md), etc.\n- For styled Nuxt components built on Reka UI → use **nuxt-ui** skill\n\n## Key Concepts\n\n| Concept                 | Description                                                           |\n| ----------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `asChild`               | Render as child element instead of wrapper, merging props/behavior    |\n| Controlled/Uncontrolled | Use `v-model` for controlled, `default*` props for uncontrolled       |\n| Parts                   | Components split into Root, Trigger, Content, Portal, etc.            |\n| `forceMount`            | Keep element in DOM for animation libraries                           |\n| Virtualization          | Optimize large lists (Combobox, Listbox, Tree) with virtual scrolling |\n| Context Injection       | Access component context from child components                        |\n\n## Installation\n\n```ts\n// nuxt.config.ts (auto-imports all components)\nexport default defineNuxtConfig({\n  modules: [''reka-ui/nuxt'']\n})\n```\n\n```ts\nimport { RekaResolver } from ''reka-ui/resolver''\n// vite.config.ts (with auto-import resolver)\nimport Components from ''unplugin-vue-components/vite''\n\nexport default defineConfig({\n  plugins: [vue(), Components({ resolvers: [RekaResolver()] })]\n})\n```\n\n## Basic Patterns\n\n```vue\n<!-- Dialog with controlled state -->\n<script setup>\n  import {\n    DialogRoot,\n    DialogTrigger,\n    DialogPortal,\n    DialogOverlay,\n    DialogContent,\n    DialogTitle,\n    DialogDescription,\n    DialogClose\n  } from ''reka-ui''\n  const open = ref(false)\n</script>\n\n<template>\n  <DialogRoot v-model:open=\"open\">\n    <DialogTrigger>Open</DialogTrigger>\n    <DialogPortal>\n      <DialogOverlay class=\"fixed inset-0 bg-black/50\" />\n      <DialogContent\n        class=\"fixed left-1/2 top-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 bg-white p-6 rounded\"\n      >\n        <DialogTitle>Title</DialogTitle>\n        <DialogDescription>Description</DialogDescription>\n        <DialogClose>Close</DialogClose>\n      </DialogContent>\n    </DialogPortal>\n  </DialogRoot>\n</template>\n```\n\n```vue\n<!-- Select with uncontrolled default -->\n<SelectRoot default-value=\"apple\">\n  <SelectTrigger>\n    <SelectValue placeholder=\"Pick fruit\" />\n  </SelectTrigger>\n  <SelectPortal>\n    <SelectContent>\n      <SelectViewport>\n        <SelectItem value=\"apple\"><SelectItemText>Apple</SelectItemText></SelectItem>\n        <SelectItem value=\"banana\"><SelectItemText>Banana</SelectItemText></SelectItem>\n      </SelectViewport>\n    </SelectContent>\n  </SelectPortal>\n</SelectRoot>\n```\n\n```vue\n<!-- asChild for custom trigger element -->\n<DialogTrigger as-child>\n  <button class=\"my-custom-button\">Open</button>\n</DialogTrigger>\n```\n\n## Recent Updates (v2.5.0-v2.7.0)\n\n- **New composables exposed**: `useLocale`, `useDirection` (v2.6.0)\n- **Select**: Added `disableOutsidePointerEvents` prop to Content\n- **Toast**: Added `disableSwipe` prop for swipe control\n- **DatePicker**: Added `closeOnSelect` property\n- **ContextMenu**: Added `pressOpenDelay` for long-press configuration\n- **Virtualization**: `estimateSize` now accepts function for Listbox/Tree (v2.7.0); supported in Combobox, Listbox, Tree\n\n## Resources\n\n- [Reka UI Docs](https://reka-ui.com)\n- [GitHub](https://github.com/unovue/reka-ui)\n- [Nuxt UI](https://ui.nuxt.com) (styled Reka components)\n- [shadcn-vue](https://www.shadcn-vue.com) (styled Reka components)\n\n---\n\n_Token efficiency: ~350 tokens base, components.md index ~100 tokens, per-component ~50-150 tokens_\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:29:47.958Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing accessible and customizable UI components with WAI-ARIA compliance.","zh":"适合需要可访问和自定义 UI 组件的前端代理，符合 WAI-ARIA 标准。","ja":"フロントエンドエージェントがアクセシブルでカスタマイズ可能な UI コンポーネントを必要とする場合に最適です。WAI-ARIA 準拠。","ko":"액세스 가능한 UI 컴포넌트와 WAI-ARIA 규격을 준수하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan componentes de interfaz de usuario accesibles y personalizables con cumplimiento de WAI-ARIA.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend ayant besoin de composants d''interface utilisateur accessibles et personnalisables avec une conformité WAI-ARIA.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die zugängliche und anpassbare Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten mit WAI-ARIA-Konformität benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agents de Frontend que precisam de componentes de UI acessíveis e personalizáveis com conformidade WAI-ARIA.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов frontend, которым необходимы доступные и настраиваемые компоненты UI с соблюдением WAI-ARIA.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوكيل الأمامي التي تحتاج إلى مكونات واجهة المستخدم القابلة للوصول والإعداد مع الامتثال ل-WAI-ARIA."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build headless and unstyled components from scratch using Vue 3, with seamless integration into Nuxt UI, shadcn-vue, or other Reka-based libraries, ensuring accessible forms, dialogs, menus, and popovers via WAI-ARIA compliant components.","zh":"使代理能够使用 Vue 3 从头开始构建无头和无样式组件，并将其无缝集成到 Nuxt UI、shadcn-vue 或其他基于 Reka 的库中，确保通过 WAI-ARIA 合规组件实现可访问的表单、对话框、菜单和弹出窗口。","ja":"エージェントが Vue 3 を使用してヘッドレスおよびスタイルのないコンポーネントをスクラッチから構築できるようにし、Nuxt UI、shadcn-vue、またはその他の Reka ベースのライブラリにシームレスに統合し、WAI-ARIA 準拠コンポーネントを介してアクセシブルなフォーム、ダイアログ、メニュー、ポップオーバーを実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 Vue 3를 사용하여 헤드리스 및 스타일이 없는 컴포넌트를 처음부터 구축할 수 있도록 하며, Nuxt UI, shadcn-vue 또는 다른 Reka 기반 라이브러리에無縫로 통합하여 WAI-ARIA 규격 컴포넌트를 통해 접근 가능한 양식, 대화 상자, 메뉴 및 팝오버를 구현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a construir componentes headless y sin estilo desde cero utilizando Vue 3, con una integración perfecta en Nuxt UI, shadcn-vue o otras bibliotecas basadas en Reka, asegurando formularios, diálogos, menús y elementos emergentes accesibles a través de componentes compatibles con WAI-ARIA.","fr":"Permet aux agents de construire des composants headless et sans style à partir de zéro en utilisant Vue 3, avec une intégration transparente dans Nuxt UI, shadcn-vue ou d''autres bibliothèques basées sur Reka, garantissant des formulaires, des dialogues, des menus et des fenêtres contextuelles accessibles via des composants conformes à WAI-ARIA.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, headless- und ungestaltete Komponenten von Grund auf mit Vue 3 zu erstellen, mit einer nahtlosen Integration in Nuxt UI, shadcn-vue oder andere auf Reka basierende Bibliotheken, um zugängliche Formulare, Dialoge, Menüs und Overlay-Elemente über WAI-ARIA-konforme Komponenten sicherzustellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir componentes headless e sem estilo do zero usando Vue 3, com integração perfeita em Nuxt UI, shadcn-vue ou outras bibliotecas baseadas em Reka, garantindo formulários, diálogos, menus e popovers acessíveis por meio de componentes compatíveis com WAI-ARIA.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать компоненты headless и без стилей с нуля, используя Vue 3, с бесшовной интеграцией в Nuxt UI, shadcn-vue или другие библиотеки на основе Reka, обеспечивая доступные формы, диалоги, меню и поповеры посредством компонентов, соответствующих WAI-ARIA.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من بناء المكونات بدون رأس أو بدون تنسيق من الصفر باستخدام Vue 3، مع التكامل السلس في Nuxt UI، shadcn-vue أو مكتبات أخرى مبنية على Reka، مما يضمن أشكالًا وصفحات حوار وقوائم وpopover يمكن الوصول إليها من خلال مكونات متوافقة مع WAI-ARIA."},"useCases":{"en":["Building accessible web applications with Reka UI","Customizing UI components for enhanced user experience","Implementing WAI-ARIA compliant dialogs and menus"],"zh":["使用 Reka UI 构建可访问的 Web 应用程序","自定义 UI 组件以增强用户体验","实施 WAI-ARIA 合规的对话框和菜单"],"ja":["Reka UI を使用してアクセシブルな Web アプリケーションを構築する","UI コンポーネントをカスタマイズしてユーザーエクスペリエンスを向上させる","WAI-ARIA 準拠のダイアログとメニューを実装する"],"ko":["Reka UI를 사용하여 접근 가능한 웹 애플리케이션을 구축하는 것","UI 컴포넌트를 사용자 지정하여 사용자 경험을 향상시키는 것","WAI-ARIA 규격의 대화 상자 및 메뉴를 구현하는 것"],"es":["Construir aplicaciones web accesibles con Reka UI","Personalizar componentes de interfaz de usuario para una experiencia de usuario mejorada","Implementar diálogos y menús compatibles con WAI-ARIA"],"fr":["Construire des applications web accessibles avec Reka UI","Personnaliser les composants d''interface utilisateur pour une expérience utilisateur améliorée","Mettre en œuvre des dialogues et des menus conformes à WAI-ARIA"],"de":["Zugängliche Webanwendungen mit Reka UI erstellen","Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten anpassen, um die Benutzererfahrung zu verbessern","WAI-ARIA-konforme Dialoge und Menüs implementieren"],"pt":["Construir aplicações web acessíveis com Reka UI","Personalizar componentes de UI para experiência de usuário aprimorada","Implementar diálogos e menus compatíveis com WAI-ARIA"],"ru":["Создание доступных веб-приложений с Reka UI","Настройка компонентов UI для улучшения пользовательского опыта","Реализация диалогов и меню, соответствующих WAI-ARIA"],"ar":["بناء تطبيقات ويب يمكن الوصول إليها مع Reka UI","تخصيص مكونات واجهة المستخدم لتجربة مستخدم محسّنة","تنفيذ حوارات وقوائم متوافقة مع WAI-ARIA"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Vue 3 compatibility","Specifically designed for building headless or unstyled components"],"zh":["需要 Vue 3 兼容性","专门设计用于构建无头或无样式组件"],"ja":["Vue 3 との互換性が必要","ヘッドレスまたはスタイルのないコンポーネントを構築するために特に設計されています"],"ko":["Vue 3와의 호환성이 필요함","헤드리스 또는 스타일이 없는 컴포넌트를 구축하기 위해 특별히 설계됨"],"es":["Requiere compatibilidad con Vue 3","Diseñado específicamente para la creación de componentes headless o sin estilo"],"fr":["Nécessite une compatibilité avec Vue 3","Conçu spécifiquement pour la création de composants headless ou sans style"],"de":["Benötigt Vue-3-Kompatibilität","Speziell für die Erstellung von headless- oder ungestalteten Komponenten konzipiert"],"pt":["Requer compatibilidade com Vue 3","Projetado especificamente para construir componentes headless ou sem estilo"],"ru":["Требует совместимости с Vue 3","Спецально разработан для создания компонентов headless или без стилей"],"ar":["يتطلب توافقًا مع Vue 3","تم تصميمه على وجه التحديد لبناء مكونات بدون رأس أو بدون تنسيق"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"397474ecdb0a6ef065def617b7df53fb714c4688d84bade4c863dbc026843817","qualityScore":43}');
