ase Mechanisms KB 대체품","Disease Mechanisms KB 와 경쟁사 비교","Disease Mechanisms KB 설치","Disease Mechanisms KB 설정 가이드","AI 애플리케이션 개발","질병 기전 연구"],"es":["herramientas de AI para desarrolladores","bases de conocimientos de enfermedades","cómo utilizar dismech-terms","dismeck-terms alternativa","dismeck-terms vs otras herramientas de AI","instalación de dismech-terms","guía de configuración de dismech-terms"],"fr":["outils d''IA pour les développeurs","bases de connaissances sur les maladies","comment utiliser dismech-terms","dismeck-terms alternative","dismeck-terms vs d''autres outils d''IA","installation de dismech-terms","guide de configuration de dismech-terms"],"de":["KI-Tools für Entwickler","Wissensdatenbanken über Krankheiten","wie man dismech-terms verwendet","dismeck-terms Alternative","dismeck-terms vs andere KI-Tools","Installation von dismech-terms","Konfigurationsanleitung für dismech-terms"],"pt":["como usar a base de conhecimento de mecanismos de doenças","o que é uma base de conhecimento de mecanismos de doenças","ferramentas de ia para saúde","alternativas à base de conhecimento de mecanismos de doenças","guias de instalação da base de conhecimento de mecanismos de doenças","configuração da base de conhecimento de mecanismos de doenças","desenvolvimento de soluções de saúde com ia","ia em saúde","tecnologias de ia para saúde"],"ru":["как использовать базу знаний механизмов заболеваний","что такое база знаний механизмов заболеваний","ИИ Агенты для здравоохранения","альтернативы базе знаний механизмов заболеваний","руководства по установке базы знаний механизмов заболеваний","настройка базы знаний механизмов заболеваний","разработка решений здравоохранения с ИИ","ИИ в здравоохранении","технологии ИИ для здравоохранения"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام قاعدة بيانات الآليات المرضية","ما هي قاعدة بيانات الآليات المرضية","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للصحة","بديلات لقاعدة بيانات الآليات المرضية","دلائل تثبيت قاعدة بيانات الآليات المرضية","تكوين قاعدة بيانات الآليات المرضية","تطوير حلول الصحة بالذكاء الاصطناعي","الذكاء الاصطناعي في الصحة","تكنولوجيا الذكاء الاصطناعي للصحة"]}},"owner":"monarch-initiative","repo":"dismech","repoPath":"monarch-initiative/dismech","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.120Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"dismech-terms","description":">","bodyPreview":"# Dismech Ontology Terms Skill\n\n## Overview\n\nAdd and validate ontology term references in the dismech disorder knowledge base. This ensures\nphenotypes, cell types, biological processes, and other entities are properly linked to\nauthoritative ontology terms with correct IDs and labels.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Adding `phenotype_term` to phenotype entries (uses HP - Human Phenotype Ontology)\n- Adding `term` to `cell_types` entries (uses CL - Cell Ontology)\n- Adding `term` to `biological_processes` entri","body":"# Dismech Ontology Terms Skill\n\n## Overview\n\nAdd and validate ontology term references in the dismech disorder knowledge base. This ensures\nphenotypes, cell types, biological processes, and other entities are properly linked to\nauthoritative ontology terms with correct IDs and labels.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Adding `phenotype_term` to phenotype entries (uses HP - Human Phenotype Ontology)\n- Adding `term` to `cell_types` entries (uses CL - Cell Ontology)\n- Adding `term` to `biological_processes` entries (uses GO - Gene Ontology)\n- Adding `disease_term` to disease entries (uses MONDO)\n- Validating existing ontology term references\n- Fixing label mismatches between preferred_term and ontology labels\n\n## Term Object Structure\n\nAll term references follow this YAML structure:\n\n```yaml\n# For phenotypes:\nphenotype_term:\n  preferred_term: <Human readable name>\n  term:\n    id: HP:XXXXXXX\n    label: <Exact HP label from ontology>\n\n# For cell types:\ncell_types:\n- preferred_term: <Human readable name>\n  term:\n    id: CL:XXXXXXX\n    label: <Exact CL label from ontology>\n\n# For biological processes:\nbiological_processes:\n- preferred_term: <Human readable name>\n  term:\n    id: GO:XXXXXXX\n    label: <Exact GO label from ontology>\n```\n\n## Ontology Lookup with OAK\n\nUse the Ontology Access Kit (OAK) to look up terms:\n\n### Exact Match\n```bash\nuv run runoak -i sqlite:obo:hp info \"seizure\"\n# Returns: HP:0001250 ! Seizure\n```\n\n### Fuzzy Search\n```bash\nuv run runoak -i sqlite:obo:hp info \"l~cognitive impairment\"\n# Returns multiple matches - select the most appropriate\n```\n\n### Get Full Term Details\n```bash\nuv run runoak -i sqlite:obo:cl info CL:0000540 -O obo\n# Returns complete term information including definition\n```\n\n### Common Ontology Prefixes\n| Ontology | Prefix | Adapter | Use For |\n|----------|--------|---------|---------|\n| Human Phenotype | HP | sqlite:obo:hp | phenotype_term |\n| Cell Ontology | CL | sqlite:obo:cl | cell_types |\n| Gene Ontology | GO | sqlite:obo:go | biological_processes |\n| MONDO Disease | MONDO | sqlite:obo:mondo | disease_term |\n| Uberon Anatomy | UBERON | sqlite:obo:uberon | anatomical locations |\n\n## Specificity Guidelines\n\n**Critical**: Always use the most specific term that accurately describes the entity:\n\n| Incorrect (too general) | Correct (specific) |\n|------------------------|-------------------|\n| CL:0000066 epithelial cell | CL:0002202 epithelial cell of tracheobronchial tree |\n| HP:0000001 All | HP:0001250 Seizure |\n| CL:0000000 cell | CL:0000540 neuron |\n\nWhen a fuzzy search returns multiple results:\n1. Review all candidates\n2. Check term definitions with `-O obo` flag\n3. Select the term that most precisely matches the biological context\n4. If no specific term exists, use the closest parent but note the limitation\n\n## Validation\n\nAfter adding terms, validate with:\n\n```bash\njust validate-terms\n```\n\nThis checks:\n- Term IDs exist in the ontology\n- Labels match the canonical ontology labels exactly\n- Required fields are present\n\n### Fixing Label Mismatches\n\nIf validation reports a label mismatch:\n```\nLABEL MISMATCH: Cholera.yaml\n  Term: HP:0003394\n  Expected: Muscle cramps\n  Actual: Muscle spasm\n```\n\nUpdate the `label` field to match the ontology''s canonical label exactly.\n\n## Batch Processing\n\nTo find entries missing term annotations:\n\n```python\nimport yaml\nimport glob\n\nfor f in glob.glob(\"kb/disorders/*.yaml\"):\n    with open(f) as file:\n        data = yaml.safe_load(file)\n    for pheno in data.get(''phenotypes'', []):\n        if ''phenotype_term'' not in pheno:\n            print(f\"{f}: {pheno.get(''name'')} - missing phenotype_term\")\n```\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Adding HPO to a Phenotype\n1. Look up term: `uv run runoak -i sqlite:obo:hp info \"l~<phenotype name>\"`\n2. Verify specificity: `uv run runoak -i sqlite:obo:hp info <HP:ID> -O obo`\n3. Add to YAML:\n   ```yaml\n   phenotype_term:\n     preferred_term: <Original Name>\n     term:\n       id: <HP:ID>\n       label: <Exact label from OAK>\n   ```\n4. Validate: `just validate-terms`\n\n### Adding CL to Cell Types\n1. Look up term: `uv run runoak -i sqlite:obo:cl info \"l~<cell type>\"`\n2. Verify specificity\n3. Add `term:` block under the cell_type entry\n4. Validate\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:39:10.141Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for Biomedical Research Agents curating structured disorder knowledge bases with proper ontology standards.","zh":"对于生物医学研究代理人来说，用于整理结构化疾病知识库的适当本体论标准至关重要。","ja":"構造化障害知識ベースを適切なオントロジー標準でキュレーションするバイオメディカルリサーチエージェントに不可欠です。","ko":"구조화된 장애 지식베이스에 대한 적절한 온톨로지 표준으로 바이오 의학 연구 에이전트를キュレ이트하는 데 필수적입니다.","es":"Esencial para Agentes de Investigación Biomédica que curan bases de conocimiento de trastornos estructurados con estándares de ontología adecuados.","fr":"Essentiel pour les agents de recherche biomédicale qui mettent en place des bases de connaissances de troubles structurés avec des normes d''ontologie appropriées.","de":"Wesentlich für Biomedizinische Forschungsagenten, die strukturierte Störungswissensbasen mit geeigneten Ontologie-Standards kuratieren.","pt":"Essencial para Agentes de Pesquisa Biomédica que organizam bases de conhecimento estruturadas de distúrbios com os padrões adequados de ontologia.","ru":"Необходимо для Агентов Биомедицинских Исследований, занимающихся курированием структурированных баз знаний о расстройствах с надлежащими стандартами онтологий.","ar":"أساسي لوكلاء الأبحاث الطبية الحيوية الذين يقومون بتنظيم قواعد المعرفة المهيكلة للاضطرابات بمعايير الأنطولوجيا المناسبة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables automated validation and linking of Human Phenotype Ontology (HP) terms for phenotypes, Cell Ontology (CL) terms for cell types, and authoritative ontology terms for biological processes, ensuring semantic consistency across medical knowledge bases.","zh":"实现对人类表型本体论（HP）术语的自动化验证和链接，用于表型，细胞本体论（CL）术语用于细胞类型，以及权威本体论术语用于生物过程，确保医疗知识库中语义的一致性。","ja":"ヒューマンフェノタイプオントロジー（HP）用語の自動検証とリンク、セルオントロジー（CL）用語のセルタイプ定義へのリンク、権威のあるオントロジー用語の生物学的プロセス用語の標準化、医療知識ベース間のオントロジーID-ラベルの一貫性の確保などを行う。","ko":"자동화된 검증 및 현상에 대한 인간 페노 타입 온톨로지 (HP) 용어, 세포 유형 정의에 대한 세포 온톨로지 (CL) 용어 및 생물학적 프로세스에 대한 권위 있는 온톨로지 용어의 연결을 통해 의료 지식베이스에서 의미적 일관성을 보장합니다.","es":"Permite la validación y vinculación automatizadas de términos de la Ontología de Fenotipo Humano (HP) para fenotipos, términos de la Ontología de Células (CL) para tipos de células y términos de ontología autorizados para procesos biológicos, garantizando la coherencia semántica en las bases de conocimiento médicas.","fr":"Permet la validation et le lien automatisés des termes de l''Ontologie des Phénotypes Humains (HP) pour les phénotypes, des termes de l''Ontologie des Cellules (CL) pour les types de cellules et des termes d''ontologie autorisés pour les processus biologiques, assurant la cohérence sémantique à travers les bases de connaissances médicales.","de":"Ermöglicht die automatisierte Überprüfung und Verknüpfung von Human Phenotype Ontology (HP)-Termen für Phänotypen, Cell Ontology (CL)-Termen für Zelltypen und autorisierten Ontologie-Termen für biologische Prozesse, um semantische Konsistenz in medizinischen Wissensbasen sicherzustellen.","pt":"Permite a validação automatizada e a vinculação de termos da Human Phenotype Ontology (HP) para fenótipos, termos da Cell Ontology (CL) para tipos celulares e termos de ontologias autoritativas para processos biológicos, garantindo consistência semântica entre as bases de conhecimento médico.","ru":"Обеспечивает автоматизированную проверку и связывание терминов Human Phenotype Ontology (HP) для фенотипов, терминов Cell Ontology (CL) для типов клеток и авторитетных онтологических терминов для биологических процессов, гарантируя семантическую согласованность в медицинских базах знаний.","ar":"يمكن من التحقق الآلي وربط مصطلحات Human Phenotype Ontology (HP) للأنماط الظاهرية، ومصطلحات Cell Ontology (CL) لأنواع الخلايا، والمصطلحات الأنطولوجية الموثوقة للعمليات البيولوجية، مما يضمن الاتساق الدلالي عبر قواعد المعرفة الطبية."},"useCases":{"en":["Validating HP term IDs for phenotype entries","Linking CL ontology terms to cell type definitions","Standardizing biological process terminology with proper ontology references","Ensuring ontology ID-label consistency in medical databases"],"zh":["验证HP术语ID用于现象条目","将CL本体论术语链接到细胞类型定义","使用适当的本体论引用标准化生物过程术语","确保医疗数据库中本体论ID-标签的一致性"],"ja":["現象エントリ用のHP用語IDの検証","セルタイプ定義へのCLオントロジー用語のリンク","適切なオントロジー参照を使用した生物学的プロセス用語の標準化","医療データベースにおけるオントロジーID-ラベルの一貫性の確保"],"ko":["현상 항목용 HP 용어 ID의 검증","셀 유형 정의에 대한 CL 온톨로지 용어의 연결","적절한 온톨로지 참조를 사용하는 생물학적 프로세스 용어의 표준화","의료 데이터베이스에서 온톨로지 ID-레이블的一貫性を確保"],"es":["Validar IDs de términos HP para entradas de fenotipos","Vincular términos de ontología CL a definiciones de tipos de células","Establecer una terminología de procesos biológicos estandarizada con referencias de ontología adecuadas","Garantizar la coherencia entre ID y etiqueta de ontología en bases de datos médicas"],"fr":["Valider les ID de termes HP pour les entrées de phénotypes","Lier les termes d''ontologie CL aux définitions de types de cellules","Normaliser la terminologie des processus biologiques avec des références d''ontologie appropriées","Assurer la cohérence entre l''ID et l''étiquette d''ontologie dans les bases de données médicales"],"de":["Überprüfen von HP-Term-IDs für Phänotyp-Einträge","Verknüpfen von CL-Ontologie-Termen mit Zelltyp-Definitionen","Standardisieren der Terminologie biologischer Prozesse mit geeigneten Ontologie-Verweisen","Sicherstellen der Konsistenz zwischen Ontologie-ID und -Bezeichnung in medizinischen Datenbanken"],"pt":["Validação de IDs de termos HP para entradas de fenótipo","Vinculação de termos de ontologia CL a definições de tipo celular","Padronização da terminologia de processos biológicos com referências de ontologia adequadas","Garantia da consistência entre ID e rótulo de ontologia em bancos de dados médicos"],"ru":["Проверка идентификаторов терминов HP для записей фенотипов","Связывание терминов онтологии CL с определениями типов клеток","Стандартизация терминологии биологических процессов с надлежащими онтологическими ссылками","Обеспечение согласованности ID и метки онтологии в медицинских базах данных"],"ar":["التحقق من معرفات مصطلحات HP لإدخالات الأنماط الظاهرية","ربط مصطلحات أنطولوجيا CL بتعريفات أنواع الخلايا","توحيد مصطلحات العمليات البيولوجية مع المراجع الأنطولوجية المناسبة","ضمان الاتساق بين معرف الأنطولوجيا والتسمية في قواعد البيانات الطبية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to dismech knowledge base structure","Limited to HP and CL ontology standards specifically","Depends on external ontology authority validation"],"zh":["需要访问dismech知识库结构","仅限HP和CL本体论标准","依赖外部本体论权威验证"],"ja":["dismech知識ベース構造へのアクセスが必要","HPおよびCLオントロジー標準のみに限定","外部オントロジー権威の検証に依存"],"ko":["dismech 지식베이스 구조에 대한 액세스가 필요","HP 및 CL 온톨로지 표준만으로 제한","외부 온톨로지 권위의 검증에 의존"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la estructura de la base de conocimiento de dismech","Limitado a los estándares de ontología HP y CL específicamente","Depende de la validación de la autoridad de ontología externa"],"fr":["Nécessite l''accès à la structure de la base de connaissances de dismech","Limité aux normes d''ontologie HP et CL spécifiquement","Dépend de la validation de l''autorité d''ontologie externe"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf die Struktur der dismech-Wissensbasen","Begrenzt auf HP- und CL-Ontologie-Standards speziell","Hängt von der Überprüfung der externen Ontologie-Autorität ab"],"pt":["Requer acesso à estrutura da base de conhecimento dismech","Limitado especificamente aos padrões de ontologia HP e CL","Depende da validação de autoridade de ontologia externa"],"ru":["Требует доступа к структуре базы знаний dismech","Ограничено конкретно стандартами онтологий HP и CL","Зависит от проверки внешним онтологическим органом"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى هيكل قاعدة المعرفة dismech","مقتصر على معايير أنطولوجيا HP و CL على وجه التحديد","يعتمد على التحقق من قبل سلطة الأنطولوجيا الخارجية"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"e63b1a790291363cc65d9ff3facd4a5d64e3547037376e7b65b6d01b9c14ecf1","qualityScore":43}');
