ng mit Tuist","von Tuist generierte Projekte","Tuist für Mobile-Entwickler"],"pt":["como usar using-tuist-generated-projects","o que é using-tuist-generated-projects","ferramentas de AI Agent para desenvolvedores móveis","using-tuist-generated-projects alternative","using-tuist-generated-projects vs outras ferramentas","instalar using-tuist-generated-projects","guia de configuração do using-tuist-generated-projects"],"ru":["как использовать ИИ Агенты для мобильных разработчиков","что такое ИИ Агенты для мобильных разработчиков","инструменты ИИ Агентов для мобильных разработчиков","ИИ Агенты для мобильных разработчиков alternative","ИИ Агенты для мобильных разработчиков vs другие инструменты","установка ИИ Агентов для мобильных разработчиков","руководство по настройке ИИ Агентов для мобильных разработчиков"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام أدوات الإي アジェنت للتنمية المتنقلة","ما هي أدوات الإي アジェنت للتنمية المتنقلة","أدوات الإي アジェنت للتنمية المتنقلة","أدوات الإي アジェنت للتنمية المتنقلة alternative","أدوات الإي アジェنت للتنمية المتنقلة vs أدوات أخرى","تثبيت أدوات الإي アジェنت للتنمية المتنقلة","دليل إعداد أدوات الإي アジェنت للتنمية المتنقلة"]}},"owner":"tuist","repo":"tuist","repoPath":"tuist/tuist","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.141Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"using-tuist-generated-projects","description":"Guides day-to-day work in Tuist-generated Xcode workspaces, including generation, build and test commands, and buildable folders. Use when working in a Tuist-generated project or when users mention `tuist generate`, `xcodebuild test`, or generated workspaces.","bodyPreview":"# Using Tuist Generated Projects\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```bash\n# Generate workspace without opening Xcode\ntuist generate --no-open\n\n# Build a scheme with xcodebuild\nxcodebuild build -workspace App.xcworkspace -scheme App\n\n# Run tests with xcodebuild\nxcodebuild test -workspace App.xcworkspace -scheme AppTests -only-testing AppTests/MyTestCase\n```\n\n## Project definition\n\n### Prefer buildable folders\n\nUse `buildableFolders` instead of `sources` and `resources` globs. Buildable folders stay synchronized","body":"# Using Tuist Generated Projects\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```bash\n# Generate workspace without opening Xcode\ntuist generate --no-open\n\n# Build a scheme with xcodebuild\nxcodebuild build -workspace App.xcworkspace -scheme App\n\n# Run tests with xcodebuild\nxcodebuild test -workspace App.xcworkspace -scheme AppTests -only-testing AppTests/MyTestCase\n```\n\n## Project definition\n\n### Prefer buildable folders\n\nUse `buildableFolders` instead of `sources` and `resources` globs. Buildable folders stay synchronized with the file system, so adding or removing files does not require regeneration.\n\n```swift\nlet target = Target(\n  name: \"App\",\n  buildableFolders: [\n    \"App/Sources\",\n    \"App/Resources\",\n  ]\n)\n```\n\n### Tag targets for focus\n\nUse target tags to group areas of the project, for example:\n\n- `tag:team:*`\n- `tag:feature:*`\n- `tag:layer:*`\n\nThese tags make it easier to scope generation and testing later.\n\nExample target metadata with tags:\n\n```swift\nlet target = Target(\n  name: \"PaymentsUI\",\n  metadata: .metadata(tags: [\n    \"tag:team:commerce\",\n    \"tag:feature:payments\",\n    \"tag:layer:ui\",\n  ])\n)\n```\n\nWhen working on a focused area, generate only what you need:\n\n```bash\ntuist generate tag:feature:payments\ntuist generate PaymentsUI PaymentsTests\n```\n\n### Align build configurations\n\nKeep build configurations aligned between the project and external dependencies. Use `PackageSettings(settings: .settings(configurations: []))` to mirror project configurations; mismatches emit warnings.\n\n## Workflows\n\n### Generate intentionally\n\n- Use `tuist generate --no-open` in automation and scripts to avoid launching Xcode.\n- Regenerate when any manifest changes (or the dependency graph changes).\n- If generation fails due to missing products, run `tuist install` to resolve dependencies and retry.\n\n### Build with xcodebuild\n\nUse `xcodebuild build` against the generated workspace and scheme.\n\n```bash\nxcodebuild build \\\n  -workspace App.xcworkspace \\\n  -scheme App \\\n  -destination \"generic/platform=iOS Simulator\"\n```\n\n### Test with xcodebuild\n\nUse `xcodebuild test` for running tests locally. Prefer it over `tuist test` because `tuist test` regenerates the project on each invocation, which slows down iteration.\n\nTo optimize test run time:\n\n- **Use `--only-testing`** to run only the specific test suite or test case you are working on, instead of the full target.\n- **Pick the scheme with the fewest compilation targets** that still includes the test target you need. This minimizes build time before tests run.\n\n```bash\n# Run a specific test suite\nxcodebuild test \\\n  -workspace App.xcworkspace \\\n  -scheme AppTests \\\n  -only-testing AppTests/MyTestSuite\n\n# Run a single test case\nxcodebuild test \\\n  -workspace App.xcworkspace \\\n  -scheme AppTests \\\n  -only-testing AppTests/MyTestSuite/testMyFunction\n```\n\n## Guidelines\n\n- Keep `buildableFolders` paths aligned to the target''s real file system layout.\n- Avoid overlapping `buildableFolders` with `sources` or `resources` globs in the same target.\n- Open Xcode manually when needed after running `tuist generate --no-open`.\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n**Static side effects warnings:** adjust product types deliberately. Use `Target.product` for local targets and `PackageSettings(productTypes:)` for external products. Making everything dynamic with `.framework` can compile and run, but it may hurt launch time. Prefer static products (static frameworks or libraries) when possible and when they do not introduce side effects.\n\n**Objective-C dependency crashes:** add `-ObjC` or `-force_load` via `OTHER_LDFLAGS` on consuming targets as needed. Reference: `https://docs.tuist.dev/en/guides/features/projects/dependencies#objectivec-dependencies`.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:43:48.189Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Mobile Dev Agents needing streamlined project generation and automation with Tuist and Xcode","zh":"适合需要使用Tuist和Xcode进行流程化项目生成和自动化的移动开发代理","ja":"TuistとXcodeを使用したプロジェクト生成と自動化の簡素化を必要とするモバイルDevエージェントに適しています","ko":"Tuist와 Xcode를 사용하여 프로젝트 생성 및 자동화를 스트리밍하는 모바일 Dev 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo móvil que necesitan una generación de proyectos y automatización optimizadas con Tuist y Xcode","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement mobile ayant besoin d''une génération de projets et d''une automatisation optimisées avec Tuist et Xcode","de":"Perfekt für Mobile Dev Agents, die eine optimierte Projektgenerierung und -automatisierung mit Tuist und Xcode benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Móvel que precisam de geração de projetos e automação simplificadas com Tuist e Xcode","ru":"Идеально подходит для Мобильных Разработчиков, которым необходима упрощенная генерация и автоматизация проектов с помощью Tuist и Xcode","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير المحمول الذي يحتاج إلى توليد مشروع وآليّة مبسطة مع Tuist و Xcode"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate and manage Tuist projects, leveraging `tuist generate` and `xcodebuild` for seamless build and test automation, while utilizing `buildableFolders` for synchronized project structure","zh":"赋予代理生成和管理Tuist项目的能力，利用`tuist generate`和`xcodebuild`进行无缝的构建和测试自动化，同时利用`buildableFolders`进行同步的项目结构","ja":"`tuist generate`と`xcodebuild`を利用してシームレスなビルドとテストの自動化を行い、`buildableFolders`を利用して同期されたプロジェクト構造を実現するTuistプロジェクトの生成と管理をエージェントに可能にする","ko":"`tuist generate`와 `xcodebuild`를 사용하여無縫な 빌드와 테스트 자동화를 제공하고, `buildableFolders`를 사용하여 동기화된 프로젝트 구조를 제공하며, 에이전트가 Tuist 프로젝트를 생성하고 관리할 수 있도록 합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar y gestionar proyectos Tuist, aprovechando `tuist generate` y `xcodebuild` para una automatización de compilación y prueba sin problemas, mientras utiliza `buildableFolders` para una estructura de proyecto sincronizada","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer et de gérer des projets Tuist, en exploitant `tuist generate` et `xcodebuild` pour une automatisation de construction et de test sans problème, tout en utilisant `buildableFolders` pour une structure de projet synchronisée","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Tuist-Projekte zu generieren und zu verwalten, indem es `tuist generate` und `xcodebuild` für eine nahtlose Build- und Testautomatisierung nutzt, während es `buildableFolders` für eine synchronisierte Projektstruktur verwendet","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar e gerenciar projetos Tuist, aproveitando `tuist generate` e `xcodebuild` para automação de compilação e teste sem interrupção, ao mesmo tempo em que utiliza `buildableFolders` para estrutura de projeto sincronizada","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать и управлять проектами Tuist, используя `tuist generate` и `xcodebuild` для бесперебойной автоматизации сборки и тестирования, а также использует `buildableFolders` для синхронизированной структуры проекта","ar":"يمنح الوكيل khảية توليد وإدارة مشاريع Tuist، مستفيداً من `tuist generate` و `xcodebuild` لآليّة بناء واختبار متواصلة، وفي الوقت نفسه يستفيد من `buildableFolders` لهيكلة مشروع متزامنة"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Xcode workspace generation with `tuist generate --no-open`","Building and testing schemes using `xcodebuild` commands","Optimizing project definitions with `buildableFolders` for improved synchronization"],"zh":["使用`tuist generate --no-open`自动化Xcode工作区生成","使用`xcodebuild`命令构建和测试方案","使用`buildableFolders`优化项目定义以改善同步"],"ja":["`tuist generate --no-open`を使用してXcodeワークスペースの生成を自動化する","`xcodebuild`コマンドを使用してスキームをビルドしてテストする","`buildableFolders`を使用してプロジェクト定義を最適化して同期を改善する"],"ko":["`tuist generate --no-open`를 사용하여 Xcode 작업공간 생성 자동화","`xcodebuild` 명령을 사용하여 스키마 빌드 및 테스트","`buildableFolders`를 사용하여 프로젝트 정의 최적화 및 동기화 개선"],"es":["Automatización de la generación de espacios de trabajo de Xcode con `tuist generate --no-open`","Compilación y prueba de esquemas utilizando comandos `xcodebuild`","Optimización de definiciones de proyecto con `buildableFolders` para una mejora de la sincronización"],"fr":["Automatisation de la génération d''espaces de travail Xcode avec `tuist generate --no-open`","Construction et test de schémas en utilisant des commandes `xcodebuild`","Optimisation des définitions de projet avec `buildableFolders` pour une amélioration de la synchronisation"],"de":["Automatisierung der Xcode-Arbeitsbereichsgenerierung mit `tuist generate --no-open`","Erstellung und Testen von Schemata mit `xcodebuild`-Befehlen","Optimierung von Projektdaten mit `buildableFolders` für eine verbesserte Synchronisation"],"pt":["Automatizar a geração de espaço de trabalho do Xcode com `tuist generate --no-open`","Construir e testar esquemas usando comandos `xcodebuild`","Otimizar definições de projeto com `buildableFolders` para sincronização aprimorada"],"ru":["Автоматизировать генерацию рабочего пространства Xcode с помощью `tuist generate --no-open`","Собирать и тестировать схемы, используя команды `xcodebuild`","Оптимизировать определения проекта с помощью `buildableFolders` для улучшения синхронизации"],"ar":["تأليفة توليد مساحة العمل في Xcode باستخدام `tuist generate --no-open`","بناء واختبار مخططات باستخدام أوامر `xcodebuild`","تحسين تعريفات المشروع باستخدام `buildableFolders` لتحسين التزامن"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Tuist installation and configuration","Xcode and xcodebuild dependency for build and test automation","Limited to projects compatible with Tuist and Xcode"],"zh":["需要Tuist安装和配置","依赖Xcode和xcodebuild进行构建和测试自动化","仅限于与Tuist和Xcode兼容的项目"],"ja":["Tuistのインストールと設定が必要","Xcodeとxcodebuildに依存してビルドとテストの自動化を行う","TuistとXcodeと互換性のあるプロジェクトに限定される"],"ko":["Tuist 설치 및 구성 필요","Xcode 및 xcodebuild 의존성으로 인한 빌드 및 테스트 자동화","Tuist 및 Xcode와 호환되는 프로젝트로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere la instalación y configuración de Tuist","Dependencia de Xcode y xcodebuild para la automatización de compilación y prueba","Limitado a proyectos compatibles con Tuist y Xcode"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation et la configuration de Tuist","Dépendance de Xcode et xcodebuild pour l''automatisation de la construction et du test","Limité aux projets compatibles avec Tuist et Xcode"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation und Konfiguration von Tuist","Abhängigkeit von Xcode und xcodebuild für die Build- und Testautomatisierung","Begrenzt auf Projekte, die mit Tuist und Xcode kompatibel sind"],"pt":["Requer instalação e configuração do Tuist","Dependência do Xcode e xcodebuild para automação de compilação e teste","Limitado a projetos compatíveis com Tuist e Xcode"],"ru":["Требует установки и настройки Tuist","Зависимость от Xcode и xcodebuild для автоматизации сборки и тестирования","Ограничен проектами, совместимыми с Tuist и Xcode"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت وضبط Tuist","اعتماد على Xcode و xcodebuild لآليّة البناء والاختبار","محدود بمشاريع متوافقة مع Tuist و Xcode"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"b378a819ded936a3a745a7ca3d93de381765d0cc627a9b4922e0d73070443846","qualityScore":43}');
