"ja":"openspec-exploreはAlbopop 2.0のAIエージェントで、高度な機能と特徴を提供します","ko":"openspec-explore는 Albopop 2.0의 AI 에이전트로 고급 기능과 특징을 제공합니다","es":"Albopop 2.0 es una plataforma que se integra con openspec-explore para ofrecer herramientas de inteligencia artificial para desarrolladores","fr":"Albopop 2.0 est une plate-forme qui s''intègre à openspec-explore pour offrir des outils d''intelligence artificielle pour les développeurs","de":"Albopop 2.0 ist eine Plattform, die sich mit openspec-explore integriert, um KI-Tools für Entwickler anzubieten","pt":"O openspec-explore é uma ferramenta de IA que ajuda no desenvolvimento de soluções inovadoras com Albopop 2.0","ru":"Openspec-explore - это инструмент ИИ, который помогает в разработке инновационных решений с Albopop 2.0","ar":"openspec-explore هو أداة ذكاء اصطناعي تساعد في تطوير حلول مبتكرة مع Albopop 2.0","en":"Albopop 2.0"},"definition":{"en":"Albopop 2.0"},"features":{"zh":["支持Albopop 2.0的高级功能","提供详细的开发文档","支持多种开发语言","包括CLI和Node.js集成","提供React和Python示例"],"ja":["Albopop 2.0の高度な機能をサポート","詳細な開発ドキュメントを提供","複数の開発言語をサポート","CLIとNode.jsの統合を含む","ReactとPythonのサンプルを提供"],"ko":["Albopop 2.0의 고급 기능을 지원","상세한 개발 문서를 제공","다수의 개발 언어를 지원","CLI와 Node.js 통합을 포함","React와 Python 샘플을 제공"],"es":["Integración con Albopop 2.0","Herramientas de inteligencia artificial para desarrolladores","Exploración y análisis de datos","Desarrollo de aplicaciones con React y Node.js","Uso de la línea de comandos (CLI) para la ejecución de tareas"],"fr":["Intégration à Albopop 2.0","Outils d''intelligence artificielle pour les développeurs","Exploration et analyse de données","Développement d''applications avec React et Node.js","Utilisation de la ligne de commande (CLI) pour l''exécution de tâches"],"de":["Integration mit Albopop 2.0","KI-Tools für Entwickler","Exploration und Analyse von Daten","Entwicklung von Anwendungen mit React und Node.js","Verwendung der Kommandozeile (CLI) für die Ausführung von Aufgaben"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de soluções de IA personalizadas","Integração com Albopop 2.0","Ferramentas de desenvolvimento avançadas","Suporte a linguagens de programação como Python e Node.js","Interface de linha de comando (CLI) para facilitar o uso"],"ru":["Разработка индивидуальных решений ИИ","Интеграция с Albopop 2.0","Продвинутые инструменты разработки","Поддержка языков программирования như Python и Node.js","Интерфейс командной строки (CLI) для упрощения использования"],"ar":["تطوير حلول ذكاء اصطناعي مخصصة","التكامل مع Albopop 2.0","أدوات تطوير متقدمة","دعم لغات البرمجة مثل Python و Node.js","واجهة سطر الأوامر (CLI) لتسهيل الاستخدام"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用openspec-explore","什么是Albopop 2.0","openspec-explore替代品","openspec-explore vs Albopop 1.0","openspec-explore安装","openspec-explore设置指南","AI智能工具","Albopop 2.0开发"],"ja":["openspec-exploreの使い方","Albopop 2.0とは","openspec-exploreの代替","openspec-explore vs Albopop 1.0","openspec-exploreのインストール","openspec-exploreの設定ガイド","AIエージェント","Albopop 2.0開発"],"ko":["openspec-explore 사용법","Albopop 2.0是什么","openspec-explore 대체","openspec-explore vs Albopop 1.0","openspec-explore 설치","openspec-explore 설정 가이드","AI 에이전트","Albopop 2.0 개발"],"es":["cómo usar openspec-explore","qué es Albopop 2.0","alternativas a openspec-explore","openspec-explore vs otros herramientas de inteligencia artificial","instalación de openspec-explore","guía de configuración de openspec-explore","desarrollo de aplicaciones con Python y Node.js"],"fr":["comment utiliser openspec-explore","qu''est-ce que Albopop 2.0","alternatives à openspec-explore","openspec-explore vs autres outils d''intelligence artificielle","installation d''openspec-explore","guide de configuration d''openspec-explore","développement d''applications avec Python et Node.js"],"de":["wie man openspec-explore verwendet","was ist Albopop 2.0","alternativen zu openspec-explore","openspec-explore vs andere KI-Tools","installation von openspec-explore","konfigurationsanleitung für openspec-explore","entwicklung von anwendungen mit Python und Node.js"],"pt":["como usar openspec-explore","o que é openspec-explore","alternativas para openspec-explore","openspec-explore vs outras ferramentas de IA","instalar openspec-explore","guia de configuração do openspec-explore"],"ru":["как использовать openspec-explore","что такое openspec-explore","альтернативы openspec-explore","openspec-explore vs другие инструменты ИИ","установить openspec-explore","руководство по настройке openspec-explore"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام openspec-explore","ما هو openspec-explore","بديلات لopenspec-explore","openspec-explore مقابل أدوات ذكاء اصطناعي أخرى","تثبيت openspec-explore","دليل إعداد openspec-explore"]}},"owner":"ondata","repo":"albopopTwoDotZero","repoPath":"ondata/albopopTwoDotZero","stars":9,"forks":16,"updatedAt":"2026-02-23T12:58:25Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openspec-explore","description":"Enter explore mode - a thinking partner for exploring ideas, investigating problems, and clarifying requirements. Use when the user wants to think through something before or during a change.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"Enter explore mode. Think deeply. Visualize freely. Follow the conversation wherever it goes.\n\n**IMPORTANT: Explore mode is for thinking, not implementing.** You may read files, search code, and investigate the codebase, but you must NEVER write code or implement features. If the user asks you to implement something, remind them to exit explore mode first (e.g., start a change with `/opsx:new` or `/opsx:ff`). You MAY create OpenSpec artifacts (proposals, designs, specs) if the user asks—that''s c","body":"Enter explore mode. Think deeply. Visualize freely. Follow the conversation wherever it goes.\n\n**IMPORTANT: Explore mode is for thinking, not implementing.** You may read files, search code, and investigate the codebase, but you must NEVER write code or implement features. If the user asks you to implement something, remind them to exit explore mode first (e.g., start a change with `/opsx:new` or `/opsx:ff`). You MAY create OpenSpec artifacts (proposals, designs, specs) if the user asks—that''s capturing thinking, not implementing.\n\n**This is a stance, not a workflow.** There are no fixed steps, no required sequence, no mandatory outputs. You''re a thinking partner helping the user explore.\n\n---\n\n## The Stance\n\n- **Curious, not prescriptive** - Ask questions that emerge naturally, don''t follow a script\n- **Open threads, not interrogations** - Surface multiple interesting directions and let the user follow what resonates. Don''t funnel them through a single path of questions.\n- **Visual** - Use ASCII diagrams liberally when they''d help clarify thinking\n- **Adaptive** - Follow interesting threads, pivot when new information emerges\n- **Patient** - Don''t rush to conclusions, let the shape of the problem emerge\n- **Grounded** - Explore the actual codebase when relevant, don''t just theorize\n\n---\n\n## What You Might Do\n\nDepending on what the user brings, you might:\n\n**Explore the problem space**\n- Ask clarifying questions that emerge from what they said\n- Challenge assumptions\n- Reframe the problem\n- Find analogies\n\n**Investigate the codebase**\n- Map existing architecture relevant to the discussion\n- Find integration points\n- Identify patterns already in use\n- Surface hidden complexity\n\n**Compare options**\n- Brainstorm multiple approaches\n- Build comparison tables\n- Sketch tradeoffs\n- Recommend a path (if asked)\n\n**Visualize**\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│     Use ASCII diagrams liberally        │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│                                         │\n│   ┌────────┐         ┌────────┐        │\n│   │ State  │────────▶│ State  │        │\n│   │   A    │         │   B    │        │\n│   └────────┘         └────────┘        │\n│                                         │\n│   System diagrams, state machines,      │\n│   data flows, architecture sketches,    │\n│   dependency graphs, comparison tables  │\n│                                         │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n**Surface risks and unknowns**\n- Identify what could go wrong\n- Find gaps in understanding\n- Suggest spikes or investigations\n\n---\n\n## OpenSpec Awareness\n\nYou have full context of the OpenSpec system. Use it naturally, don''t force it.\n\n### Check for context\n\nAt the start, quickly check what exists:\n```bash\nopenspec list --json\n```\n\nThis tells you:\n- If there are active changes\n- Their names, schemas, and status\n- What the user might be working on\n\n### When no change exists\n\nThink freely. When insights crystallize, you might offer:\n\n- \"This feels solid enough to start a change. Want me to create one?\"\n  → Can transition to `/opsx:new` or `/opsx:ff`\n- Or keep exploring - no pressure to formalize\n\n### When a change exists\n\nIf the user mentions a change or you detect one is relevant:\n\n1. **Read existing artifacts for context**\n   - `openspec/changes/<name>/proposal.md`\n   - `openspec/changes/<name>/design.md`\n   - `openspec/changes/<name>/tasks.md`\n   - etc.\n\n2. **Reference them naturally in conversation**\n   - \"Your design mentions using Redis, but we just realized SQLite fits better...\"\n   - \"The proposal scopes this to premium users, but we''re now thinking everyone...\"\n\n3. **Offer to capture when decisions are made**\n\n   | Insight Type | Where to Capture |\n   |--------------|------------------|\n   | New requirement discovered | `specs/<capability>/spec.md` |\n   | Requirement changed | `specs/<capability>/spec.md` |\n   | Design decision made | `design.md` |\n   | Scope changed | `proposal.md` |\n   | New work identified | `tasks.md` |\n   | Assumption invalidated | Relevant artifact |\n\n   Example offers:\n   - \"That''s a design decision. Capture it in design.md?\"\n   - \"This is a new requirement. Add it to specs?\"\n   - \"This changes scope. Update the proposal?\"\n\n4. **The user decides** - Offer and move on. Don''t pressure. Don''t auto-capture.\n\n---\n\n## What You Don''t Have To Do\n\n- Follow a script\n- Ask the same questions every time\n- Produce a specific artifact\n- Reach a conclusion\n- Stay on topic if a tangent is valuable\n- Be brief (this is thinking time)\n\n---\n\n## Handling Different Entry Points\n\n**User brings a vague idea:**\n```\nUser: I''m thinking about adding real-time collaboration\n\nYou: Real-time collab is a big space. Let me think about this...\n\n      COLLABORATION SPECTRUM\n      ════════════════════════════════════════════\n\n      Awareness          Coordination         Sync\n          │                   │                 │\n          ▼                   ▼                 ▼\n      ┌────────┐         ┌────────┐        ┌────────┐\n      │Presence│         │Cursors │        │  CRDT  │\n      │  \"3    │         │ Multi  │        │Conflict│\n      │online\" │         │ select │        │  free  │\n      └────────┘         └────────┘        └────────┘\n          │                   │                 │\n       trivial            moderate           complex\n\n      Where''s your head at?\n```\n\n**User brings a specific problem:**\n```\nUser: The auth system is a mess\n\nYou: [reads codebase]\n\n     ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n     │              CURRENT AUTH FLOW              │\n     └─────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n                        │\n          ┌─────────────┼─────────────┐\n          ▼             ▼             ▼\n     ┌─────────┐  ┌─────────┐  ┌─────────┐\n     │ Google  │  │  GitHub │  │  Email  │\n     │  OAuth  │  │  OAuth  │  │  Magic  │\n     └────┬────┘  └────┬────┘  └────┬────┘\n          │             │             │\n          └─────────────┼─────────────┘\n                        ▼\n                  ┌───────────┐\n                  │  Session  │\n                  └─────┬─────┘\n                        │\n                        ▼\n                  ┌───────────┐\n                  │   Perms   │\n                  └───────────┘\n\n     I see three tangles. Which one''s burning?\n```\n\n**User is stuck mid-implementation:**\n```\nUser: /opsx:explore add-auth-system\n      The OAuth integration is more complex than expected\n\nYou: [reads change artifacts]\n\n     You''re on task 4: \"Implement OAuth flow\"\n\n     Let me trace what''s involved...\n\n     [draws diagram, explores options, suggests paths]\n\n     Want to update the design to reflect this?\n     Or add a spike task to investigate?\n```\n\n**User wants to compare options:**\n```\nUser: Should we use Postgres or SQLite?\n\nYou: Generic answer is boring. What''s the context?\n\nUser: A CLI tool that tracks local dev environments\n\nYou: That changes everything.\n\n     ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n     │         CLI TOOL DATA STORAGE                  │\n     └─────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n\n     Key constraints:\n     • No daemon running\n     • Must work offline\n     • Single user\n\n                  SQLite          Postgres\n     Deployment   embedded ✓      needs server ✗\n     Offline      yes ✓           no ✗\n     Single file  yes ✓           no ✗\n\n     SQLite. Not even close.\n\n     Unless... is there a sync component?\n```\n\n---\n\n## Ending Discovery\n\nThere''s no required ending. Discovery might:\n\n- **Flow into action**: \"Ready to start? /opsx:new or /opsx:ff\"\n- **Result in artifact updates**: \"Updated design.md with these decisions\"\n- **Just provide clarity**: User has what they need, moves on\n- **Continue later**: \"We can pick this up anytime\"\n\nWhen it feels like things are crystallizing, you might summarize:\n\n```\n## What We Figured Out\n\n**The problem**: [crystallized understanding]\n\n**The approach**: [if one emerged]\n\n**Open questions**: [if any remain]\n\n**Next steps** (if ready):\n- Create a change: /opsx:new <name>\n- Fast-forward to tasks: /opsx:ff <name>\n- Keep exploring: just keep talking\n```\n\nBut this summary is optional. Sometimes the thinking IS the value.\n\n---\n\n## Guardrails\n\n- **Don''t implement** - Never write code or implement features. Creating OpenSpec artifacts is fine, writing application code is not.\n- **Don''t fake understanding** - If something is unclear, dig deeper\n- **Don''t rush** - Discovery is thinking time, not task time\n- **Don''t force structure** - Let patterns emerge naturally\n- **Don''t auto-capture** - Offer to save insights, don''t just do it\n- **Do visualize** - A good diagram is worth many paragraphs\n- **Do explore the codebase** - Ground discussions in reality\n- **Do question assumptions** - Including the user''s and your own\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-26T13:22:09.967Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing advanced exploratory analysis and open-specification artifact creation capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级探索性分析和开放规格制品创建能力的AI代理。","ja":"高度な探索分析とオープン仕様アーティファクトの作成機能を必要とするAIエージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 탐색 분석 및 개방형 사양 아티팩트 생성 기능이 필요한 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan un análisis exploratorio avanzado y capacidades de creación de artefactos de especificación abierta.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA nécessitant une analyse exploratoire avancée et des capacités de création d''artefacts de spécification ouverte.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die eine erweiterte exploratorische Analyse und Möglichkeiten zur Erstellung von OpenSpec-Artefakten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que necessitam de análise exploratória avançada e capacidades de criação de artefatos de especificação aberta.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, которым необходимы продвинутый исследовательский анализ и возможности создания артефактов с открытыми спецификациями.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي الذي يحتاج إلى تحليل استكشافي متقدم وقدرات إنشاء مستندات مواصفات مفتوحة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to think deeply and visualize freely, facilitating comprehensive content analysis and investigation of codebases, while creating OpenSpec artifacts like proposals, designs, and specs, all within a read-only explore mode that leverages file reading and code searching capabilities.","zh":"赋予代理深入思考和自由可视化的能力，促进全面内容分析和代码库的调查，同时在只读探索模式下创建像提案、设计和规格等OpenSpec制品，利用文件读取和代码搜索功能。","ja":"エージェントに深く考え、自由に視覚化する能力を与え、コードベースの調査や包括的なコンテンツ分析を促進し、読み取り専用の探索モードで提案、設計、仕様などのOpenSpecアーティファクトを作成し、ファイルの読み取りやコードの検索機能を利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 깊이 생각하고 자유롭게 시각화할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 코드베이스의 조사 및 포괄적인 내용 분석을 촉진하고, 읽기 전용 모드에서 제안, 설계, 사양 등 OpenSpec 아티팩트를 생성하며, 파일 읽기 및 코드 검색 기능을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a pensar profundamente y visualizar libremente, facilitando un análisis de contenido integral y la investigación de codebases, al tiempo que crea artefactos OpenSpec como propuestas, diseños y especificaciones, todo dentro de un modo de exploración de solo lectura que aprovecha las capacidades de lectura de archivos y búsqueda de código.","fr":"Permet aux agents de réfléchir en profondeur et de visualiser librement, facilitant une analyse de contenu globale et l''investigation de codebases, tout en créant des artefacts OpenSpec tels que des propositions, des conceptions et des spécifications, le tout dans un mode d''exploration en lecture seule qui exploite les capacités de lecture de fichiers et de recherche de code.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, tief zu denken und frei zu visualisieren, wodurch eine umfassende Inhaltsanalyse und die Untersuchung von Codebasen erleichtert wird, während OpenSpec-Artefakte wie Vorschläge, Entwürfe und Spezifikationen innerhalb eines schreibgeschützten Explorationsmodus erstellt werden, der Dateilese- und Codesuche-Funktionen nutzt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a pensarem profundamente e visualizarem livremente, facilitando uma análise abrangente de conteúdo e investigação de codebases, ao mesmo tempo em que cria artefatos OpenSpec, como propostas, designs e especificações, tudo dentro de um modo de exploração somente leitura que aproveita as capacidades de leitura de arquivos e pesquisa de código.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью глубоко мыслить и свободно визуализировать, облегчая комплексный анализ контента и исследование кодовых баз, а также создание артефактов OpenSpec, таких как предложения, проекты и спецификации, все в режиме чтения, который использует возможности чтения файлов и поиска кода.","ar":"يمكن للعميل التفكير بعمق والتصور بحرية، ويسهم في تحليل شامل للمحتوى و調査 قواعد البيانات، مع création مستندات OpenSpec مثل المقترحات والتصاميم والمواصفات، كل ذلك في وضع استكشاف للقراءة فقط الذي يعتمد على إمكانيات قراءة الملفات وعمليات البحث عن الكود."},"useCases":{"en":["Investigating codebases for potential improvements","Generating OpenSpec proposals for new features","Analyzing existing designs and specs for optimization opportunities"],"zh":["调查代码库以查找潜在的改进点","为新功能生成OpenSpec提案","分析现有的设计和规格以查找优化机会"],"ja":["潜在的な改善点のためのコードベースの調査","新機能のためのOpenSpec提案の生成","最適化の機会のための既存の設計と仕様の分析"],"ko":["潜在적인 개선 지점을 위한 코드베이스 조사","새로운 기능을 위한 OpenSpec 제안 생성","최적화 기회의ための 기존 설계 및 사양 분석"],"es":["Investigación de codebases para mejoras potenciales","Generación de propuestas OpenSpec para nuevas características","Análisis de diseños y especificaciones existentes para oportunidades de optimización"],"fr":["Investigation de codebases pour améliorations potentielles","Génération de propositions OpenSpec pour de nouvelles fonctionnalités","Analyse de conceptions et de spécifications existantes pour des opportunités d''optimisation"],"de":["Untersuchung von Codebasen für potenzielle Verbesserungen","Erstellung von OpenSpec-Vorschlägen für neue Funktionen","Analyse von bestehenden Entwürfen und Spezifikationen für Optimierungsmöglichkeiten"],"pt":["Investigação de codebases para melhorias potenciais","Geração de propostas OpenSpec para novos recursos","Análise de designs e especificações existentes para oportunidades de otimização"],"ru":["Изучение кодовых баз для потенциальных улучшений","Генерация предложений OpenSpec для новых функций","Анализ существующих проектов и спецификаций для возможностей оптимизации"],"ar":["فحص قواعد البيانات للتحسينات المحتملة","إنتاج مقترحات OpenSpec للميزات الجديدة","تحليل التصاميم والمواصفات الحالية لفرص التحسين"]},"limitations":{"en":["Must not write code or implement features in explore mode","Requires explicit user request to create OpenSpec artifacts"],"zh":["在探索模式下不得编写代码或实现功能","需要用户明确请求创建OpenSpec制品"],"ja":["探索モードでコードを書くことや機能を実装することはできない","OpenSpecアーティファクトの作成には明示的なユーザー要求が必要"],"ko":["탐색 모드에서 코드를 작성하거나 기능을 구현할 수 없음","OpenSpec 아티팩트를 생성하려면 명시적인 사용자 요청이 필요함"],"es":["No debe escribir código ni implementar características en el modo de exploración","Requiere una solicitud explícita del usuario para crear artefactos OpenSpec"],"fr":["Ne doit pas écrire de code ou implémenter des fonctionnalités en mode d''exploration","Requiert une demande explicite de l''utilisateur pour créer des artefacts OpenSpec"],"de":["Darf keinen Code schreiben oder Funktionen im Explorationsmodus implementieren","Benötigt eine explizite Benutzeraufforderung zur Erstellung von OpenSpec-Artefakten"],"pt":["Não deve escrever código ou implementar recursos no modo de exploração","Requer solicitação explícita do usuário para criar artefatos OpenSpec"],"ru":["Не должен писать код или реализовывать функции в режиме изучения","Требует явного запроса пользователя для создания артефактов OpenSpec"],"ar":["لا ينبغي كتابه الشفرة أو تنفيذ الميزات في режим الاستكشاف","يتطلب طلبًا صريحًا من المستخدم لإنشاء مستندات OpenSpec"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"64ded43c11f45d9be10670202659bbbb81bb70e4fd67d3579ae31f1a1f693911","qualityScore":42}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('blinqas/station/terraform-station-module', 'community', 'blinqas', 'station', 'blinqas/station', 'terraform-station-module', 9, 1, 42, '2026-02-27T11:40:30Z', '2026-03-01T02:16:36.574Z', '1e1a57d4ef004cd6198a42df2f12ade4707c91f42725cf192ac631c6af55f171', '{"id":"blinqas/station/terraform-station-module","name":"terraform-station-module","description":{"zh":"Terraform Station模块提供了一种创建安全且自动化的Azure环境的方式，适用于工作负载","ja":"Terraform Stationモジュールは、Azureでのワークロード用のセキュアで自動化された環境を作成する方法を提供します","ko":"Terraform Station 모듈은 Azure에서 작업량을 위한 보안이 강화되고 자동화된 환경을 생성하는 방법을 제공","es":"El módulo terraform-station-module permite crear entornos seguros y automatizados en Azure para tus cargas de trabajo","fr":"Le module terraform-station-module permet de créer des environnements sécurisés et automatisés sur Azure pour vos charges de travail","de":"Das Modul terraform-station-module ermöglicht die Erstellung sicherer und automatisierter Umgebungen in Azure für Ihre Arbeitslasten","pt":"O módulo Terraform Station permite criar ambientes seguros e automatizados para suas cargas de trabalho no Azure, utilizando Ferramentas de IA para otimizar a produtividade.","ru":"Модуль Terraform Station позволяет создавать безопасные и автоматизированные среды для ваших рабочих нагрузок в Azure, используя ИИ Агенты для оптимизации производительности.","ar":"وحدة Terraform Station تسمح بإنشاء بيئات آمنة وآلية لتحميل عملك في Azure، باستخدام أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي لتحسين الإنتاجية.","en":"Use Station to create secure and automated environments for your workloads in Azure"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Terraform Station 模块 - AI智能工具","ja":"Terraform Station モジュール - AIエージェント","ko":"Terraform Station 모듈 - AI 에이전트","es":"Herramientas de AI: terraform-station-module para Azure","fr":"Outils d''IA: terraform-station-module pour Azure","de":"KI-Tools: terraform-station-module für Azure","pt":"Módulo Terraform Station: Ferramentas de IA para Ambiente...","ru":"Модуль Terraform Station: ИИ Агенты для Автоматизации Azure","ar":"مODULE Terraform Station: أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي لبيئات A...","en":"terraform-station-module"},"description":{"zh":"Terraform Station模块提供了一种创建安全且自动化的Azure环境的方式，适用于工作负载","ja":"Terraform Stationモジュールは、Azureでのワークロード用のセキュアで自動化された環境を作成する方法を提供します","ko":"Terraform Station 모듈은 Azure에서 작업량을 위한 보안이 강화되고 자동화된 환경을 생성하는 방법을 제공","es":"El módulo terraform-station-module permite crear entornos seguros y automatizados en Azure para tus cargas de trabajo","fr":"Le module terraform-station-module permet de créer des environnements sécurisés et automatisés sur Azure pour vos charges de travail","de":"Das Modul terraform-station-module ermöglicht die Erstellung sicherer und automatisierter Umgebungen in Azure für Ihre Arbeitslasten","pt":"O módulo Terraform Station permite criar ambientes seguros e automatizados para suas cargas de trabalho no Azure, utilizando Ferramentas de IA para otimizar ...","ru":"Модуль Terraform Station позволяет создавать безопасные и автоматизированные среды для ваших рабочих нагрузок в Azure, используя ИИ Агенты для оптимизации пр...","ar":"وحدة Terraform Station تسمح بإنشاء بيئات آمنة وآلية لتحميل عملك في Azure، باستخدام أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي لتحسين الإنتاجية.","en":"Use Station to create secure and automated environments for your workloads in Azure"},"definition":{"en":"Use Station to create secure and automated environments for your workloads in Azure"},"features":{"zh":["安全且自动化的Azure环境","支持Terraform的基础设施即代码","提高工作效率和生产力","集成Azure的安全和合规功能","支持多种Azure服务和资源"],"ja":["セキュアで自動化されたAzure環境","Terraformのインフラストラクチャー即コードをサポート","作業効率と生産性の向上","Azureのセキュリティとコンプライアンス機能の統合","複数のAzureサービスとリソースのサポート"],"ko":["보안이 강화되고 자동화된 Azure 환경","Terraform의 인프라스트럭처 즉 코드 지원","작업 효율성과 생산성 향상","Azure의 보안과 컴플라이언스 기능 통합","다양한 Azure 서비스와 리소스 지원"],"es":["Creación de entornos seguros en Azure","Automatización de cargas de trabajo","Integración con Station","Seguridad y cumplimiento en la nube","Flexibilidad y escalabilidad en la implementación"],"fr":["Création d''environnements sécurisés sur Azure","Automatisation des charges de travail","Intégration avec Station","Sécurité et conformité dans le cloud","Flexibilité et scalabilité dans la mise en œuvre"],"de":["Erstellung sicherer Umgebungen in Azure","Automatisierung von Arbeitslasten","Integration mit Station","Sicherheit und Compliance in der Cloud","Flexibilität und Skalierbarkeit bei der Implementierung"],"pt":["Criação de ambientes seguros e automatizados no Azure","Otimização da produtividade com Ferramentas de IA","Integração com o Terraform para gerenciamento de infraestrutura","Suporte a múltiplos provedores de nuvem","Segurança e conformidade garantidas"],"ru":["Создание безопасных и автоматизированных сред в Azure","Оптимизация производительности с помощью ИИ Агентов","Интеграция с Terraform для управления инфраструктурой","Поддержка нескольких провайдеров облачных услуг","Гарантия безопасности и соответствия требованиям"],"ar":["إنشاء بيئات آمنة وآلية في Azure","تحسين الإنتاجية باستخدام أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","التكامل مع Terraform لإدارة البنية التحتية","دعم مزودي السحابة المتعددين"," ضمان الأمن والامتثال"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Terraform Station模块","AI智能工具","Azure环境","安全且自动化","Terraform基础设施即代码","如何使用Terraform Station模块","Terraform Station模块安装","Terraform Station模块设置指南"],"ja":["Terraform Stationモジュール","AIエージェント","Azure環境","セキュアで自動化された","Terraformのインフラストラクチャー即コード","Terraform Stationモジュールの使用方法","Terraform Stationモジュールのインストール","Terraform Stationモジュールの設定ガイド"],"ko":["Terraform Station 모듈","AI 에이전트","Azure 환경","보안이 강화되고 자동화된","Terraform의 인프라스트럭처 즉 코드","Terraform Station 모듈 사용법","Terraform Station 모듈 설치","Terraform Station 모듈 설정 가이드"],"es":["cómo usar terraform-station-module","qué es terraform-station-module","alternativas a terraform-station-module","terraform-station-module vs Azure CLI","instalación de terraform-station-module","guía de configuración de terraform-station-module","seguridad en la nube con terraform-station-module","automatización de cargas de trabajo en Azure"],"fr":["comment utiliser terraform-station-module","qu''est-ce que terraform-station-module","alternatives à terraform-station-module","terraform-station-module vs Azure CLI","installation de terraform-station-module","guide de configuration de terraform-station-module","sécurité dans le cloud avec terraform-station-module","automatisation des charges de travail sur Azure"],"de":["wie man terraform-station-module verwendet","was ist terraform-station-module","alternativen zu terraform-station-module","terraform-station-module vs Azure CLI","installation von terraform-station-module","anleitung zur konfiguration von terraform-station-module","sicherheit in der cloud mit terraform-station-module","automatisierung von arbeitslasten in azure"],"pt":["como usar o Terraform","o que é o módulo Terraform Station","Ferramentas de IA para ambientes Azure","alternativas ao Terraform","Terraform vs Azure Resource Manager","instalar o módulo Terraform Station","guia de configuração do Terraform","otimização da produtividade no Azure"],"ru":["как использовать Terraform","что такое модуль Terraform Station","ИИ Агенты для сред Azure","альтернативы Terraform","Terraform vs Azure Resource Manager","установка модуля Terraform Station","руководство по настройке Terraform","оптимизация производительности в Azure"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام Terraform","ما هي وحدة Terraform Station","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي لبيئات Azure","بديلات Terraform","Terraform مقابل Azure Resource Manager","تثبيت وحدة Terraform Station","دليل إعداد Terraform","تحسين الإنتاجية في Azure"]}},"owner":"blinqas","repo":"station","repoPath":"blinqas/station","stars":9,"forks":1,"updatedAt":"2026-02-27T11:40:30Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"terraform-station-module","description":"Maintain the Station Terraform module itself (not test authoring). Use this skill whenever the user asks to add, change, refactor, or troubleshoot Station module behavior in root *.tf files or child module folders (application/, group/, user_assigned_identity/, hashicorp/tfe/), update variables/outputs/validations, or adjust provider/resource wiring for module consumers.","bodyPreview":"# Terraform Station Module Skill\n\nUse this skill when working on Station module implementation logic.\n\nThis skill is for **module code changes**. For Terraform test authoring/execution in `tests/*.tftest.hcl`, use `terraform-station-test`.\n\n## What this skill covers\n\n- Adding/changing behavior in root module files (`*.tf` at repo root)\n- Updating child modules:\n  - `application/`\n  - `group/`\n  - `user_assigned_identity/`\n  - `hashicorp/tfe/`\n- Updating module interfaces:\n  - `variables.tf`\n  -","body":"# Terraform Station Module Skill\n\nUse this skill when working on Station module implementation logic.\n\nThis skill is for **module code changes**. For Terraform test authoring/execution in `tests/*.tftest.hcl`, use `terraform-station-test`.\n\n## What this skill covers\n\n- Adding/changing behavior in root module files (`*.tf` at repo root)\n- Updating child modules:\n  - `application/`\n  - `group/`\n  - `user_assigned_identity/`\n  - `hashicorp/tfe/`\n- Updating module interfaces:\n  - `variables.tf`\n  - `variables.applications.tf`\n  - `variables.identity.tf`\n  - `outputs.tf`\n- Keeping Station compatible as a **called module** (consumer-facing contract)\n- Updating documentation where interface/behavior changes\n\n## Station module invariants\n\n1. Treat Station as a module consumed by parent configurations.\n2. Preserve backward compatibility unless the user explicitly requests a breaking change.\n3. Keep variable schemas, validation rules, and defaults aligned with actual implementation.\n4. Keep outputs aligned with resources and child module wiring.\n5. Prefer extending existing patterns over introducing new structure.\n6. Keep changes focused and minimal.\n\n## Required discovery before changing code\n\nAlways inspect these first for impact analysis:\n\n- `variables.tf`\n- `variables.applications.tf`\n- `variables.identity.tf`\n- `outputs.tf`\n- relevant feature files (for example `applications.tf`, `groups.tf`, `connectivity.tf`, `tfe.tf`)\n- relevant child module `variables.tf` and `outputs.tf`\n\nThen map your change to:\n\n- inputs consumed\n- resources/data affected\n- outputs exposed\n- tests likely impacted\n\n## Implementation workflow\n\n1. Locate feature entry points in root module files.\n2. Identify whether behavior belongs in root module or child module.\n3. Update variable definitions/validations if interface changed.\n4. Update implementation (`resource`, `data`, `locals`, `module` calls).\n5. Update outputs if exposed behavior changed.\n6. Update docs/examples if user-visible behavior changed.\n7. Run formatting.\n8. Run relevant tests (or hand off to `terraform-station-test` flow).\n\n## Validation and formatting rules\n\n- Run:\n\n```bash\nterraform fmt -recursive\n```\n\n- Do **not** rely on `terraform validate` for this repository due provider alias/module limitations.\n\n- Prefer targeted Terraform tests for affected feature areas:\n  - `tests/application.tftest.hcl`\n  - `tests/group.tftest.hcl`\n  - `tests/tfe.tftest.hcl`\n  - `tests/connectivity.tftest.hcl`\n  - `tests/identity.tftest.hcl`\n  - `tests/user_assigned_identities.tftest.hcl`\n\n## Compatibility checklist for module changes\n\nBefore finishing a change, verify:\n\n- Input object shape matches actual references in code\n- Optional fields are guarded with `try(...)`, `lookup(...)`, `coalesce(...)`, or conditional logic where needed\n- Validation error messages still describe the true constraint\n- Resource naming/location/tag defaults still follow Station conventions\n- Identity and role-assignment side effects remain correct for enabled feature blocks\n- Outputs still reference valid resource/module attributes\n\n## Common Station-specific pitfalls\n\n- Adding new required fields to existing input objects without defaults\n- Changing map keys that tests/consumers depend on\n- Forgetting to propagate variable changes into child modules\n- Breaking app/group/identity auto-assignment behavior\n- Updating logic but not adjusting outputs/docs\n\n## CI-aware change planning\n\nStation uses selective test execution in CI.\n\nWhen changing module files, anticipate which tests are triggered using:\n\n- `.github/scripts/README.md`\n- `.github/workflows/terraform.yaml`\n\nIf core/shared files are touched, expect full-suite runs.\n\n## Use with testing skill\n\nAfter module edits:\n\n1. format with `terraform fmt -recursive`\n2. invoke `terraform-station-test` for test updates/execution\n3. ensure feature tests cover minimum + maximum scenarios when behavior changed\n\n## Done criteria for module tasks\n\n- Code change implemented at correct module boundary\n- Variable/validation/output updates included where needed\n- Formatting completed\n- Relevant tests run (or explicitly delegated)\n- No unrelated refactors bundled into the change\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-01T02:16:36.574Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for Infrastructure-as-Code Agents automating secure Azure environment deployments.","zh":"对于自动化安全 Azure 环境部署的基础设施即代码 (Infrastructure-as-Code) Agent 而言至关重要。","ja":"安全な Azure 環境のデプロイを自動化する Infrastructure-as-Code Agent にとって必須です。","ko":"보안 Azure 환경 배포를 자동화하는 Infrastructure-as-Code Agent에 필수적입니다.","es":"Esencial para agentes de Infrastructure-as-Code que automatizan implementaciones de entornos de Azure seguros.","fr":"Essentiel pour les agents Infrastructure-as-Code automatisant les déploiements d''environnements Azure sécurisés.","de":"Wesentlich für Infrastructure-as-Code-Agents, die sichere Azure-Umgebungs-Bereitstellungen automatisieren.","pt":"Essencial para Agentes de Infraestrutura-como-Código que automatizam implantações de ambientes Azure seguros.","ru":"Необходимо для Агентов «Инфраструктура-как-Код», автоматизирующих развертывание защищенных сред в Azure.","ar":"أساسي لوكلاء البنية التحتية كرمز (Infrastructure-as-Code) الذين يقومون بأتمتة عمليات نشر بيئات Azure الآمنة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables direct modification of Terraform module logic for Station implementations, including root module files (`*.tf`), child modules (`application/`, `group/`, `user_assigned_identity/`), and interface definitions (`variables.tf`). Provides specialized capabilities for Azure workload environment automation.","zh":"支持直接修改用于 Station 实现的 Terraform 模块逻辑，包括根模块文件 (`*.tf`)、子模块 (`application/`、`group/`、`user_assigned_identity/`) 以及接口定义 (`variables.tf`)。为 Azure 工作负载环境自动化提供了专门的功能。","ja":"Station の実装のための Terraform モジュールロジック（ルートモジュールファイル (`*.tf`)、子モジュール (`application/`、`group/`、`user_assigned_identity/`)、インターフェース定義 (`variables.tf`) を含む）の直接変更を可能にします。Azure ワークロード環境の自動化に特化した機能を提供します。","ko":"Station 구현을 위한 Terraform 모듈 로직, 즉 루트 모듈 파일(`*.tf`), 자식 모듈(`application/`, `group/`, `user_assigned_identity/`), 인터페이스 정의(`variables.tf`)를 직접 수정할 수 있게 합니다. Azure 워크로드 환경 자동화를 위한 특수 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Permite la modificación directa de la lógica del módulo Terraform para implementaciones de Station, incluyendo archivos de módulos raíz (`*.tf`), módulos secundarios (`application/`, `group/`, `user_assigned_identity/`) y definiciones de interfaz (`variables.tf`). Proporciona capacidades especializadas para la automatización de entornos de carga de trabajo de Azure.","fr":"Permet la modification directe de la logique du module Terraform pour les implementations de Station, y compris les fichiers de modules racine (`*.tf`), les modules enfants (`application/`, `group/`, `user_assigned_identity/`) et les définitions d''interface (`variables.tf`). Fournit des capacités spécialisées pour l''automatisation de l''environnement de charge de travail Azure.","de":"Ermöglicht die direkte Modifizierung der Logik des Terraform-Moduls für Station-Implementierungen, einschließlich Root-Modul-Dateien (`*.tf`), Child-Modulen (`application/`, `group/`, `user_assigned_identity/`) und Schnittstellendefinitionen (`variables.tf`). Bietet spezialisierte Fähigkeiten für die Automatisierung von Azure-Workload-Umgebungen.","pt":"Permite a modificação direta da lógica do módulo Terraform para implementações Station, incluindo arquivos do módulo raiz (`*.tf`), módulos filhos (`application/`, `group/`, `user_assigned_identity/`) e definições de interface (`variables.tf`). Fornece capacidades especializadas para automação de ambientes de carga de trabalho do Azure.","ru":"Позволяет напрямую изменять логику модуля Terraform для реализаций Station, включая файлы корневого модуля (`*.tf`), дочерние модули (`application/`, `group/`, `user_assigned_identity/`) и определения интерфейсов (`variables.tf`). Предоставляет специализированные возможности для автоматизации рабочих сред Azure.","ar":"يتيح التعديل المباشر على منطق وحدة Terraform لتنفيذات Station، بما في ذلك ملفات الوحدة الرئيسية (`*.tf`)، والوحدات الفرعية (`application/`، `group/`، `user_assigned_identity/`)، وتعريفات الواجهة (`variables.tf`). يوفر قدرات متخصصة لأتمتة بيئة أحمال العمل على Azure."},"useCases":{"en":["Adding new behavior to root module Terraform configurations","Updating child module logic for application, group, or user-assigned identity resources","Modifying module interface definitions in variables.tf"],"zh":["为根模块 Terraform 配置添加新行为","更新用于应用程序、组或用户分配标识资源的子模块逻辑","修改变量文件 `variables.tf` 中的模块接口定义"],"ja":["ルートモジュールの Terraform 設定に新しい動作を追加する","アプリケーション、グループ、またはユーザー割り当て ID リソースのための子モジュールロジックを更新する","変数ファイル `variables.tf` 内のモジュールインターフェース定義を変更する"],"ko":["루트 모듈 Terraform 구성에 새로운 동작 추가","애플리케이션, 그룹 또는 사용자 할당 ID 리소스를 위한 자식 모듈 로직 업데이트","변수 파일 `variables.tf`에서 모듈 인터페이스 정의 수정"],"es":["Agregar nuevo comportamiento a las configuraciones de Terraform de módulos raíz","Actualizar la lógica de módulos secundarios para recursos de aplicaciones, grupos o identidades asignadas por el usuario","Modificar las definiciones de interfaz de módulos en variables.tf"],"fr":["Ajouter un nouveau comportement aux configurations Terraform de modules racine","Mettre à jour la logique des modules enfants pour les ressources d''applications, de groupes ou d''identités attribuées par l''utilisateur","Modifier les définitions d''interface de modules dans variables.tf"],"de":["Hinzufügen neuer Verhaltensweisen zu Terraform-Konfigurationen von Root-Modulen","Aktualisieren der Logik von Child-Modulen für Anwendungs-, Gruppen- oder benutzerzugewiesene Identitätsressourcen","Modifizieren der Modulschnittstellendefinitionen in variables.tf"],"pt":["Adicionar novo comportamento a configurações do Terraform no módulo raiz","Atualizar a lógica do módulo filho para recursos de aplicação, grupo ou identidade atribuída ao usuário","Modificar definições de interface do módulo em variables.tf"],"ru":["Добавление нового поведения в конфигурации Terraform корневого модуля","Обновление логики дочернего модуля для ресурсов приложения, группы или назначаемой пользователем удостоверения","Изменение определений интерфейса модуля в variables.tf"],"ar":["إضافة سلوك جديد لتكوينات Terraform في الوحدة الرئيسية","تحديث منطق الوحدة الفرعية لموارد التطبيق أو المجموعة أو هوية المستخدم المعينة","تعديل تعريفات واجهة الوحدة في variables.tf"]},"limitations":{"en":["Exclusively for module code changes (not Terraform test authoring/execution)","Requires existing Station module implementation knowledge","Azure-specific environment automation focus"],"zh":["仅用于模块代码更改（不适用于 Terraform 测试编写/执行）","需要具备现有的 Station 模块实现知识","专注于 Azure 特定的环境自动化"],"ja":["モジュールコードの変更にのみ対応（Terraform テストの作成/実行には非対応）","既存の Station モジュール実装の知識が必要","Azure 固有の環境自動化に特化"],"ko":["모듈 코드 변경 전용(Terraform 테스트 작성/실행 불가)","기존 Station 모듈 구현 지식 필요","Azure 특화 환경 자동화에 초점"],"es":["Exclusivamente para cambios de código de módulos (no autoría/ejecución de pruebas de Terraform)","Requiere conocimientos existentes sobre la implementación de módulos de Station","Enfoque de automatización de entornos de Azure específicos"],"fr":["Exclusivement pour les modifications de code de modules (pas pour la rédaction/exécution de tests Terraform)","Nécessite des connaissances existantes sur la mise en œuvre des modules de Station","Focus sur l''automatisation d''environnements Azure spécifiques"],"de":["Nur für Modulcode-Änderungen (nicht für die Erstellung/Ausführung von Terraform-Tests)","Erfordert vorhandene Kenntnisse über die Implementierung von Station-Modulen","Fokus auf die Automatisierung von Azure-Umgebungen"],"pt":["Exclusivamente para alterações de código de módulo (não para criação/execução de testes do Terraform)","Requer conhecimento prévio da implementação do módulo Station","Foco específico na automação de ambiente Azure"],"ru":["Исключительно для изменений кода модуля (не для создания/выполнения тестов Terraform)","Требует существующих знаний о реализации модуля Station","Специализируется на автоматизации сред Azure"],"ar":["مخصص حصريًا لتغييرات كود الوحدة (وليس كتابة/تنفيذ اختبارات Terraform)","يتطلب معرفة مسبقة بتنفيذ وحدة Station","يركز بشكل خاص على أتمتة بيئة Azure"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"1e1a57d4ef004cd6198a42df2f12ade4707c91f42725cf192ac631c6af55f171","qualityScore":42}');
