a","Código abierto","Sin cuentas ni recopilación de datos","Soporte para plata, oro, platino y paladio"],"fr":["Suivi de métaux précieux","Gestion d''investissements privée","Open source","Pas de comptes ni de collecte de données","Prise en charge de l''argent, de l''or, du platine et du palladium"],"de":["Edelmetall-Portfolio-Verwaltung","Private Investitionsverwaltung","Open Source","Keine Konten oder Datensammlung","Unterstützung für Silber, Gold, Platin und Palladium"],"pt":["Rastreamento de prata, ouro, platina e paládio","Execução entirely no navegador","Sem contas ou coleta de dados","Privacidade e segurança garantidas","Fácil de usar e configurar"],"ru":["Отслеживание серебра, золота, платины и палладия","Работает entirely в браузере","Без учетных записей или сбора данных","Конфиденциальность и безопасность гарантированы","Легко использовать и настроить"],"ar":["تعقب الفضة والذهب والبلاتين والبالاديوم","تعمل بالكامل في المتصفح","بدون حسابات أو جمع بيانات","الخصوصية والأمان مضمونة","سهلة الاستخدام والتهيئة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["贵金属投资跟踪","AIエージェント","零售商提供的AI工具","如何使用零售商提供的AI工具","零售商提供的AI工具安装","零售商提供的AI工具设置指南"],"ja":["貴金属投資トラッカー","AIエージェント","零售商提供のAIツール","零售商提供のAIツールの使い方","零售商提供のAIツールのインストール","零售商提供のAIツールの設定ガイド"],"ko":["贵金属 投資 트래커","AI 에이전트","소매 업체 제공 AI 도구","소매 업체 제공 AI 도구 사용법","소매 업체 제공 AI 도구 설치","소매 업체 제공 AI 도구 설정 가이드"],"es":["herramientas de seguimiento de metales preciosos","gestión de inversiones privada","código abierto para inversores","retail-provider-fix alternativa","guía de instalación de retail-provider-fix","retail-provider-fix vs otras herramientas","cómo usar retail-provider-fix","qué es retail-provider-fix","retail-provider-fix para principiantes"],"fr":["outils de suivi de métaux précieux","gestion d''investissements privée","open source pour investisseurs","retail-provider-fix alternative","guide d''installation de retail-provider-fix","retail-provider-fix vs autres outils","comment utiliser retail-provider-fix","qu''est-ce que retail-provider-fix","retail-provider-fix pour débutants"],"de":["KI-Tools für Edelmetall-Portfolios","private Investitionsverwaltung","Open Source für Investoren","retail-provider-fix Alternative","Installationsanleitung für retail-provider-fix","retail-provider-fix vs andere Tools","wie man retail-provider-fix verwendet","was ist retail-provider-fix","retail-provider-fix für Anfänger"],"pt":["como usar retail-provider-fix","o que é retail-provider-fix","alternativa para retail-provider-fix","retail-provider-fix vs outros","instalar retail-provider-fix","guia de configuração retail-provider-fix","rastreamento de metais preciosos","privacidade e segurança em metais preciosos"],"ru":["как использовать retail-provider-fix","что такое retail-provider-fix","альтернатива для retail-provider-fix","retail-provider-fix vs другие","установить retail-provider-fix","руководство по настройке retail-provider-fix","отслеживание драгоценных металлов","конфиденциальность и безопасность в драгоценных металлах"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام retail-provider-fix","ما هي retail-provider-fix","بديل ل retail-provider-fix","retail-provider-fix مقابل غيرها","تثبيت retail-provider-fix","دليل إعداد retail-provider-fix","تعقب المعادن النفيسة","الخصوصية والأمان في المعادن النفيسة"]}},"owner":"lbruton","repo":"StakTrakr","repoPath":"lbruton/StakTrakr","stars":2,"forks":1,"updatedAt":"2026-02-26T11:50:11Z","topics":["gold","inventory","inventory-management-system","precious-metals","silver"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"retail-provider-fix","description":"Use when retail prices are failing for a vendor — wrong prices, fractional_weight warnings, all-zeros for a provider, page-loaded-no-price errors, or after suspecting a dealer changed their site structure. Covers live Firecrawl diagnostics, interpreting extraction failures, and updating price-extract.js and providers.json.","bodyPreview":"# Retail Provider Fix\n\nDiagnose and fix scraping failures for individual dealers in the StakTrakr retail pipeline.\nAll code lives in `StakTrakrApi/devops/retail-poller/`. All URL config is in `providers.json` on the `api` branch.\n\n---\n\n## Step 1 — Live Firecrawl Diagnostic\n\nRun directly inside the Fly.io container against the self-hosted Firecrawl at `localhost:3002`:\n\n```bash\n# Substitute URL from providers.json for the failing vendor/coin\nfly ssh console -a staktrakr -C \"curl -s -X POST http:/","body":"# Retail Provider Fix\n\nDiagnose and fix scraping failures for individual dealers in the StakTrakr retail pipeline.\nAll code lives in `StakTrakrApi/devops/retail-poller/`. All URL config is in `providers.json` on the `api` branch.\n\n---\n\n## Step 1 — Live Firecrawl Diagnostic\n\nRun directly inside the Fly.io container against the self-hosted Firecrawl at `localhost:3002`:\n\n```bash\n# Substitute URL from providers.json for the failing vendor/coin\nfly ssh console -a staktrakr -C \"curl -s -X POST http://localhost:3002/v1/scrape \\\n  -H ''Content-Type: application/json'' \\\n  -d ''{\\\"url\\\":\\\"PROVIDER_URL_HERE\\\",\\\"formats\\\":[\\\"markdown\\\"],\\\"waitFor\\\":6000,\\\"onlyMainContent\\\":false}'' \\\n  | python3 -c \\\"import sys,json; d=json.load(sys.stdin); \\\n    md=d.get(''data'',{}).get(''markdown'',''''); \\\n    w=d.get(''data'',{}).get(''warning'',''''); \\\n    print(''WARNING:'',w); print(''LEN:'',len(md)); print(md[:5000])\\\"\"\n```\n\nFor home LXC, replace `fly ssh console -a staktrakr -C` with `ssh home-lxc`:\n```bash\nssh home-lxc \"curl -s -X POST http://localhost:3002/v1/scrape ...\"\n```\n\n---\n\n## Step 2 — Interpret the Output\n\n| Symptom | Meaning | Fix category |\n|---|---|---|\n| `warning: waitFor not supported` | Self-hosted Firecrawl ignores `waitFor` — JS never renders | Force Playwright path (see §4) |\n| Markdown contains only `\"Loading...\"` | Product table is JS-rendered, not in static HTML | Force Playwright path |\n| Redirected to homepage URL in metadata | Bot detection — page is blocked | Playwright + residential proxy (see §5) |\n| Spot prices appear before product price | `MARKDOWN_HEADER_SKIP_PATTERNS` not matching | Update header skip regex (see §3) |\n| `fractional_weight — 1/4 oz` | Scraper found a fractional nav price before product price | Update `MARKDOWN_CUTOFF_PATTERNS` or force Playwright |\n| `page loaded, no price` | Page renders but extraction regex doesn''t match | Update `extractPrice` logic for that provider |\n| `out_of_stock — PRE-ORDER` | Correct; item actually on pre-order | No fix needed unless provider is in `PREORDER_TOLERANT_PROVIDERS` |\n\n---\n\n## Step 3 — Config Map in `price-extract.js`\n\nAll extraction config is in `StakTrakrApi/devops/retail-poller/price-extract.js`.\n\n| Config | Line ~| What it does |\n|---|---|---|\n| `SLOW_PROVIDERS` | 474 | Adds `waitFor:6000` to Firecrawl AND `waitForTimeout(8000)` in Playwright fallback |\n| `MARKDOWN_HEADER_SKIP_PATTERNS` | 157 | Regex matching the site header/nav — cuts everything BEFORE the match |\n| `MARKDOWN_CUTOFF_PATTERNS` | 132 | Array of regexes — cuts everything AFTER the first match (removes related products, carousels) |\n| `PREORDER_TOLERANT_PROVIDERS` | 134 | Providers where \"Pre-Order\" text should NOT count as OOS |\n| `USES_AS_LOW_AS` | 117 | Providers that use \"As Low As\" as their primary price indicator (currently empty) |\n| `FBP_DEALER_NAME_MAP` | 196 | Maps FindBullionPrices dealer display names → provider IDs |\n| `onlyMainContent` | 485 | Firecrawl flag — set `false` for JMBullion to avoid missing the price table |\n\n**URL changes go in `providers.json` on the `api` branch** — NOT in price-extract.js.\nBoth pollers auto-sync providers.json before every run via `curl ... /api/data/retail/providers.json`.\n\n---\n\n## Step 4 — Self-Hosted Firecrawl `waitFor` Not Supported\n\n**This is the current state** (confirmed Feb 2026): The self-hosted Firecrawl container does not support the `waitFor` parameter. It returns the static/pre-render HTML immediately.\n\n**Consequence**: All JS-heavy SPAs (JMBullion, BullionExchanges, Monument Metals) get unrendered HTML from Firecrawl. Monument Metals and HeroBullion recover via the Playwright fallback. JMBullion does NOT recover because `fractional_weight` detection fires on the pre-render content and exits without triggering Playwright.\n\n**Fix options** (in order of preference):\n\n1. **Upgrade Firecrawl** to a version that supports `waitFor` — check `ghcr.io/firecrawl/firecrawl:latest` changelog\n2. **Force Playwright path for specific providers** — add them to a `PLAYWRIGHT_ONLY_PROVIDERS` set that skips Firecrawl entirely\n3. **Treat `fractional_weight` as Playwright trigger** — same as `price === null` in the fallback condition\n\n---\n\n## Step 5 — Bot Detection (BullionExchanges Pattern)\n\nWhen Firecrawl returns a redirect to the site''s homepage with only a banner image, bot detection is active.\n\n**Diagnosis**: `url` in response metadata differs from `sourceURL`. e.g., `sourceURL` = product page, `url` = `bullionexchanges.com`.\n\n**Current status**: BullionExchanges redirects ALL headless browser requests to homepage.\n\n**Fix options**:\n- Playwright with residential proxy chain (`HOME_PROXY_URL_2` → Webshare) — verify tinyproxy `ConnectPort` allows 443\n- Add browser stealth headers: real user-agent, `Accept-Language`, `Sec-Fetch-*` headers\n- If Tailscale exit node is active, ALL traffic routes via home residential IP — verify `tailscale status` in container before debugging further\n\n---\n\n## Step 6 — Test Single Vendor (Dry Run)\n\nFrom inside the container or home LXC:\n\n```bash\n# Fly.io — SSH in then run\nfly ssh console -a staktrakr\ncd /app\nDATA_DIR=/data/staktrakr-api-export/data \\\nFIRECRAWL_BASE_URL=http://localhost:3002 \\\nPLAYWRIGHT_LAUNCH=1 \\\nCOINS=ase PROVIDERS=jmbullion \\\nDRY_RUN=1 node price-extract.js\n\n# Filter to multiple vendors\nCOINS=ase,age PROVIDERS=jmbullion,bullionexchanges DRY_RUN=1 node price-extract.js\n```\n\nA successful result shows `✓ jmbullion: $XXX.XX (playwright)` or `✓ jmbullion: $XXX.XX (firecrawl)`.\n\n---\n\n## Step 7 — Deploy the Fix\n\nAfter verifying the fix in dry-run:\n\n```bash\n# Fly.io — redeploy container (required for price-extract.js changes)\ncd /Volumes/DATA/GitHub/StakTrakrApi/devops/retail-poller\nfly deploy -a staktrakr\n\n# Home LXC — no deploy needed; run-home.sh reads price-extract.js directly\n# Just commit + pull on the home server:\n# git pull origin main && (restart cron if needed)\n\n# providers.json URL changes — push to api branch\ngit checkout api\n# edit data/retail/providers.json\ngit add data/retail/providers.json && git commit -m \"fix(providers): update VENDOR urls\"\ngit push origin api\n# Both pollers pick this up automatically on next run (no redeploy needed)\n```\n\n---\n\n## Common Provider Failure Patterns\n\n### JMBullion — `fractional_weight`\n**Cause**: Firecrawl''s `waitFor` not supported → product table renders as \"Loading...\" → no price → but header skip exposes fractional nav links or spot prices that trigger false `fractional_weight` detection.\n**Fix**: Force Playwright path; verify `MARKDOWN_HEADER_SKIP_PATTERNS.jmbullion` still matches the header timestamp format.\n\n### BullionExchanges — `page loaded, no price`\n**Cause**: Bot detection redirects to homepage; Firecrawl gets one-line banner. Playwright fallback also redirected.\n**Fix**: Check tinyproxy HTTPS CONNECT config; use Playwright with stealth headers.\n\n### Monument Metals — `out_of_stock — PRE-ORDER`\n**Cause**: Coin legitimately on pre-order (common for new-year coins Jan–Mar).\n**Fix**: Update providers.json URL to a different in-stock coin, OR wait for inventory to arrive.\n\n### SDB — wrong price from \"Add on Items\" carousel\n**Cause**: `sdbullion` was in `USES_AS_LOW_AS`; carousel prices bled through.\n**Fix (applied 2026-02-20)**: `sdbullion` removed from `USES_AS_LOW_AS`; `MARKDOWN_CUTOFF_PATTERNS.sdbullion` added.\n\n---\n\n## Firecrawl Engine Capabilities (Self-Hosted)\n\nThe self-hosted container uses Firecrawl''s `basic` engine (not `playwright`). Capabilities:\n\n| Feature | Supported |\n|---|---|\n| Static HTML fetch | ✅ |\n| `waitFor` (JS wait) | ❌ (silently ignored, warning in response) |\n| `onlyMainContent` | ✅ |\n| `formats: markdown` | ✅ |\n| Proxy (`PROXY_SERVER`) | ✅ via playwright-service |\n| `BLOCK_MEDIA` | ✅ via playwright-service env |\n\nTo check current Firecrawl version in container:\n```bash\nfly ssh console -a staktrakr -C \"node -e \\\"const p=require(''/opt/firecrawl/package.json''); console.log(p.version)\\\"\"\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-28T01:38:46.388Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for DevOps Agents specializing in web scraping diagnostics and retail data pipeline maintenance.","zh":"非常适合专注于网络抓取诊断和零售数据管道维护的 DevOps Agent。","ja":"Webスクレイピング診断と小売データパイプラインのメンテナンスを専門とするDevOps Agentに最適です。","ko":"웹 스크레이핑 진단 및 소매 데이터 파이프라인 유지보수를 전문으로 하는 DevOps Agent에 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de DevOps especializados en diagnósticos de scraping web y mantenimiento de canalizaciones de datos de venta al por menor.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents DevOps spécialisés dans les diagnostics de scraping web et la maintenance des canalisations de données de détail.","de":"Perfekt für DevOps-Agents, die auf Web-Scraping-Diagnose und Wartung von Einzelhandels-Datencanälen spezialisiert sind.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes DevOps especializados em diagnósticos de web scraping e manutenção de pipelines de dados de varejo.","ru":"Идеально подходит для DevOps-агентов, специализирующихся на диагностике веб-скрапинга и обслуживании конвейеров данных розничной торговли.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء DevOps المتخصصين في تشخيصات استخراج البيانات من الويب وصيانة خطوط أنابيب بيانات التجزئة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to diagnose and fix scraping failures for precious metals dealers using live Firecrawl diagnostics directly against Fly.io containers. Provides direct access to provider configurations in providers.json and enables SSH console execution for real-time troubleshooting.","zh":"使Agent能够使用Firecrawl实时诊断功能直接针对Fly.io容器进行诊断和修复贵金属经销商的抓取故障。提供对providers.json中供应商配置的直接访问权限，并支持SSH控制台执行以进行实时故障排除。","ja":"AgentがFirecrawlのライブ診断機能を使用してFly.ioコンテナに対して直接、貴金属ディーラーのスクレイピング障害を診断および修正できるようにします。providers.json内のプロバイダー構成への直接アクセスを提供し、リアルタイムのトラブルシューティングのためにSSHコンソールの実行を可能にします。","ko":"Agent가 Firecrawl 라이브 진단 기능을 사용하여 Fly.io 컨테이너에 직접 진단을 수행하여 귀금속 딜러의 스크레이핑 장애를 진단하고 수정할 수 있도록 합니다. providers.json의 공급자 구성에 대한 직접 액세스를 제공하며 실시간 문제 해결을 위한 SSH 콘솔 실행을 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes para diagnosticar y solucionar fallos de scraping para comerciantes de metales preciosos utilizando diagnostics de Firecrawl en vivo directamente contra contenedores de Fly.io. Proporciona acceso directo a configuraciones de proveedores en providers.json y permite la ejecución de la consola SSH para solucionar problemas en tiempo real.","fr":"Permet aux agents de diagnostiquer et de corriger les défaillances de scraping pour les détaillants de métaux précieux en utilisant les diagnostics Firecrawl en direct contre les conteneurs Fly.io. Fournit un accès direct aux configurations des fournisseurs dans providers.json et permet l''exécution de la console SSH pour le dépannage en temps réel.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Scraping-Fehler für Edelmetallhändler zu diagnostizieren und zu beheben, indem sie Live-Firecrawl-Diagnosen direkt gegen Fly.io-Container verwenden. Bietet direkten Zugriff auf Anbieterkonfigurationen in providers.json und ermöglicht die Ausführung von SSH-Konsole für Echtzeit-Problembehandlung.","pt":"Capacita os agentes a diagnosticar e corrigir falhas de scraping para negociantes de metais preciosos usando diagnósticos ao vivo do Firecrawl diretamente contra contêineres Fly.io. Fornece acesso direto às configurações do provedor em providers.json e permite a execução do console SSH para solução de problemas em tempo real.","ru":"Позволяет агентам диагностировать и устранять сбои скрапинга для дилеров драгоценных металлов с использованием live-диагностики Firecrawl непосредственно в контейнерах Fly.io. Обеспечивает прямой доступ к конфигурациям провайдеров в providers.json и позволяет выполнять команды через SSH-консоль для устранения неполадок в реальном времени.","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من تشخيص وإصلاح أعطال استخراج البيانات لتجار المعادن الثمينة باستخدام تشخيصات Firecrawl المباشرة ضد حاويات Fly.io. يوفر وصولاً مباشراً إلى تكوينات الموفر في ملف providers.json ويمكن من تنفيذ أوامر عبر console SSH للتصحيح الفوري في الوقت الحقي."},"useCases":{"en":["Diagnosing scraping failures for individual dealers","Executing live Firecrawl diagnostics against Fly.io containers","Fixing retail pipeline issues for precious metals data","Validating provider URL configurations from providers.json"],"zh":["诊断个别经销商的抓取故障","针对Fly.io容器执行Firecrawl实时诊断","修复贵金属数据的零售管道问题","验证providers.json中的供应商URL配置"],"ja":["個々のディーラーのスクレイピング障害の診断","Fly.ioコンテナに対するFirecrawlライブ診断の実行","貴金属データの小売パイプライン問題の修正","providers.jsonからのプロバイダーURL構成の検証"],"ko":["개별 딜러의 스크레이핑 장애 진단","Fly.io 컨테이너에 대한 Firecrawl 라이브 진단 실행","귀금속 데이터의 소매 파이프라인 문제 수정","providers.json의 공급자 URL 구성 검증"],"es":["Diagnosticar fallos de scraping para comerciantes individuales","Ejecutar diagnostics de Firecrawl en vivo contra contenedores de Fly.io","Solucionar problemas de canalización de venta al por menor para datos de metales preciosos","Validar configuraciones de URL de proveedores desde providers.json"],"fr":["Diagnostiquer les défaillances de scraping pour les détaillants individuels","Exécuter les diagnostics Firecrawl en direct contre les conteneurs Fly.io","Résoudre les problèmes de canalisation de détail pour les données de métaux précieux","Valider les configurations d''URL des fournisseurs à partir de providers.json"],"de":["Scraping-Fehler für einzelne Händler diagnostizieren","Live-Firecrawl-Diagnosen gegen Fly.io-Container ausführen","Einzelhandelskanal-Probleme für Edelmetall-Daten beheben","Anbieter-URL-Konfigurationen aus providers.json validier