"什么是Unicode规范化","euni-commands-guide替代品","euni-commands-guide安装","euni-commands-guide设置指南","Unicode规范化问题解决","Git仓库优化","CI运行器优化"],"ja":["euni-commands-guideの使用方法","Unicode正規化とは","euni-commands-guideの代替品","euni-commands-guideのインストール","euni-commands-guideの設定ガイド","Unicode正規化問題の解決","Gitリポジトリの最適化","CIランナーの最適化"],"ko":["euni-commands-guide 사용법","유니코드 규칙화란","euni-commands-guide 대체품","euni-commands-guide 설치","euni-commands-guide 설정 가이드","유니코드 규칙화 문제 해결","Git 저장소 최적화","CI 런너 최적화"],"es":["guía de comandos euni","normalización Unicode","diferencias de normalización Unicode","Agente de IA para desarrolladores","herramienta de línea de comandos","instalación de euni","configuración de euni","alternativas a euni"],"fr":["guide de commandes euni","normalisation Unicode","différences de normalisation Unicode","outil IA pour les développeurs","outil en ligne de commande","installation de euni","configuration de euni","alternatives à euni"],"de":["Euni-Kommando-Guide","Unicode-Normalisierung","Unterschiede in der Unicode-Normalisierung","KI-Tool für Entwickler","Kommandozeilen-Tool","Installation von euni","Konfiguration von euni","Alternativen zu euni"],"pt":["como usar euni-commands-guide","o que é normalização Unicode","ferramentas de IA para Git","euni-commands-guide vs outras ferramentas","instalar euni-commands-guide","guia de configuração do euni-commands-guide"],"ru":["как использовать euni-commands-guide","что такое нормализация Юникода","инструменты ИИ для Git","euni-commands-guide vs другие инструменты","установка euni-commands-guide","руководство по настройке euni-commands-guide"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام أداة euni-commands-guide","ما هو تعديل يونيكود","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي لمستودعات جيت","أداة euni-commands-guide مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت أداة euni-commands-guide","دليل إعداد أداة euni-commands-guide"]}},"owner":"takuto-tanaka-4digit","repo":"excel-unidiff-cli","repoPath":"takuto-tanaka-4digit/excel-unidiff-cli","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-27T01:22:47Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"euni-commands-guide","description":"English runbook for euni command usage in local development and CI, including exit-code and UG-code troubleshooting.","bodyPreview":"# euni Commands (English)\n\nOperational playbook for `excel-unidiff-cli` (`euni`).\nGoal: decide quickly which command to run, in what order, and how to interpret results.\n\n## Command Map\n\n- `euni init-policy`\n  - Create `.euni.yml` template in `--repo`.\n- `euni check`\n  - Non-destructive check for policy drift + Unicode findings on tracked files.\n- `euni apply`\n  - Apply policy drift fixes via `git config --local` only.\n  - Use `--dry-run` before writing.\n  - Use `--repair-unicode-deletes` to res","body":"# euni Commands (English)\n\nOperational playbook for `excel-unidiff-cli` (`euni`).\nGoal: decide quickly which command to run, in what order, and how to interpret results.\n\n## Command Map\n\n- `euni init-policy`\n  - Create `.euni.yml` template in `--repo`.\n- `euni check`\n  - Non-destructive check for policy drift + Unicode findings on tracked files.\n- `euni apply`\n  - Apply policy drift fixes via `git config --local` only.\n  - Use `--dry-run` before writing.\n  - Use `--repair-unicode-deletes` to restore staged/worktree deleted tracked paths in `core.precomposeunicode=false` mode.\n  - The repair keeps staged non-delete changes (`worktree-only delete` is restored with `git restore --worktree`).\n  - Caution: this restores deleted tracked paths in scope; do not use when deletions are intentional.\n- `euni doctor`\n  - Combined diagnosis (`check` + scan-like Unicode analysis).\n- `euni scan`\n  - Unicode path analysis on tracked + untracked files (no policy input).\n- `euni version`\n  - Print `euni <version> (<commit>)`.\n\n## Core Rules\n\n- Subcommand required; no standalone `help` command.\n- `--recursive` default is `false` (root repo only).\n- Write operations are only `apply` and `init-policy`.\n- `scan` does not accept `--policy`.\n- `version` accepts no options.\n- `--format` is `text` or `json` only.\n\n## Recommended Flows\n\n### 1) First-time setup\n\n```bash\neuni init-policy --repo .\neuni check --repo . --recursive --policy ./.euni.yml\n```\n\n### 2) Drift remediation loop\n\n```bash\neuni apply --repo . --recursive --policy ./.euni.yml --dry-run\neuni apply --repo . --recursive --policy ./.euni.yml\neuni check --repo . --recursive --policy ./.euni.yml\n```\n\n### 3) Unicode phantom delete repair (one command)\n\n```bash\neuni apply --repo . --recursive --policy ./.euni.yml --repair-unicode-deletes\n```\n\n### 4) Hard-case diagnosis\n\n```bash\neuni doctor --repo . --recursive --policy ./.euni.yml\neuni scan --repo . --recursive --format json\n```\n\n## CI Recipe (Deterministic Gate)\n\n```bash\neuni check \\\n  --repo . \\\n  --recursive \\\n  --policy ./.euni.yml \\\n  --non-interactive \\\n  --format json > euni-report.json\n```\n\nGate expectations:\n\n- Validate against `schema/euni-report.schema.json`.\n- Ensure process exit code matches `report.exitCode`.\n- Treat `exit 1` as findings (operational failure), `exit 2` as execution/runtime failure.\n- Upload `euni-report.json` as artifact.\n\nJSON contract:\n\n- `stdout`: exactly one JSON object.\n- `stderr`: logs/progress/error details.\n\n## Exit Codes\n\n- `0`: no findings, no errors.\n- `1`: findings present.\n- `2`: execution error.\n\nPrecedence: if any execution error exists, exit is `2`.\n\n## UG Code Triage (Quick)\n\nCommon findings (`exit 1`):\n\n- `UG004`: config drift detected.\n- `UG005`: NFC collision detected.\n- `UG011`: combining mark in path.\n- `UG012`: non-standard FS entry (symlink/reparse/mount).\n- `UG013`: ambiguous policy path key (case-only collision).\n- `UG014`: unicode delete repair signal (dry-run plan or runtime safety skip).\n\nCommon execution errors (`exit 2`):\n\n- `UG001`: invalid/inaccessible `--repo`.\n- `UG002`: git command/runtime failure.\n- `UG003`: policy load failure.\n- `UG006`: submodule uninitialized/inaccessible.\n- `UG007`: invalid policy structure/unsupported keys.\n- `UG008`: `.euni.yml` exists without `--force`.\n- `UG009`: unsupported command/option usage.\n- `UG010`: gitdir/top-level outside `--repo` boundary.\n\n## Local Source Run Note\n\nWhen running via `go run`, non-zero app exits may appear as process exit `1` (Go tool wrapper behavior).\nFor strict `0/1/2` contract checks, build and run the binary directly:\n\n```bash\ngo build -o ./bin/euni ./cmd/euni\n./bin/euni check --repo . --policy ./.euni.yml\necho $?\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-28T14:52:49.796Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for DevOps Agents needing Unicode normalization management across macOS, Linux, and Windows CI runners.","zh":"非常适合需要在macOS、Linux和Windows CI运行器上进行Unicode标准化管理的DevOps代理。","ja":"macOS、Linux、Windows CIランナー上でUnicode正規化管理が必要なDevOpsエージェントに最適です。","ko":"macOS, Linux, Windows CI 실행기에서 유니코드 정규화 관리가 필요한 DevOps 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de DevOps que necesitan administración de normalización de Unicode en ejecutores de CI de macOS, Linux y Windows.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents DevOps ayant besoin d''une gestion de normalisation d''Unicode sur les exécuteurs de CI macOS, Linux et Windows.","de":"Perfekt für DevOps-Agents, die eine Verwaltung der Unicode-Normalisierung auf macOS-, Linux- und Windows-CI-Runnern benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes DevOps que necessitam de gerenciamento de normalização de Unicode em runners de CI do macOS, Linux e Windows.","ru":"Идеально для агентов DevOps, которым необходим управление нормализацией Unicode в средах выполнения CI macOS, Linux и Windows.","ar":"مثالي للموكلين DevOps الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة تطبيع Unicode عبر تشغيل CI لنظام macOS و Linux و Windows."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to detect and fix Unicode normalization issues via Git diffs using the `excel-unidiff-cli` (`euni`) command-line tool, preventing phantom Excel file changes and ensuring consistent repository states by leveraging `euni init-policy`, `euni check`, and `euni apply` commands.","zh":"使代理能够通过Git差异和`excel-unidiff-cli`（`euni`）命令行工具检测和修复Unicode标准化问题，防止幻影Excel文件更改，并通过利用`euni init-policy`、`euni check`和`euni apply`命令确保一致的存储库状态。","ja":"エージェントがGitの差分と`excel-unidiff-cli`（`euni`）コマンドラインツールを使用してUnicode正規化の問題を検出および修正できるようにし、幻影的なExcelファイルの変更を防ぎ、`euni init-policy`、`euni check`、`euni apply`コマンドを利用して一貫したリポジトリ状態を確保します。","ko":"에이전트가 Git 차이점과 `excel-unidiff-cli`(`euni`) 명령줄 도구를 사용하여 유니코드 표준화 문제를 감지하고 수정할 수 있도록 하여幻影 Excel 파일 변경을 방지하고 `euni init-policy`, `euni check`, `euni apply` 명령을 활용하여 일관된 저장소 상태를 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a detectar y solucionar problemas de normalización de Unicode a través de diferencias de Git utilizando la herramienta de línea de comandos `excel-unidiff-cli` (`euni`), evitando cambios de archivos de Excel fantasma y asegurando estados de repositorio coherentes mediante los comandos `euni init-policy`, `euni check` y `euni apply`.","fr":"Permet aux agents de détecter et de corriger les problèmes de normalisation d''Unicode via des différences Git en utilisant l''outil de ligne de commande `excel-unidiff-cli` (`euni`), empêchant les modifications de fichiers Excel fantômes et assurant des états de référentiel cohérents en utilisant les commandes `euni init-policy`, `euni check` et `euni apply`.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Unicode-Normalisierungsprobleme über Git-Diffs mithilfe des Kommandozeilen-Tools `excel-unidiff-cli` (`euni`) zu erkennen und zu beheben, verhindert Phantom-Excel-Dateiänderungen und stellt konsistente Repository-Zustände sicher, indem es die Befehle `euni init-policy`, `euni check` und `euni apply` nutzt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a detectar e corrigir problemas de normalização de Unicode por meio de diffs do Git usando a ferramenta de linha de comando `excel-unidiff-cli` (`euni`), prevenindo alterações fantasmagóricas de arquivos do Excel e garantindo estados de repositório consistentes aproveitando os comandos `euni init-policy`, `euni check` e `euni apply`.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обнаруживать и исправлять проблемы нормализации Unicode с помощью diff Git, используя командную утилиту `excel-unidiff-cli` (`euni`), предотвращая фантомные изменения файлов Excel и обеспечивая последовательное состояние репозиториев за счет команд `euni init-policy`, `euni check` и `euni apply`.","ar":"يمكن للموكلين اكتشاف ومعالجة مشاكل تطبيع Unicode من خلال DIFF Git باستخدام أداة سطر الأوامر `excel-unidiff-cli` (`euni`)، ومنع تغييرات الملفات المزيفة لبرنامج Excel وضمان حالات مستودع متسقة من خلال أوامر `euni init-policy` و `euni check` و `euni apply`."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Unicode normalization checks for Git repositories and submodules","Debugging phantom Excel file changes across different operating systems","Applying policy drift fixes via `git config --local` for consistent repository management"],"zh":["自动化Git存储库和子模块的Unicode标准化检查","调试不同操作系统上的幻影Excel文件更改","通过`git config --local`应用策略漂移修复以实现一致的存储库管理"],"ja":["GitリポジトリとサブモジュールのUnicode正規化チェックを自動化する","異なるオペレーティングシステムでの幻影的なExcelファイルの変更をデバッグする","`git config --local`を使用してポリシードリフトの修正を適用し、一貫したリポジトリ管理を実現する"],"ko":["Git 저장소 및 서브모듈의 유니코드 표준화 확인 자동화","다양한 운영 체제에서幻影 Excel 파일 변경 디버깅","`git config --local`를 통해 정책漂移 수정 적용 및 일관된 저장소 관리"],"es":["Automatización de comprobaciones de normalización de Unicode para repositorios y submódulos de Git","Depuración de cambios de archivos de Excel fantasma en diferentes sistemas operativos","Aplicación de correcciones de desviación de políticas a través de `git config --local` para una administración de repositorios coherente"],"fr":["Automatisation des vérifications de normalisation d''Unicode pour les référentiels et les sous-modules Git","Débogage des modifications de fichiers Excel fantômes sur différents systèmes d''exploitation","Application de corrections de dérive de politiques via `git config --local` pour une gestion de référentiel cohérente"],"de":["Automatisierung von Überprüfungen der Unicode-Normalisierung für Git-Repositorys und -Submodule","Fehlerbehebung von Phantom-Excel-Dateiänderungen auf verschiedenen Betriebssystemen","Anwendung von Richtlinien-Abweichungskorrekturen über `git config --local` für eine konsistente Repository-Verwaltung"],"pt":["Automatizar verificações de normalização de Unicode para repositórios e submódulos Git","Depurar alterações fantasmagóricas de arquivos do Excel em diferentes sistemas operacionais","Aplicar correções de deriva de política via `git config --local` para gerenciamento de repositório consistente"],"ru":["Автоматизировать проверки нормализации Unicode для репозиториев и подмодулей Git","Отлаживать фантомные изменения файлов Excel на разных операционных системах","Применять исправления policy drift через `git config --local` для последовательного управления репозиторием"],"ar":["تأتمتة فحوصات تطبيع Unicode لمستودعات Git والفرعي","تصحيح الأخطاء في الملفات المزيفة لبرنامج Excel عبر أنظمة تشغيل مختلفة","تطبيق إصلاحات انحراف السياسة عبر `git config --local` لإدارة المستودع المتسقة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires `excel-unidiff-cli` installation","Limited to Git repositories and submodules","Needs `--repo` specification for `.euni.yml` template creation"],"zh":["需要`excel-unidiff-cli`安装","仅限Git存储库和子模块","需要`--repo`指定来创建`.euni.yml`模板"],"ja":["`excel-unidiff-cli`のインストールが必要","Gitリポジトリとサブモジュールのみ","`.euni.yml`テンプレートの作成には`--repo`の指定が必要"],"ko":["`excel-unidiff-cli` 설치 필요","Git 저장소 및 서브모듈만 해당","`.euni.yml` 템플릿 생성을 위해 `--repo` 지정 필요"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de `excel-unidiff-cli`","Limitado a repositorios y submódulos de Git","Necesita la especificación de `--repo` para la creación de plantillas `.euni.yml`"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de `excel-unidiff-cli`","Limité aux référentiels et sous-modules Git","Nécessite la spécification de `--repo` pour la création de modèles `.euni.yml`"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation von `excel-unidiff-cli`","Begrenzt auf Git-Repositorys und -Submodule","Benötigt die Angabe von `--repo` für die Erstellung von `.euni.yml`-Vorlagen"],"pt":["Exige instalação do `excel-unidiff-cli`","Limitado a repositórios e submódulos Git","Necessita de especificação `--repo` para criação de modelo `.euni.yml`"],"ru":["Требует установки `excel-unidiff-cli`","Ограничен репозиториями и подмодулями Git","Требует указания `--repo` для создания шаблона `.euni.yml`"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت `excel-unidiff-cli`","محدود بمستودعات Git والفرعي","يحتاج إلى تحديد `--repo` لإنشاء نموذج `.euni.yml`"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"8a76a59a292ed44f2a7ef6c3781bce30645aaea3b92a7d290d873e30efb6f634","qualityScore":42}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('EthanAlgoX/MarketBot/gog', 'community', 'EthanAlgoX', 'MarketBot', 'EthanAlgoX/MarketBot', 'gog', 0, 0, 42, '2026-03-02T01:56:10.877Z', '2026-03-02T02:07:14.872Z', '4882b9f7160c6a8b3692e1b001a1df9aa0835908cac934bed3f33361f73fbfe6', '{"id":"EthanAlgoX/MarketBot/gog","name":"gog","description":{"zh":"Gog AI代理技能是市场智能和交易分析的专用AI代理，用于提供市场分析和交易决策支持","ja":"Gog AIエージェントスキルは、市場インテリジェンスとトレーディング分析のための専用AIエージェントです","ko":"Gog AI 에이전트 스킬은 시장 지능 및 거래 분석을 위한 전용 AI 에이전트입니다","es":"gog es una herramienta de línea de comandos que permite automatizar tareas en Gmail, Calendar, Drive y otros servicios de Google. Requiere configuración de OAuth.","fr":"gog est un outil de ligne de commande qui permet d''automatiser des tâches dans Gmail, Calendar, Drive et d''autres services Google. Nécessite une configuration OAuth.","de":"gog ist ein Kommandozeilen-Tool, das die Automatisierung von Aufgaben in Gmail, Calendar, Drive und anderen Google-Diensten ermöglicht. Erfordert OAuth-Konfiguration.","pt":"O gog é uma ferramenta de linha de comando para integração com serviços do Google, como Gmail e Google Drive. Ele permite a automação de tarefas e consultas.","ru":"gog - это утилита командной строки для интеграции с сервисами Google, такими как Gmail и Google Drive. Он позволяет автоматизировать задачи и запросы.","ar":"gog هو أداة سطر أوامر للتحكم في تطبيقات جوجل المختلفة مثل جيميل و جوجل درايف. يمكنه توفير الوقت والجهد من خلال Automação والاستعلامات.","en":"MarketBot is a finance-customized version of openclaw, built as a dedicated AI agent for market intelligence, trading analysis, and decision support."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Gog AI代理技能：市场智能和交易分析","ja":"Gog AIエージェントスキル：市場インテリジェンスとトレーディング分析","ko":"Gog AI 에이전트 스킬: 시장 지능 및 거래 분석","es":"gog: Herramienta de automatización de Gmail y Google","fr":"gog : Outil d''automatisation de Gmail et Google","de":"gog: Werkzeug für die Automatisierung von Gmail und Google","pt":"gog: Ferramenta de Integração com Gmail e Google Apps","ru":"gog: Инструмент для интеграции с Gmail и Google Apps","ar":"gog: أداة التكامل مع جيميل وتطبيقات جوجل","en":"gog"},"description":{"zh":"Gog AI代理技能是市场智能和交易分析的专用AI代理，用于提供市场分析和交易决策支持","ja":"Gog AIエージェントスキルは、市場インテリジェンスとトレーディング分析のための専用AIエージェントです","ko":"Gog AI 에이전트 스킬은 시장 지능 및 거래 분석을 위한 전용 AI 에이전트입니다","es":"gog es una herramienta de línea de comandos que permite automatizar tareas en Gmail, Calendar, Drive y otros servicios de Google. Requiere configuración de O...","fr":"gog est un outil de ligne de commande qui permet d''automatiser des tâches dans Gmail, Calendar, Drive et d''autres services Google. Nécessite une configuratio...","de":"gog ist ein Kommandozeilen-Tool, das die Automatisierung von Aufgaben in Gmail, Calendar, Drive und anderen Google-Diensten ermöglicht. Erfordert OAuth-Konfi...","pt":"O gog é uma ferramenta de linha de comando para integração com serviços do Google, como Gmail e Google Drive. Ele permite a automação de tarefas e consultas.","ru":"gog - это утилита командной строки для интеграции с сервисами Google, такими как Gmail и Google Drive. Он позволяет автоматизировать задачи и запросы.","ar":"gog هو أداة سطر أوامر للتحكم في تطبيقات جوجل المختلفة مثل جيميل و جوجل درايف. يمكنه توفير الوقت والجهد من خلال Automação والاستعلامات.","en":"MarketBot is a finance-customized version of openclaw, built as a dedicated AI agent for market intelligence, trading analysis, and decision support."},"definition":{"en":"MarketBot is a finance-customized version of openclaw, built as a dedicated AI agent for market intelligence, trading analysis, and decision support."},"features":{"zh":["市场智能分析","交易分析和决策支持","Gmail/Calendar/Drive/Contacts/Sheets/Docs集成","OAuth认证支持","自定义搜索和消息筛选"],"ja":["市場インテリジェンス分析","トレーディング分析と意思決定サポート","Gmail/Calendar/Drive/Contacts/Sheets/Docs統合","OAuth認証サポート","カスタム検索とメッセージフィルタリング"],"ko":["시장 지능 분석","거래 분석 및 의사 결정 지원","Gmail/Calendar/Drive/Contacts/Sheets/Docs 통합","OAuth 인증 지원","사용자 정의 검색 및 메시지 필터링"],"es":["Automatización de tareas en Gmail y otros servicios de Google","Configuración de OAuth para autenticación segura","Búsqueda y envío de correos electrónicos con comandos personalizados","Compatibilidad con múltiples cuentas y servicios de Google","Interfaz de línea de comandos para una integración fácil con scripts y herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["Automatisation de tâches dans Gmail et d''autres services Google","Configuration OAuth pour une authentification sécurisée","Recherche et envoi d''e-mails avec des commandes personnalisées","Compatibilité avec plusieurs comptes et services Google","Interface de ligne de commande pour une intégration facile avec des scripts et des outils de développement"],"de":["Automatisierung von Aufgaben in Gmail und anderen Google-Diensten","OAuth-Konfiguration für eine sichere Authentifizierung","Suchen und Senden von E-Mails mit benutzerdefinierten Befehlen","Unterstützung für mehrere Konten und Google-Dienste","Kommandozeilen-Schnittstelle für eine einfache Integration mit Skripten und Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["Integração com Gmail","Acesso ao Google Drive","Gerenciamento de contatos","Agendamento de eventos no Calendar","Envio de emails","Suporte a múltiplos serviços do Google"],"ru":["Интеграция с Gmail","Доступ к Google Drive","Управление контактами","Планирование событий в Calendar","Отправка писем","Поддержка множества сервисов Google"],"ar":["التكامل مع جيميل","الوصول إلى جوجل درايف","إدارة جهات الاتصال","التقويم في كالندر","إرسال البريد الإلكتروني","دعم تطبيقات جوجل المتعددة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Gog AI代理技能","市场智能","交易分析","决策支持","Gmail集成","OAuth认证"],"ja":["Gog AIエージェントスキル","市場インテリジェンス","トレーディング分析","意思決定サポート","Gmail統合","OAuth認証"],"ko":["Gog AI 에이전트 스킬","시장 지능","거래 분석","의사 결정 지원","Gmail 통합","OAuth 인증"],"es":["gog","automatización de Gmail","automatización de Google","OAuth","línea de comandos","desarrollo de software","productividad","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["gog","automatisation de Gmail","automatisation de Google","OAuth","ligne de commande","développement de logiciels","productivité","outils de développement"],"de":["gog","Automatisierung von Gmail","Automatisierung von Google","OAuth","Kommandozeile","Software-Entwicklung","Produktivität","Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["gog","integração com gmail","google drive","automatização de tarefas","ferramenta de linha de comando","serviços do google","gerenciamento de contatos","agendamento de eventos"],"ru":["gog","интеграция с gmail","google drive","автоматизация задач","утилита командной строки","сервисы google","управление контактами","планирование событий"],"ar":["gog","التكامل مع جيميل","جوجل درايف","توفير الوقت والجهد","أداة سطر أوامر","تطبيقات جوجل","إدارة جهات الاتصال","التقويم"]}},"owner":"EthanAlgoX","repo":"MarketBot","repoPath":"EthanAlgoX/MarketBot","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.877Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"gog","description":"Google Workspace CLI for Gmail, Calendar, Drive, Contacts, Sheets, and Docs.","bodyPreview":"# gog\n\nUse `gog` for Gmail/Calendar/Drive/Contacts/Sheets/Docs. Requires OAuth setup.\n\nSetup (once)\n- `gog auth credentials /path/to/client_secret.json`\n- `gog auth add you@gmail.com --services gmail,calendar,drive,contacts,docs,sheets`\n- `gog auth list`\n\nCommon commands\n- Gmail search: `gog gmail search ''newer_than:7d'' --max 10`\n- Gmail messages search (per email, ignores threading): `gog gmail messages search \"in:inbox from:ryanair.com\" --max 20 --account you@example.com`\n- Gmail send (plain):","body":"# gog\n\nUse `gog` for Gmail/Calendar/Drive/Contacts/Sheets/Docs. Requires OAuth setup.\n\nSetup (once)\n- `gog auth credentials /path/to/client_secret.json`\n- `gog auth add you@gmail.com --services gmail,calendar,drive,contacts,docs,sheets`\n- `gog auth list`\n\nCommon commands\n- Gmail search: `gog gmail search ''newer_than:7d'' --max 10`\n- Gmail messages search (per email, ignores threading): `gog gmail messages search \"in:inbox from:ryanair.com\" --max 20 --account you@example.com`\n- Gmail send (plain): `gog gmail send --to a@b.com --subject \"Hi\" --body \"Hello\"`\n- Gmail send (multi-line): `gog gmail send --to a@b.com --subject \"Hi\" --body-file ./message.txt`\n- Gmail send (stdin): `gog gmail send --to a@b.com --subject \"Hi\" --body-file -`\n- Gmail send (HTML): `gog gmail send --to a@b.com --subject \"Hi\" --body-html \"<p>Hello</p>\"`\n- Gmail draft: `gog gmail drafts create --to a@b.com --subject \"Hi\" --body-file ./message.txt`\n- Gmail send draft: `gog gmail drafts send <draftId>`\n- Gmail reply: `gog gmail send --to a@b.com --subject \"Re: Hi\" --body \"Reply\" --reply-to-message-id <msgId>`\n- Calendar list events: `gog calendar events <calendarId> --from <iso> --to <iso>`\n- Calendar create event: `gog calendar create <calendarId> --summary \"Title\" --from <iso> --to <iso>`\n- Calendar create with color: `gog calendar create <calendarId> --summary \"Title\" --from <iso> --to <iso> --event-color 7`\n- Calendar update event: `gog calendar update <calendarId> <eventId> --summary \"New Title\" --event-color 4`\n- Calendar show colors: `gog calendar colors`\n- Drive search: `gog drive search \"query\" --max 10`\n- Contacts: `gog contacts list --max 20`\n- Sheets get: `gog sheets get <sheetId> \"Tab!A1:D10\" --json`\n- Sheets update: `gog sheets update <sheetId> \"Tab!A1:B2\" --values-json ''[[\"A\",\"B\"],[\"1\",\"2\"]]'' --input USER_ENTERED`\n- Sheets append: `gog sheets append <sheetId> \"Tab!A:C\" --values-json ''[[\"x\",\"y\",\"z\"]]'' --insert INSERT_ROWS`\n- Sheets clear: `gog sheets clear <sheetId> \"Tab!A2:Z\"`\n- Sheets metadata: `gog sheets metadata <sheetId> --json`\n- Docs export: `gog docs export <docId> --format txt --out /tmp/doc.txt`\n- Docs cat: `gog docs cat <docId>`\n\nCalendar Colors\n- Use `gog calendar colors` to see all available event colors (IDs 1-11)\n- Add colors to events with `--event-color <id>` flag\n- Event color IDs (from `gog calendar colors` output):\n  - 1: #a4bdfc\n  - 2: #7ae7bf\n  - 3: #dbadff\n  - 4: #ff887c\n  - 5: #fbd75b\n  - 6: #ffb878\n  - 7: #46d6db\n  - 8: #e1e1e1\n  - 9: #5484ed\n  - 10: #51b749\n  - 11: #dc2127\n\nEmail Formatting\n- Prefer plain text. Use `--body-file` for multi-paragraph messages (or `--body-file -` for stdin).\n- Same `--body-file` pattern works for drafts and replies.\n- `--body` does not unescape `\\n`. If you need inline newlines, use a heredoc or `$''Line 1\\n\\nLine 2''`.\n- Use `--body-html` only when you need rich formatting.\n- HTML tags: `<p>` for paragraphs, `<br>` for line breaks, `<strong>` for bold, `<em>` for italic, `<a href=\"url\">` for links, `<ul>`/`<li>` for lists.\n- Example (plain text via stdin):\n  ```bash\n  gog gmail send --to recipient@example.com \\\n    --subject \"Meeting Follow-up\" \\\n    --body-file - <<''EOF''\n  Hi Name,\n\n  Thanks for meeting today. Next steps:\n  - Item one\n  - Item two\n\n  Best regards,\n  Your Name\n  EOF\n  ```\n- Example (HTML list):\n  ```bash\n  gog gmail send --to recipient@example.com \\\n    --subject \"Meeting Follow-up\" \\\n    --body-html \"<p>Hi Name,</p><p>Thanks for meeting today. Here are the next steps:</p><ul><li>Item one</li><li>Item two</li></ul><p>Best regards,<br>Your Name</p>\"\n  ```\n\nNotes\n- Set `GOG_ACCOUNT=you@gmail.com` to avoid repeating `--account`.\n- For scripting, prefer `--json` plus `--no-input`.\n- Sheets values can be passed via `--values-json` (recommended) or as inline rows.\n- Docs supports export/cat/copy. In-place edits require a Docs API client (not in gog).\n- Confirm before sending mail or creating events.\n- `gog gmail search` returns one row per thread; use `gog gmail messages search` when you need every individual email returned separately.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:07:14.872Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Cloud Integration Agents requiring seamless interaction with Google services like Gmail, Calendar, and Drive.","zh":"适用于需要与Google服务（如Gmail、日历和Drive）进行无缝交互的云集成代理的理想选择。","ja":"Gmail、カレンダー、ドライブなどのGoogleサービスとのシームレスな相互作用を必要とするクラウド統合エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Gmail, 달력, 드라이브 등 Google 서비스와의無縫한 상호 작용이 필요한 클라우드 통합 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de integración en la nube que requieren interacción sin problemas con servicios de Google como Gmail, Calendar y Drive.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''intégration cloud nécessitant une interaction transparente avec les services Google tels que Gmail, Calendar et Drive.","de":"Ideal für Cloud-Integration-Agents, die eine nahtlose Interaktion mit Google-Diensten wie Gmail, Calendar und Drive erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Integração em Nuvem que exigem interação sem problemas com serviços do Google, como Gmail, Calendar e Drive.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов интеграции в облаке, требующих бесшовного взаимодействия с сервисами Google, такими как Gmail, Calendar и Drive.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التكامل السحابي الذي يتطلب التفاعل الخالي من المشاكل مع خدمات جوجل مثل جيميل والتقويم ودرايف."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate tasks using OAuth setup, facilitating secure access to Gmail, Calendar, Drive, Contacts, Sheets, and Docs through commands like `gog gmail search` and `gog auth add`, leveraging services such as Gmail messages search and send capabilities.","zh":"赋予代理自动执行任务的能力，使用OAuth设置，通过命令如`gog gmail search`和`gog auth add`，实现对Gmail、日历、驱动器、联系人、表格和文档的安全访问，利用Gmail消息搜索和发送能力等服务。","ja":"OAuth設定を使用してエージェントにタスクの自動化を可能にし、`gog gmail search`や`gog auth add`などのコマンドを使用してGmail、カレンダー、ドライブ、連絡先、スプレッドシート、ドキュメントへの安全なアクセスを提供し、Gmailメッセージの検索や送信機能などのサービスを活用します。","ko":"OAuth 설정을 사용하여 에이전트가 작업을 자동화하도록 ermöglicht하고, `gog gmail search` 및 `gog auth add`와 같은 명령을 사용하여 Gmail, 달력, 드라이브, 연락처, 시트, 문서에 대한 보안 액세스를 제공하고, Gmail 메시지 검색 및 전송 기능과 같은 서비스를 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar tareas mediante la configuración de OAuth, lo que facilita el acceso seguro a Gmail, Calendar, Drive, Contactos, Sheets y Docs a través de comandos como `gog gmail search` y `gog auth add`, aprovechando servicios como la búsqueda y el envío de mensajes de Gmail.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser des tâches en utilisant la configuration OAuth, facilitant ainsi l''accès sécurisé à Gmail, Calendar, Drive, Contacts, Sheets et Docs via des commandes telles que `gog gmail search` et `gog auth add`, en exploitant des services tels que la recherche et les capacités d''envoi de messages Gmail.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Aufgaben mit der OAuth-Konfiguration zu automatisieren, wodurch ein sicherer Zugriff auf Gmail, Calendar, Drive, Kontakte, Sheets und Docs über Befehle wie `gog gmail search` und `gog auth add` ermöglicht wird, indem Dienste wie die Suche und Sendefunktionen von Gmail genutzt werden.","pt":"Permite que os agentes automatizem tarefas usando a configuração OAuth, facilitando o acesso seguro ao Gmail, Calendar, Drive, Contatos, Planilhas e Docs por meio de comandos como `gog gmail search` e `gog auth add`, aproveitando serviços como a pesquisa e capacidades de envio de mensagens do Gmail.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать задачи с помощью настройки OAuth, обеспечивая безопасный доступ к Gmail, Calendar, Drive, Контакты, Таблицы и Документы через команды типа `gog gmail search` и `gog auth add`, используя сервисы, такие как поиск и отправка сообщений Gmail.","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من توفير مهام باستخدام إعداد OAuth، و تسهيل الوصول الآمن إلى جيميل والتقويم ودرايف والاتصال والأوراق والوثائق من خلال أوامر مثل `gog gmail search` و `gog auth add`، و استخدام خدمات مثل البحث وإمكانيات إرسال رسائل جيميل."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Gmail searches with specific filters like ''newer_than:7d''","Generating reports by searching Gmail messages from specific senders","Synchronizing Google Calendar events with agent tasks"],"zh":["使用特定过滤器（如''newer_than:7d''）自动执行Gmail搜索","通过搜索来自特定发件人的Gmail消息生成报告","同步Google日历事件与代理任务"],"ja":["特定のフィルタ（例：''newer_than:7d''）を使用してGmail検索を自動化する","特定の送信者からのGmailメッセージを検索してレポートを生成する","Googleカレンダーのイベントをエージェントのタスクと同期する"],"ko":["특정 필터（예： ''newer_than:7d''）를 사용하여 Gmail 검색 자동화","특정 발신자로부터의 Gmail 메시지를 검색하여 보고서 생성","Google 달력의 이벤트를 에이전트의 작업과 동기화"],"es":["Automatizar búsquedas de Gmail con filtros específicos como ''newer_than:7d''","Generar informes mediante la búsqueda de mensajes de Gmail de remitentes específicos","Sincronizar eventos de Google Calendar con tareas de agente"],"fr":["Automatiser des recherches Gmail avec des filtres spécifiques tels que ''newer_than:7d''","Générer des rapports en recherchant des messages Gmail d''expéditeurs spécifiques","Synchroniser les événements Google Calendar avec les tâches d''agent"],"de":["Automatisieren von Gmail-Suchen mit spezifischen Filtern wie ''newer_than:7d''","Erstellen von Berichten durch die Suche nach Gmail-Nachrichten von bestimmten Absendern","Synchronisieren von Google-Kalender-Ereignissen mit Agentenaufgaben"],"pt":["Automatizar pesquisas no Gmail com filtros específicos como ''newer_than:7d''","Gerar relatórios pesquisando mensagens do Gmail de remetentes específicos","Sincronizar eventos do Google Calendar com tarefas do agente"],"ru":["Автоматизировать поиск в Gmail с конкретными фильтрами, такими как ''newer_than:7d''","Генерировать отчеты, выполняя поиск сообщений Gmail от конкретных отправителей","Синхронизировать события Google Calendar с задачами агента"],"ar":["توفير عمليات بحث في جيميل باستخدام مرشحات محددة مثل ''newer_than:7d''","توليد تقارير من خلال البحث عن رسائل جيميل من مرسلين محددين","تماشى أحداث جوجل كالندار مع مهام العميل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires OAuth setup with client_secret.json","Needs explicit service activation through `gog auth add`","Limited to Google services such as Gmail, Calendar, Drive, Contacts, Sheets, and Docs"],"zh":["需要使用client_secret.json进行OAuth设置","需要通过`gog auth add`显式激活服务","仅限于Gmail、日历、驱动器、联系人、表格和文档等Google服务"],"ja":["client_secret.jsonを使用したOAuth設定が必要","`gog auth add`を使用したサービス明示的アクティベーションが必要","Gmail、カレンダー、ドライブ、連絡先、スプレッドシート、ドキュメントなどのGoogleサービスのみに限定"],"ko":["client_secret.json을 사용한 OAuth 설정이 필요","`gog auth add`를 사용한 서비스 명시적 활성화 필요","Gmail, 달력, 드라이브, 연락처, 시트, 문서 등의 Google 서비스만으로 제한"],"es":["Requiere configuración de OAuth con client_secret.json","Necesita activación explícita del servicio a través de `gog auth add`","Limitado a servicios de Google como Gmail, Calendar, Drive, Contactos, Sheets y Docs"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration OAuth avec client_secret.json","Nécessite une activation explicite du service via `gog auth add`","Limité aux services Google tels que Gmail, Calendar, Drive, Contacts, Sheets et Docs"],"de":["Benötigt OAuth-Konfiguration mit client_secret.json","Benötigt explizite Aktivierung des Dienstes über `gog auth add`","Begrenzt auf Google-Dienste wie Gmail, Calendar, Drive, Kontakte, Sheets und Docs"],"pt":["Exige configuração OAuth com client_secret.json","Necessita de ativação explícita do serviço por meio de `gog auth add`","Limitado a serviços do Google, como Gmail, Calendar, Drive, Contatos, Planilhas e Docs"],"ru":["Требует настройки OAuth с client_secret.json","Требует явной активации сервиса через `gog auth add`","Ограничен сервисами Google, такими как Gmail, Calendar, Drive, Контакты, Таблицы и Документы"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد OAuth مع client_secret.json","يحتاج إلى تفعيل خدمة صريح من خلال `gog auth add`","محدود بخدمات جوجل مثل جيميل والتقويم ودرايف والاتصال والأوراق والوثائق"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"4882b9f7160c6a8b3692e1b001a1df9aa0835908cac934bed3f33361f73fbfe6","qualityScore":42}');
