tantes","efficacité et évolutivité","sécurité et fiabilité","comment utiliser core-dev","alternatives à core-dev","installation de core-dev","guide de configuration de core-dev"],"de":["KI-Tools","core-dev","Serverless-Workflow-Laufzeit","bestehende Infrastrukturen","Effizienz und Skalierbarkeit","Sicherheit und Zuverlässigkeit","wie man core-dev verwendet","Alternativen zu core-dev","Installation von core-dev","Konfigurationsanleitung für core-dev"],"pt":["como usar Core-Dev","o que é Workflow DSL","Core-Dev alternativa","Core-Dev vs AWS Step Functions","instalar Core-Dev","guia de configuração do Core-Dev","desenvolvimento de workflows serverless","otimização de infraestrutura"],"ru":["как использовать Core-Dev","что такое Workflow DSL","Core-Dev альтернатива","Core-Dev vs AWS Step Functions","установить Core-Dev","руководство по настройке Core-Dev","разработка серверных рабочих процессов","оптимизация инфраструктуры"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام Core-Dev","ما هو Workflow DSL","بديل Core-Dev","Core-Dev مقابل AWS Step Functions","تثبيت Core-Dev","دليل إعداد Core-Dev","تطوير عمليات العمل بدون خادم","تحسين البنية التحتية"]}},"owner":"lemline","repo":"lemline","repoPath":"lemline/lemline","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.893Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"core-dev","description":">","bodyPreview":"# Lemline Core Development Guide\n\n## Purpose\n\nGuide development of the lemline-core module - the pure, stateless workflow execution engine implementing the Serverless\nWorkflow DSL v1.0 specification.\n\n**Documentation:**\n\n- [Overview](lemline-core/docs/core-overview.md) - Module structure, DSL parsing, adding tasks\n- [Nodes](lemline-core/docs/core-nodes.md) - Node tree, NodePosition, navigation\n- [Orchestrators](lemline-core/docs/core-orchestrators.md) - StepByStep vs Full execution\n- [Processors","body":"# Lemline Core Development Guide\n\n## Purpose\n\nGuide development of the lemline-core module - the pure, stateless workflow execution engine implementing the Serverless\nWorkflow DSL v1.0 specification.\n\n**Documentation:**\n\n- [Overview](lemline-core/docs/core-overview.md) - Module structure, DSL parsing, adding tasks\n- [Nodes](lemline-core/docs/core-nodes.md) - Node tree, NodePosition, navigation\n- [Orchestrators](lemline-core/docs/core-orchestrators.md) - StepByStep vs Full execution\n- [Processors](lemline-core/docs/core-processors.md) - NodeProcessor, control flows, activities\n- [Fork](lemline-core/docs/core-fork.md) - Parallel branches, error boundaries\n- [Errors](lemline-core/docs/core-errors.md) - Exceptions, retry, error handling\n- [States](lemline-core/docs/core-states.md) - TaskState, WorkflowCommand, WorkflowEvent\n- [Expressions](lemline-core/docs/core-expressions.md) - JQ evaluation, scope variables\n\n---\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### If you need to change something in...\n\n**Orchestration:**\n\nFirst, read [core-orchestrators.md](lemline-core/docs/core-orchestrators.md)\n\n- **Change step execution flow** →\n  Modify [StepByStepOrchestrator.kt](lemline-core/src/main/kotlin/com/lemline/core/orchestrator/StepByStepOrchestrator.kt)\n- **Change synchronous test execution** →\n  Modify [FullOrchestrator.kt](lemline-core/src/main/kotlin/com/lemline/core/orchestrator/FullOrchestrator.kt)\n- **Add a new WorkflowCommand/Event** →\n  Modify [WorkflowState.kt](lemline-core/src/main/kotlin/com/lemline/core/orchestrator/WorkflowState.kt)\n\n**Nodes:**\n\nFirst, read [core-nodes.md](lemline-core/docs/core-nodes.md)\n\n- **Change node tree structure** →\n  Modify [Node.kt](lemline-core/src/main/kotlin/com/lemline/core/nodes/Node.kt)\n- **Add a new Token type** →\n  Modify [Token.kt](lemline-core/src/main/kotlin/com/lemline/core/nodes/Token.kt)\n- **Change position addressing** →\n  Modify [NodePosition.kt](lemline-core/src/main/kotlin/com/lemline/core/nodes/NodePosition.kt)\n\n**Processors:**\n\nFirst, read [core-processors.md](lemline-core/docs/core-processors.md)\n\n- **Add a new task type** → Read [core-overview.md](lemline-core/docs/core-overview.md#adding-a-new-task-type)\n- **Change control flow logic (Do, For, Switch)** →\n  Modify `processors/DoProcessor.kt`, `ForProcessor.kt`, `SwitchProcessor.kt`\n- **Change activity behavior (Wait, Call, Run)** →\n  Modify `processors/WaitProcessor.kt`, `CallProcessor.kt`, `RunProcessor.kt`\n\n**States:**\n\nFirst, read [core-states.md](lemline-core/docs/core-states.md)\n\n- **Add a new TaskState** → Create in `states/` directory, extend `TaskState`\n- **Change scope variables** → Modify the `scope` property in the relevant state class\n- **Change state serialization** → Modify `TaskStates.kt`\n\n**Error Handling:**\n\nFirst, read [core-errors.md](lemline-core/docs/core-errors.md)\n\n- **Change retry logic** →\n  Modify [TryProcessor.kt](lemline-core/src/main/kotlin/com/lemline/core/processors/TryProcessor.kt)\n- **Add a new AsyncTaskException** →\n  Modify [AsyncTaskException.kt](lemline-core/src/main/kotlin/com/lemline/core/errors/AsyncTaskException.kt)\n- **Change error types** →\n  Modify [WorkflowException.kt](lemline-core/src/main/kotlin/com/lemline/core/errors/WorkflowException.kt)\n\n**Expressions:**\n\nFirst, read [core-expressions.md](lemline-core/docs/core-expressions.md)\n\n- **Change JQ evaluation** →\n  Modify [JQExpression.kt](lemline-core/src/main/kotlin/com/lemline/core/expressions/JQExpression.kt)\n- **Add scope variables** → Modify the relevant state class''s `scope` property\n- **Change input/output transformation** → Modify transformation helpers in orchestrator\n\n**Fork/Parallel:**\n\nFirst, read [core-fork.md](lemline-core/docs/core-fork.md)\n\n- **Change fork execution** →\n  Modify [ForkProcessor.kt](lemline-core/src/main/kotlin/com/lemline/core/processors/ForkProcessor.kt)\n- **Change branch detection** → Modify `forkBranchCompleted`/`forkBranchFailed` in `StepByStepOrchestrator.kt`\n\n**DSL Parsing:**\n\nFirst, read [core-overview.md](lemline-core/docs/core-overview.md#dsl-parsing)\n\n- **Change parsing logic** →\n  Modify [DefinitionCache.kt](lemline-core/src/main/kotlin/com/lemline/core/definitions/DefinitionCache.kt)\n\n---\n\n## Critical Rules\n\n### ✅ ALWAYS Do This\n\n1. **Keep processors stateless** - receive state, return updated state via `NextStepInfo`\n2. **Use exception-driven control flow** - throw `AsyncTaskException` for wait/fork/runWorkflow\n3. **Serialize all state** - `TaskState` subclasses must be `@Serializable`\n4. **Clean up states** - return `null` in `stateUpdates` when leaving a node\n5. **Provide scope variables** - override `scope` property when state provides expression variables\n6. **Test with FullOrchestrator** - use for unit testing workflow logic\n7. **Build node tree lazily** - use `by lazy` for `children` property\n8. **Use `FlowDirective`** - `Continue`, `End`, or `Then(target)` for navigation\n\n### ❌ NEVER Do This\n\n1. **Store mutable state in processors** - processors are stateless\n2. **Modify Node objects** - nodes are immutable definitions\n3. **Skip state serialization** - breaks stateless worker pattern\n4. **Use blocking operations** - all I/O should be in `suspend` functions\n5. **Throw regular exceptions for control flow** - use `AsyncTaskException` subtypes\n6. **Ignore `Direction` parameter** - behavior differs based on entry direction\n7. **Leak state across branches** - clean states when completing fork branches\n\n---\n\n## Architecture Overview\n\n### Step-by-Step Execution Model\n\n```\nWorkflowCommand\n    │\n    ▼\nOrchestrator.runByTask()\n    │\n    ├── Check if condition (skip if false)\n    ├── Transform input (inputFrom)\n    ├── Get processor for node\n    └── Call processor.getNextStepInfo()\n            │\n            ├── AsyncTaskException ──► WaitStarted/ForkStarted/RunWorkflowStarted\n            │\n            └── NextStepInfo ──► completeTask()\n                                    ├── Transform output (outputAs)\n                                    ├── Export to context (exportAs)\n                                    └── Navigate to next\n                                            │\n                                            └── TaskScheduled/WorkflowCompleted/WorkflowFailed\n```\n\n### Key Files\n\n| Purpose | File |\n|---------|------|\n| Step orchestration | `orchestrator/StepByStepOrchestrator.kt` |\n| Full execution | `orchestrator/FullOrchestrator.kt` |\n| Node structure | `nodes/Node.kt` |\n| Position addressing | `nodes/NodePosition.kt` |\n| Processor interface | `processors/NodeProcessor.kt` |\n| Base state | `states/TaskState.kt` |\n| Commands/Events | `orchestrator/WorkflowState.kt` |\n| JQ evaluation | `expressions/JQExpression.kt` |\n| DSL parsing | `definitions/DefinitionCache.kt` |\n\n---\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Creating a New Processor\n\n```kotlin\n// 1. State class\n@Serializable\ndata class CustomState(\n    override val startedAt: Instant = Clock.System.now(),\n    val customField: String = \"\"\n) : TaskState() {\n    // Optional: provide scope variables\n    override val scope: Scope get() = buildJsonObject {\n        put(\"custom\", JsonPrimitive(customField))\n    }\n}\n\n// 2. Processor\nclass CustomProcessor(override val node: Node<CustomTask>) : NodeProcessor<CustomTask, CustomState> {\n    override fun createInitialState() = CustomState()\n\n    override fun getNextStepInfo(state: CustomState, dataset: JsonElement, scope: Scope, direction: Direction): NextStepInfo<CustomState> {\n        return when (direction) {\n            FROM_PARENT -> {\n                // Process task\n                NextStepInfo(\n                    state = state,\n                    rawOutput = result,\n                    stateUpdates = mapOf(node.position to null), // Clean up\n                    flowDirective = FlowDirective.Continue\n                )\n            }\n            FROM_CHILD -> { /* Handle child completion */ }\n            else -> { /* Handle other directions */ }\n        }\n    }\n}\n\n// 3. Register in factory\nfun createProcessor(node: Node<*>) = when (node.task) {\n    is CustomTask -> CustomProcessor(node as Node<CustomTask>)\n    // ...\n}\n```\n\n### Throwing AsyncTaskException\n\n```kotlin\n// For activities that need orchestrator coordination\noverride fun getNextStepInfo(...): NextStepInfo<WaitState> {\n    throw AsyncTaskException.WaitStartedException(\n        state = state,\n        transformedInput = dataset,\n        config = WaitStartedException.Config(waitUntil = calculateWaitUntil())\n    )\n}\n```\n\n### Handling Navigation\n\n```kotlin\noverride fun getNextStepInfo(state, dataset, scope, direction) = when (direction) {\n    FROM_PARENT -> {\n        // First entry - initialize and go to first child\n        NextStepInfo(state = initialState, flowDirective = Continue)\n    }\n    FROM_CHILD -> {\n        if (hasMoreChildren) {\n            NextStepInfo(state = nextState, flowDirective = Continue)\n        } else {\n            // Done - clean up state and return to parent\n            NextStepInfo(stateUpdates = mapOf(node.position to null), flowDirective = Continue)\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Testing Patterns\n\n### Unit Test with FullOrchestrator\n\n```kotlin\n@Test\nfun `should execute workflow`() = runTest {\n    val yaml = \"\"\"\n        document:\n          name: test\n          version: \"1.0\"\n        do:\n          - myTask:\n              set:\n                result: \"success\"\n    \"\"\".trimIndent()\n\n    val workflow = DefinitionCache.parse(yaml)\n    val orchestrator = FullOrchestrator(activityRunner, definitionLoader)\n\n    val result = orchestrator.start(workflow, JsonObject(mapOf()))\n\n    assertEquals(\"success\", result.jsonObject[\"result\"]?.jsonPrimitive?.content)\n}\n```\n\n### Testing Individual Processors\n\n```kotlin\n@Test\nfun `DoProcessor should iterate children`() {\n    val node = createDoNode(childCount = 3)\n    val processor = DoProcessor(node)\n\n    val result = processor.getNextStepInfo(\n        state = processor.createInitialState(),\n        dataset = JsonObject(mapOf()),\n        scope = JsonObject(mapOf()),\n        direction = Direction.FROM_PARENT\n    )\n\n    assertEquals(0, (result.state as DoState).index)\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Running Tests\n\n```bash\n# All tests\n./gradlew :lemline-core:test\n\n# Specific test class\n./gradlew :lemline-core:test --tests \"com.lemline.core.tests.MyTest\"\n\n# Specific test method\n./gradlew :lemline-core:test --tests \"com.lemline.core.tests.MyTest.should do something\"\n```\n\n---\n\n## Related Documentation\n\n- **CLAUDE.md** - Project-wide guidelines and architecture overview\n- **runner-dev skill** - lemline-runner module (messaging, persistence, CLI)\n- **Serverless Workflow DSL** - https://serverlessworkflow.io/\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:10:24.738Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Advanced Workflow Agents requiring efficient, event-driven Serverless Workflow DSL runtime integration","zh":"非常适合需要高效、事件驱动的 Serverless Workflow DSL 运行时集成的高级工作流 Agent","ja":"効率的でイベント駆動型の Serverless Workflow DSL ランタイム統合を必要とする高度なワークフロー Agent に最適","ko":"효율적이고 이벤트 기반의 Serverless Workflow DSL 런타임 통합이 필요한 고급 워크플로우 에이전트에 이상적","es":"Ideal para agentes de flujo de trabajo avanzados que requieren una integración de tiempo de ejecución de DSL de flujo de trabajo serverless eficiente y basada en eventos","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de workflow avancés qui nécessitent une intégration de temps de exécution de DSL de workflow serverless efficace et basée sur les événements","de":"Ideal für Advanced Workflow Agents, die eine effiziente, ereignisgesteuerte Serverless Workflow DSL Runtime Integration benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Fluxo de Trabalho Avançados que exigem integração de tempo de execução de fluxo de trabalho sem servidor eficiente e baseada em eventos","ru":"Идеально для Продвинутых Агентов Workflow, требующих эффективной, событийно-ориентированной интеграции безсерверного DSL рабочего процесса","ar":"مثالي لعميل تدفق العمل المتقدم الذي يتطلب تكامل وقت تشغيل كفء وقائم على الحدث ل.dsl تدفق العمل بدون خادم"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to execute stateless workflows with minimal database reliance, leveraging the Serverless Workflow DSL v1.0 specification and efficient node tree navigation, while supporting both StepByStep and Full execution orchestrators","zh":"赋能 Agent 执行无状态工作流，最大限度地减少对数据库的依赖，利用 Serverless Workflow DSL v1.0 规范和高效的节点树导航，同时支持 StepByStep 和 Full 执行协调器","ja":"Serverless Workflow DSL v1.0 仕様と効率的なノードツリーナビゲーションを活用し、StepByStep および Full 実行オーケストレーターの両方をサポートしながら、データベースへの依存を最小限に抑えたステートレスワークフローの実行を Agent に可能にします","ko":"Serverless Workflow DSL v1.0 사양과 효율적인 노드 트리 탐색을 활용하여 데이터베이스 의존성을 최소화하면서 무상태 워크플로우를 실행할 수 있도록 에이전트에 권한을 부여하며, StepByStep 및 Full 실행 오케스트레이터를 모두 지원합니다","es":"Empodera a los agentes para ejecutar flujos de trabajo sin estado con una dependencia mínima de base de datos, aprovechando la especificación de DSL de flujo de trabajo serverless v1.0 y una navegación eficiente de árbol de nodos, mientras que admite ambos ejecutores de StepByStep y Full","fr":"Empodera a los agentes para ejecutar flujos de trabajo sin estado con una dependencia mínima de base de datos, aprovechando la especificación de DSL de flujo de trabajo serverless v1.0 y una navegación eficiente de árbol de nodos, mientras que admite ambos ejecutores de StepByStep y Full","de":"Empodera a los agentes, um stateless Workflows mit minimaler Datenbankabhängigkeit auszuführen, indem es die Serverless Workflow DSL v1.0 Spezifikation und eine effiziente Node Tree Navigation nutzt, während es sowohl StepByStep als auch Full Ausführungsorchestratoren unterstützt","pt":"Habilita os agentes a executar fluxos de trabalho sem estado com mínima dependência de banco de dados, aproveitando a especificação Serverless Workflow DSL v1.0 e navegação eficiente de árvore de nodes, além de suportar ambos os orquestradores de execução StepByStep e Full","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выполнять бесстатные рабочие процессы с минимальной зависимостью от базы данных, используя спецификацию Serverless Workflow DSL v1.0 и эффективную навигацию по дереву узлов, а также поддерживает как StepByStep, так и Full исполнительные оркестраторы","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تنفيذ سلاسل عمل بدون حالة مع اعتماد حداقل على قاعدة البيانات، مستفيدا من مواصفات.dsl تدفق العمل بدون خادم v1.0 وتحريك شجرة العقد بكفاءة، ودعم كل من مشغل تنفيذ StepByStep ومشغل تنفيذ Full"},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing serverless workflows on existing infrastructure","Optimizing event-driven workflow execution","Developing custom workflow nodes and orchestrators"],"zh":["在现有基础设施上实现 Serverless 工作流","优化事件驱动的工作流执行","开发自定义工作流节点和协调器"],"ja":["既存のインフラストラクチャ上での Serverless ワークフローの実装","イベント駆動型ワークフロー実行の最適化","カスタムワークフローノードとオーケストレーターの開発"],"ko":["기존 인프라에서 Serverless 워크플로우 구현","이벤트 기반 워크플로우 실행 최적화","사용자 정의 워크플로우 노드 및 오케스트레이터 개발"],"es":["Implementar flujos de trabajo serverless en infraestructura existente","Optimizar la ejecución de flujos de trabajo basados en eventos","Desarrollar nodos y orquestadores de flujo de trabajo personalizados"],"fr":["Implémenter des flux de travail serverless sur des infrastructures existantes","Optimiser la exécution de flux de travail basés sur les événements","Développer des nodos et des orquestateurs de flux de travail personnalisés"],"de":["Serverless Workflows in bestehender Infrastruktur implementieren","Die Ausführung von ereignisgesteuerten Workflows optimieren","Benutzerdefinierte Workflow Nodes und Orchestrierer entwickeln"],"pt":["Implementação de fluxos de trabalho sem servidor em infraestrutura existente","Otimização da execução de fluxo de trabalho baseada em eventos","Desenvolvimento de nodes e orquestradores de fluxo de trabalho personalizados"],"ru":["Реализация безсерверных рабочих процессов на существующей инфраструктуре","Оптимизация выполнения событийно-ориентированных рабочих процессов","Разработка пользовательских узлов и оркестраторов рабочих процессов"],"ar":["تنفيذ سلاسل عمل بدون خادم على البنية التحتية الحالية","تحسين تنفيذ سلسلة العمل القائمة على الحدث","تطوير العقد والمنسقين المخصصين لسلسلة العمل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of Serverless Workflow DSL v1.0 specification","Limited to stateless workflow execution"],"zh":["需要理解 Serverless Workflow DSL v1.0 规范","仅限于无状态工作流执行"],"ja":["Serverless Workflow DSL v1.0 仕様の理解が必要","ステートレスワークフローの実行に限定される"],"ko":["Serverless Workflow DSL v1.0 사양에 대한 이해가 필요함","무상태 워크플로우 실행으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere una comprensión de la especificación de DSL de flujo de trabajo serverless v1.0","Limitado a la ejecución de flujos de trabajo sin estado"],"fr":["Requiere une compréhension de la spécification de DSL de flujo de trabajo serverless v1.0","Limitado a la ejecución de flujos de trabajo sin estado"],"de":["Erfordert ein Verständnis der Serverless Workflow DSL v1.0 Spezifikation","Limitiert auf die Ausführung von stateless Workflows"],"pt":["Exige compreensão da especificação Serverless Workflow DSL v1.0","Limitado à execução de fluxo de trabalho sem estado"],"ru":["Требует понимания спецификации Serverless Workflow DSL v1.0","Ограничен выполнением бесстатных рабочих процессов"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم مواصفات.dsl تدفق العمل بدون خادم v1.0","محدود بالتنفيذ سلسلة العمل بدون حالة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"e891aeb18da30381354870b7a33aae591d079eb0292ed29610bedff23a636ab0","qualityScore":42}');
