arrollo de agentes de IA","herramientas de IA","guías de desarrollo de IA","alternativas a Ground","Ground vs otros frameworks de IA","instalación de Ground","configuración de Ground","uso de React con Ground","uso de Node.js con Ground"],"fr":["développement d''agents IA","outils IA","guides de développement IA","alternatives à Ground","Ground vs autres frameworks IA","installation de Ground","configuration de Ground","utilisation de React avec Ground","utilisation de Node.js avec Ground"],"de":["KI-Agents-Entwicklung","KI-Tools","KI-Entwicklungsguides","Alternativen zu Ground","Ground vs andere KI-Frameworks","Installation von Ground","Konfiguration von Ground","Verwendung von React mit Ground","Verwendung von Node.js mit Ground"],"pt":["agente de IA","desenvolvimento de agente de IA","ferramentas de agente de IA","guias de agente de IA","como criar um agente de IA","o que é um agente de IA","agente de IA vs chatbot","instalação de agente de IA","configuração de agente de IA"],"ru":["ИИ Агент","разработка ИИ Агентов","инструменты ИИ Агентов","руководства ИИ Агентов","как создать ИИ Агента","что такое ИИ Агент","ИИ Агент vs чат-бот","установка ИИ Агента","настройка ИИ Агента"],"ar":["وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي","تطوير وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","أدوات وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","دلائل وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","كيفية إنشاء وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي","ما هو وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي","وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي vs بوت المحادثة","تثبيت وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي","تكوين وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"Mburdo","repo":"knowledge_and_vibes","repoPath":"Mburdo/knowledge_and_vibes","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.894Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ground","description":"Verify external libraries, APIs, and frameworks against current documentation. Use when implementing external dependencies, when unsure if a pattern is current, when the user mentions ground, verify docs, exa, or current API.","bodyPreview":"# Ground — External Documentation\n\nVerify external dependencies against current documentation before implementation. Direct execution.\n\n> **Design rationale:** This skill executes directly rather than spawning subagents because grounding is a simple query + verification sequence (~300 tokens), not substantial analytical work. Per Lita research: \"Simple agents achieve 97% of complex system performance with 15x less code.\"\n\n## When This Applies\n\n| Signal | Action |\n|--------|--------|\n| About to w","body":"# Ground — External Documentation\n\nVerify external dependencies against current documentation before implementation. Direct execution.\n\n> **Design rationale:** This skill executes directly rather than spawning subagents because grounding is a simple query + verification sequence (~300 tokens), not substantial analytical work. Per Lita research: \"Simple agents achieve 97% of complex system performance with 15x less code.\"\n\n## When This Applies\n\n| Signal | Action |\n|--------|--------|\n| About to write `import` for external lib | Ground first |\n| Using API/SDK methods | Verify current syntax |\n| Framework-specific patterns | Check version compatibility |\n| Auth/security code | Always verify current best practices |\n| User says \"ground\" or \"verify\" | Run full grounding check |\n| New library or major version | Deep grounding |\n\n**Default: When uncertain about external APIs, ground.**\n\n---\n\n## Tool Reference\n\n### Exa MCP Tools\n| Tool | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| `web_search_exa(query)` | General documentation search |\n| `get_code_context_exa(query)` | Code examples from GitHub/tutorials |\n| `crawling(url)` | Extract content from specific URLs |\n\n---\n\n## Decision Tree\n\n```\nWhere does truth live?\n\nEXTERNAL DOCS ──► /ground (this skill)\n                 \"What''s the current API for X?\"\n\nCODEBASE ───────► /explore (warp-grep)\n                 \"How does X work in our code?\"\n\nHISTORY ────────► /recall (cm + cass)\n                 \"How did we do this before?\"\n\nTASKS ──────────► bv --robot-*\n                 \"What should I work on?\"\n```\n\n---\n\n## Execution Flow\n\nExecute these steps directly. No subagents needed.\n\n### Step 1: Identify What Needs Grounding\n\nCategories that need verification:\n\n| Category | Why | Risk |\n|----------|-----|------|\n| **Imports/Initialization** | Syntax changes between versions | High |\n| **API Methods** | Methods get renamed/deprecated | High |\n| **Configuration** | Options/flags evolve | Medium |\n| **Async Patterns** | Async APIs vary significantly | Medium |\n| **Auth/Security** | Security best practices change | Critical |\n| **Data Validation** | Validators/schemas evolve | Medium |\n\n---\n\n### Step 2: Construct Query\n\n**Formula:**\n```\n{library_name} {specific_feature} {version_if_known} 2024 2025\n```\n\n**Examples:**\n```\nFastAPI Pydantic v2 model_validator 2024 2025\nNext.js 14 app router server components\nReact useOptimistic hook 2024\nPrisma findMany where clause 2024\n```\n\n**Strengthening queries:**\n- Add version number if known\n- Add year for recency (2024, 2025)\n- Add \"official\" or \"docs\" for authoritative sources\n- Add \"migration\" if moving between versions\n\n---\n\n### Step 3: Execute Search\n\n**For documentation:**\n```python\nweb_search_exa(\"{library} {feature} {version} 2024 2025\")\n```\n\n**For code examples:**\n```python\nget_code_context_exa(\"{library} {pattern} implementation example\")\n```\n\n**For specific page:**\n```python\ncrawling(\"{url}\")\n```\n\n---\n\n### Step 4: Verify Results\n\n| Criterion | Pass If |\n|-----------|---------|\n| **Source** | Official docs or reputable repo |\n| **Freshness** | Updated within 12 months |\n| **Version** | Matches your dependency |\n| **Completeness** | Full import + usage pattern |\n| **Status** | Not deprecated |\n\n---\n\n### Step 5: Record Grounding Status\n\nTrack in your work:\n\n```markdown\n## Grounding Status\n| Pattern | Query | Source | Status |\n|---------|-------|--------|--------|\n| `@model_validator` | \"Pydantic v2 2024\" | docs.pydantic.dev | ✅ Verified |\n| `useOptimistic` | \"React 19 2024\" | react.dev | ✅ Verified |\n```\n\n**Status values:**\n- ✅ Verified — Matches current docs\n- ⚠️ Changed — API changed, updated approach\n- ❌ Deprecated — Found alternative\n- ❓ Unverified — Couldn''t confirm, flagged\n\n---\n\n## Query Patterns\n\n### Current API Documentation\n```\n\"{library} {method} documentation 2024\"\n\"{library} {feature} API reference\"\n\"{library} official docs {feature}\"\n```\n\n### Migration Between Versions\n```\n\"{library} v{old} to v{new} migration\"\n\"{library} {version} breaking changes\"\n\"{library} upgrade guide {version}\"\n```\n\n### Code Examples\n```python\nget_code_context_exa(\"{library} {pattern} implementation example\")\nget_code_context_exa(\"{library} {use_case} tutorial\")\n```\n\n### Security/Auth Patterns\n```\n\"{auth_method} best practices 2024\"\n\"{library} authentication {pattern} security\"\n\"OAuth PKCE {language} 2024\"\n```\n\n### Error Resolution\n```\n\"{library} {error_message} fix\"\n\"{library} {error_type} troubleshooting\"\n```\n\n---\n\n## Grounding Depth Levels\n\n| Depth | When | What to Check |\n|-------|------|---------------|\n| **Quick** | Familiar pattern, just confirming | One query, verify method exists |\n| **Standard** | Normal implementation | Query + check for deprecation warnings |\n| **Deep** | Security/auth, new library, major version | Multiple queries, read changelog, check issues |\n\n---\n\n## Version Sensitivity Signals\n\nGround more carefully when you see:\n\n| Signal | Risk |\n|--------|------|\n| Major version in deps (v1 → v2) | Breaking changes likely |\n| Library < 2 years old | API still evolving |\n| \"experimental\" or \"beta\" in docs | May change without notice |\n| Security-related code | Best practices evolve |\n| AI training data gap | Libs released after training cutoff |\n\n---\n\n## Failure Handling\n\n| Issue | Response |\n|-------|----------|\n| No results | Broaden query, try alternate terms |\n| Conflicting info | Official docs > GitHub > tutorials |\n| Only outdated info | Mark ❓, proceed with caution, add TODO |\n| Can''t verify | Flag for human review |\n\n---\n\n## Query Anti-Patterns\n\n| Bad Query | Problem | Better Query |\n|-----------|---------|--------------|\n| `\"how to use {library}\"` | Too vague | `\"{library} {specific_feature} 2024\"` |\n| `\"{library} tutorial\"` | May be outdated | `\"{library} {feature} official docs\"` |\n| `\"best {library}\"` | Opinion, not docs | `\"{library} {pattern} documentation\"` |\n| `\"{library}\"` alone | No specificity | Add feature + version + year |\n\n---\n\n## Query Strengthening\n\nIf initial query returns poor results:\n\n1. **Add version**: `\"React 19 useOptimistic\"` vs `\"React useOptimistic\"`\n2. **Add year**: `\"FastAPI middleware 2024\"` vs `\"FastAPI middleware\"`\n3. **Add \"official\"**: `\"Next.js official docs app router\"`\n4. **Be more specific**: `\"Prisma findMany where clause\"` vs `\"Prisma queries\"`\n5. **Try alternate terms**: `\"authentication\"` vs `\"auth\"` vs `\"login\"`\n\n---\n\n## Progressive Grounding\n\nFor large implementations:\n\n1. **Start**: Ground the core imports/setup\n2. **As you go**: Ground each new external method before using\n3. **Before commit**: Review grounding table, verify nothing ❓\n\nDon''t try to ground everything upfront — ground just-in-time as you encounter external deps.\n\n---\n\n## Integration with Workflow\n\n### Before implementing (via /advance)\n```python\n# Check external dependencies\nweb_search_exa(\"{library} {feature} 2024\")\n```\n\n### During implementation\n```python\n# Just-in-time verification\nget_code_context_exa(\"{specific_method} example\")\n```\n\n### Before commit\nReview grounding table, ensure all ❓ are resolved or documented.\n\n---\n\n## Requirements\n\nRequires Exa API key configured:\n\n```bash\nclaude mcp add exa -s user \\\n  -e EXA_API_KEY=your-key \\\n  -- npx -y @anthropic-labs/exa-mcp-server\n```\n\n---\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n```python\n# Documentation search\nweb_search_exa(\"{library} {feature} {version} 2024 2025\")\n\n# Code examples\nget_code_context_exa(\"{library} {pattern} implementation example\")\n\n# Specific page\ncrawling(\"{url}\")\n```\n\n**Query formula:**\n```\n{library} {feature} {version} 2024 2025\n```\n\n---\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n| Don''t | Why | Do Instead |\n|-------|-----|------------|\n| Skip grounding for external APIs | Training data may be stale | Ground before using |\n| Use tutorials over docs | Tutorials get outdated | Prefer official docs |\n| Ignore version mismatches | Breaking changes exist | Verify version compatibility |\n| Ground everything upfront | Wastes time | Ground just-in-time |\n| Skip grounding for \"familiar\" libs | APIs change | Quick verify is still worth it |\n\n---\n\n## See Also\n\n- `/recall` — Past session patterns\n- `/explore` — Codebase search\n- `/advance` — Bead workflow (includes grounding step)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:10:25.251Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing external dependency verification and documentation validation.","zh":"非常适合需要外部依赖验证和文档验证的AI代理。","ja":"外部依存関係の検証とドキュメントのバリデーションが必要なAIエージェントに最適です。","ko":"외부 종속성 검증 및 문서 유효성 검사가 필요한 AI 에이전트에게 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan verificación de dependencias externas y validación de documentación.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''IA nécessitant une vérification de dépendances externes et une validation de documentation.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die eine Überprüfung externer Abhängigkeiten und eine Validierung der Dokumentation benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que precisam de verificação de dependência externa e validação de documentação.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, которым требуется проверка внешних зависимостей и проверка документации.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي الذي يحتاج إلى التحقق من الاعتماد الخارجيและการ التحقق من الوثائق."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to verify external dependencies against current documentation using direct execution, ensuring accuracy and consistency in query + verification sequences, leveraging ~300 tokens for efficient analysis.","zh":"使代理能够使用直接执行验证外部依赖项与当前文档，确保查询 + 验证序列的准确性和一致性，利用 ~300 个令牌进行高效分析。","ja":"エージェントが直接実行を使用して外部依存関係を現在のドキュメントに対して検証できるようにし、クエリ + 検証シーケンスの精度と一貫性を保証し、約 300 トークンを使用して効率的な分析を行う。","ko":"에이전트가 직접 실행을 사용하여 외부 종속성을 현재 문서와 비교하여 검증할 수 있도록 하여 쿼리 + 검증 시퀀스의 정확성과 일관성을 보장하며, 약 300개의 토큰을 사용하여 효율적인 분석을 수행합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a verificar las dependencias externas frente a la documentación actual utilizando la ejecución directa, asegurando la precisión y la coherencia en las secuencias de consulta y verificación, aprovechando ~300 tokens para un análisis eficiente.","fr":"Permet aux agents de vérifier les dépendances externes par rapport à la documentation actuelle en utilisant l''exécution directe, en garantissant l''exactitude et la cohérence dans les séquences de requête et de vérification, en exploitant ~300 jetons pour une analyse efficace.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, externe Abhängigkeiten gegen die aktuelle Dokumentation mit direkter Ausführung zu überprüfen, wodurch Genauigkeit und Konsistenz in Abfrage- und Verifizierungssequenzen sichergestellt werden, indem ~300 Token für eine effiziente Analyse genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a verificar dependências externas contra a documentação atual usando execução direta, garantindo precisão e consistência nas sequências de consulta + verificação, aproveitando ~300 tokens para análise eficiente.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проверять внешние зависимости против текущей документации с помощью прямого выполнения, гарантируя точность и последовательность в последовательностях запроса + проверки, используя ~300 токенов для эффективного анализа.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على التحقق من الاعتماد الخارجي ضد الوثائق الحالية باستخدام التنفيذ المباشر، مما يضمن الدقة والاتساق في تسلسلات الاستعلام + التحقق، مستفيدا من ~300 رمز للتحليل الفعال."},"useCases":{"en":["Validating external documentation","Verifying dependencies before implementation","Ensuring consistency in query sequences"],"zh":["验证外部文档","在实施前验证依赖项","确保查询序列的一致性"],"ja":["外部ドキュメントの検証","実装前の依存関係の検証","クエリシーケンスの一貫性の確保"],"ko":["외부 문서의 유효성 검사","구현 전 종속성 검증","쿼리 시퀀스의 일관성 보장"],"es":["Validar la documentación externa","Verificar las dependencias antes de la implementación","Asegurar la coherencia en las secuencias de consulta"],"fr":["Valider la documentation externe","Vérifier les dépendances avant la mise en œuvre","Assurer la cohérence dans les séquences de requête"],"de":["Externe Dokumentation validieren","Abhängigkeiten vor der Implementierung überprüfen","Konsistenz in Abfrage-Sequenzen sicherstellen"],"pt":["Validação de documentação externa","Verificação de dependências antes da implementação","Garantia de consistência nas sequências de consulta"],"ru":["Проверка внешней документации","Проверка зависимостей перед реализацией","Обеспечение последовательности в последовательностях запросов"],"ar":["التحقق من الوثائق الخارجية","التحقق من الاعتماد قبل التنفيذ","ضمان الاتساق في تسلسلات الاستعلام"]},"limitations":{"en":["Simple query + verification sequence only","Not suitable for substantial analytical work","Direct execution may have performance implications"],"zh":["仅支持简单的查询 + 验证序列","不适合进行大量的分析工作","直接执行可能会对性能产生影响"],"ja":["シンプルなクエリ + 検証シーケンスのみをサポート","大量の分析作業には不適切","直接実行はパフォーマンスに影響を与える可能性がある"],"ko":["단순한 쿼리 + 검증 시퀀스만 지원","大量의 분석 작업에는 부적합","직접 실행은 성능에 영향을 줄 수 있음"],"es":["Secuencia de consulta y verificación simple solamente","No es adecuado para un trabajo analítico sustancial","La ejecución directa puede tener implicaciones de rendimiento"],"fr":["Seule une séquence de requête et de vérification simple","Pas adapté pour un travail d''analyse substantiel","L''exécution directe peut avoir des implications de performances"],"de":["Nur einfache Abfrage- und Verifizierungssequenz","Nicht geeignet für umfangreiche analytische Arbeiten","Die direkte Ausführung kann Performance-Auswirkungen haben"],"pt":["Apenas sequência de consulta + verificação simples","Não é adequado para trabalhos analíticos substanciais","A execução direta pode ter implicações de desempenho"],"ru":["Только простая последовательность запроса + проверки","Не подходит для существенной аналитической работы","Прямое выполнение может иметь последствия для производительности"],"ar":["تسلسل استعلام + التحقق البسيط فقط","لا يصلح للعمل التحليلي المهم","التنفيذ المباشر قد يكون له آثار على الأداء"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"7505c36375062c9690e4fb215374357f0bba39f5d210123fa68fe7afc53a59cf","qualityScore":42}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ShunsukeHayashi/Miyabi/ccg', 'community', 'ShunsukeHayashi', 'Miyabi', 'ShunsukeHayashi/Miyabi', 'ccg', 0, 0, 42, '2026-03-02T01:56:10.894Z', '2026-03-02T02:10:27.396Z', '0903675e6dc91dab917da75ce76876366651933df8b7bb0857dce8972638a860', '{"id":"ShunsukeHayashi/Miyabi/ccg","name":"ccg","description":{"zh":"CCG是一个开源、经济治理、初学者友好的自主开发框架，基于问题驱动开发","ja":"CCGはオープンソース、経済的ガバナンス、初心者向けの自律型開発フレームワークです","ko":"CCG는 오픈소스, 경제적 거버넌스, 초보자용 자율형 개발 프레임워크입니다","es":"CCG es un marco de desarrollo autónomo que permite a los desarrolladores crear Agentes de IA de manera fácil y eficiente","fr":"CCG est un cadre de développement autonome qui permet aux développeurs de créer des Agents IA de manière facile et efficace","de":"CCG ist ein Rahmenwerk für autonome Entwicklung, das es Entwicklern ermöglicht, KI-Agents einfach und effizient zu erstellen","pt":"O ccg é um framework de desenvolvimento autônomo de código aberto, governado economicamente e fácil de usar, mesmo para iniciantes","ru":"ccg - это первый открытый автономный разработка, управляемый экономикой, и дружественный для начинающих","ar":"ccg هو إطار عمل تطوير ذاتي مفتوح المصدر وحكوم économica وسهل الاستخدام، حتى للمبتدئين","en":"🤖 First open-source, economically-governed, beginner-friendly autonomous development framework built on Issue-Driven Development | 超初心者でも使える自律型開発フレームワーク"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI智能开发框架 - CCG","ja":"AIエージェント開発フレームワーク - CCG","ko":"AI 에이전트 개발 프레임워크 - CCG","es":"Agente de IA CCG: Marco de Desarrollo Autónomo","fr":"Agent IA CCG : Cadre de Développement Autonome","de":"KI-Agent CCG: Rahmenwerk für Autonome Entwicklung","pt":"Ferramentas de IA: ccg - Desenvolvimento Autônomo","ru":"ИИ Агенты: ccg - Автономная Разработка","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: ccg - إطار عمل تطوير ذاتي","en":"ccg"},"description":{"zh":"CCG是一个开源、经济治理、初学者友好的自主开发框架，基于问题驱动开发","ja":"CCGはオープンソース、経済的ガバナンス、初心者向けの自律型開発フレームワークです","ko":"CCG는 오픈소스, 경제적 거버넌스, 초보자용 자율형 개발 프레임워크입니다","es":"CCG es un marco de desarrollo autónomo que permite a los desarrolladores crear Agentes de IA de manera fácil y eficiente","fr":"CCG est un cadre de développement autonome qui permet aux développeurs de créer des Agents IA de manière facile et efficace","de":"CCG ist ein Rahmenwerk für autonome Entwicklung, das es Entwicklern ermöglicht, KI-Agents einfach und effizient zu erstellen","pt":"O ccg é um framework de desenvolvimento autônomo de código aberto, governado economicamente e fácil de usar, mesmo para iniciantes","ru":"ccg - это первый открытый автономный разработка, управляемый экономикой, и дружественный для начинающих","ar":"ccg هو إطار عمل تطوير ذاتي مفتوح المصدر وحكوم économica وسهل الاستخدام، حتى للمبتدئين","en":"🤖 First open-source, economically-governed, beginner-friendly autonomous development framework built on Issue-Driven Development | 超初心者でも使える自律型開発フレームワーク"},"definition":{"en":"🤖 First open-source, economically-governed, beginner-friendly autonomous development framework built on Issue-Driven Development | 超初心者でも使える自律型開発フレームワーク"},"features":{"zh":["开源和社区驱动","经济治理和透明度","初学者友好和易于使用","基于问题驱动开发","支持多种编程语言"],"ja":["オープンソースとコミュニティ主導","経済的ガバナンスと透明性","初心者向けと使いやすい","Issue-Driven Developmentに基づく","多くのプログラミング言語をサポート"],"ko":["오픈소스와 커뮤니티 주도","경제적 거버넌스와 투명성","초보자용과 사용하기 쉬운","문제 해결 개발에 기반","다수의 프로그래밍 언어를 지원"],"es":["Desarrollo autónomo basado en Issue-Driven Development","Código abierto y gobernado económicamente","Ideal para principiantes en desarrollo de Agentes de IA","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo populares","Documentación y soporte comunitario"],"fr":["Développement autonome basé sur Issue-Driven Development","Code open-source et gouverné économiquement","Idéal pour les débutants en développement d''Agents IA","Intégration avec des outils de développement populaires","Documentation et support communautaire"],"de":["Autonome Entwicklung basierend auf Issue-Driven Development","Open-Source-Code und wirtschaftlich regiert","Ideal für Anfänger in der Entwicklung von KI-Agents","Integration mit beliebten Entwicklungstools","Dokumentation und Community-Unterstützung"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento autônomo","Código aberto","Governado economicamente","Fácil de usar","Perfeito para iniciantes"],"ru":["Автономная разработка","Открытый код","Управляемый экономикой","Легко использовать","Идеально для начинающих"],"ar":["التطوير الذاتي","مفتوح المصدر","الحوكمة الاقتصادية","سهل الاستخدام","مناسب للمبتدئين"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能开发框架","CCG开发框架","问题驱动开发","自主开发框架","开源开发框架","如何使用CCG","CCG安装指南","CCG与其他框架的比较"],"ja":["AIエージェント開発フレームワーク","CCG開発フレームワーク","Issue-Driven Development","自律型開発フレームワーク","オープンソース開発フレームワーク","CCGの使い方","CCGのインストールガイド","CCGと他のフレームワークの比較"],"ko":["AI 에이전트 개발 프레임워크","CCG 개발 프레임워크","문제 해결 개발","자율형 개발 프레임워크","오픈소스 개발 프레임워크","CCG 사용 방법","CCG 설치 가이드","CCG와 다른 프레임워크의 비교"],"es":["Agente de IA","Desarrollo autónomo","Issue-Driven Development","Código abierto","Guía de instalación de CCG","Alternativas a CCG","CCG vs otros Agentes de IA"],"fr":["Agent IA","Développement autonome","Issue-Driven Development","Code open-source","Guide d''installation de CCG","Alternatives à CCG","CCG vs autres Agents IA"],"de":["KI-Agent","Autonome Entwicklung","Issue-Driven Development","Open-Source-Code","Installationsanleitung für CCG","Alternativen zu CCG","CCG im Vergleich zu anderen KI-Agents"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia","desenvolvimento autônomo","ccg alternative","como usar ccg","o que é ccg","ccg vs outras ferramentas","instalar ccg","guia de configuração ccg"],"ru":["ИИ агенты","автономная разработка","ccg альтернатива","как использовать ccg","что такое ccg","ccg vs другие инструменты","установить ccg","руководство по настройке ccg"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","التطوير الذاتي","بديل ccg","كيفية استخدام ccg","ما هو ccg","ccg مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت ccg","دليل إعداد ccg"]}},"owner":"ShunsukeHayashi","repo":"Miyabi","repoPath":"ShunsukeHayashi/Miyabi","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.894Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ccg","description":"AI Course Content Generator - Generate complete online courses with Gemini API. Triggers on create course, generate lesson, course content, ccg, /ccg.","bodyPreview":"# AI Course Content Generator (CCG)\n\n**Version**: 1.0.0\n**Location**: `/Users/shunsukehayashi/dev/ai-course-content-generator-v2`\n\n---\n\n## Triggers\n\n| Trigger | Examples |\n|---------|----------|\n| Course creation | \"create course\", \"generate course\", \"/ccg\" |\n| Development | \"ccg dev\", \"start course generator\" |\n| Build | \"ccg build\", \"build course app\" |\n\n---\n\n## Quick Commands\n\n```bash\n# Development\ncd /Users/shunsukehayashi/dev/ai-course-content-generator-v2 && npm run dev\n\n# Production build","body":"# AI Course Content Generator (CCG)\n\n**Version**: 1.0.0\n**Location**: `/Users/shunsukehayashi/dev/ai-course-content-generator-v2`\n\n---\n\n## Triggers\n\n| Trigger | Examples |\n|---------|----------|\n| Course creation | \"create course\", \"generate course\", \"/ccg\" |\n| Development | \"ccg dev\", \"start course generator\" |\n| Build | \"ccg build\", \"build course app\" |\n\n---\n\n## Quick Commands\n\n```bash\n# Development\ncd /Users/shunsukehayashi/dev/ai-course-content-generator-v2 && npm run dev\n\n# Production build\ncd /Users/shunsukehayashi/dev/ai-course-content-generator-v2 && npm run build\n\n# Electron dev\ncd /Users/shunsukehayashi/dev/ai-course-content-generator-v2 && npm run electron:dev\n\n# Electron build\ncd /Users/shunsukehayashi/dev/ai-course-content-generator-v2 && npm run electron:build\n```\n\n---\n\n## Key Capabilities\n\n1. **Course Structure Generation** - JSON curriculum generation\n2. **Lesson Script Generation** - Customizable narration scripts\n3. **Text-to-Speech** - Gemini TTS audio generation\n4. **Slide Generation** - Graphic recording style\n5. **Video Rendering** - WebCodecs API MP4 creation\n6. **Bulk Export** - ZIP download of all assets\n\n---\n\n## Architecture\n\n```\nVision Panel → Structure → Content Pipeline → Export\n     ↓              ↓              ↓            ↓\n Image/PDF/URL  JSON Structure  Slides/Audio  MP3/MP4/ZIP\n```\n\n---\n\n## Key Files\n\n| File | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| `services/geminiService.ts` | Gemini API calls + retry logic |\n| `templates/prompts.ts` | Zod schemas + prompt builders |\n| `utils/audioUtils.ts` | PCM→MP3 encoding (lamejs) |\n| `utils/videoUtils.ts` | MP4 muxing (WebCodecs) |\n| `types.ts` | Course structure interfaces |\n| `constants.ts` | Defaults + TTS voice options |\n\n---\n\n## Gemini Models\n\n- **Primary**: `gemini-3-flash-preview` (with thinking)\n- **Backup**: `gemini-2.5-flash` (quota fallback)\n- **TTS**: `gemini-2.5-flash-preview-tts`\n- **Image**: `gemini-3-pro-image-preview`\n\n---\n\n## Environment\n\n- `GEMINI_API_KEY` required in `.env`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:10:27.396Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Development Agents needing autonomous course creation capabilities using Issue-Driven Development frameworks.","zh":"非常适合需要利用 Issue-Driven Development 框架，具备自主创建课程能力的 AI Development Agents。","ja":"Issue-Driven Development フレームワークを使用した自律的なコース作成機能を必要とする AI Development Agents に最適です。","ko":"Issue-Driven Development 프레임워크를 사용하여 자율적인 코스 생성 능력이 필요한 AI Development Agents에 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollo de IA que necesitan capacidades de creación de cursos autónomos utilizando frameworks de Desarrollo Dirigido por Problemas.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Développement d''IA nécessitant des capacités de création de cours autonomes en utilisant des frameworks de Développement Piloté par Problèmes.","de":"Perfekt für AI-Entwicklungsagenten, die autonome Kurs-Erstellungsfähigkeiten unter Verwendung von Issue-Driven Development-Frameworks benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento de IA que necessitam de capacidades de criação de cursos autônomos usando frameworks de Desenvolvimento Dirigido por Problemas.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки ИИ, которым необходимы возможности автономного создания курсов с использованием фреймворков, основанных на принципах разработки, ориентированной на проблемы.","ar":"مثالي لوسائل وكالات التطوير الاصطناعي التي تحتاج إلى إمكانيات إنشاء دورات مستقلة باستخدام إطارات عمل متطورة قائم على مبادئ التطوير الموجه بالمشكلات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables autonomous development of AI course content through an open-source, economically-governed framework built on Issue-Driven Development principles. Provides beginner-friendly course generation capabilities with npm-based development workflows.","zh":"通过一个基于 Issue-Driven Development 原则构建的开源、经济治理的框架，实现 AI 课程内容的自主开发。提供基于 npm 的开发工作流程，具备对初学者友好的课程生成能力。","ja":"Issue-Driven Development の原則に基づいて構築されたオープンソースで経済的にガバナンスされたフレームワークを通じて、AI コースコンテンツの自律的な開発を可能にします。npm ベースの開発ワークフローによる初心者に優しいコース生成機能を提供します。","ko":"Issue-Driven Development 원칙 위에 구축된 오픈 소스, 경제적으로 거버넌스되는 프레임워크를 통해 AI 코스 콘텐츠의 자율 개발을 가능하게 합니다. npm 기반 개발 워크플로우를 통한 초보자 친화적인 코스 생성 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Permite el desarrollo autónomo de contenido de cursos de IA a través de un framework de código abierto, gobernado económicamente, construido sobre principios de Desarrollo Dirigido por Problemas. Proporciona capacidades de generación de cursos para principiantes con flujos de trabajo de desarrollo basados en npm.","fr":"Permet le développement autonome de contenu de cours d''IA à travers un framework open-source, régi économiquement, construit sur les principes de Développement Piloté par Problèmes. Fournit des capacités de génération de cours pour débutants avec des flux de travail de développement basés sur npm.","de":"Ermöglicht die autonome Entwicklung von AI-Kursinhalten durch ein Open-Source-Framework, das wirtschaftlich regiert wird und auf Issue-Driven Development-Prinzipien basiert. Bietet benutzerfreundliche Kursgenerierungsfähigkeiten mit npm-basierten Entwicklungswerkzeugen.","pt":"Permite o desenvolvimento autônomo de conteúdo de curso de IA por meio de um framework de código aberto, economicamente governado, construído com base nos princípios do Desenvolvimento Dirigido por Problemas. Fornece capacidades de geração de cursos amigáveis para iniciantes com fluxos de trabalho de desenvolvimento baseados em npm.","ru":"Позволяет создавать автономный контент курсов ИИ с помощью открытого фреймворка с экономическим управлением, построенного на принципах разработки, ориентированной на проблемы. Предоставляет возможности генерации курсов для начинающих с рабочими процессами разработки на основе npm.","ar":"يسمح بالتطوير المستقل لمحتوى دورات التطوير الاصطناعي من خلال إطار عمل مفتوح المصدر يتم التحكم فيه اقتصاديًا، مبني على مبادئ التطوير الموجه بالمشكلات. يوفر إمكانيات توليد الدورات الصديقة للمبتدئين مع سير عمل التطوير المستندة إلى npm."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating comprehensive AI course materials","Automating course development workflows","Building production-ready course applications","Managing course content through Issue-Driven Development"],"zh":["生成全面的 AI 课程材料","自动化课程开发工作流程","构建生产就绪的课程应用程序","通过 Issue-Driven Development 管理课程内容"],"ja":["包括的な AI コース教材の生成","コース開発ワークフローの自動化","プロダクションレディなコースアプリケーションの構築","Issue-Driven Development によるコースコンテンツの管理"],"ko":["포괄적인 AI 코스 자료 생성","코스 개발 워크플로우 자동화","프로덕션 준비가 된 코스 애플리케이션 구축","Issue-Driven Development를 통한 코스 콘텐츠 관리"],"es":["Generación de materiales de curso de IA exhaustivos","Automatización de flujos de trabajo de desarrollo de cursos","Creación de aplicaciones de cursos listas para producción","Gestión de contenido de cursos a través de Desarrollo Dirigido por Problemas"],"fr":["Génération de matériel de cours d''IA complet","Automatisation des flux de travail de développement de cours","Création d''applications de cours prêtes pour la production","Gestion de contenu de cours via Développement Piloté par Problèmes"],"de":["Erstellung umfassender AI-Kursmaterialien","Automatisierung von Kursentwicklungs-Workflows","Erstellung von produktionsbereiten Kursanwendungen","Verwaltung von Kursinhalten durch Issue-Driven Development"],"pt":["Geração de materiais de curso de IA abrangentes","Automatização de fluxos de trabalho de desenvolvimento de cursos","Construção de aplicações de curso prontas para produção","Gerenciamento de conteúdo de curso por meio do Desenvolvimento Dirigido por Problemas"],"ru":["Генерация комплексных материалов курсов ИИ","Автоматизация рабочих процессов разработки курсов","Создание приложений курсов, готовых к производству","Управление контентом курса с помощью разработки, ориентированной на проблемы"],"ar":["توليد مواد شاملة للدورات التطويرية الاصطناعية","تأتمة سير عمل تطوير الدورات","بناء تطبيقات الدورة الجاهزة للانتاج","إدارة محتوى الدورة من خلال التطوير الموجه بالمشكلات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires npm and Node.js environment","Needs development server setup for local execution","Limited to JavaScript/TypeScript ecosystem"],"zh":["需要 npm 和 Node.js 环境","本地执行需要设置开发服务器","仅限于 JavaScript/TypeScript 生态系统"],"ja":["npm および Node.js 環境が必要","ローカル実行には開発サーバーのセットアップが必要","JavaScript/TypeScript エコシステムに限定"],"ko":["npm 및 Node.js 환경 필요","로컬 실행을 위한 개발 서버 설정 필요","JavaScript/TypeScript 생태계로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere entorno npm y Node.js","Necesita configuración de servidor de desarrollo para ejecución local","Limitado al ecosistema JavaScript/TypeScript"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement npm et Node.js","A besoin d''une configuration de serveur de développement pour l''exécution locale","Limité à l''écosystème JavaScript/TypeScript"],"de":["Benötigt npm- und Node.js-Umgebung","Benötigt Entwicklungsserver-Einrichtung für lokale Ausführung","Begrenzt auf JavaScript/TypeScript-Ökosystem"],"pt":["Exige ambiente npm e Node.js","Necessita de configuração de servidor de desenvolvimento para execução local","Limitado ao ecossistema JavaScript/TypeScript"],"ru":["Требует среды npm и Node.js","Требует настройки сервера разработки для локального выполнения","Ограничен экосистемой JavaScript/TypeScript"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة npm و Node.js","يحتاج إلى إعداد خادم التطوير للتشغيل المحلي","محدود بنظام البيئية JavaScript/TypeScript"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"0903675e6dc91dab917da75ce76876366651933df8b7bb0857dce8972638a860","qualityScore":42}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('alex-ilgayev/MCPSpy/github-issue-creator', 'community', 'alex-ilgayev', 'MCPSpy', 'alex-ilgayev/MCPSpy', 'github-issue-creator', 0, 0, 42, '2026-03-02T01:56:10.895Z', '2026-03-02T02:10:38.383Z', '3719971b7e2f0da37d3fecb022fcffcb6994a0fbb907183ada0ce57724a286b8', '{"id":"alex-ilgayev/MCPSpy/github-issue-creator","name":"github-issue-creator","description":{"zh":"github-issue-creator是一个用于创建github问题的AI智能工具，支持MCP监控与eBPF集成","ja":"github-issue-creatorはgithubの問題を作成するためのAIエージェントです。MCPモニタリングとeBPFの統合をサポートします","ko":"github-issue-creator는 github 이슈를 생성하는 AI 에이전트로 MCP 모니터링 및 eBPF 통합을 지원합니다","es":"El creador de issues de GitHub con MCP y eBPF es una herramienta de AI que automatiza la creación de issues en GitHub","fr":"Le créateur d''issues GitHub avec MCP et eBPF est un outil d''IA qui automatise la création d''issues sur GitHub","de":"Der GitHub-Issue-Ersteller mit MCP und eBPF ist ein KI-Tool, das die Erstellung von Issues in GitHub automatisiert","pt":"O agente github-issue-creator permite criar issues no GitHub de forma automática com a monitoração MCP e eBPF, melhorando o processo de desenvolvimento","ru":"Агент github-issue-creator позволяет создавать issue на GitHub автоматически с помощью мониторинга MCP и eBPF, улучшая процесс разработки","ar":"الوكيل github-issue-creator يسمح بإنشاء مشاكل على GitHub بشكل تلقائي مع مراقبة MCP و eBPF، مما يحسن عملية التطوير","en":"MCP Monitoring with eBPF"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI智能工具：github-issue-creator","ja":"AIエージェント：github-issue-creator","ko":"AI 에이전트: github-issue-creator","es":"Herramientas de AI: Creador de Issues de GitHub con MCP y...","fr":"Outils d''IA: Créateur d''Issues GitHub avec MCP et eBPF","de":"KI-Tools: GitHub-Issue-Ersteller mit MCP und eBPF","pt":"Ferramentas de IA: Crie issues no GitHub com MCP e eBPF","ru":"ИИ Агенты: Создание issue на GitHub с MCP и eBPF","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: إنشاء مشاكل على GitHub مع MCP و eBPF","en":"github-issue-creator"},"description":{"zh":"github-issue-creator是一个用于创建github问题的AI智能工具，支持MCP监控与eBPF集成","ja":"github-issue-creatorはgithubの問題を作成するためのAIエージェントです。MCPモニタリングとeBPFの統合をサポートします","ko":"github-issue-creator는 github 이슈를 생성하는 AI 에이전트로 MCP 모니터링 및 eBPF 통합을 지원합니다","es":"El creador de issues de GitHub con MCP y eBPF es una herramienta de AI que automatiza la creación de issues en GitHub","fr":"Le créateur d''issues GitHub avec MCP et eBPF est un outil d''IA qui automatise la création d''issues sur GitHub","de":"Der GitHub-Issue-Ersteller mit MCP und eBPF ist ein KI-Tool, das die Erstellung von Issues in GitHub automatisiert","pt":"O agente github-issue-creator permite criar issues no GitHub de forma automática com a monitoração MCP e eBPF, melhorando o processo de desenvolvimento","ru":"Агент github-issue-creator позволяет создавать issue на GitHub автоматически с помощью мониторинга MCP и eBPF, улучшая процесс разработки","ar":"الوكيل github-issue-creator يسمح بإنشاء مشاكل على GitHub بشكل تلقائي مع مراقبة MCP و eBPF، مما يحسن عملية التطوير","en":"MCP Monitoring with eBPF"},"definition":{"en":"MCP Monitoring with eBPF"},"features":{"zh":["支持MCP监控","支持eBPF集成","自动创建github问题","提高开发效率","支持多种编程语言"],"ja":["MCPモニタリングのサポート","eBPFの統合サポート","githubの問題の自動作成","開発効率の向上","複数のプログラミング言語のサポート"],"ko":["MCP 모니터링 지원","eBPF 통합 지원","github 이슈 자동 생성","개발 효율성 향상","다중 프로그래밍 언어 지원"],"es":["Integración con GitHub","Automatización de la creación de issues","Utiliza MCP y eBPF para el monitoreo","Mejora del flujo de trabajo","Soporte para CLI"],"fr":["Intégration avec GitHub","Automatisation de la création d''issues","Utilise MCP et eBPF pour la surveillance","Amélioration du flux de travail","Prise en charge de la CLI"],"de":["Integration mit GitHub","Automatisierung der Erstellung von Issues","Verwendung von MCP und eBPF für die Überwachung","Verbesserung des Arbeitsablaufs","Unterstützung für die CLI"],"pt":["Criação automática de issues no GitHub","Monitoração MCP com eBPF","Integração com o GitHub","Suporte a múltiplos repositórios","Configuração personalizada"],"ru":["Автоматическое создание issue на GitHub","Мониторинг MCP с eBPF","Интеграция с GitHub","Поддержка нескольких репозиториев","Настройка под себя"],"ar":["إنشاء تلقائي لمشاكل على GitHub","مراقبة MCP مع eBPF","التكامل مع GitHub","دعم متعددة المستودعات","التكوين المخصص"]},"keywords":{"zh":["github-issue-creator","AI智能工具","MCP监控","eBPF集成","github问题创建","开发效率提高","github-issue-creator教程","github-issue-creator安装","github-issue-creator替代品"],"ja":["github-issue-creator","AIエージェント","MCPモニタリング","eBPFの統合","githubの問題の作成","開発効率の向上","github-issue-creatorの使い方","github-issue-creatorのインストール","github-issue-creatorの代替"],"ko":["github-issue-creator","AI 에이전트","MCP 모니터링","eBPF 통합","github 이슈 생성","개발 효율성 향상","github-issue-creator 사용법","github-issue-creator 설치","github-issue-creator 대안"],"es":["herramientas de AI","creador de issues de GitHub","MCP","eBPF","automatización de issues","integración con GitHub","mejora del flujo de trabajo","CLI","guía de instalación de GitHub Issue Creator"],"fr":["outils d''IA","créateur d''issues GitHub","MCP","eBPF","automatisation des issues","intégration avec GitHub","amélioration du flux de travail","CLI","guide d''installation de GitHub Issue Creator"],"de":["KI-Tools","GitHub-Issue-Ersteller","MCP","eBPF","Automatisierung von Issues","Integration mit GitHub","Verbesserung des Arbeitsablaufs","CLI","Installationsanleitung für GitHub Issue Creator"],"pt":["como usar o github-issue-creator","o que é eBPF","github-issue-creator alternative","github-issue-creator vs jira","instalar github-issue-creator","guia de configuração do github-issue-creator"],"ru":["как использовать github-issue-creator","что такое eBPF","альтернатива github-issue-creator","github-issue-creator vs jira","установить github-issue-creator","руководство по настройке github-issue-creator"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام github-issue-creator","ما هو eBPF","بديل github-issue-creator","github-issue-creator مقابل jira","تثبيت github-issue-creator","دليل إعداد github-issue-creator"]}},"owner":"alex-ilgayev","repo":"MCPSpy","repoPath":"alex-ilgayev/MCPSpy","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.895Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"github-issue-creator","description":"Creates well-structured GitHub issues for the MCPSpy project using the gh CLI tool. Use when asked to create issues, report bugs, or document features. Follows conventional naming with feat/chore/fix prefixes and maintains appropriate detail levels.","bodyPreview":"# GitHub Issue Creator Skill\n\nAutomates the creation of well-structured GitHub issues for the MCPSpy project.\n\n## Tools and Usage\n\nUse the `gh issue` CLI tool to create GitHub issues. If the issue body is rather long, write it to a temporary markdown file and use the `gh issue create --body-file <file>` option.\n\n## Issue Naming Convention\n\n- Use standard prefixes: `feat(component):`, `chore:`, `fix(component):`\n- Component examples: `library-manager`, `ebpf`, `mcp`, `http`, `output`\n- Brackets a","body":"# GitHub Issue Creator Skill\n\nAutomates the creation of well-structured GitHub issues for the MCPSpy project.\n\n## Tools and Usage\n\nUse the `gh issue` CLI tool to create GitHub issues. If the issue body is rather long, write it to a temporary markdown file and use the `gh issue create --body-file <file>` option.\n\n## Issue Naming Convention\n\n- Use standard prefixes: `feat(component):`, `chore:`, `fix(component):`\n- Component examples: `library-manager`, `ebpf`, `mcp`, `http`, `output`\n- Brackets are optional but recommended for clarity\n- Keep titles concise and descriptive\n\n### Examples\n\n- `feat(library-manager): add support for container runtime detection`\n- `chore: update dependencies to latest versions`\n- `fix(ebpf): handle kernel version compatibility issues`\n\n## Issue Content Guidelines\n\n### What to Include\n\n- **High-level design notes** - focus on the \"what\" and \"why\"\n- **POC-level details** - enough to get started, not exhaustive\n- **Actionable scope** - should be implementable by a developer familiar with the codebase\n\n### What NOT to Include\n\n- Detailed test plans\n- Exhaustive acceptance criteria\n- Deep technical specifications\n- Code examples (unless absolutely necessary for clarity)\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Creating new feature requests\n- Reporting bugs and issues\n- Documenting technical debt\n- Planning work items for the MCPSpy project\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:10:38.383Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring automated GitHub issue creation and management with standardized naming conventions.","zh":"适用于需要自动创建和管理 GitHub_issue 并使用标准命名约定的开发代理。","ja":"GitHub の issue の自動作成と管理が必要な開発エージェントに適しています。","ko":"GitHub 이슈를 자동으로 생성하고 관리하며 표준命명 규칙을 사용하는 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Desarrollo que requieren la creación y gestión automatizada de problemas de GitHub con convenciones de nomenclatura estandarizadas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement nécessitant la création et la gestion automatisées des problèmes GitHub avec des conventions de dénomination standardisées.","de":"Ideal für Entwicklungssagenten, die eine automatisierte Erstellung und Verwaltung von GitHub-Problemen mit standardisierten Benennungskonventionen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que exigem criação e gerenciamento automatizados de problemas do GitHub com convenções de nomenclatura padronizadas.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки, требующих автоматизированного создания и управления проблемами GitHub с стандартизированными соглашениями об именах.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الذين يتطلبون إنشاء مشاكل GitHub وتدبيرها آليًا مع اتفاقيات تسمية معيارية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create well-structured GitHub issues using the `gh issue` CLI tool, supporting long issue bodies via temporary markdown files and adhering to standard prefixes like `feat(component):` and `fix(component):` for organized project tracking.","zh":"启用代理使用 `gh issue` CLI 工具创建结构良好的 GitHub_issue，支持通过临时 markdown 文件进行长 issue 正文，并遵循 `feat(component):` 和 `fix(component):` 等标准前缀以实现组织化的项目跟踪。","ja":"`gh issue` CLI ツールを使用して、標準的な接頭辞 `feat(component):` と `fix(component):` を使用した構造化された GitHub の issue を作成できるようにエージェントを有効にし、長い issue 本文の場合は一時的な markdown ファイルを使用してプロジェクトの追跡を整理します。","ko":"`gh issue` CLI 도구를 사용하여 구조화된 GitHub 이슈를 생성할 수 있도록 에이전트를 활성화하여 `feat(component):` 및 `fix(component):`와 같은 표준 접두사를 사용하고 긴 이슈 본문은 임시 markdown 파일을 통해 조직적인 프로젝트 추적을 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear problemas de GitHub bien estructurados utilizando la herramienta CLI `gh issue`, que admite cuerpos de problemas largos a través de archivos markdown temporales y que siguen prefijos estándar como `feat(component):` y `fix(component):` para un seguimiento de proyecto organizado.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des problèmes GitHub bien structurés en utilisant l''outil CLI `gh issue`, qui prend en charge les corps de problèmes longs via des fichiers markdown temporaires et qui suivent des préfixes standard comme `feat(component):` et `fix(component):` pour un suivi de projet organisé.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, gut strukturierte GitHub-Probleme mithilfe des CLI-Tools `gh issue` zu erstellen, das lange Problembeschreibungen über temporäre Markdown-Dateien unterstützt und standardmäßige Präfixe wie `feat(component):` und `fix(component):` für eine organisierte Projektverfolgung verwendet.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar problemas do GitHub bem estruturados usando a ferramenta CLI `gh issue`, suportando corpos de problemas longos via arquivos markdown temporários e aderindo a prefixos padrão como `feat(component):` e `fix(component):` para acompanhamento de projeto organizado.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать хорошо структурированные проблемы GitHub с помощью инструмента CLI `gh issue`, поддерживающего длинные описания проблем через временные файлы markdown и соблюдая стандартные префиксы типа `feat(component):` и `fix(component):` для организованного отслеживания проекта.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل khảية إنشاء مشاكل GitHub منظمة جيدًا باستخدام أداة `gh issue` CLI، ودعم أجسام المشاكل الطويلة من خلال ملفات markdown مؤقتة والامتثال لأوافيق معيارية مثل `feat(component):` و `fix(component):` من أجل تتبع المشروع المنظم."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating the creation of GitHub issues for the MCPSpy project","Generating standardized issue names with prefixes and component specifications","Streamlining issue tracking with temporary markdown files for lengthy issue descriptions"],"zh":["自动创建 MCPSpy 项目的 GitHub_issue","生成具有前缀和组件规范的标准化 issue 名称","使用临时 markdown 文件实现长 issue 描述的 issue 跟踪简化"],"ja":["MCPSpy プロジェクトの GitHub の issue を自動的に作成する","prefix とコンポーネントの仕様を使用した標準化された issue 名称の生成","長い issue 説明のための一時的な markdown ファイルを使用した issue 追跡の合理化"],"ko":["MCPSpy 프로젝트의 GitHub 이슈를 자동으로 생성합니다.","접두사 및 구성 요소 사양을 사용하여 표준화된 이슈 이름을 생성합니다.","긴 이슈 설명에 대한 임시 markdown 파일을 사용하여 이슈 추적을 간소화합니다."],"es":["Automatización de la creación de problemas de GitHub para el proyecto MCPSpy","Generación de nombres de problemas estandarizados con prefijos y especificaciones de componentes","Optimización del seguimiento de problemas con archivos markdown temporales para descripciones de problemas largas"],"fr":["Automatisation de la création de problèmes GitHub pour le projet MCPSpy","Génération de noms de problèmes standardisés avec des préfixes et des spécifications de composants","Optimisation du suivi des problèmes avec des fichiers markdown temporaires pour les descriptions de problèmes longues"],"de":["Automatisierung der Erstellung von GitHub-Problemen für das Projekt MCPSpy","Erzeugung standardisierter Problemmnamen mit Präfixen und Komponentenspezifikationen","Optimierung der Problemmverfolgung mit temporären Markdown-Dateien für lange Problembeschreibungen"],"pt":["Automatizar a criação de problemas do GitHub para o projeto MCPSpy","Gerar nomes de problemas padronizados com prefixos e especificações de componentes","Otizar o acompanhamento de problemas com arquivos markdown temporários para descrições de problemas longas"],"ru":["Автоматизировать создание проблем GitHub для проекта MCPSpy","Генерировать стандартизированные имена проблем с префиксами и спецификациями компонентов","Оптимизировать отслеживание проблем с помощью временных файлов markdown для длинных описаний проблем"],"ar":["تأتمتة إنشاء مشاكل GitHub لمشروع MCPSpy","توليد أسماء مشاكل معيارية مع أوافيق ومواصفات المكونات","جعل تتبع المشاكل أكثر كفاءة باستخدام ملفات markdown مؤقتة لوصف المشاكل الطويلة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires the `gh issue` CLI tool","Dependent on GitHub API or CLI access","Issue body length may require temporary file creation"],"zh":["需要 `gh issue` CLI 工具","依赖于 GitHub API 或 CLI 访问","issue 正文长度可能需要临时文件创建"],"ja":["`gh issue` CLI ツールが必要","GitHub API または CLI アクセスに依存","issue 本文の長さにより一時ファイルの作成が必要になる場合がある"],"ko":["`gh issue` CLI 도구가 필요합니다.","GitHub API 또는 CLI 액세스를 사용하는 경우","이슈 본문의 길이로 인해 임시 파일 생성이 필요할 수 있습니다."],"es":["Requiere la herramienta CLI `gh issue`","Dependiente del acceso a la API o CLI de GitHub","La longitud del cuerpo del problema puede requerir la creación de un archivo temporal"],"fr":["Nécessite l''outil CLI `gh issue`","Dépend de l''accès à l''API ou CLI de GitHub","La longueur du corps du problème peut nécessiter la création d''un fichier temporaire"],"de":["Benötigt das CLI-Tool `gh issue`","Abhängig vom Zugriff auf die GitHub-API oder -CLI","Die Länge der Problembeschreibung kann die Erstellung einer temporären Datei erfordern"],"pt":["Exige a ferramenta CLI `gh issue`","Depende do acesso à API ou CLI do GitHub","O comprimento do corpo do problema pode exigir a criação de um arquivo temporário"],"ru":["Требует инструмента CLI `gh issue`","Зависит от доступа к API или CLI GitHub","Длина описания проблемы может потребовать создания временного файла"],"ar":["يتطلب أداة `gh issue` CLI","يعتمد على الوصول إلى واجهة برمجة التطبيقات أو CLI من GitHub","يمكن أن يتطلب طول جسم المشكلة إنشاء ملف مؤقت"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"3719971b7e2f0da37d3fecb022fcffcb6994a0fbb907183ada0ce57724a286b8","qualityScore":42}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('yu-iskw/lightdash-tools/openspec-explore', 'community', 'yu-iskw', 'lightdash-tools', 'yu-iskw/lightdash-tools', 'openspec-explore', 0, 0, 42, '2026-03-02T01:56:10.899Z', '2026-03-02T02:12:27.296Z', '37cb96a8ba4c1f65d3a79e3a2636f1367325e7dbc815e9519c2c5d46d346ce15', '{"id":"yu-iskw/lightdash-tools/openspec-explore","name":"openspec-explore","description":{"zh":"openspec-explore是Lightdash工具箱的一部分，提供HTTP客户端、CLI、MCP等强大工具","ja":"openspec-exploreはLightdashツールの一つで、HTTPクライアント、CLI、MCPなどの機能を提供します","ko":"openspec-explore는 라이트대시 도구의 일부로 HTTP 클라이언트, CLI, MCP 등의 강력한 기능을 제공합니다","es":"Lightdash ofrece una variedad de herramientas para desarrolladores, incluyendo un cliente HTTP, CLI, MCP y más, con openspec-explore","fr":"Lightdash propose une variété d''outils pour les développeurs, notamment un client HTTP, CLI, MCP et plus, avec openspec-explore","de":"Lightdash bietet eine Vielzahl von Tools für Entwickler, einschließlich eines HTTP-Clients, CLI, MCP und mehr, mit openspec-explore","pt":"O openspec-explore é uma ferramenta que oferece recursos avançados de desenvolvimento com Lightdash, incluindo HTTP client, CLI e MCP","ru":"openspec-explore - это инструмент, который предлагает расширенные возможности разработки с помощью Lightdash, включая HTTP-клиент, CLI и MCP","ar":"openspec-explore هو أداة تقدم ميزات متقدمة للتطوير باستخدام Lightdash، بما في ذلك العميل HTTP و CLI و MCP","en":"Lightdash tools (HTTP client, CLI, MCP and more)"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI工具openspec-explore：Lightdash工具箱","ja":"AIエージェントopenspec-explore：Lightdashツール","ko":"AI 에이전트 openspec-explore: 라이트대시 도구","es":"Herramientas de Lightdash: openspec-explore para Agentes ...","fr":"Outils Lightdash: openspec-explore pour les Outils d''IA","de":"Lightdash-Tools: openspec-explore für KI-Agents","pt":"Ferramentas de AI: openspec-explore com Lightdash","ru":"ИИ Агенты: openspec-explore с инструментами Lightdash","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: openspec-explore مع Lightdash","en":"openspec-explore"},"description":{"zh":"openspec-explore是Lightdash工具箱的一部分，提供HTTP客户端、CLI、MCP等强大工具","ja":"openspec-exploreはLightdashツールの一つで、HTTPクライアント、CLI、MCPなどの機能を提供します","ko":"openspec-explore는 라이트대시 도구의 일부로 HTTP 클라이언트, CLI, MCP 등의 강력한 기능을 제공합니다","es":"Lightdash ofrece una variedad de herramientas para desarrolladores, incluyendo un cliente HTTP, CLI, MCP y más, con openspec-explore","fr":"Lightdash propose une variété d''outils pour les développeurs, notamment un client HTTP, CLI, MCP et plus, avec openspec-explore","de":"Lightdash bietet eine Vielzahl von Tools für Entwickler, einschließlich eines HTTP-Clients, CLI, MCP und mehr, mit openspec-explore","pt":"O openspec-explore é uma ferramenta que oferece recursos avançados de desenvolvimento com Lightdash, incluindo HTTP client, CLI e MCP","ru":"openspec-explore - это инструмент, который предлагает расширенные возможности разработки с помощью Lightdash, включая HTTP-клиент, CLI и MCP","ar":"openspec-explore هو أداة تقدم ميزات متقدمة للتطوير باستخدام Lightdash، بما في ذلك العميل HTTP و CLI و MCP","en":"Lightdash tools (HTTP client, CLI, MCP and more)"},"definition":{"en":"Lightdash tools (HTTP client, CLI, MCP and more)"},"features":{"zh":["HTTP客户端","CLI工具","MCP支持","Lightdash工具箱","强大功能"],"ja":["HTTPクライアント","CLIツール","MCPサポート","Lightdashツールボックス","強力な機能"],"ko":["HTTP 클라이언트","CLI 도구","MCP 지원","라이트대시 도구박스","강력한 기능"],"es":["Cliente HTTP para solicitudes y respuestas","CLI para ejecutar comandos y scripts","MCP para la gestión de procesos y tareas","Integración con otros tools y tecnologías de Lightdash","Documentación y soporte para desarrolladores"],"fr":["Client HTTP pour les requêtes et les réponses","CLI pour exécuter des commandes et des scripts","MCP pour la gestion des processus et des tâches","Intégration avec d''autres outils et technologies de Lightdash","Documentation et support pour les développeurs"],"de":["HTTP-Client für Anfragen und Antworten","CLI für die Ausführung von Befehlen und Skripten","MCP für die Verwaltung von Prozessen und Aufgaben","Integration mit anderen Tools und Technologien von Lightdash","Dokumentation und Support für Entwickler"],"pt":["Suporte a HTTP client","Integração com CLI","Recursos de MCP","Desenvolvimento avançado com Lightdash","Ferramentas de desenvolvimento personalizadas"],"ru":["Поддержка HTTP-клиента","Интеграция с CLI","Возможности MCP","Расширенное развитие с помощью Lightdash","Настройка инструментов разработки"],"ar":["دعم العميل HTTP","التكامل مع CLI","ميزات MCP","التطوير المتقدم باستخدام Lightdash","أدوات التطوير المخصصة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用openspec-explore","什么是Lightdash工具","openspec-explore替代品","Lightdash工具箱安装","openspec-explore设置指南","AI工具openspec-explore"],"ja":["openspec-exploreの使い方","Lightdashツールとは","openspec-exploreの代替","Lightdashツールボックスのインストール","openspec-exploreの設定ガイド","AIエージェントopenspec-explore"],"ko":["openspec-explore 사용법","라이트대시 도구란","openspec-explore 대체품","라이트대시 도구박스의 설치","openspec-explore 설정 가이드","AI 에이전트 openspec-explore"],"es":["cómo usar Lightdash","qué es openspec-explore","alternativas a Lightdash","Lightdash vs Tableau","instalar Lightdash","guía de configuración de Lightdash","herramientas de IA para desarrolladores","desarrollo de aplicaciones con Lightdash"],"fr":["comment utiliser Lightdash","qu''est-ce que openspec-explore","alternatives à Lightdash","Lightdash vs Tableau","installer Lightdash","guide de configuration de Lightdash","outils d''IA pour les développeurs","développement d''applications avec Lightdash"],"de":["wie man Lightdash verwendet","was ist openspec-explore","Alternativen zu Lightdash","Lightdash vs Tableau","Lightdash installieren","Konfigurationsanleitung für Lightdash","KI-Tools für Entwickler","Anwendungsentwicklung mit Lightdash"],"pt":["como usar openspec-explore","o que é openspec-explore","alternativas para Lightdash","Lightdash vs openspec-explore","instalar openspec-explore","guia de configuração do openspec-explore","desenvolvimento com Lightdash","ferramentas de desenvolvimento de AI"],"ru":["как использовать openspec-explore","что такое openspec-explore","альтернативы Lightdash","Lightdash vs openspec-explore","установка openspec-explore","руководство по настройке openspec-explore","разработка с помощью Lightdash","инструменты разработки ИИ"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام openspec-explore","ما هو openspec-explore","بديلات Lightdash","Lightdash مقابل openspec-explore","تثبيت openspec-explore","دليل إعداد openspec-explore","التطوير باستخدام Lightdash","أدوات التطوير الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"yu-iskw","repo":"lightdash-tools","repoPath":"yu-iskw/lightdash-tools","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.899Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openspec-explore","description":"Enter explore mode - a thinking partner for exploring ideas, investigating problems, and clarifying requirements. Use when the user wants to think through something before or during a change.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"# OpenSpec Explore\n\nEnter explore mode. Think deeply. Visualize freely. Follow the conversation wherever it goes.\n\n**IMPORTANT: Explore mode is for thinking, not implementing.** You may read files, search code, and investigate the codebase, but you must NEVER write code or implement features. If the user asks you to implement something, remind them to exit explore mode first (e.g., start a change with `/opsx:new` or `/opsx:ff`). You MAY create OpenSpec artifacts (proposals, designs, specs) if th","body":"# OpenSpec Explore\n\nEnter explore mode. Think deeply. Visualize freely. Follow the conversation wherever it goes.\n\n**IMPORTANT: Explore mode is for thinking, not implementing.** You may read files, search code, and investigate the codebase, but you must NEVER write code or implement features. If the user asks you to implement something, remind them to exit explore mode first (e.g., start a change with `/opsx:new` or `/opsx:ff`). You MAY create OpenSpec artifacts (proposals, designs, specs) if the user asks—that''s capturing thinking, not implementing.\n\n**This is a stance, not a workflow.** There are no fixed steps, no required sequence, no mandatory outputs. You''re a thinking partner helping the user explore.\n\n---\n\n## The Stance\n\n- **Curious, not prescriptive** - Ask questions that emerge naturally, don''t follow a script\n- **Open threads, not interrogations** - Surface multiple interesting directions and let the user follow what resonates. Don''t funnel them through a single path of questions.\n- **Visual** - Use ASCII diagrams liberally when they''d help clarify thinking\n- **Adaptive** - Follow interesting threads, pivot when new information emerges\n- **Patient** - Don''t rush to conclusions, let the shape of the problem emerge\n- **Grounded** - Explore the actual codebase when relevant, don''t just theorize\n\n---\n\n## What You Might Do\n\nDepending on what the user brings, you might:\n\n**Explore the problem space**\n\n- Ask clarifying questions that emerge from what they said\n- Challenge assumptions\n- Reframe the problem\n- Find analogies\n\n**Investigate the codebase**\n\n- Map existing architecture relevant to the discussion\n- Find integration points\n- Identify patterns already in use\n- Surface hidden complexity\n\n**Compare options**\n\n- Brainstorm multiple approaches\n- Build comparison tables\n- Sketch tradeoffs\n- Recommend a path (if asked)\n\n**Visualize**\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│     Use ASCII diagrams liberally        │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│                                         │\n│   ┌────────┐         ┌────────┐        │\n│   │ State  │────────▶│ State  │        │\n│   │   A    │         │   B    │        │\n│   └────────┘         └────────┘        │\n│                                         │\n│   System diagrams, state machines,      │\n│   data flows, architecture sketches,    │\n│   dependency graphs, comparison tables  │\n│                                         │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n**Surface risks and unknowns**\n\n- Identify what could go wrong\n- Find gaps in understanding\n- Suggest spikes or investigations\n\n---\n\n## OpenSpec Awareness\n\nYou have full context of the OpenSpec system. Use it naturally, don''t force it.\n\n### Check for context\n\nAt the start, quickly check what exists:\n\n```bash\ncd docs && openspec list --json\n```\n\nThis tells you:\n\n- If there are active changes\n- Their names, schemas, and status\n- What the user might be working on\n\n### When no change exists\n\nThink freely. When insights crystallize, you might offer:\n\n- \"This feels solid enough to start a change. Want me to create one?\"\n  → Can transition to `/opsx:new` or `/opsx:ff`\n- Or keep exploring - no pressure to formalize\n\n### When a change exists\n\nIf the user mentions a change or you detect one is relevant:\n\n1. **Read existing artifacts for context**\n   - `docs/openspec/changes/<name>/proposal.md`\n   - `docs/openspec/changes/<name>/design.md`\n   - `docs/openspec/changes/<name>/tasks.md`\n   - etc.\n\n2. **Reference them naturally in conversation**\n   - \"Your design mentions using Redis, but we just realized SQLite fits better...\"\n   - \"The proposal scopes this to premium users, but we''re now thinking everyone...\"\n\n3. **Offer to capture when decisions are made**\n\n   | Insight Type               | Where to Capture             |\n   | -------------------------- | ---------------------------- |\n   | New requirement discovered | `specs/<capability>/spec.md` |\n   | Requirement changed        | `specs/<capability>/spec.md` |\n   | Design decision made       | `design.md`                  |\n   | Scope changed              | `proposal.md`                |\n   | New work identified        | `tasks.md`                   |\n   | Assumption invalidated     | Relevant artifact            |\n\n   Example offers:\n   - \"That''s a design decision. Capture it in design.md?\"\n   - \"This is a new requirement. Add it to specs?\"\n   - \"This changes scope. Update the proposal?\"\n\n4. **The user decides** - Offer and move on. Don''t pressure. Don''t auto-capture.\n\n---\n\n## What You Don''t Have To Do\n\n- Follow a script\n- Ask the same questions every time\n- Produce a specific artifact\n- Reach a conclusion\n- Stay on topic if a tangent is valuable\n- Be brief (this is thinking time)\n\n---\n\n## Handling Different Entry Points\n\n**User brings a vague idea:**\n\n```\nUser: I''m thinking about adding real-time collaboration\n\nYou: Real-time collab is a big space. Let me think about this...\n\n      COLLABORATION SPECTRUM\n      ════════════════════════════════════════════\n\n      Awareness          Coordination         Sync\n          │                   │                 │\n          ▼                   ▼                 ▼\n      ┌────────┐         ┌────────┐        ┌────────┐\n      │Presence│         │Cursors │        │  CRDT  │\n      │  \"3    │         │ Multi  │        │Conflict│\n      │online\" │         │ select │        │  free  │\n      └────────┘         └────────┘        └────────┘\n          │                   │                 │\n       trivial            moderate           complex\n\n      Where''s your head at?\n```\n\n**User brings a specific problem:**\n\n```\nUser: The auth system is a mess\n\nYou: [reads codebase]\n\n     ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n     │              CURRENT AUTH FLOW              │\n     └─────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n                        │\n          ┌─────────────┼─────────────┐\n          ▼             ▼             ▼\n     ┌─────────┐  ┌─────────┐  ┌─────────┐\n     │ Google  │  │  GitHub │  │  Email  │\n     │  OAuth  │  │  OAuth  │  │  Magic  │\n     └────┬────┘  └────┬────┘  └────┬────┘\n          │             │             │\n          └─────────────┼─────────────┘\n                        ▼\n                  ┌───────────┐\n                  │  Session  │\n                  └─────┬─────┘\n                        │\n                        ▼\n                  ┌───────────┐\n                  │   Perms   │\n                  └───────────┘\n\n     I see three tangles. Which one''s burning?\n```\n\n**User is stuck mid-implementation:**\n\n```\nUser: /opsx:explore add-auth-system\n      The OAuth integration is more complex than expected\n\nYou: [reads change artifacts]\n\n     You''re on task 4: \"Implement OAuth flow\"\n\n     Let me trace what''s involved...\n\n     [draws diagram, explores options, suggests paths]\n\n     Want to update the design to reflect this?\n     Or add a spike task to investigate?\n```\n\n**User wants to compare options:**\n\n```\nUser: Should we use Postgres or SQLite?\n\nYou: Generic answer is boring. What''s the context?\n\nUser: A CLI tool that tracks local dev environments\n\nYou: That changes everything.\n\n     ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n     │         CLI TOOL DATA STORAGE                  │\n     └─────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n\n     Key constraints:\n     • No daemon running\n     • Must work offline\n     • Single user\n\n                  SQLite          Postgres\n     Deployment   embedded ✓      needs server ✗\n     Offline      yes ✓           no ✗\n     Single file  yes ✓           no ✗\n\n     SQLite. Not even close.\n\n     Unless... is there a sync component?\n```\n\n---\n\n## Ending Discovery\n\nThere''s no required ending. Discovery might:\n\n- **Flow into action**: \"Ready to start? /opsx:new or /opsx:ff\"\n- **Result in artifact updates**: \"Updated design.md with these decisions\"\n- **Just provide clarity**: User has what they need, moves on\n- **Continue later**: \"We can pick this up anytime\"\n\nWhen it feels like things are crystallizing, you might summarize:\n\n```\n## What We Figured Out\n\n**The problem**: [crystallized understanding]\n\n**The approach**: [if one emerged]\n\n**Open questions**: [if any remain]\n\n**Next steps** (if ready):\n- Create a change: /opsx:new <name>\n- Fast-forward to tasks: /opsx:ff <name>\n- Keep exploring: just keep talking\n```\n\nBut this summary is optional. Sometimes the thinking IS the value.\n\n---\n\n## Guardrails\n\n- **Don''t implement** - Never write code or implement features. Creating OpenSpec artifacts is fine, writing application code is not.\n- **Don''t fake understanding** - If something is unclear, dig deeper\n- **Don''t rush** - Discovery is thinking time, not task time\n- **Don''t force structure** - Let patterns emerge naturally\n- **Don''t auto-capture** - Offer to save insights, don''t just do it\n- **Do visualize** - A good diagram is worth many paragraphs\n- **Do explore the codebase** - Ground discussions in reality\n- **Do question assumptions** - Including the user''s and your own\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:12:27.296Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like Cursor, Windsurf, or Claude Code needing advanced exploratory analysis and OpenSpec artifact creation capabilities.","zh":"适合如Cursor、Windsurf或Claude Code等AI代理，需要高级探索性分析和OpenSpec工件创建能力的场景。","ja":"Cursor、Windsurf、またはClaude CodeのようなAIエージェントに適しています。これらのエージェントは、高度な探索分析とOpenSpecアーティファクトの作成機能を必要とします。","ko":"Cursor, Windsurf 또는 Claude Code와 같은 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다. 이러한 에이전트는 고급 탐색 분석 및 OpenSpec 아티팩트 생성 기능을 필요로 합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf o Claude Code que necesitan análisis exploratorio avanzado y capacidades de creación de artefactos OpenSpec.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA comme Cursor, Windsurf ou Claude Code nécessitant une analyse exploratoire avancée et des capacités de création d''artefacts OpenSpec.","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents wie Cursor, Windsurf oder Claude Code, die erweiterte explorative Analyse- und OpenSpec-Artifact-Erstellungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf ou Claude Code que necessitam de análise exploratória avançada e capacidades de criação de artefatos OpenSpec.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, таких как Cursor, Windsurf или Claude Code, которые требуют продвинутого эксплораторного анализа и возможностей создания артефактов OpenSpec.","ar":"مثالية للوكلاء الذكية مثل Cursor و Windsurf أو Claude Code التي تحتاج إلى تحليل استكشافي متقدم وقدرات إنشاء مستندات OpenSpec."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to deeply explore and visualize codebases using HTTP clients, CLI, and MCP tools, facilitating the creation of OpenSpec proposals, designs, and specs without implementing code changes, leveraging protocols like HTTP and file formats for investigation.","zh":"赋予代理深入探索和可视化代码库的能力，使用HTTP客户端、CLI和MCP工具，促进OpenSpec提案、设计和规格的创建，而无需实施代码更改，利用HTTP和文件格式等协议进行调查。","ja":"エージェントに、HTTPクライアント、CLI、およびMCPツールを使用してコードベースを深く探索および視覚化する能力を与え、コードの変更を実装せずにOpenSpecの提案、設計、および仕様を生成することを容易にし、HTTPやファイル形式などのプロトコルを使用して調査します。","ko":"에이전트에게 HTTP 클라이언트, CLI 및 MCP 도구를 사용하여 코드베이스를 깊이探색하고 시각화하는 능력을 부여하며, 코드 변경을 구현하지 않고 OpenSpec 제안, 설계 및 사양을 생성하며, HTTP 및 파일 형식 등의 프로토콜을 사용하여 조사합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes explorar y visualizar profundamente las bases de código utilizando clientes HTTP, CLI y herramientas MCP, facilitando la creación de propuestas, diseños y especificaciones OpenSpec sin implementar cambios de código, aprovechando protocolos como HTTP y formatos de archivo para la investigación.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''explorer et de visualiser en profondeur les bases de code à l''aide de clients HTTP, CLI et d''outils MCP, facilitant la création de propositions, de conceptions et de spécifications OpenSpec sans implémenter de modifications de code, en exploitant des protocoles comme HTTP et des formats de fichiers pour l''investigation.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Codebasen mithilfe von HTTP-Clients, CLI und MCP-Tools tief zu erkunden und zu visualisieren, wodurch die Erstellung von OpenSpec-Vorschlägen, -Entwürfen und -Spezifikationen ohne die Implementierung von Codeänderungen erleichtert wird, indem Protokolle wie HTTP und Dateiformate für die Untersuchung genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a explorar profundamente e visualizar repositórios de código usando clientes HTTP, CLI e ferramentas MCP, facilitando a criação de propostas, projetos e especificações OpenSpec sem implementar alterações de código, aproveitando protocolos como HTTP e formatos de arquivo para investigação.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью глубоко исследовать и визуализировать кодовые базы с помощью HTTP-клиентов, CLI и инструментов MCP, облегчая создание предложений, проектов и спецификаций OpenSpec без реализации изменений кода, используя протоколы, такие как HTTP, и форматы файлов для расследования.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من استكشاف глубوك وتصور مخازن الشفرة باستخدام عملاء HTTP و CLI وأدوات MCP، وتسهيل إنشاء مقترحات وتصاميم ومواصفات OpenSpec دون تنفيذ تغييرات الشفرة، واستخدام بروتوكولات مثل HTTP وشكلات الملفات للتحقيق."},"useCases":{"en":["Investigating codebase structures","Generating OpenSpec artifacts for proposal and design documentation","Exploring Lightdash tool integrations for comprehensive analysis"],"zh":["调查代码库结构","为提案和设计文档生成OpenSpec工件","探索Lightdash工具集成以进行综合分析"],"ja":["コードベースの構造を調査する","提案と設計文書のためのOpenSpecアーティファクトを生成する","包括的な分析のためのLightdashツールの統合を探索する"],"ko":["코드베이스 구조 조사","제안 및 설계 문서를 위한 OpenSpec 아티팩트 생성","포괄적인 분석을 위한 Lightdash 도구 통합 탐색"],"es":["Investigación de estructuras de base de código","Generación de artefactos OpenSpec para la documentación de propuestas y diseños","Exploración de integraciones de herramientas Lightdash para un análisis integral"],"fr":["Investigation des structures de base de code","Génération d''artefacts OpenSpec pour la documentation des propositions et conceptions","Exploration des intégrations d''outils Lightdash pour une analyse complète"],"de":["Untersuchung von Codebasen-Strukturen","Erzeugung von OpenSpec-Artifacten für Vorschlags- und Entwurfsdokumentation","Erkundung von Lightdash-Tool-Integrationen für eine umfassende Analyse"],"pt":["Investigação de estruturas de repositórios de código","Geração de artefatos OpenSpec para documentação de propostas e projetos","Exploração de integrações de ferramentas Lightdash para análise abrangente"],"ru":["Изучение структур кодовой базы","Генерация артефактов OpenSpec для документации предложений и проектов","Изучение интеграций инструментов Lightdash для всестороннего анализа"],"ar":["تحقيق هيكل مخازن الشفرة","إنشاء مستندات OpenSpec لمستندات المقترحات والتصاميم","استكشاف دمج أدوات Lightdash للتحليل الشامل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Must not write code or implement features in explore mode","Requires exit from explore mode to implement changes","Limited to reading files, searching code, and investigating the codebase"],"zh":["探索模式下不能编写代码或实现功能","需要退出探索模式才能实施更改","仅限于读取文件、搜索代码和调查代码库"],"ja":["探索モードではコードを書いたり機能を実装したりできない","変更を実装するには探索モードを終了する必要がある","ファイルの読み取り、コードの検索、コードベースの調査のみに限定される"],"ko":["탐색 모드에서 코드를 작성하거나 기능을 구현할 수 없음","변경 사항을 구현하려면 탐색 모드를 종료해야 함","파일 읽기, 코드 검색 및 코드베이스 조사만 허용"],"es":["No debe escribir código ni implementar características en el modo de exploración","Requiere la salida del modo de exploración para implementar cambios","Limitado a la lectura de archivos, búsqueda de código e investigación de la base de código"],"fr":["Ne doit pas écrire de code ou implémenter de fonctionnalités en mode d''exploration","Nécessite la sortie du mode d''exploration pour implémenter des modifications","Limité à la lecture de fichiers, à la recherche de code et à l''investigation de la base de code"],"de":["Darf keinen Code schreiben oder Funktionen im Explorationsmodus implementieren","Erfordert den Ausstieg aus dem Explorationsmodus, um Änderungen zu implementieren","Begrenzt auf das Lesen von Dateien, die Suche nach Code und die Untersuchung der Codebasis"],"pt":["Não deve escrever código ou implementar recursos no modo de exploração","Requer saída do modo de exploração para implementar alterações","Limitado à leitura de arquivos, busca de código e investigação do repositório de código"],"ru":["Не должен писать код или реализовывать функции в режиме исследования","Требует выхода из режима исследования для реализации изменений","Ограничен чтением файлов, поиском кода и исследованием кодовой базы"],"ar":["لا ينبغي书 كود أو تنفيذ ميزات في режим الاستكشاف","يتطلب الخروج من وضع الاستكشاف لتنفيذ التغييرات","محدود بالقراءة من الملفات و البحث عن الشفرة و التحقيق في مخزن الشفرة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"37cb96a8ba4c1f65d3a79e3a2636f1367325e7dbc815e9519c2c5d46d346ce15","qualityScore":42}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('mariotoffia/gobridge/deployment-aws-canary-setup', 'community', 'mariotoffia', 'gobridge', 'mariotoffia/gobridge', 'deployment-aws-canary-setup', 0, 0, 42, '2026-03-02T01:56:10.903Z', '2026-03-02T02:17:00.228Z', 'bf13ba527ac817430840b0c5588dc5da775c8b352f11c3eedea70def1c1fdc7a', '{"id":"mariotoffia/gobridge/deployment-aws-canary-setup","name":"deployment-aws-canary-setup","description":{"zh":"此AI智能代理实现了无状态世界和有状态世界之间的桥接，例如Lambda和MQTT或Azure Service Bus","ja":"このAIエージェントは、ステートレスな世界とステートフルな世界の間のブリッジを提供します。例えば、LambdaとMQTTまたはAzure Service Bus","ko":"이 AI 에이전트는 무상태 세계와 상태FUL 세계 간의 브릿지를 제공합니다. 예를 들어, Lambda와 MQTT 또는 Azure Service Bus","es":"La configuración de canario en AWS es un puente entre el mundo sin estado y el estado, como Lambda y MQTT o Azure Service Bus, permitiendo una integración fluida","fr":"La configuration de canari en AWS est un pont entre le monde sans état et l''état, comme Lambda et MQTT ou Azure Service Bus, permettant une intégration fluide","de":"Die Canary-Release-Konfiguration in AWS ist eine Brücke zwischen der staatenlosen Welt und der staatenreichen Welt, wie Lambda und MQTT oder Azure Service Bus, und ermöglicht eine nahtlose Integration","pt":"O deployment-aws-canary-setup é uma ponte entre o mundo stateless e stateful, permitindo a integração de serviços como Lambda e MQTT","ru":"Deployment-aws-canary-setup является мостом между бесстатным и статным мирами, позволяя интегрировать сервисы, такие как Lambda и MQTT","ar":"deployment-aws-canary-setup هو جسر بين العالم الخالي من الحالة وال世界 الحالم، مما يسمح بدمج خدمات مثل Lambda و MQTT","en":"This is a bridge between the stateless world and the stateful such as Lambda <-> MQTT or Azure Service Bus"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI智能代理 - 部署AWS金丝雀发布","ja":"AIエージェント - AWSカナリアリリースの設定","ko":"AI 에이전트 - AWS 카나리 배포 설정","es":"Herramientas de AI: Config