avanzado"],"fr":["Interface d''analyse de logs légère et haute performance","Requêtes et visualisations rapides","Compatibilité avec ClickHouse","Conception d''une seule binaire pour une mise en œuvre simple","Analyse de logs avancée"],"de":["Leichtes und leistungsfähiges Log-Analytics-Interface","Schnelle Abfragen und Visualisierungen","Kompatibilität mit ClickHouse","Einzelne Binär-Design für eine einfache Implementierung","Erweiterte Log-Analyse"],"pt":["Interface de análise de logs leve e de alto desempenho","Consultas e visualização de alta performance","Suporte a ClickHouse","Arquitetura de único binário","Foco em alta performance e escalabilidade"],"ru":["Легкий и высокопроизводительный интерфейс анализа логов","Высокопроизводительные запросы и визуализация","Поддержка ClickHouse","Архитектура единого бинарного файла","Фокус на высокой производительности и масштабируемости"],"ar":["واجهة تحليل سجلات خفيفة وعالية الأداء","استفسارات وتصوير عالية الأداء","دعم ClickHouse","هيكل منفرد الثنائيات","تركيز على الأداء العالي والتنقل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["logchef教程","ClickHouse日志分析","高性能日志查询","实时日志可视化","logchef安装","ClickHouse vs Elasticsearch","logchef替代品"],"ja":["logchefチュートリアル","ClickHouseログ分析","高性能ログクエリ","リアルタイムログ可視化","logchefインストール","ClickHouse vs Elasticsearch","logchefの代替"],"ko":["logchef 튜토리얼","클릭하우스 로그 분석","고성능 로그 쿼리","실시간 로그 시각화","logchef 설치","클릭하우스 vs 엘라스틱서치","logchef 대안"],"es":["herramientas de análisis de registros","logchef","ClickHouse","análisis de datos","cómo utilizar logchef","alternativas a logchef","logchef vs ELK","instalación de logchef","guía de configuración de logchef"],"fr":["outils d''analyse de logs","logchef","ClickHouse","analyse de données","comment utiliser logchef","alternatives à logchef","logchef vs ELK","installation de logchef","guide de configuration de logchef"],"de":["Log-Analytics-Tools","logchef","ClickHouse","Datenanalyse","wie man logchef verwendet","Alternativen zu logchef","logchef vs ELK","Installation von logchef","Konfigurationshandbuch für logchef"],"pt":["como usar logchef","o que é logchef","alternativa ao logstash","logchef vs elk","instalar logchef","guia de configuração do logchef","análise de logs de alto desempenho","ferramentas de ia para análise de logs"],"ru":["как использовать logchef","что такое logchef","альтернатива logstash","logchef vs elk","установить logchef","руководство по настройке logchef","высокопроизводительный анализ логов","инструменты ии для анализа логов"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام logchef","ما هو logchef","بديل لlogstash","logchef مقابل elk","تثبيت logchef","دليل إعداد logchef","تحليل سجلات عالي الأداء","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي لتحليل السجلات"]}},"owner":"mr-karan","repo":"logchef","repoPath":"mr-karan/logchef","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.920Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"logchef","description":"Query and analyze LogChef logs from the terminal using the LogChef CLI. Use for incident triage, debugging errors, exploring LogChefQL filters, running ClickHouse SQL, and executing saved collections.","bodyPreview":"# LogChef CLI\n\nUse the LogChef CLI to query logs safely and accurately.\n\n**Quick Start**\n1. Authenticate with OIDC: `logchef auth --server https://logs.example.com`\n2. Set defaults: `logchef config set team \"my-team\"` and `logchef config set source \"nginx-logs\"`\n3. Query logs: `logchef query ''level=\"error\"'' --since 15m --limit 20`\n\n**Command Cheat Sheet**\n| Command | Use |\n| --- | --- |\n| `logchef auth` | Authenticate (browser-based OIDC) |\n| `logchef query ''...''` | Run LogChefQL filters with ti","body":"# LogChef CLI\n\nUse the LogChef CLI to query logs safely and accurately.\n\n**Quick Start**\n1. Authenticate with OIDC: `logchef auth --server https://logs.example.com`\n2. Set defaults: `logchef config set team \"my-team\"` and `logchef config set source \"nginx-logs\"`\n3. Query logs: `logchef query ''level=\"error\"'' --since 15m --limit 20`\n\n**Command Cheat Sheet**\n| Command | Use |\n| --- | --- |\n| `logchef auth` | Authenticate (browser-based OIDC) |\n| `logchef query ''...''` | Run LogChefQL filters with time flags |\n| `logchef sql ''...''` | Run raw ClickHouse SQL (use `LIMIT` in SQL) |\n| `logchef collections` | List or run saved collections |\n| `logchef teams` | List teams available to you |\n| `logchef sources` | List sources for a team |\n| `logchef schema` | Show columns/types for a source |\n| `logchef config ...` | Manage contexts and defaults |\n\n**Auth And Context**\nUse `logchef auth --server <url>` to create a context and store a token.\nUse `logchef auth --status` and `logchef auth --logout` to check or clear auth.\nUse `--context <name>` or `LOGCHEF_CONTEXT` to target a specific context.\nUse `--server <url>` and `--token <token>` (or `LOGCHEF_SERVER_URL` and `LOGCHEF_AUTH_TOKEN`) for one-off, ephemeral use.\nUse `logchef config list` to view contexts and `logchef config use <name>` to switch.\nAvoid `logchef config set auth.token` because it is not supported by the CLI.\n\n**Required Context**\nProvide `--team` and `--source` on every command unless defaults are set.\nSet defaults with `logchef config set team <name_or_id>` and `logchef config set source <name_or_id>`.\nUse interactive mode by running `logchef query` or `logchef sql` with no args in a TTY and no defaults.\nUse case-insensitive names, numeric IDs, or `database.table` as the `--source` value.\nDiscover names and IDs with `logchef teams` and `logchef sources --team <name_or_id>`.\n\n**Time Range And Limit**\nUse `--since` on `logchef query` and `logchef collections` for relative ranges with `m`, `h`, `d`, or `w` (default is `15m` for `query`).\nUse `--from` and `--to` together for absolute ranges on `logchef query` only.\nUse the exact format `YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS` for `--from` and `--to`.\nSet timezone with `logchef config set timezone \"UTC\"` (or IANA name like `America/Los_Angeles`) and provide absolute times in that timezone.\nExpect `--limit` default to `100` for `logchef query` unless overridden via `logchef config set limit <n>`.\nUse `LIMIT` in SQL because `logchef sql` does not accept `--limit` or `--since`.\nExpect collections to use their saved time range and limit unless overridden.\n\n**LogChefQL Basics**\nQuote the entire query with single quotes to avoid shell piping and expansion.\nUse `=` `!=` `>` `<` `>=` `<=` for comparisons.\nUse `~` and `!~` for case-insensitive substring match (not regex).\nUse `and` / `or` with parentheses for grouping.\nUse `| field1 field2` to select output columns.\nQuote values with spaces or special characters.\nQuote field names that contain dots or special characters.\n\n```bash\n# Exact match\nlogchef query ''level=\"error\" and service=\"api\"'' --since 15m\n\n# Substring match (case-insensitive)\nlogchef query ''msg~\"timeout\"'' --since 1h --limit 20\n\n# Field selection with pipe (note the single quotes)\nlogchef query ''status>=500 and path~\"/v1/\" | _timestamp status path msg'' --since 30m\n\n# Field name with dots\nlogchef query ''k8s.labels.\"app.kubernetes.io/name\"=\"api\"'' --since 1h\n```\n\n**SQL Usage**\nUse `logchef sql` for aggregations, joins, or complex logic.\nAlways include a time filter on the timestamp column (often `_timestamp`).\nUse `LIMIT` in SQL to control result size.\nUse `-` to read SQL from stdin for longer queries.\n\n```bash\nlogchef sql \"SELECT level, count() AS cnt FROM logs.app WHERE _timestamp > now() - INTERVAL 1 HOUR GROUP BY level ORDER BY cnt DESC LIMIT 10\"\n\ncat query.sql | logchef sql -\n```\n\n**Collections**\nList collections: `logchef collections --team \"production\" --source \"nginx-logs\"`.\nRun a collection by name: `logchef collections \"Error Dashboard\" --team \"production\" --source \"nginx-logs\"`.\nOverride time range: `--since 1h`.\nOverride limit: `--limit 50`.\nOverride variables: `--var name=value` (repeatable).\n\n**Teams, Sources, Schema**\nList teams: `logchef teams`.\nList sources for a team: `logchef sources --team \"production\"`.\nShow columns/types: `logchef schema --team \"production\" --source \"nginx-logs\"`.\n\n**Output And Highlighting**\nUse `--output text|json|jsonl|table` on `query`, `sql`, and `collections`.\nUse `--output list` on `collections` when listing.\nUse `--no-highlight` and `--no-timestamp` for clean piping.\nUse `--highlight color:WORD1,WORD2` and `--disable-highlight GROUP` for ad-hoc formatting.\nUse `--show-sql` on `logchef query` to display the generated SQL.\n\n```bash\nlogchef query ''status=500'' --output json | jq ''.count''\nlogchef query ''status=500'' --output jsonl | jq ''.msg''\nlogchef query ''level=\"error\"'' --no-highlight | grep -i \"timeout\"\n```\n\n**Common Errors And Fixes**\n`No context configured` → run `logchef auth --server <url>` or set `LOGCHEF_SERVER_URL` and `LOGCHEF_AUTH_TOKEN`.\n`Team not specified` → pass `--team` or run `logchef config set team <name_or_id>`.\n`Source not specified` → pass `--source` or run `logchef config set source <name_or_id>`.\n`--from requires --to` → always set both `--from` and `--to`.\n`invalid time format` → use `YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS` (no `T`, no `Z`, no offset).\n`SQL query required` → pass SQL as an argument or use `-` to read from stdin.\nShell pipe errors → wrap LogChefQL in single quotes.\n\n**Safety Rules**\nAlways bound time (start with `15m`, expand gradually).\nAlways scope with at least one filter besides time (service, level, host, trace_id).\nAlways use `--limit` for `query` and `collections`.\nKeep raw samples small (≤20 lines) and redact secrets or PII.\nPrefer aggregations before pulling raw logs.\n\n**Investigation Workflow**\n1. Count volume with a narrow window.\n2. Group by a small dimension to find dominant errors.\n3. Sample a few representative logs.\n4. Pivot on `trace_id` or `request_id`.\n5. Expand time range only after counts look reasonable.\n\n```bash\n# Count errors (SQL)\nlogchef sql \"SELECT count() AS cnt FROM logs.app WHERE _timestamp > now() - INTERVAL 15 MINUTE AND level=''error''\"\n\n# Top error messages (SQL)\nlogchef sql \"SELECT msg, count() AS cnt FROM logs.app WHERE _timestamp > now() - INTERVAL 15 MINUTE AND msg ILIKE ''%error%'' GROUP BY msg ORDER BY cnt DESC LIMIT 10\"\n\n# Sample specific error\nlogchef query ''msg~\"connection refused\"'' --since 15m --limit 10\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:26:15.430Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Log Analysis Agents needing high-performance querying and visualization for ClickHouse logs.","zh":"非常适合需要高性能查询和可视化ClickHouse日志的日志分析代理。","ja":"ClickHouseのログに対する高性能なクエリと視覚化を必要とするログ分析エージェントに最適です。","ko":"ClickHouse 로그에 대한 고성능 쿼리 및 시각화를 필요한 로그 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis de Log que necesitan consultas y visualización de alto rendimiento para logs de ClickHouse.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse de logs nécessitant des requêtes et une visualisation haute performance pour les logs ClickHouse.","de":"Perfekt für Log-Analyse-Agents, die eine hochleistungsstarke Abfrage und Visualisierung für ClickHouse-Logs benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Logs que necessitam de consulta e visualização de alto desempenho para logs do ClickHouse.","ru":"Идеально для агентов анализа журналов, которым требуется высокопроизводительный запрос и визуализация для журналов ClickHouse.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تحليل السجلات الذي يحتاج إلى استعلام وتصوير عالي الأداء لسجلات ClickHouse."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to query logs safely and accurately using LogChefQL filters with OIDC authentication and high-performance visualization capabilities, supporting protocols like OIDC for secure authentication and handling log data from sources such as nginx-logs.","zh":"赋予代理安全准确地使用LogChefQL过滤器查询日志的能力，支持OIDC身份验证和高性能视觉化能力，支持如OIDC的协议以实现安全身份验证，并处理来自如nginx-logs的日志数据源。","ja":"エージェントがLogChefQLフィルタを使用して安全に正確にログを照会できるようにし、OIDC認証と高パフォーマンスの視覚化機能をサポートし、OIDCなどのプロトコルを使用して安全な認証を行い、nginx-logsなどのログデータソースからのデータを処理します。","ko":"에이전트가 LogChefQL 필터를 사용하여 안전하게 정확하게 로그를 쿼리할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, OIDC 인증 및 고성능 시각화 기능을 지원하고, OIDC와 같은 프로토콜을 사용하여 보안 인증을 수행하며, nginx-logs와 같은 로그 데이터 소스에서 데이터를 처리합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a consultar registros de manera segura y precisa utilizando filtros LogChefQL con autenticación OIDC y capacidades de visualización de alto rendimiento, que admiten protocolos como OIDC para autenticación segura y manejo de datos de registro de fuentes como nginx-logs.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''interroger les logs de manière sûre et précise en utilisant des filtres LogChefQL avec une authentification OIDC et des capacités de visualisation haute performance, prenant en charge des protocoles tels que OIDC pour une authentification sécurisée et la gestion des données de journal à partir de sources telles que nginx-logs.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, Protokolle sicher und genau abzufragen, indem sie LogChefQL-Filter mit OIDC-Authentifizierung und hochleistungsstarke Visualisierungsfunktionen verwenden, die Protokolle wie OIDC für sichere Authentifizierung und die Verarbeitung von Protokoll-Daten aus Quellen wie nginx-logs unterstützen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a consultar os logs de forma segura e precisa usando filtros LogChefQL com autenticação OIDC e capacidades de visualização de alto desempenho, suportando protocolos como OIDC para autenticação segura e manipulação de dados de log de fontes como nginx-logs.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью безопасного и точного запроса журналов с помощью фильтров LogChefQL и аутентификации OIDC, а также высокопроизводительных возможностей визуализации, поддерживая протоколы, такие как OIDC, для безопасной аутентификации и обработки журнальных данных из источников, таких как nginx-logs.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على استعلام السجلات بأمان ودقة باستخدام مرشحات LogChefQL وتوثيق OIDC وقدرات التصوير عالي الأداء، مع دعم بروتوكولات مثل OIDC للتوثيق الآمن ومعالجة بيانات السجلات من مصادر مثل nginx-logs."},"useCases":{"en":["Querying logs for error levels using LogChefQL","Visualizing log data from ClickHouse for performance optimization","Authenticating with OIDC for secure log access"],"zh":["使用LogChefQL查询错误级别的日志","从ClickHouse视觉化日志数据以优化性能","使用OIDC进行安全的日志访问身份验证"],"ja":["LogChefQLを使用してエラーレベルのログを照会する","ClickHouseからのログデータを視覚化してパフォーマンスを最適化する","OIDCを使用して安全なログアクセス認証を実行する"],"ko":["LogChefQL을 사용하여 오류 수준의 로그를 쿼리하는 것","ClickHouse에서 로그 데이터를 시각화하여 성능을 최적화하는 것","OIDC를 사용하여 안전한 로그 접근 인증을 수행하는 것"],"es":["Consulta de registros para niveles de error utilizando LogChefQL","Visualización de datos de registro de ClickHouse para la optimización del rendimiento","Autenticación con OIDC para un acceso seguro a los registros"],"fr":["Interrogation de logs pour des niveaux d''erreur en utilisant LogChefQL","Visualisation des données de log ClickHouse pour l''optimisation des performances","Authentification avec OIDC pour un accès sécurisé aux logs"],"de":["Abfrage von Protokollen für Fehlerstufen unter Verwendung von LogChefQL","Visualisierung von Protokolldaten von ClickHouse für die Leistungsoptimierung","Authentifizierung mit OIDC für sicheren Zugriff auf Protokolle"],"pt":["Consultar logs para níveis de erro usando LogChefQL","Visualizar dados de log do ClickHouse para otimização de desempenho","Autenticar com OIDC para acesso seguro a logs"],"ru":["Запрос журналов для уровней ошибок с помощью LogChefQL","Визуализация данных журнала из ClickHouse для оптимизации производительности","Аутентификация с помощью OIDC для безопасного доступа к журналам"],"ar":["استعلام السجلات لمستويات الخطأ باستخدام LogChefQL","تصوير بيانات السجل من ClickHouse لتحسين الأداء","التحقق باستخدام OIDC للوصول الآمن إلى السجلات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires ClickHouse database","OIDC authentication needed","Limited to LogChefQL filters"],"zh":["需要ClickHouse数据库","需要OIDC身份验证","仅限LogChefQL过滤器"],"ja":["ClickHouseデータベースが必要","OIDC認証が必要","LogChefQLフィルタのみ"],"ko":["ClickHouse 데이터베이스가 필요합니다","OIDC 인증이 필요합니다","LogChefQL 필터만"],"es":["Requiere base de datos ClickHouse","Se necesita autenticación OIDC","Limitado a filtros LogChefQL"],"fr":["Nécessite une base de données ClickHouse","Authentification OIDC requise","Limité aux filtres LogChefQL"],"de":["Erfordert ClickHouse-Datenbank","OIDC-Authentifizierung erforderlich","Begrenzt auf LogChefQL-Filter"],"pt":["Requer banco de dados ClickHouse","Autenticação OIDC necessária","Limitado a filtros LogChefQL"],"ru":["Требуется база данных ClickHouse","Необходима аутентификация OIDC","Ограничен фильтрами LogChefQL"],"ar":["يتطلب قاعدة بيانات ClickHouse","يتطلب توثيق OIDC","محدود بمرشحات LogChefQL"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"c106a0a40d625cd7a24d5133239f6ac0c4c15e9b44c166ecca4f29a8b85354ef","qualityScore":42}');
