ec Tailwind et Material","Monorepo de nx pour une meilleure organisation","Compatibilité avec la dernière version d''Angular"],"de":["Kodierbeispiele für plastikaweb mit Angular","Integration mit @ngrx für die Zustandsverwaltung","Design mit Tailwind und Material","Monorepo von nx für eine bessere Organisation","Kompatibilität mit der neuesten Version von Angular"],"pt":["Exemplos de codificação plastikaweb com Angular","Integração com @ngrx","Estilização com tailwind","Componentes de material","Monorepo nx para gerenciamento de código"],"ru":["Примеры кодирования plastikaweb с использованием Angular","Интеграция с @ngrx","Стилизация с помощью tailwind","Компоненты material","Nx-монорепо для управления кодом"],"ar":["أمثلة من kodierung plastikaweb باستخدام Angular","التكامل مع @ngrx","التنسيق باستخدام tailwind","مكونات material","monorepo nx لإدارة الكود"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Angular Signaling AI工具","Angular Signals AIエージェント","Angular Signaling AI工具","Angular应用构建","Angular性能优化","Angular Signaling AI工具"],"ja":["Angular Signals AIエージェント","Angular Signaling AI工具","Angular Signals AIエージェント","Angular应用构建","Angular性能优化","Angular Signaling AI工具"],"ko":["Angular Signaling AI 에이전트","Angular Signals AI에이전트","Angular Signaling AI 에이전트","Angular应用构建","Angular性能优化","Angular Signaling AI 에이전트"],"es":["cómo usar angular-signals","qué es angular-signals","alternativas a angular-signals","angular-signals vs @ngrx","instalación de angular-signals","guía de configuración de angular-signals","desarrollo de aplicaciones con angular-signals"],"fr":["comment utiliser angular-signals","quoi est angular-signals","alternatives à angular-signals","angular-signals vs @ngrx","installation d''angular-signals","guide de configuration d''angular-signals","développement d''applications avec angular-signals"],"de":["wie man angular-signals verwendet","was ist angular-signals","alternativen zu angular-signals","angular-signals vs @ngrx","installation von angular-signals","konfigurationsanleitung für angular-signals","entwicklung von anwendungen mit angular-signals"],"pt":["como usar angular-signals","o que é plastikaweb","angular-signals vs outros monorepos","instalar angular-signals","guia de configuração do angular-signals","exemplos de codificação com Angular","integração com @ngrx","estilização com tailwind"],"ru":["как использовать angular-signals","что такое plastikaweb","angular-signals vs другие моноре포","установить angular-signals","руководство по настройке angular-signals","примеры кодирования с использованием Angular","интеграция с @ngrx","стилизация с помощью tailwind"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام angular-signals","ما هو plastikaweb","angular-signals مقابل مونوريبو الأخرى","تثبيت angular-signals","دليل إعداد angular-signals","أمثلة من kodierung باستخدام Angular","التكامل مع @ngrx","التنسيق باستخدام tailwind"]}},"owner":"plastikaweb","repo":"plastikspace","repoPath":"plastikaweb/plastikspace","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.924Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"angular-signals","description":"Implement signal-based reactive state management in Angular v20+. Use for creating reactive state with signal(), derived state with computed(), dependent state with linkedSignal(), and side effects with effect(). Triggers on state management questions, converting from BehaviorSubject/Observable patterns to signals, or implementing reactive data flows.","bodyPreview":"# Angular Signals\n\nSignals are Angular''s reactive primitive for state management. They provide synchronous, fine-grained reactivity.\n\n## Core Signal APIs\n\n### signal() - Writable State\n\n```typescript\nimport { signal } from ''@angular/core'';\n\n// Create writable signal\nconst count = signal(0);\n\n// Read value\nconsole.log(count()); // 0\n\n// Set new value\ncount.set(5);\n\n// Update based on current value\ncount.update(c => c + 1);\n\n// With explicit type\nconst user = signal<User | null>(null);\nuser.set({","body":"# Angular Signals\n\nSignals are Angular''s reactive primitive for state management. They provide synchronous, fine-grained reactivity.\n\n## Core Signal APIs\n\n### signal() - Writable State\n\n```typescript\nimport { signal } from ''@angular/core'';\n\n// Create writable signal\nconst count = signal(0);\n\n// Read value\nconsole.log(count()); // 0\n\n// Set new value\ncount.set(5);\n\n// Update based on current value\ncount.update(c => c + 1);\n\n// With explicit type\nconst user = signal<User | null>(null);\nuser.set({ id: 1, name: ''Alice'' });\n```\n\n### computed() - Derived State\n\n```typescript\nimport { signal, computed } from ''@angular/core'';\n\nconst firstName = signal(''John'');\nconst lastName = signal(''Doe'');\n\n// Derived signal - automatically updates when dependencies change\nconst fullName = computed(() => `${firstName()} ${lastName()}`);\n\nconsole.log(fullName()); // \"John Doe\"\nfirstName.set(''Jane'');\nconsole.log(fullName()); // \"Jane Doe\"\n\n// Computed with complex logic\nconst items = signal<Item[]>([]);\nconst filter = signal('''');\n\nconst filteredItems = computed(() => {\n  const query = filter().toLowerCase();\n  return items().filter(item => item.name.toLowerCase().includes(query));\n});\n\nconst totalPrice = computed(() => filteredItems().reduce((sum, item) => sum + item.price, 0));\n```\n\n### linkedSignal() - Dependent State with Reset\n\n```typescript\nimport { signal, linkedSignal } from ''@angular/core'';\n\nconst options = signal([''A'', ''B'', ''C'']);\n\n// Resets to first option when options change\nconst selected = linkedSignal(() => options()[0]);\n\nconsole.log(selected()); // \"A\"\nselected.set(''B''); // User selects B\nconsole.log(selected()); // \"B\"\noptions.set([''X'', ''Y'']); // Options change\nconsole.log(selected()); // \"X\" - auto-reset to first\n\n// With previous value access\nconst items = signal<Item[]>([]);\n\nconst selectedItem = linkedSignal<Item[], Item | null>({\n  source: () => items(),\n  computation: (newItems, previous) => {\n    // Try to preserve selection if item still exists\n    const prevItem = previous?.value;\n    if (prevItem && newItems.some(i => i.id === prevItem.id)) {\n      return prevItem;\n    }\n    return newItems[0] ?? null;\n  },\n});\n```\n\n### effect() - Side Effects\n\n```typescript\nimport { signal, effect, inject, DestroyRef } from ''@angular/core'';\n\n@Component({...})\nexport class Search {\n  query = signal('''');\n\n  constructor() {\n    // Effect runs when query changes\n    effect(() => {\n      console.log(''Search query:'', this.query());\n    });\n\n    // Effect with cleanup\n    effect((onCleanup) => {\n      const timer = setInterval(() => {\n        console.log(''Current query:'', this.query());\n      }, 1000);\n\n      onCleanup(() => clearInterval(timer));\n    });\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Effect rules:**\n\n- Run in injection context (constructor or with `runInInjectionContext`)\n- Automatically cleaned up when component destroys\n\n## Component State Pattern\n\n```typescript\n@Component({\n  selector: ''app-todo-list'',\n  template: `\n    <input [value]=\"newTodo()\" (input)=\"newTodo.set($any($event.target).value)\" />\n    <button (click)=\"addTodo()\" [disabled]=\"!canAdd()\">Add</button>\n\n    <ul>\n      @for (todo of filteredTodos(); track todo.id) {\n        <li [class.done]=\"todo.done\">\n          {{ todo.text }}\n          <button (click)=\"toggleTodo(todo.id)\">Toggle</button>\n        </li>\n      }\n    </ul>\n\n    <p>{{ remaining() }} remaining</p>\n  `,\n})\nexport class TodoList {\n  // State\n  todos = signal<Todo[]>([]);\n  newTodo = signal('''');\n  filter = signal<''all'' | ''active'' | ''done''>(''all'');\n\n  // Derived state\n  canAdd = computed(() => this.newTodo().trim().length > 0);\n\n  filteredTodos = computed(() => {\n    const todos = this.todos();\n    switch (this.filter()) {\n      case ''active'':\n        return todos.filter(t => !t.done);\n      case ''done'':\n        return todos.filter(t => t.done);\n      default:\n        return todos;\n    }\n  });\n\n  remaining = computed(() => this.todos().filter(t => !t.done).length);\n\n  // Actions\n  addTodo() {\n    const text = this.newTodo().trim();\n    if (text) {\n      this.todos.update(todos => [...todos, { id: crypto.randomUUID(), text, done: false }]);\n      this.newTodo.set('''');\n    }\n  }\n\n  toggleTodo(id: string) {\n    this.todos.update(todos => todos.map(t => (t.id === id ? { ...t, done: !t.done } : t)));\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## RxJS Interop\n\n### toSignal() - Observable to Signal\n\n```typescript\nimport { toSignal } from ''@angular/core/rxjs-interop'';\nimport { interval } from ''rxjs'';\n\n@Component({...})\nexport class Timer {\n  private http = inject(HttpClient);\n\n  // From observable - requires initial value or allowUndefined\n  counter = toSignal(interval(1000), { initialValue: 0 });\n\n  // From HTTP - undefined until loaded\n  users = toSignal(this.http.get<User[]>(''/api/users''));\n\n  // With requireSync for synchronous observables (BehaviorSubject)\n  private user$ = new BehaviorSubject<User | null>(null);\n  currentUser = toSignal(this.user$, { requireSync: true });\n}\n```\n\n### toObservable() - Signal to Observable\n\n```typescript\nimport { toObservable } from ''@angular/core/rxjs-interop'';\nimport { switchMap, debounceTime } from ''rxjs'';\n\n@Component({...})\nexport class Search {\n  query = signal('''');\n\n  private http = inject(HttpClient);\n\n  // Convert signal to observable for RxJS operators\n  results = toSignal(\n    toObservable(this.query).pipe(\n      debounceTime(300),\n      switchMap(q => this.http.get<Result[]>(`/api/search?q=${q}`))\n    ),\n    { initialValue: [] }\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## Signal Equality\n\n```typescript\n// Custom equality function\nconst user = signal<User>({ id: 1, name: ''Alice'' }, { equal: (a, b) => a.id === b.id });\n\n// Only triggers updates when ID changes\nuser.set({ id: 1, name: ''Alice Updated'' }); // No update\nuser.set({ id: 2, name: ''Bob'' }); // Triggers update\n```\n\n## Untracked Reads\n\n```typescript\nimport { untracked } from ''@angular/core'';\n\nconst a = signal(1);\nconst b = signal(2);\n\n// Only depends on ''a'', not ''b''\nconst result = computed(() => {\n  const aVal = a();\n  const bVal = untracked(() => b());\n  return aVal + bVal;\n});\n```\n\n## Service State Pattern\n\n```typescript\n@Injectable({ providedIn: ''root'' })\nexport class Auth {\n  // Private writable state\n  private _user = signal<User | null>(null);\n  private _loading = signal(false);\n\n  // Public read-only signals\n  readonly user = this._user.asReadonly();\n  readonly loading = this._loading.asReadonly();\n  readonly isAuthenticated = computed(() => this._user() !== null);\n\n  private http = inject(HttpClient);\n\n  async login(credentials: Credentials): Promise<void> {\n    this._loading.set(true);\n    try {\n      const user = await firstValueFrom(this.http.post<User>(''/api/login'', credentials));\n      this._user.set(user);\n    } finally {\n      this._loading.set(false);\n    }\n  }\n\n  logout(): void {\n    this._user.set(null);\n  }\n}\n```\n\nFor advanced patterns including resource(), see [references/signal-patterns.md](references/signal-patterns.md).\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:26:43.214Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing fine-grained state management with Angular''s reactive primitives.","zh":"非常适合需要使用 Angular 的响应式原语进行细粒度状态管理的前端代理。","ja":"Angular の反応的なプリミティブを使用した細粒度の状態管理が必要なフロントエンド エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Angular의 반응형 原语를 사용하여 세부적인 상태 관리가 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan un control de estado granular con los primitivos reactivos de Angular.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend qui ont besoin d''une gestion d''état fine avec les primitives réactives d''Angular.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die eine feingranulare Zustandsverwaltung mit den reaktiven Primitiven von Angular benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de gerenciamento de estado granular com primitivos reativos do Angular.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым необходим тонкий контроль состояния с помощью реактивных примитивов Angular.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة حالة دقيقة باستخدام البدائيات التفاعلية لأنجولار."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage state synchronously using Angular Signals, integrating seamlessly with @ngrx and Tailwind for robust frontend development, and providing explicit type control for signals like User or null.","zh":"赋予代理使用 Angular Signals 同步管理状态的能力，与 @ngrx 和 Tailwind 无缝集成，提供强大的前端开发，并为信号（如 User 或 null）提供显式类型控制。","ja":"Angular Signals を使用して状態を同期的に管理するエージェントを可能にし、@ngrx と Tailwind との統合を容易にし、信号（たとえば User または null）に対する明示的な型制御を提供することで、ロバストなフロントエンド開発を可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가 Angular Signals를 사용하여 상태를 동기적으로 관리할 수 있도록 하며, @ngrx 및 Tailwind와의 통합을 원활하게 하고, User 또는 null과 같은 신호에 대한 명시적인 유형 제어를 제공하여 강력한 프론트엔드 개발을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar el estado de forma sincrónica utilizando Angular Signals, integrándose de forma nativa con @ngrx y Tailwind para un desarrollo de frontend robusto, y proporcionando un control de tipo explícito para señales como User o null.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer l''état de manière synchrone en utilisant les signaux Angular, en s''intégrant sans problème avec @ngrx et Tailwind pour un développement de frontend robuste, et en fournissant un contrôle de type explicite pour les signaux comme User ou null.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, den Zustand synchron mithilfe von Angular Signals zu verwalten, indem sie nahtlos in @ngrx und Tailwind für robuste Frontend-Entwicklung integriert werden und eine explizite Typsteuerung für Signale wie User oder null bereitstellen.","pt":"Habilita agentes a gerenciar estado de forma síncrona usando Sinais do Angular, integrando-se perfeitamente com @ngrx e Tailwind para desenvolvimento de frontend robusto, e fornecendo controle de tipo explícito para sinais como User ou nulo.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять состоянием синхронно с помощью сигналов Angular, интегрируясь без проблем с @ngrx и Tailwind для прочного frontend-разработки, и обеспечивая явный контроль типов для сигналов, таких как User или null.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من إدارة الحالة بشكل متزامن باستخدام إشارات الأنجولار، ودمجها بشكل متكامل مع @ngrx و Tailwind من أجل تطوير واجهة المستخدم الأمامية القوية، وتوفير التحكم الصريح في النوع للإشارات مثل المستخدم أو فارغة."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating synchronous, fine-grained reactive components with signal()","Updating state values using signal.set() and signal.update() methods","Implementing explicit type control for signals, such as User or null, in Angular applications"],"zh":["使用 signal() 创建同步、细粒度的响应式组件","使用 signal.set() 和 signal.update() 方法更新状态值","在 Angular 应用程序中实现信号（如 User 或 null）的显式类型控制"],"ja":["signal() を使用して同期的な、細粒度の反応コンポーネントを作成する","signal.set() と signal.update() メソッドを使用して状態値を更新する","Angular アプリケーションで、User または null などの信号の明示的な型制御を実装する"],"ko":["signal()를 사용하여 동기적이고 세부적인 반응형 컴포넌트를 생성합니다.","signal.set() 및 signal.update() 메서드를 사용하여 상태 값을 업데이트합니다.","Angular 애플리케이션에서 User 또는 null과 같은 신호에 대한 명시적인 유형 제어를 구현합니다."],"es":["Crear componentes reactivos sincrónicos y granulares con signal()","Actualizar valores de estado utilizando los métodos signal.set() y signal.update()","Implementar un control de tipo explícito para señales como User o null en aplicaciones Angular"],"fr":["Créer des composants réactifs synchrones et granulaires avec signal()","Mettre à jour les valeurs d''état en utilisant les méthodes signal.set() et signal.update()","Mettre en œuvre un contrôle de type explicite pour les signaux comme User ou null dans les applications Angular"],"de":["Erstellen von synchronen, feingranularen reaktiven Komponenten mit signal()","Aktualisieren von Zustandswerten mithilfe der Methoden signal.set() und signal.update()","Implementieren einer expliziten Typsteuerung für Signale wie User oder null in Angular-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Criar componentes reativos finos e síncronos com signal()","Atualizar valores de estado usando métodos signal.set() e signal.update()","Implementar controle de tipo explícito para sinais, como User ou nulo, em aplicativos Angular"],"ru":["Создание синхронных, тонких реактивных компонентов с помощью signal()","Обновление значений состояния с помощью методов signal.set() и signal.update()","Реализация явного контроля типов для сигналов, таких как User или null, в приложениях Angular"],"ar":["إنشاء مكونات تفاعلية دقيقة ومزامنة باستخدام signal()","تحديث قيم الحالة باستخدام أساليب signal.set() و signal.update()","تنفيذ التحكم الصريح في النوع للإشارات مثل المستخدم أو فارغة في تطبيقات الأنجولار"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Angular and @angular/core installation","Limited to Angular ecosystem, not compatible with other frontend frameworks"],"zh":["需要安装 Angular 和 @angular/core","仅限于 Angular 生态系统，不兼容其他前端框架"],"ja":["Angular と @angular/core のインストールが必要","Angular エコシステムのみに制限され、他のフロントエンド フレームワークとの互換性がありません"],"ko":["Angular 및 @angular/core의 설치가 필요합니다.","Angular 생태계에만 제한되며 다른 프론트엔드 프레임워크와 호환되지 않습니다."],"es":["Requiere la instalación de Angular y @angular/core","Limitado al ecosistema de Angular, no compatible con otros frameworks de frontend"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation d''Angular et de @angular/core","Limité à l''écosystème d''Angular, non compatible avec d''autres frameworks de frontend"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation von Angular und @angular/core","Begrenzt auf das Angular-Ökosystem, nicht kompatibel mit anderen Frontend-Frameworks"],"pt":["Requer instalação do Angular e @angular/core","Limitado ao ecossistema do Angular, não compatível com outros frameworks de frontend"],"ru":["Требует установки Angular и @angular/core","Ограничен экосистемой Angular, не совместим с другими фронтенд-фреймворками"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت الأنجولار و @angular/core","محدود بنظام الأنجولار، غير متوافق مع إطارات واجهة المستخدم الأمامية الأخرى"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"6ba4eff135230b69cf49d64f9c57a458fa5081fa0553dbd67239639ac27dd02d","qualityScore":42}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('EpicenterHQ/epicenter/documentation', 'community', 'EpicenterHQ', 'epicenter', 'EpicenterHQ/epicenter', 'documentation', 0, 0, 42, '2026-03-02T01:56:10.929Z', '2026-03-02T02:29:06.887Z', '3bde9a18824c6aba5de728c80c6971f0ec9de88042c912447d6ea96b8501b6ee', '{"id":"EpicenterHQ/epicenter/documentation","name":"documentation","description":{"zh":"AI智能文档工具，通过语音输入获取文本，免费开源，支持本地优先应用","ja":"AIエージェントドキュメントは、ショートカットを押して話してテキストを取得する、無料でオープンソースのツールです","ko":"AI 에이전트 문서화 도구는 단축키를 눌러 말한 후 텍스트를 얻을 수 있는 무료 및 오픈 소스 도구입니다","es":"La documentación se vuelve fácil con atajos y herramientas de AI de código abierto. Obtén texto con solo hablar","fr":"La documentation devient facile avec des raccourcis et des outils d''IA open source. Obtenir du texte en parlant simplement","de":"Dokumentation wird einfach mit Shortcuts und Open-Source-KI-Tools. Erhalten Sie Text, indem Sie einfach sprechen","pt":"A documentação de agente de IA é uma ferramenta gratuita e de código aberto que permite aos desenvolvedores criar aplicativos locais com facilidade","ru":"Документация ИИ Агентов - это бесплатный и открытый инструмент, который позволяет разработчикам создавать местные приложения легко","ar":"توثيق وثائق الوسائط هو أداة مجانية ومفتوحة المصدر تسمح للمطورين إنشاء تطبيقات محلية بسهولة","en":"Press shortcut → speak → get text. Free and open source. More local-first apps soon ❤️"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI智能文档工具","ja":"AIエージェント ドキュメント","ko":"AI 에이전트 문서화 도구","es":"Herramientas de AI: Documentación con Atajos","fr":"Outils d''IA: Documentation avec Raccourcis","de":"KI-Tools: Dokumentation mit Shortcuts","pt":"Ferramentas de IA: Documentação de Agente de IA","ru":"ИИ Агенты: Документация для Разработчиков","ar":"ادوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: توثيق وثائق الوسائط","en":"documentation"},"description":{"zh":"AI智能文档工具，通过语音输入获取文本，免费开源，支持本地优先应用","ja":"AIエージェントドキュメントは、ショートカットを押して話してテキストを取得する、無料でオープンソースのツールです","ko":"AI 에이전트 문서화 도구는 단축키를 눌러 말한 후 텍스트를 얻을 수 있는 무료 및 오픈 소스 도구입니다","es":"La documentación se vuelve fácil con atajos y herramientas de AI de código abierto. Obtén texto con solo hablar","fr":"La documentation devient facile avec des raccourcis et des outils d''IA open source. Obtenir du texte en parlant simplement","de":"Dokumentation wird einfach mit Shortcuts und Open-Source-KI-Tools. Erhalten Sie Text, indem Sie einfach sprechen","pt":"A documentação de agente de IA é uma ferramenta gratuita e de código aberto que permite aos desenvolvedores criar aplicativos locais com facilidade","ru":"Документация ИИ Агентов - это бесплатный и открытый инструмент, который позволяет разработчикам создавать местные приложения легко","ar":"توثيق وثائق الوسائط هو أداة مجانية ومفتوحة المصدر تسمح للمطورين إنشاء تطبيقات محلية بسهولة","en":"Press shortcut → speak → get text. Free and open source. More local-first apps soon ❤️"},"definition":{"en":"Press shortcut → speak → get text. Free and open source. More local-first apps soon ❤️"},"features":{"zh":["语音输入","免费开源","本地优先应用","支持多种平台","简单易用"],"ja":["ショートカットを押して話してテキストを取得","無料でオープンソース","ローカルファーストアプリ","多種プラットフォームに対応","簡単に使える"],"ko":["단축키를 눌러 말한 후 텍스트를 얻음","무료 및 오픈 소스","로컬 우선 앱","다양한 플랫폼 지원","간단하고 사용하기 쉬움"],"es":["Atajos personalizados para una mayor eficiencia","Integración con aplicaciones de código abierto","Obtención de texto con comandos de voz","Funcionamiento local para una mayor privacidad","Amplia compatibilidad con diferentes sistemas operativos"],"fr":["Raccourcis personnalisés pour une plus grande efficacité","Intégration avec des applications open source","Obtention de texte avec des commandes vocales","Fonctionnement local pour une plus grande confidentialité","Compatibilité étendue avec différents systèmes d''exploitation"],"de":["Benutzerdefinierte Shortcuts für höhere Effizienz","Integration mit Open-Source-Anwendungen","Erhalt von Text mit Sprachbefehlen","Lokales Funktionieren für höhere Datenschutz","Erweiterte Kompatibilität mit verschiedenen Betriebssystemen"],"pt":["Press shortcut para falar e obter texto","Aplicativos locais gratuitos e de código aberto","Desenvolvimento de aplicativos com facilidade","Ferramenta gratuita e de código aberto","Suporte a desenvolvedores"],"ru":["Нажмите сочетание клавиш, чтобы говорить и получать текст","Местные приложения бесплатно и с открытым исходным кодом","Разработка приложений с легкостью","Бесплатный и открытый инструмент","Поддержка разработчиков"],"ar":["اضغط على اختصار للكلام والحصول على نص","تطبيقات محلية مجانية ومفتوحة المصدر","تطوير التطبيقات بسهولة","أداة مجانية ومفتوحة المصدر","دعم المطورين"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能文档工具","语音输入","免费开源","本地优先应用","如何使用AI文档工具","AI文档工具替代品","AI文档工具安装","AI文档工具设置指南"],"ja":["AIエージェントドキュメント","ショートカットを押して話してテキストを取得","無料でオープンソース","ローカルファーストアプリ","AIエージェントドキュメントの使い方","AIエージェントドキュメントの代替","AIエージェントドキュメントのインストール","AIエージェントドキュメントの設定ガイド"],"ko":["AI 에이전트 문서화 도구","단축키를 눌러 말한 후 텍스트를 얻음","무료 및 오픈 소스","로컬 우선 앱","AI 에이전트 문서화 도구 사용법","AI 에이전트 문서화 도구 대체","AI 에이전트 문서화 도구 설치","AI 에이전트 문서화 도구 설정 가이드"],"es":["herramientas de AI","documentación con atajos","aplicaciones de código abierto","cómo utilizar herramientas de AI","alternativas a herramientas de AI","guía de instalación de herramientas de AI","configuración de herramientas de AI"],"fr":["outils d''IA","documentation avec raccourcis","applications open source","comment utiliser des outils d''IA","alternatives aux outils d''IA","guide d''installation des outils d''IA","configuration des outils d''IA"],"de":["KI-Tools","Dokumentation mit Shortcuts","Open-Source-Anwendungen","wie man KI-Tools verwendet","Alternative zu KI-Tools","Installationsanleitung für KI-Tools","Einrichtung von KI-Tools"],"pt":["como usar agente de ia","o que é agente de ia","agente de ia alternative","agente de ia vs competitor","instalar agente de ia","guia de configuração do agente de ia","desenvolvimento de aplicativos locais","ferramentas de ia para desenvolvedores"],"ru":["как использовать ИИ Агент","что такое ИИ Агент","ИИ Агент альтернатива","ИИ Агент vs конкурент","установить ИИ Агент","руководство по настройке ИИ Агента","разработка местных приложений","инструменты ИИ для разработчиков"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام وثائق الوسائط","ما هي وثائق الوسائط","وثائق الوسائط بديلة","وثائق الوسائط مقابل منافس","تثبيت وثائق الوسائط","دليل إعداد وثائق الوسائط","تطوير التطبيقات المحلية","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين"]}},"owner":"EpicenterHQ","repo":"epicenter","repoPath":"EpicenterHQ/epicenter","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.929Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"documentation","description":"In-code documentation, folder READMEs, and code comments. Use when writing README.md files, JSDoc comments, or explaining code organization.","bodyPreview":"# Documentation\n\nFollow [writing-voice](../writing-voice/SKILL.md) for tone.\n\nDocumentation explains **why**, not **what**. Users can read code to see what it does. They need you to explain the reasoning.\n\n## Folder READMEs\n\nPrimary job: explain **why** this folder exists and the mental model.\n\n### Can Include\n\n- ASCII art diagrams for complex relationships\n- Overview of key exports or entry points\n- Brief file descriptions IF they add context beyond the filename\n- Relationships to other folders","body":"# Documentation\n\nFollow [writing-voice](../writing-voice/SKILL.md) for tone.\n\nDocumentation explains **why**, not **what**. Users can read code to see what it does. They need you to explain the reasoning.\n\n## Folder READMEs\n\nPrimary job: explain **why** this folder exists and the mental model.\n\n### Can Include\n\n- ASCII art diagrams for complex relationships\n- Overview of key exports or entry points\n- Brief file descriptions IF they add context beyond the filename\n- Relationships to other folders\n\n### Avoid\n\n- Exhaustive file listings that just duplicate `ls`\n- Descriptions that repeat the filename (\"auth.ts - authentication\")\n- Implementation details better expressed in code\n\n### Good\n\n````markdown\n# Converters\n\nTransform field schemas into format-specific representations.\n\n```\n┌─────────────┐     ┌──────────────┐\n│ Field Schema│────▶│  to-arktype  │────▶ Runtime validation\n└─────────────┘     ├──────────────┤\n                    │  to-drizzle  │────▶ SQLite columns\n                    └──────────────┘\n```\n\nField schemas are pure JSON Schema objects with `x-component` hints. Each converter takes the same input and produces output for a specific consumer.\n````\n\n### Bad\n\n```markdown\n# Converters\n\n- `to-arktype.ts` - Converts to ArkType\n- `to-drizzle.ts` - Converts to Drizzle\n- `index.ts` - Exports\n```\n\nThe bad example just lists files without explaining the pattern or when to add new converters.\n\n## JSDoc Comments\n\nJSDoc explains **when and why** to use something, not just what it does.\n\n### Good\n\n````typescript\n/**\n * Get all table helpers as an array.\n *\n * Useful for providers and indexes that need to iterate over all tables.\n * Returns only the table helpers, excluding utility methods like `clearAll`.\n *\n * @example\n * ```typescript\n * for (const table of tables.defined()) {\n *   console.log(table.name, table.count());\n * }\n * ```\n */\ndefined() { ... }\n````\n\n### Bad\n\n```typescript\n/** Returns all table helpers as an array. */\ndefined() { ... }\n```\n\n### Rules\n\n- Include `@example` blocks with realistic usage\n- Explain WHEN to use it, not just WHAT it does\n- Document non-obvious behavior or edge cases\n- Public APIs get detailed docs; internal helpers can be minimal\n\n## Code Comments\n\nComments explain **why**, not **what**.\n\n### Good\n\n```typescript\n// Y.Doc clientIDs are random 32-bit integers, so we can''t rely on ordering.\n// Use timestamps from the entries themselves for deterministic sorting.\nconst sorted = entries.sort((a, b) => a.timestamp - b.timestamp);\n```\n\n### Bad\n\n```typescript\n// Sort the entries\nconst sorted = entries.sort((a, b) => a.timestamp - b.timestamp);\n```\n\n### Rules\n\n- If the code is clear, don''t comment it\n- Comment the \"why\" when it''s not obvious\n- Comment workarounds with links to issues/docs\n- Delete commented-out code; that''s what git is for\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:29:06.887Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Developer Agents needing advanced code explanation and folder structure insights.","zh":"非常适合需要高级代码解释和文件夹结构洞察的开发者代理。","ja":"開発者エージェントが高度なコードの説明とフォルダ構造の洞察が必要な場合に最適です。","ko":"개발자 에이전트가 고급 코드 설명과 폴더 구조에 대한 통찰력이 필요한 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollador que necesitan explicaciones avanzadas de código y conocimientos de la estructura de carpetas.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Développeur ayant besoin d''explications de code avancées et d''informations sur la structure de dossiers.","de":"Perfekt für Entwickleragenten, die erweiterte Codeerklärungen und Ordnerstruktur-Einblicke benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvedor que necessitam de explicações avançadas de código e insights de estrutura de pasta.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов-разработчиков, которым требуются расширенные объяснения кода и идеи о структуре папок.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المطورين الذين يحتاجون إلى شرح متقدم للرمز ورسومات هيكل المجلد."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate high-quality README files using ASCII art diagrams, providing context beyond code with folder relationships and key export overviews, all while maintaining a consistent writing voice.","zh":"赋予代理生成高质量的README文件的能力，使用ASCII艺术图表，提供超出代码的上下文，包括文件夹关系和关键导出概述，同时保持一致的写作语调。","ja":"エージェントに、高品質のREADMEファイルを生成する能力を付与します。ASCIIアートの図を使用して、コードを超えたコンテキストを提供し、フォルダの関係や重要なエクスポートの概要を提供しながら、一貫した書き言葉を維持します。","ko":"에이전트가 고급 품질의 README 파일을 생성할 수 있는 능력을 부여합니다. ASCII 아트 다이어그램을 사용하여 코드를 넘어서는 컨텍스트를 제공하며 폴더 관계와 주요 내보내기 개요를 제공하면서 일관된 글쓰기 목소리를 유지합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar archivos README de alta calidad utilizando diagramas de arte ASCII, proporcionando contexto más allá del código con relaciones de carpetas y resúmenes de exportaciones clave, manteniendo al mismo tiempo una voz de escritura consistente.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des fichiers README de haute qualité en utilisant des diagrammes d''art ASCII, fournissant un contexte au-delà du code avec des relations de dossiers et des aperçus d''exportation clés, tout en maintenant une voix d''écriture cohérente.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, hochwertige README-Dateien mit ASCII-Kunstdiagrammen zu generieren, die einen Kontext jenseits des Codes mit Ordnerbeziehungen und wichtigen Exportübersichten bieten, während sie gleichzeitig eine konsistente Schreibstimme beibehalten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar arquivos README de alta qualidade usando diagramas de arte ASCII, fornecendo contexto além do código com relações de pasta e visões gerais de exportação-chave, mantendo uma voz de escrita consistente.","ru":"Позволяет агентам генерировать файлы README высокого качества, используя диаграммы ASCII-искусства, предоставляя контекст за пределами кода с отношениями папок и обзорами ключевых экспортов, сохраняя при этом последовательный тон письма.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من生成 ملفات README ذات جودة عالية باستخدام رسومات الفن ASCII ، وتقديم السياق ما وراء الرمز مع علاقات المجلدات وملخصات التصدير الرئيسية ، مع الحفاظ على صوت كتابة متسق."},"useCases":{"en":["Explaining complex code relationships","Generating folder READMEs with mental models","Creating brief file descriptions for context"],"zh":["解释复杂的代码关系","生成包含心理模型的文件夹README","创建简要的文件描述以提供上下文"],"ja":["複雑なコード関係の説明","精神モデルを含むフォルダREADMEの生成","コンテキストを提供するための簡潔なファイルの説明"],"ko":["복잡한 코드 관계 설명","심리 모델을 포함한 폴더 README 생성","컨텍스트를 제공하기 위한 간단한 파일 설명"],"es":["Explicar relaciones de código complejas","Generar README de carpetas con modelos mentales","Crear descripciones de archivo breves para contexto"],"fr":["Expliquer les relations de code complexes","Générer des README de dossiers avec des modèles mentaux","Créer des descriptions de fichiers brèves pour le contexte"],"de":["Komplexe Code-Beziehungen erklären","Ordner-README mit mentalen Modellen generieren","Kurze Dateibeschreibungen für den Kontext erstellen"],"pt":["Explicar relacionamentos de código complexos","Gerar READMEs de pasta com modelos mentais","Criar descrições de arquivo breves para contexto"],"ru":["Объяснять сложные отношения кода","Генерировать README для папок с умственными моделями","Создавать краткие описания файлов для контекста"],"ar":["شرح علاقات الرمز المعقدة","генерировать READMEs للمجلدات مع النماذج العقلية","إنشاء описания الملفات القصيرة للسياق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of writing voice guidelines","Focused on explaining why, not what the code does"],"zh":["需要了解写作语调指南","专注于解释为什么，而不是代码的功能"],"ja":["書き言葉のガイドラインを理解する必要がある","コードの機能ではなく、 почемуを説明することに焦点を当てている"],"ko":["글쓰기 목소리 가이드라인을 이해해야 함","코드의 기능이 아니라 왜 그런지 설명하는 것에 중점을 둠"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de las directrices de la voz de escritura","Se centra en explicar por qué, no qué hace el código"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension des directives de voix d''écriture","Se concentre sur l''explication de pourquoi, et non de ce que fait le code"],"de":["Benötigt Verständnis für Richtlinien zur Schreibstimme","Konzentriert sich auf die Erklärung, warum, nicht was der Code tut"],"pt":["Exige compreensão das diretrizes de voz de escrita","Focado em explicar por quê, não o que o código faz"],"ru":["Требует понимания руководящих принципов тона письма","Сосредоточен на объяснении почему, а не что делает код"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم إرشادات صوت الكتابة","مركز على شرح لماذا ، وليس ما يفعله الرمز"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"3bde9a18824c6aba5de728c80c6971f0ec9de88042c912447d6ea96b8501b6ee","qualityScore":42}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('thesampaton/durable-streams-reference/m13-domain-error', 'community', 'thesampaton', 'durable-streams-reference', 'thesampaton/durable-streams-reference', 'm13-domain-error', 0, 0, 42, '2026-03-02T01:56:10.930Z', '2026-03-02T02:30:06.237Z', '5e87ba8162af9e34e6a6afe6f50e7e708bc5363216f7d691870d25965cafa1d3', '{"id":"thesampaton/durable-streams-reference/m13-domain-error","name":"m13-domain-error","description":{"zh":"m13-domain-error是一个使用axum和tokio的Rust实现的Durable Streams协议，支持流读取、生产者幂等性、JSON批处理和TTL","ja":"m13-domain-errorは、axumとtokioを使用したRustによるDurable Streamsプロトコルの実装です。ストリーミング読み取り、プロデューサーの冪等性、JSONバッチモード、TTLをサポートします","ko":"m13-domain-error는 axum과 tokio를 사용하여 Rust로 구현된 Durable Streams 프로토콜로, 스트리밍 읽기, 생산자 동등성, JSON 배치 모드, TTL을 지원합니다","es":"m13-domain-error es una implementación de referencia de Durable Streams en Rust con axum y tokio, soportando lecturas de streaming y productor idempotente","fr":"m13-domain-error est une implémentation de référence de Durable Streams en Rust avec axum et tokio, prenant en charge les lectures de streaming et le producteur idempotent","de":"m13-domain-error ist eine Referenzimplementierung von Durable Streams in Rust mit axum und tokio, unterstützt Streaming-Lesevorgänge und idempotente Produzenten","pt":"Implementação em Rust do protocolo Durable Streams com axum e tokio, suportando leituras de streaming e produtor idempotente","ru":"Реализация на Rust протокола Durable Streams с axum и tokio, поддерживающая потоковые чтения и идемпотентный продюсер","ar":"تنفيذ بروستل للبروتوكول Durable Streams مع axum و tokio، يدعم قراءات التدفق وإنتاج المُتكرر","en":"  Reference implementation of the Durable Streams protocol in Rust, built with axum and tokio. Supports streaming reads (long-poll, SSE), producer idempotency, JSON batch mode, TTL "},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI智能代理m13-domain-err