IA especializados para Claude Code","Funcionalidades de IA para aplicações web","Integração com tecnologias de frontend","Código limpo e organizado"],"ru":["Шаблон TypeScript для ИИ Агентов Frontend","Специализированные агенты для Claude Code","Функции ИИ для веб-приложений","Интеграция с технологиями frontend","Чистый и организованный код"],"ar":["قالب تا입سكريبت جاهز للإنتاج","موكلات الذكاء الاصطناعي المخصصة ل Claude Code","ميزات الذكاء الاصطناعي لتطبيقات الويب","التكامل مع تقنيات الويب الأمامية","كود نظيف ومنظم"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","前端技术规范","TypeScript样板","Claude Code","AI驱动应用","生产就绪","高性能","可扩展性","如何使用AI智能代理"],"ja":["AIエージェント","フロントエンド技術仕様","TypeScriptボイラープレート","Claude Code","AI駆動アプリケーション","生産準備","高パフォーマンス","スケーラビリティ","AIエージェントの使い方"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","프론트엔드 기술 사양","TypeScript 보일러 플레이트","클라우드 코드","AI 구동 애플리케이션","프로덕션 준비","고성능","확장성","AI 에이전트 사용법"],"es":["cómo usar agentes de IA","qué es un agente de inteligencia artificial","alternativas a Claude Code","Claude Code vs competidores","instalación de agentes de IA","guía de configuración de agentes de IA","desarrollo de agentes de IA con TypeScript"],"fr":["comment utiliser des agents d''IA","quoi est un agent d''intelligence artificielle","alternatives à Claude Code","Claude Code vs concurrents","installation d''agents d''IA","guide de configuration d''agents d''IA","développement d''agents d''IA avec TypeScript"],"de":["wie man KI-Agents verwendet","was ist ein KI-Agent","Alternativen zu Claude Code","Claude Code vs Wettbewerber","Installation von KI-Agents","Konfigurationsanleitung für KI-Agents","Entwicklung von KI-Agents mit TypeScript"],"pt":["como usar agentes de IA","o que é agente de IA frontend","modelo de TypeScript para agentes de IA","agentes de IA para Claude Code","alternativas para agentes de IA","guia de instalação de agentes de IA","configuração de agentes de IA"],"ru":["как использовать ИИ Агенты","что такое ИИ Агент Frontend","шаблон TypeScript для ИИ Агентов","ИИ Агенты для Claude Code","альтернативы для ИИ Агентов","руководство по установке ИИ Агентов","настройка ИИ Агентов"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام موكلات الذكاء الاصطناعي","ما هو موكل الذكاء الاصطناعي الأمامي","قالب تا입سكريبت لموكلات الذكاء الاصطناعي","موكلات الذكاء الاصطناعي ل Claude Code","بديلات لموكلات الذكاء الاصطناعي","دليل تثبيت موكلات الذكاء الاصطناعي","ضبط موكلات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"shinpr","repo":"ai-coding-project-boilerplate","repoPath":"shinpr/ai-coding-project-boilerplate","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.943Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"frontend/technical-spec","description":"Defines frontend environment variables, component design, and data flow patterns. Use when configuring React environment.","bodyPreview":"# Technical Design Rules (Frontend)\n\n## Basic Technology Stack Policy\nTypeScript-based React application implementation. Architecture patterns should be selected according to project requirements and scale.\n\n## Environment Variable Management and Security\n\n### Environment Variable Management\n- **Use build tool''s environment variable system**: `process.env` does not work in browser environments\n- Centrally manage environment variables through configuration layer\n- Implement proper type safety wit","body":"# Technical Design Rules (Frontend)\n\n## Basic Technology Stack Policy\nTypeScript-based React application implementation. Architecture patterns should be selected according to project requirements and scale.\n\n## Environment Variable Management and Security\n\n### Environment Variable Management\n- **Use build tool''s environment variable system**: `process.env` does not work in browser environments\n- Centrally manage environment variables through configuration layer\n- Implement proper type safety with TypeScript\n- Properly implement default value settings and mandatory checks\n\n```typescript\n// Build tool environment variables (public values only)\nconst config = {\n  apiUrl: import.meta.env.API_URL || ''http://localhost:3000'',\n  appName: import.meta.env.APP_NAME || ''My App''\n}\n\n// Does not work in frontend\nconst apiUrl = process.env.API_URL\n```\n\n### Security (Client-side Constraints)\n- **CRITICAL**: All frontend code is public and visible in browser\n- **Never store secrets client-side**: No API keys, tokens, or secrets in environment variables\n- Do not include `.env` files in Git (same as backend)\n- Prohibit logging of sensitive information (passwords, tokens, personal data)\n- Do not include sensitive information in error messages\n\n**Correct Approach for Secrets**:\n```typescript\n// Security risk: API key exposed in browser\nconst apiKey = import.meta.env.API_KEY\nconst response = await fetch(`https://api.example.com/data?key=${apiKey}`)\n\n// Correct: Backend manages secrets, frontend accesses via proxy\nconst response = await fetch(''/api/data'') // Backend handles API key authentication\n```\n\n## Architecture Design\n\n### Frontend Architecture Patterns\n\n**React Component Architecture**:\n- **Function Components**: Mandatory, class components deprecated\n- **Custom Hooks**: For logic reuse and dependency injection\n- **Component Hierarchy**: Atoms -> Molecules -> Organisms -> Templates -> Pages\n- **Props-driven**: Components receive all necessary data via props\n- **Co-location**: Place tests, styles, and related files alongside components\n\n**State Management Patterns**:\n- **Local State**: `useState` for component-specific state\n- **Context API**: For sharing state across component tree (theme, auth, etc.)\n- **Custom Hooks**: Encapsulate state logic and side effects\n- **Server State**: React Query or SWR for API data caching\n\n## Unified Data Flow Principles\n\n### Client-side Data Flow\nMaintain consistent data flow throughout the React application:\n\n- **Single Source of Truth**: Each piece of state has one authoritative source\n  - UI state: Component state or Context\n  - Server data: API responses cached in React Query/SWR\n  - Form data: Controlled components with React Hook Form\n\n- **Unidirectional Flow**: Data flows top-down via props\n  ```\n  API Response -> State -> Props -> Render -> UI\n  User Input -> Event Handler -> State Update -> Re-render\n  ```\n\n- **Immutable Updates**: Use immutable patterns for state updates\n  ```typescript\n  // Immutable state update\n  setUsers(prev => [...prev, newUser])\n\n  // Mutable state update (avoid)\n  users.push(newUser)\n  setUsers(users)\n  ```\n\n### Type Safety in Data Flow\n- **Frontend -> Backend**: Props/State (Type Guaranteed) -> API Request (Serialization)\n- **Backend -> Frontend**: API Response (`unknown`) -> Type Guard -> State (Type Guaranteed)\n\n```typescript\n// Type-safe data flow\nasync function fetchUser(id: string): Promise<User> {\n  const response = await fetch(`/api/users/${id}`)\n  const data: unknown = await response.json()\n\n  if (!isUser(data)) {\n    throw new Error(''Invalid user data'')\n  }\n\n  return data // Type guaranteed as User\n}\n```\n\n## Build and Testing\nUse the appropriate run command based on the `packageManager` field in package.json.\n\n### Build Commands\n- `dev` - Development server\n- `build` - Production build\n- `preview` - Preview production build\n- `type-check` - Type check (no emit)\n\n### Testing Commands\n- `test` - Run tests\n- `test:coverage` - Run tests with coverage\n- `test:coverage:fresh` - Run tests with coverage (fresh cache)\n- `test:safe` - Safe test execution (with auto cleanup)\n- `cleanup:processes` - Cleanup Vitest processes\n\n### Quality Check Requirements\nQuality checks are mandatory upon implementation completion:\n\n**Phase 1-3: Basic Checks**\n- `check` - Biome (lint + format)\n- `build` - TypeScript build\n\n**Phase 4-5: Tests and Final Confirmation**\n- `test` - Test execution\n- `test:coverage:fresh` - Coverage measurement\n- `check:all` - Overall integrated check\n\n### Coverage Requirements\n- **Mandatory**: Unit test coverage must be 60% or higher\n- **Component-specific targets**:\n  - Atoms: 70% or higher\n  - Molecules: 65% or higher\n  - Organisms: 60% or higher\n  - Custom Hooks: 65% or higher\n  - Utils: 70% or higher\n\n### Non-functional Requirements\n- **Browser Compatibility**: Chrome/Firefox/Safari/Edge (latest 2 versions)\n- **Rendering Time**: Within 5 seconds for major pages\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:40:16.205Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for TypeScript-based AI Agents requiring scalable frontend architecture and secure environment variable management.","zh":"适合需要可扩展的前端架构和安全环境变量管理的TypeScript-based AI Agents。","ja":"TypeScriptベースのAIエージェントがスケーラブルなフロントエンドアーキテクチャとセキュアな環境変数管理を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"확장 가능한 프론트엔드 아키텍처와 보안 환경 변수 관리가 필요한 TypeScript 기반 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de inteligencia artificial basados en TypeScript que requieren una arquitectura de frontend escalable y una gestión segura de variables de entorno.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''intelligence artificielle basés sur TypeScript nécessitant une architecture frontend scalable et une gestion sécurisée des variables d''environnement.","de":"Ideal für TypeScript-basierte KI-Agents, die eine skalierbare Frontend-Architektur und eine sichere Umgebungsvariablenverwaltung erfordern.","pt":"Ideal for TypeScript-based AI Agents requiring scalable frontend architecture and secure environment variable management.","ru":"Ideal for TypeScript-based AI Agents requiring scalable frontend architecture and secure environment variable management.","ar":"Ideal for TypeScript-based AI Agents requiring scalable frontend architecture and secure environment variable management."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement production-ready React applications with proper type safety, utilizing build tool''s environment variable system and centrally managed configuration layers, while ensuring security and scalability through specialized AI agents like Claude Code.","zh":"赋予代理实现生产就绪的React应用程序，具有适当的类型安全，利用构建工具的环境变量系统和集中管理的配置层，同时通过Claude Code等专业的AI代理确保安全性和可扩展性。","ja":"ビルドツールの環境変数システムと集中管理された構成層を使用して、適切なタイプセーフティを持つプロダクションレディのReactアプリケーションを実装できるようにエージェントに権限を与え、Claude Codeなどの専門のAIエージェントを介してセキュリティとスケーラビリティを確保する。","ko":"빌드 도구의 환경 변수 시스템과集中 관리되는 구성 계층을 사용하여 적절한 유형 안전성을 갖춘 프로덕션 준비가 완료된 React 애플리케이션을 구현할 수 있도록 에이전트에 권한을 부여하고, 클라우드 코드와 같은 전문 AI 에이전트를 통해 보안과 확장성을 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar aplicaciones React listas para producción con seguridad de tipo adecuada, utilizando el sistema de variables de entorno de la herramienta de compilación y capas de configuración administradas centralmente, garantizando la seguridad y la escalabilidad a través de agentes de inteligencia artificial especializados como Claude Code.","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre des applications React prêtes pour la production avec une sécurité de type appropriée, en utilisant le système de variables d''environnement de l''outil de construction et des couches de configuration gérées de manière centralisée, tout en garantissant la sécurité et la scalabilité grâce à des agents d''intelligence artificielle spécialisés comme Claude Code.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Produktions-React-Anwendungen mit ordnungsgemäßer Typsicherheit zu implementieren, indem sie das Umgebungsvariablen-System des Build-Tools und zentral verwaltete Konfigurationsebenen nutzen, während sie durch spezielle KI-Agents wie Claude Code Sicherheit und Skalierbarkeit gewährleisten.","pt":"Empowers agents to implement production-ready React applications with proper type safety, utilizing build tool''s environment variable system and centrally managed configuration layers, while ensuring security and scalability through specialized AI agents like Claude Code.","ru":"Empowers agents to implement production-ready React applications with proper type safety, utilizing build tool''s environment variable system and centrally managed configuration layers, while ensuring security and scalability through specialized AI agents like Claude Code.","ar":"Empowers agents to implement production-ready React applications with proper type safety, utilizing build tool''s environment variable system and centrally managed configuration layers, while ensuring security and scalability through specialized AI agents like Claude Code."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing secure environment variable management for browser environments","Building scalable TypeScript-based React applications","Ensuring proper type safety for frontend architecture"],"zh":["为浏览器环境实现安全的环境变量管理","构建可扩展的TypeScript-based React应用程序","确保前端架构的适当类型安全"],"ja":["ブラウザ環境のためのセキュアな環境変数管理の実装","スケーラブルなTypeScriptベースのReactアプリケーションの構築","フロントエンドアーキテクチャの適切なタイプセーフティの確保"],"ko":["브라우저 환경을 위한 보안 환경 변수 관리 구현","확장 가능한 TypeScript 기반 React 애플리케이션 구축","프론트엔드 아키텍처에 대한 적절한 유형 안전성 보장"],"es":["Implementar una gestión segura de variables de entorno para entornos de navegador","Crear aplicaciones React basadas en TypeScript escalables","Garantizar una seguridad de tipo adecuada para la arquitectura frontend"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre une gestion sécurisée des variables d''environnement pour les environnements de navigateur","Construire des applications React basées sur TypeScript escalables","Assurer une sécurité de type appropriée pour l''architecture frontend"],"de":["Eine sichere Umgebungsvariablenverwaltung für Browserumgebungen implementieren","Skalierbare TypeScript-basierte React-Anwendungen erstellen","Eine ordnungsgemäße Typsicherheit für die Frontend-Architektur sicherstellen"],"pt":["Implementing secure environment variable management for browser environments","Building scalable TypeScript-based React applications","Ensuring proper type safety for frontend architecture"],"ru":["Implementing secure environment variable management for browser environments","Building scalable TypeScript-based React applications","Ensuring proper type safety for frontend architecture"],"ar":["Implementing secure environment variable management for browser environments","Building scalable TypeScript-based React applications","Ensuring proper type safety for frontend architecture"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires TypeScript and React setup","Centrally managed environment variables through configuration layer","Limited to browser environments due to process.env constraints"],"zh":["需要TypeScript和React设置","集中管理环境变量通过配置层","由于process.env约束，仅限于浏览器环境"],"ja":["TypeScriptとReactの設定が必要","集中管理された環境変数を介した構成層","process.envの制約により、ブラウザ環境に限定"],"ko":["TypeScript 및 React 설정이 필요","중앙 관리 환경 변수를 통해 구성 계층","process.env 제약으로 인해 브라우저 환경에 제한"],"es":["Requiere configuración de TypeScript y React","Variables de entorno administradas centralmente a través de capas de configuración","Limitado a entornos de navegador debido a las limitaciones de process.env"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de TypeScript et React","Variables d''environnement gérées de manière centralisée via des couches de configuration","Limité aux environnements de navigateur en raison des contraintes de process.env"],"de":["Benötigt eine TypeScript- und React-Konfiguration","Zentral verwaltete Umgebungsvariablen über Konfigurationsebenen","Eingeschränkt auf Browserumgebungen aufgrund der Einschränkungen von process.env"],"pt":["Requires TypeScript and React setup","Centrally managed environment variables through configuration layer","Limited to browser environments due to process.env constraints"],"ru":["Requires TypeScript and React setup","Centrally managed environment variables through configuration layer","Limited to browser environments due to process.env constraints"],"ar":["Requires TypeScript and React setup","Centrally managed environment variables through configuration layer","Limited to browser environments due to process.env constraints"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"937e2cfdee77b770521c82244527ea42f982b06ccc15cd701b1bf52fbe8c4ed4","qualityScore":42}');
