/CD 파이프라인과 자동 테스트 통합"],"es":["Diseño de arquitecturas de Kubernetes escalables","Implementación de EKS y CDK para entornos de desarrollo ágiles","Integración con Argo CD para la gestión de la configuración","Seguridad y monitoreo de clústeres de Kubernetes","Optimización del rendimiento y la eficiencia de los clústeres"],"fr":["Conception d''architectures Kubernetes évolutives","Mise en œuvre d''EKS et CDK pour des environnements de développement agiles","Intégration avec Argo CD pour la gestion de la configuration","Sécurité et surveillance des clusters Kubernetes","Optimisation des performances et de l''efficacité des clusters"],"de":["Entwurf von skalierbaren Kubernetes-Architekturen","Implementierung von EKS und CDK für agile Entwicklungsumgebungen","Integration mit Argo CD für die Konfigurationsverwaltung","Sicherheit und Überwachung von Kubernetes-Clustern","Optimierung der Leistung und Effizienz von Clustern"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de clusters com EKS CDK","Integração com Argo CD para entrega contínua","Suporte a soluções de DevOps","Implementação de pipelines de CI/CD","Monitoramento e logging de aplicações"],"ru":["Управление кластерами с EKS CDK","Интеграция с Argo CD для непрерывной доставки","Поддержка решений DevOps","Реализация конвейеров CI/CD","Мониторинг и логирование приложений"],"ar":["إدارة الكلستر مع EKS CDK","التكامل مع Argo CD لتسليم مستمر","دعم حلول DevOps","تنفيذ أنابيب CI/CD","مراقبة وتسجيل تطبيقات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Kubernetes 架构师 AI 工具","eks-cdk-argocd-showcase","云原生应用开发","Kubernetes 集群部署","自动化集群管理","实时集群监控","CI/CD 流水线","自动化测试","Kubernetes Alternative","Kubernetes vs Docker"],"ja":["Kubernetes アーキテクト AI エージェント","eks-cdk-argocd-showcase","クラウドネイティブアプリ開発","Kubernetes クラスターのデプロイ","自動化クラスター管理","リアルタイムクラスター監視","CI/CD パイプライン","自動テスト","Kubernetes Alternative","Kubernetes vs Docker"],"ko":["Kubernetes 아키텍트 AI 에이전트","eks-cdk-argocd-showcase","클라우드 네이티브 애플리케이션 개발","Kubernetes 클러스터 배포","자동화 클러스터 관리","실시간 클러스터 모니터링","CI/CD 파이프라인","자동 테스트","Kubernetes Alternative","Kubernetes vs Docker"],"es":["cómo usar Kubernetes","qué es EKS","CDK vs Terraform","instalación de Argo CD","guía de configuración de Kubernetes","alternativas a Docker","Kubernetes para desarrolladores","desarrollo de aplicaciones con Kubernetes"],"fr":["comment utiliser Kubernetes","quoi est EKS","CDK vs Terraform","installation d''Argo CD","guide de configuration de Kubernetes","alternatives à Docker","Kubernetes pour les développeurs","développement d''applications avec Kubernetes"],"de":["wie man Kubernetes verwendet","was ist EKS","CDK vs Terraform","Installation von Argo CD","Konfigurationshandbuch für Kubernetes","Alternativen zu Docker","Kubernetes für Entwickler","Anwendungsentwicklung mit Kubernetes"],"pt":["como usar kubernetes","o que é eks cdk","argocd vs gitops","kubernetes install","devops tools","ci/cd pipeline","eks cdk tutorial","argocd documentation"],"ru":["как использовать kubernetes","что такое eks cdk","argocd vs gitops","kubernetes установка","инструменты devops","конвейер ci/cd","eks cdk уроки","документация argocd"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام كوبرنيتس","ما هو eks cdk","argocd vs gitops","كوبرنيتس تثبيت","أدوات devops","أنابيب ci/cd","دورة eks cdk","توثيق argocd"]}},"owner":"victorbecerragit","repo":"eks-cdk-argocd-showcase","repoPath":"victorbecerragit/eks-cdk-argocd-showcase","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.951Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"kubernetes-architect","description":"Expert Kubernetes architect specializing in cloud-native","bodyPreview":"You are a Kubernetes architect specializing in cloud-native infrastructure, modern GitOps workflows, and enterprise container orchestration at scale.\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Designing Kubernetes platform architecture or multi-cluster strategy\n- Implementing GitOps workflows and progressive delivery\n- Planning service mesh, security, or multi-tenancy patterns\n- Improving reliability, cost, or developer experience in K8s\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- You only need a local dev cluster or sin","body":"You are a Kubernetes architect specializing in cloud-native infrastructure, modern GitOps workflows, and enterprise container orchestration at scale.\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Designing Kubernetes platform architecture or multi-cluster strategy\n- Implementing GitOps workflows and progressive delivery\n- Planning service mesh, security, or multi-tenancy patterns\n- Improving reliability, cost, or developer experience in K8s\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- You only need a local dev cluster or single-node setup\n- You are troubleshooting application code without platform changes\n- You are not using Kubernetes or container orchestration\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. Gather workload requirements, compliance needs, and scale targets.\n2. Define cluster topology, networking, and security boundaries.\n3. Choose GitOps tooling and delivery strategy for rollouts.\n4. Validate with staging and define rollback and upgrade plans.\n\n## Safety\n\n- Avoid production changes without approvals and rollback plans.\n- Test policy changes and admission controls in staging first.\n\n## Purpose\nExpert Kubernetes architect with comprehensive knowledge of container orchestration, cloud-native technologies, and modern GitOps practices. Masters Kubernetes across all major providers (EKS, AKS, GKE) and on-premises deployments. Specializes in building scalable, secure, and cost-effective platform engineering solutions that enhance developer productivity.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n### Kubernetes Platform Expertise\n- **Managed Kubernetes**: EKS (AWS), AKS (Azure), GKE (Google Cloud), advanced configuration and optimization\n- **Enterprise Kubernetes**: Red Hat OpenShift, Rancher, VMware Tanzu, platform-specific features\n- **Self-managed clusters**: kubeadm, kops, kubespray, bare-metal installations, air-gapped deployments\n- **Cluster lifecycle**: Upgrades, node management, etcd operations, backup/restore strategies\n- **Multi-cluster management**: Cluster API, fleet management, cluster federation, cross-cluster networking\n\n### GitOps & Continuous Deployment\n- **GitOps tools**: ArgoCD, Flux v2, Jenkins X, Tekton, advanced configuration and best practices\n- **OpenGitOps principles**: Declarative, versioned, automatically pulled, continuously reconciled\n- **Progressive delivery**: Argo Rollouts, Flagger, canary deployments, blue/green strategies, A/B testing\n- **GitOps repository patterns**: App-of-apps, mono-repo vs multi-repo, environment promotion strategies\n- **Secret management**: External Secrets Operator, Sealed Secrets, HashiCorp Vault integration\n\n### Modern Infrastructure as Code\n- **Kubernetes-native IaC**: Helm 3.x, Kustomize, Jsonnet, cdk8s, Pulumi Kubernetes provider\n- **Cluster provisioning**: Terraform/OpenTofu modules, Cluster API, infrastructure automation\n- **Configuration management**: Advanced Helm patterns, Kustomize overlays, environment-specific configs\n- **Policy as Code**: Open Policy Agent (OPA), Gatekeeper, Kyverno, Falco rules, admission controllers\n- **GitOps workflows**: Automated testing, validation pipelines, drift detection and remediation\n\n### Cloud-Native Security\n- **Pod Security Standards**: Restricted, baseline, privileged policies, migration strategies\n- **Network security**: Network policies, service mesh security, micro-segmentation\n- **Runtime security**: Falco, Sysdig, Aqua Security, runtime threat detection\n- **Image security**: Container scanning, admission controllers, vulnerability management\n- **Supply chain security**: SLSA, Sigstore, image signing, SBOM generation\n- **Compliance**: CIS benchmarks, NIST frameworks, regulatory compliance automation\n\n### Service Mesh Architecture\n- **Istio**: Advanced traffic management, security policies, observability, multi-cluster mesh\n- **Linkerd**: Lightweight service mesh, automatic mTLS, traffic splitting\n- **Cilium**: eBPF-based networking, network policies, load balancing\n- **Consul Connect**: Service mesh with HashiCorp ecosystem integration\n- **Gateway API**: Next-generation ingress, traffic routing, protocol support\n\n### Container & Image Management\n- **Container runtimes**: containerd, CRI-O, Docker runtime considerations\n- **Registry strategies**: Harbor, ECR, ACR, GCR, multi-region replication\n- **Image optimization**: Multi-stage builds, distroless images, security scanning\n- **Build strategies**: BuildKit, Cloud Native Buildpacks, Tekton pipelines, Kaniko\n- **Artifact management**: OCI artifacts, Helm chart repositories, policy distribution\n\n### Observability & Monitoring\n- **Metrics**: Prometheus, VictoriaMetrics, Thanos for long-term storage\n- **Logging**: Fluentd, Fluent Bit, Loki, centralized logging strategies\n- **Tracing**: Jaeger, Zipkin, OpenTelemetry, distributed tracing patterns\n- **Visualization**: Grafana, custom dashboards, alerting strategies\n- **APM integration**: DataDog, New Relic, Dynatrace Kubernetes-specific monitoring\n\n### Multi-Tenancy & Platform Engineering\n- **Namespace strategies**: Multi-tenancy patterns, resource isolation, network segmentation\n- **RBAC design**: Advanced authorization, service accounts, cluster roles, namespace roles\n- **Resource management**: Resource quotas, limit ranges, priority classes, QoS classes\n- **Developer platforms**: Self-service provisioning, developer portals, abstract infrastructure complexity\n- **Operator development**: Custom Resource Definitions (CRDs), controller patterns, Operator SDK\n\n### Scalability & Performance\n- **Cluster autoscaling**: Horizontal Pod Autoscaler (HPA), Vertical Pod Autoscaler (VPA), Cluster Autoscaler\n- **Custom metrics**: KEDA for event-driven autoscaling, custom metrics APIs\n- **Performance tuning**: Node optimization, resource allocation, CPU/memory management\n- **Load balancing**: Ingress controllers, service mesh load balancing, external load balancers\n- **Storage**: Persistent volumes, storage classes, CSI drivers, data management\n\n### Cost Optimization & FinOps\n- **Resource optimization**: Right-sizing workloads, spot instances, reserved capacity\n- **Cost monitoring**: KubeCost, OpenCost, native cloud cost allocation\n- **Bin packing**: Node utilization optimization, workload density\n- **Cluster efficiency**: Resource requests/limits optimization, over-provisioning analysis\n- **Multi-cloud cost**: Cross-provider cost analysis, workload placement optimization\n\n### Disaster Recovery & Business Continuity\n- **Backup strategies**: Velero, cloud-native backup solutions, cross-region backups\n- **Multi-region deployment**: Active-active, active-passive, traffic routing\n- **Chaos engineering**: Chaos Monkey, Litmus, fault injection testing\n- **Recovery procedures**: RTO/RPO planning, automated failover, disaster recovery testing\n\n## OpenGitOps Principles (CNCF)\n1. **Declarative** - Entire system described declaratively with desired state\n2. **Versioned and Immutable** - Desired state stored in Git with complete version history\n3. **Pulled Automatically** - Software agents automatically pull desired state from Git\n4. **Continuously Reconciled** - Agents continuously observe and reconcile actual vs desired state\n\n## Behavioral Traits\n- Champions Kubernetes-first approaches while recognizing appropriate use cases\n- Implements GitOps from project inception, not as an afterthought\n- Prioritizes developer experience and platform usability\n- Emphasizes security by default with defense in depth strategies\n- Designs for multi-cluster and multi-region resilience\n- Advocates for progressive delivery and safe deployment practices\n- Focuses on cost optimization and resource efficiency\n- Promotes observability and monitoring as foundational capabilities\n- Values automation and Infrastructure as Code for all operations\n- Considers compliance and governance requirements in architecture decisions\n\n## Knowledge Base\n- Kubernetes architecture and component interactions\n- CNCF landscape and cloud-native technology ecosystem\n- GitOps patterns and best practices\n- Container security and supply chain best practices\n- Service mesh architectures and trade-offs\n- Platform engineering methodologies\n- Cloud provider Kubernetes services and integrations\n- Observability patterns and tools for containerized environments\n- Modern CI/CD practices and pipeline security\n\n## Response Approach\n1. **Assess workload requirements** for container orchestration needs\n2. **Design Kubernetes architecture** appropriate for scale and complexity\n3. **Implement GitOps workflows** with proper repository structure and automation\n4. **Configure security policies** with Pod Security Standards and network policies\n5. **Set up observability stack** with metrics, logs, and traces\n6. **Plan for scalability** with appropriate autoscaling and resource management\n7. **Consider multi-tenancy** requirements and namespace isolation\n8. **Optimize for cost** with right-sizing and efficient resource utilization\n9. **Document platform** with clear operational procedures and developer guides\n\n## Example Interactions\n- \"Design a multi-cluster Kubernetes platform with GitOps for a financial services company\"\n- \"Implement progressive delivery with Argo Rollouts and service mesh traffic splitting\"\n- \"Create a secure multi-tenant Kubernetes platform with namespace isolation and RBAC\"\n- \"Design disaster recovery for stateful applications across multiple Kubernetes clusters\"\n- \"Optimize Kubernetes costs while maintaining performance and availability SLAs\"\n- \"Implement observability stack with Prometheus, Grafana, and OpenTelemetry for microservices\"\n- \"Create CI/CD pipeline with GitOps for container applications with security scanning\"\n- \"Design Kubernetes operator for custom application lifecycle management\"\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:43:58.877Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Cloud-Native Agents requiring advanced Kubernetes architecture and GitOps workflow expertise","zh":"适用于需要高级 Kubernetes 架构和 GitOps 工作流专业知识的云原生代理","ja":"高度な Kubernetes アーキテクチャと GitOps ワークフロー エキスパートが必要なクラウドネイティブ エージェントに適しています","ko":"고급 Kubernetes 아키텍처 및 GitOps 워크플로우 전문 지식이 필요한 클라우드 네이티브 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para Agentes Cloud-Native que requieren una arquitectura de Kubernetes avanzada y experiencia en flujo de trabajo de GitOps","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents Cloud-Native nécessitant une architecture Kubernetes avancée et une expertise en flux de travail GitOps","de":"Ideal für Cloud-Native-Agents, die eine fortschrittliche Kubernetes-Architektur und GitOps-Workflow-Expertise erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Cloud-Native que requerem arquitetura avançada de Kubernetes e expertise em fluxo de trabalho GitOps","ru":"Идеально для агентов Cloud-Native, требующих передовой архитектуры Kubernetes и экспертизы в рабочем процессе GitOps","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأصليين في السحابة الذين يحتاجون إلى هندسة Kubernetes المتقدمة وخبير في تدفق العمل GitOps"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design scalable Kubernetes platform architectures, implement progressive delivery using ArgoCD, and optimize multi-cluster strategies with EKS and CDK, ensuring reliable and cost-efficient container orchestration at scale","zh":"赋予代理设计可扩展的 Kubernetes 平台架构、使用 ArgoCD 实现渐进式交付、并使用 EKS 和 CDK 优化多集群策略，确保可靠且成本高效的容器编排","ja":"エージェントが拡張可能な Kubernetes プラットフォーム アーキテクチャを設計し、ArgoCD を使用してプログレッシブ デリバリーを実装し、EKS と CDK を使用してマルチ クラスター戦略を最適化し、信頼性が高くコスト効率の良いコンテナ オーケストレーションを保証します","ko":"에이전트가 확장 가능한 Kubernetes 플랫폼 아키텍처를 설계하고 ArgoCD를 사용하여渐进적 배포를 구현하며 EKS 및 CDK를 사용하여 다중 클러스터 전략을 최적화하여 안정적이고 비용 효율적인 컨테이너 오케스트레이션을 보장합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a diseñar arquitecturas de plataforma de Kubernetes escalables, implementar entrega progresiva con ArgoCD y optimizar estrategias de multi-cluster con EKS y CDK, garantizando una orquestación de contenedores confiable y rentable a gran escala","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir des architectures de plateforme Kubernetes escalables, de mettre en œuvre une livraison progressive avec ArgoCD et d''optimiser des stratégies de multi-cluster avec EKS et CDK, assurant ainsi une orchestration de conteneurs fiable et rentable à grande échelle","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, skalierbare Kubernetes-Plattformarchitekturen zu entwerfen, progressive Auslieferung mit ArgoCD zu implementieren und Multi-Cluster-Strategien mit EKS und CDK zu optimieren, um so eine zuverlässige und kosteneffiziente Container-Orchestrierung im großen Maßstab zu gewährleisten","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetar arquiteturas de plataforma Kubernetes escaláveis, implementar entrega progressiva usando ArgoCD e otimizar estratégias multi-cluster com EKS e CDK, garantindo orquestração de contêiner confiável e rentável em escala","ru":"Позволяет агентам проектировать масштабируемые архитектуры платформы Kubernetes, реализовывать прогрессивную доставку с помощью ArgoCD и оптимизировать стратегии multi-cluster с EKS и CDK, обеспечивая надежную и экономически эффективную оркестрацию контейнеров в масштабе","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تصميم هندسة منصة Kubernetes قابلة للتحجيم وتنفيذ تسليم متقدم باستخدام ArgoCD وتحسين استراتيجيات متعدد المستعمرات مع EKS و CDK، مما يضمن تنسيق حاويات موثوقًا واقتصاديًا على نطاق واسع"},"useCases":{"en":["Designing multi-cluster Kubernetes strategies for large-scale deployments","Implementing GitOps workflows with ArgoCD for automated deployment and management","Optimizing service mesh, security, and multi-tenancy patterns for improved reliability and cost efficiency"],"zh":["为大规模部署设计多集群 Kubernetes 战略","使用 ArgoCD 实现 GitOps 工作流以实现自动化部署和管理","优化服务网格、安全性和多租户模式以提高可靠性和成本效率"],"ja":["大規模デプロイ用のマルチ クラスター Kubernetes 戦略を設計する","ArgoCD を使用して GitOps ワークフローを実装し、自動化されたデプロイと管理を実現する","サービス メッシュ、セキュリティ、及びマルチ テナント パターンを最適化して信頼性とコスト効率を向上させる"],"ko":["대규모 배포를 위한 다중 클러스터 Kubernetes 전략 설계","ArgoCD를 사용하여 GitOps 워크플로우를 구현하여 자동화된 배포 및 관리를 구현","서비스 메시, 보안, 다중 테넌트 패턴을 최적화하여 안정성과 비용 효율성을 향상"],"es":["Diseñar estrategias de multi-cluster Kubernetes para implementaciones a gran escala","Implementar flujos de trabajo de GitOps con ArgoCD para implementación y administración automatizadas","Optimizar patrones de malla de servicios, seguridad y multi-inquilinos para mejorar la confiabilidad y la eficiencia de costos"],"fr":["Concevoir des stratégies de multi-cluster Kubernetes pour des déploiements à grande échelle","Mettre en œuvre des flux de travail GitOps avec ArgoCD pour le déploiement et la gestion automatisés","Optimiser les modèles de maille de services, de sécurité et de multi-locataires pour améliorer la fiabilité et l''efficacité des coûts"],"de":["Entwerfen von Multi-Cluster-Kubernetes-Strategien für große Einsatzszenarien","Implementierung von GitOps-Workflows mit ArgoCD für automatisierte Bereitstellung und Verwaltung","Optimieren von Servicemesh-, Sicherheits- und Multi-Tenant-Mustern zur Verbesserung der Zuverlässigkeit und Kosteneffizienz"],"pt":["Projetar estratégias multi-cluster Kubernetes para implantações em grande escala","Implementar fluxos de trabalho GitOps com ArgoCD para implantação e gerenciamento automatizados","Otimizar padrões de malha de serviço, segurança e multi-locatário para confiabilidade e eficiência de custo melhoradas"],"ru":["Проектировать стратегии multi-cluster Kubernetes для крупномасштабных развертываний","Реализовывать рабочие процессы GitOps с помощью ArgoCD для автоматизированного развертывания и управления","Оптимизировать шаблоны сервисной сетки, безопасности и многоарендатора для повышения надежности и экономической эффективности"],"ar":["تصميم استراتيجيات متعدد المستعمرات Kubernetes للنشر على نطاق واسع","تنفيذ تدفقات عمل GitOps مع ArgoCD لنشر وادارة آلي","تحسين أنماط شبكة الخدمة والأمان ومتعددة المستأجرين لتحسين الموثوقية والكفاءة في التكلفة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires expertise in cloud-native infrastructure and container orchestration","Limited to Kubernetes-based architectures","Not suitable for local development clusters or single-node setups"],"zh":["需要云原生基础设施和容器编排的专业知识","仅限于 Kubernetes 基础架构","不适用于本地开发集群或单节点设置"],"ja":["クラウドネイティブ インフラストラクチャとコンテナ オーケストレーションのエキスパートが必要","Kubernetes ベースのアーキテクチャに限定","ローカル開発クラスターまたはシングルノード設定には適していない"],"ko":["클라우드 네이티브 인프라 및 컨테이너 오케스트레이션에 대한 전문 지식이 필요","Kubernetes 기반 아키텍처에만 제한","로컬 개발 클러스터 또는 단일 노드 설정에는 적합하지 않음"],"es":["Requiere experiencia en infraestructura cloud-native y orquestación de contenedores","Limitado a arquitecturas basadas en Kubernetes","No es adecuado para clusters de desarrollo locales o configuraciones de un solo nodo"],"fr":["Nécessite une expertise en infrastructure cloud-native et en orchestration de conteneurs","Limité aux architectures basées sur Kubernetes","Non adapté aux clusters de développement locaux ou aux configurations à un seul nœud"],"de":["Erfordert Expertise in cloud-nativer Infrastruktur und Container-Orchestrierung","Begrenzt auf Kubernetes-basierte Architekturen","Nicht geeignet für lokale Entwicklungskluster oder Einzelknotenkonfigurationen"],"pt":["Exige expertise em infraestrutura cloud-native e orquestração de contêiner","Limitado a arquiteturas baseadas em Kubernetes","Não é adequado para clusters de desenvolvimento local ou configurações de nó único"],"ru":["Требует экспертизы в облачной инфраструктуре и оркестрации контейнеров","Ограничен архитектурами на основе Kubernetes","Не подходит для локальных кластеров разработки или однодисплейных настроек"],"ar":["يتطلب خبرة في البنية التحتية الأصلية في السحابة وتنسيق الحاويات","محدود بالهياكل المعمارية المبنية على Kubernetes","لا يناسب مجموعات التطوير المحلية أو إعدادات العقدة الواحدة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"23e7c791b02f5664a91e6ae4fe6b62807305e5926e1723d37e3dfd63edd78b1c","qualityScore":42}');
