,"ja":"Morpho Vault V2 アダプターは、人気の DeFi プロトコルを統合するためのソリューションを提供し、開発者の効率を向上させます","ko":"Morpho Vault V2 어댑터는 인기 있는 DeFi 프로토콜을 통합하기 위한 솔루션을 제공하여 개발자 효율성을 향상시킵니다","es":"scaffold-contract es un adaptador para protocolos DeFi populares, diseñado para Morpho vault v2","fr":"scaffold-contract est un adaptateur pour les protocoles DeFi populaires, conçu pour Morpho vault v2","de":"scaffold-contract ist ein Adapter für beliebte DeFi-Protokolle, entwickelt für Morpho vault v2","pt":"O scaffold-contract oferece adapters para protocolos DeFi populares, melhorando a experiência de desenvolvedores","ru":"Scaffold-contract предоставляет адаптеры для популярных протоколов DeFi, улучшая опыт разработчиков","ar":"يوفّر scaffold-contract محولات لبروتوكولات DeFi الشائعة، مما يحسن تجربة المطورين","en":"Morpho vault v2 adapters for popular DeFi protocols"},"definition":{"en":"Morpho vault v2 adapters for popular DeFi protocols"},"features":{"zh":["支持流行 DeFi 协议","提供简单的集成解决方案","提升开发效率","增强安全性","支持多种编程语言"],"ja":["人気の DeFi プロトコルをサポート","シンプルな統合ソリューションを提供","開発効率を向上させる","セキュリティを強化","複数のプログラミング言語をサポート"],"ko":["인기 있는 DeFi 프로토콜을 지원","단순한 통합 솔루션을 제공","개발자 효율성을 향상","보안을 강화","다중 프로그래밍 언어를 지원"],"es":["Integración con protocolos DeFi populares","Diseñado para Morpho vault v2","Simplifica la implementación de contratos inteligentes","Soporte para múltiples plataformas de DeFi","Flexibilidad y personalización"],"fr":["Intégration avec les protocoles DeFi populaires","Conçu pour Morpho vault v2","Simplifie la mise en œuvre de contrats intelligents","Prise en charge de plusieurs plateformes DeFi","Flexibilité et personnalisation"],"de":["Integration mit beliebten DeFi-Protokollen","Entwickelt für Morpho vault v2","Vereinfacht die Implementierung von Smart Contracts","Unterstützung für mehrere DeFi-Plattformen","Flexibilität und Anpassungsfähigkeit"],"pt":["Adapters para protocolos DeFi populares","Melhoria da experiência de desenvolvedores","Integração com Morpho vault v2","Suporte a múltiplos protocolos","Código-fonte aberto"],"ru":["Адаптеры для популярных протоколов DeFi","Улучшение опыта разработчиков","Интеграция с Morpho vault v2","Поддержка нескольких протоколов","Открытый исходный код"],"ar":["محولات لبروتوكولات DeFi الشائعة","تحسين تجربة المطورين","التكامل مع Morpho vault v2","دعم بروتوكولات متعددة","كود مفتوح المصدر"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Morpho Vault V2","DeFi 协议","AI 工具","如何使用 Morpho Vault V2","Morpho Vault V2 代替品","Morpho Vault V2 安装","DeFi 开发","区块链开发"],"ja":["Morpho Vault V2","DeFi プロトコル","AI エージェント","Morpho Vault V2 の使用方法","Morpho Vault V2 の代替","Morpho Vault V2 のインストール","DeFi 開発","ブロックチェーン開発"],"ko":["Morpho Vault V2","DeFi 프로토콜","AI 에이전트","Morpho Vault V2 사용 방법","Morpho Vault V2 대안","Morpho Vault V2 설치","DeFi 개발","블록체인 개발"],"es":["cómo usar scaffold-contract","qué es DeFi","scaffold-contract alternativa","scaffold-contract vs otros","instalación de scaffold-contract","guía de configuración de scaffold-contract","desarrollo de contratos inteligentes","integración de protocolos DeFi"],"fr":["comment utiliser scaffold-contract","quoi est DeFi","scaffold-contract alternative","scaffold-contract vs autres","installation de scaffold-contract","guide de configuration de scaffold-contract","développement de contrats intelligents","intégration de protocoles DeFi"],"de":["wie man scaffold-contract verwendet","was ist DeFi","scaffold-contract Alternative","scaffold-contract vs andere","Installation von scaffold-contract","Einrichtungsanleitung für scaffold-contract","Entwicklung von Smart Contracts","Integration von DeFi-Protokollen"],"pt":["como usar scaffold-contract","o que é scaffold-contract","scaffold-contract alternativa","scaffold-contract vs outros","instalar scaffold-contract","guia de configuração do scaffold-contract"],"ru":["как использовать scaffold-contract","что такое scaffold-contract","альтернатива scaffold-contract","scaffold-contract vs другие","установить scaffold-contract","руководство по настройке scaffold-contract"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام scaffold-contract","ما هو scaffold-contract","بديل scaffold-contract","scaffold-contract مقابل غيره","تثبيت scaffold-contract","دليل إعداد scaffold-contract"]}},"owner":"mgnfy-view","repo":"morpho-vault-v2-adapters","repoPath":"mgnfy-view/morpho-vault-v2-adapters","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.995Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"scaffold-contract","description":"Scaffold new Solidity contract or module skeletons with NatSpec and audit-friendly structure without implementing behavior. Use when starting new modules, adapters, or contracts.","bodyPreview":"# Skill: scaffold-contract\n\n## Purpose\n\nCreate a new Solidity module skeleton with a standard, audit-friendly\nstructure and NatSpec documentation, suitable for DeFi protocol development.\n\nThis skill focuses only on structure and interfaces, not behavior or tests.\n\n## When to Invoke\n\n- Starting a new contract or module\n- Adding a new vault, strategy, adapter, or manager\n- Establishing a consistent layout before implementation begins\n- Preparing a contract surface before `spec-to-implementation`","body":"# Skill: scaffold-contract\n\n## Purpose\n\nCreate a new Solidity module skeleton with a standard, audit-friendly\nstructure and NatSpec documentation, suitable for DeFi protocol development.\n\nThis skill focuses only on structure and interfaces, not behavior or tests.\n\n## When to Invoke\n\n- Starting a new contract or module\n- Adding a new vault, strategy, adapter, or manager\n- Establishing a consistent layout before implementation begins\n- Preparing a contract surface before `spec-to-implementation`\n\n## Inputs Required\n\n- Contract name\n- Module type (e.g. vault, strategy, adapter, library)\n- Upgradeability model (immutable or upgradeable)\n- Solidity version (if different from repo default)\n- Required inheritance (base contracts, mixins)\n- Required interfaces to implement\n\n## Actions\n\n### 1) Generate a Solidity contract skeleton\n\nThe generated contract must include:\n\n- SPDX identifier\n- Solidity pragma\n- Imports following `.codex/constraints/solidity-style.md`\n- Contract declaration\n- Explicit sections for:\n  - constants\n  - immutables\n  - state variables\n  - errors\n  - events\n  - constructor or initializer\n  - external/public function declarations\n  - internal helper functions\n\nAll public and external functions must include NatSpec comments describing:\n- intent\n- parameters\n- return values\n- assumptions (if any)\n\nFunction bodies may be empty or revert with a `NotImplemented`-style custom error where appropriate.\n\n### 2) Define explicit placeholders (TODOs)\n\nAdd inline TODO comments indicating where future work belongs, including:\n- business logic\n- accounting paths\n- external integrations\n- access control checks\n- invariants that must later hold\n\nTODOs must include context explaining what is missing and why.\n\n## Constraints and Safety Rules\n\n- Must not implement business logic\n- Must not generate or modify any tests\n- Must not introduce external calls\n- Must not assume ERC20 compliance\n- Must comply with all rules in `.codex/constraints/solidity-style.md`\n- Storage layout for upgradeable contracts must be:\n  - explicit\n  - append-only\n  - clearly sectioned\n- Public APIs must be:\n  - fully declared\n  - documented\n  - unimplemented where appropriate\n\n## Outputs\n\n- `src/<module-path>/<Contract>.sol`\n\nNo test files, mocks, or scaffolding may be generated by this skill.\n\n## Verification\n\n- Contract compiles with `forge build`\n- Formatting passes `forge fmt`\n- No tests are created or modified\n\n## Handoff\n\nAfter successful execution, this skill should be followed by:\n- `spec-to-implementation` to implement behavior\n- `implementation-to-tests` to generate scenario-based tests\n\n## Example Prompts\n\n- “Use scaffold-contract to create an upgradeable ERC4626-style vault\n  named `MorphoVault` with documented public interfaces only.”\n- “Scaffold a non-upgradeable adapter contract implementing `IMarketAdapter`\n  without adding any logic or tests.”\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:04:00.411Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for DeFi-focused AI Agents needing standardized Solidity contract structures with NatSpec documentation","zh":"适合需要标准化Solidity合约结构和NatSpec文档的DeFi专注AI代理","ja":"DeFiに焦点を当てたAIエージェントが標準化されたSolidity契約構造とNatSpecドキュメントを必要とする場合に最適","ko":"DeFi에 중점을 둔 AI 에이전트가 표준화된 Solidity 계약 구조와 NatSpec 문서를 필요로 하는 경우에 적합","es":"Ideal para AI Agents centrados en DeFi que necesitan estructuras estandarizadas de contratos Solidity con documentación NatSpec","fr":"Parfait pour les AI Agents axés sur la DeFi nécessitant des structures standardisées de contrats Solidity avec une documentation NatSpec","de":"Perfekt für auf DeFi fokussierte AI Agents, die standardisierte Solidity-Vertragsstrukturen mit NatSpec-Dokumentation benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA focados em DeFi que necessitam de estruturas de contrato Solidity padronizadas com documentação NatSpec","ru":"Идеально для AI-агентов, ориентированных на DeFi, которым необходимы стандартизированные структуры контрактов Solidity с документацией NatSpec","ar":"مثالي لعمالات الذكاء الاصطناعي التي تركز على DeFi وتحتاج إلى هياكل عقد Solidity معيارية مع توثيق NatSpec"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create audit-friendly Solidity modules with a standard structure, leveraging Morpho vault v2 adapters for popular DeFi protocols and facilitating consistent layout before implementation begins","zh":"赋予代理创建具有标准结构的审计友好Solidity模块的能力，利用Morpho vault v2适配器来支持流行的DeFi协议，并在实施开始之前促进一致的布局","ja":"エージェントが標準構造を持つ監査対応のSolidityモジュールを作成する能力を与え、人気のDeFiプロトコルをサポートするMorpho vault v2アダプターを利用し、実装が開始される前に一貫したレイアウトを促進する","ko":"에이전트가 표준 구조를 갖춘 감사 친화적인 Solidity 모듈을 생성할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 인기 있는 DeFi 프로토콜을 지원하는 Morpho vault v2 어댑터를 활용하고 구현이 시작되기 전에 일관된 레이아웃을 촉진","es":"Permite a los agentes crear módulos Solidity aptos para auditorías con una estructura estándar, aprovechando los adaptadores de Morpho vault v2 para protocolos DeFi populares y facilitando un diseño consistente antes de que comience la implementación","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des modules Solidity adaptés aux audits avec une structure standard, en tirant parti des adaptateurs Morpho vault v2 pour les protocoles DeFi populaires et en facilitant une mise en page cohérente avant le début de l''implémentation","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, auditfreundliche Solidity-Module mit einer Standardstruktur zu erstellen, die Morpho Vault v2-Adapter für beliebte DeFi-Protokolle nutzen und vor Beginn der Implementierung ein konsistentes Layout fördern","pt":"Habilita agentes a criar módulos Solidity de fácil auditoria com estrutura padrão, aproveitando adaptadores Morpho vault v2 para protocolos DeFi populares e facilitando layout consistente antes do início da implementação","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать модули Solidity, удобные для аудита, со стандартной структурой, используя адаптеры Morpho vault v2 для популярных протоколов DeFi и обеспечивающие последовательный макет до начала реализации","ar":"تمكّن العميل من إنشاء وحدات Solidity سهلة التفتيش بتركيب معياري، مستفيداً من محولات Morpho vault v2 لبروتوكولات DeFi الشائعة وتسهيل التخطيط المتسق قبل بدء التنفيذ"},"useCases":{"en":["Generating new contract or module skeletons for DeFi protocol development","Establishing consistent layouts for vault, strategy, adapter, or manager additions","Preparing contract surfaces with standard interfaces before spec-to-implementation","Creating new Solidity modules with NatSpec documentation for improved readability"],"zh":["为DeFi协议开发生成新的合约或模块骨架","为金库、策略、适配器或管理器添加建立一致的布局","在规范到实现之前用标准接口准备合约表面","使用NatSpec文档创建新的Solidity模块以提高可读性"],"ja":["DeFiプロトコル開発のための新しい契約またはモジュールのスケルトンを生成する","金庫、戦略、適配器、またはマネージャーの追加のためのの一貫したレイアウトを確立する","仕様から実装までの前に標準インターフェイスで契約の表面を準備する","NatSpecドキュメントを使用して可読性の向上のための新しいSolidityモジュールを作成する"],"ko":["DeFi 프로토콜 개발을 위한 새로운 계약 또는 모듈의 골격을 생성","금고, 전략, 어댑터 또는 관리자 추가를 위한 일관된 레이아웃을 설정","명세에서 구현까지 표준 인터페이스로 계약 표면을 준비","가독성을 향상시키기 위한 새로운 Solidity 모듈을 NatSpec 문서를 사용하여 생성"],"es":["Generación de nuevos esqueletos de contratos o módulos para el desarrollo de protocolos DeFi","Establecimiento de diseños consistentes para adiciones de vault, strategy, adapter o manager","Preparación de superficies de contrato con interfaces estándar antes de la implementación de especificaciones","Creación de nuevos módulos Solidity con documentación NatSpec para una mejor legibilidad"],"fr":["Génération de nouveaux squelettes de contrats ou de modules pour le développement de protocoles DeFi","Établissement de mises en page cohérentes pour les ajouts de vault, strategy, adapter ou manager","Préparation des surfaces de contrat avec des interfaces standard avant la spécification-à-implémentation","Création de nouveaux modules Solidity avec une documentation NatSpec pour une meilleure lisibilité"],"de":["Generierung neuer Vertrags- oder Modulskelette für die DeFi-Protokollentwicklung","Etablierung konsistenter Layouts für Vault-, Strategy-, Adapter- oder Manager-Erweiterungen","Vorbereitung von Vertragsoberflächen mit Standard-Schnittstellen vor der Spezifikation-zu-Implementierung","Erstellung neuer Solidity-Module mit NatSpec-Dokumentation für verbesserte Lesbarkeit"],"pt":["Geração de novos esqueletos de contrato ou módulo para desenvolvimento de protocolo DeFi","Estabelecimento de layouts consistentes para adições de cofre, estratégia, adaptador ou gerente","Preparação de superfícies de contrato com interfaces padrão antes da especificação para implementação","Criação de novos módulos Solidity com documentação NatSpec para melhor legibilidade"],"ru":["Генерация новых скелетов контракта или модуля для разработки протокола DeFi","Установление последовательных макетов для добавления хранилища, стратегии, адаптера или менеджера","Подготовка поверхностей контракта с стандартными интерфейсами до начала реализации","Создание новых модулей Solidity с документацией NatSpec для улучшения читаемости"],"ar":["генерация جديدة من الهياكل العظمية للعقد أو الوحدة لتنمية بروتوكول DeFi","تأسيس تخطيطات متسقة لإضافات الخزان أو الاستراتيجية أو المحول أو المدير","تحضير سطوح العقد مع الواجهات المعيارية قبل التطبيق","إنشاء وحدات Solidity الجديدة مع توثيق NatSpec لتحسين القراءة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Focuses only on structure and interfaces, not behavior or tests","Specific to Solidity and DeFi protocol development","Requires familiarity with Morpho vault v2 adapters and NatSpec documentation"],"zh":["仅关注结构和接口，而不考虑行为或测试","仅限于Solidity和DeFi协议开发","需要熟悉Morpho vault v2适配器和NatSpec文档"],"ja":["構造とインターフェイスのみに焦点を当て、動作やテストは考慮していない","SolidityとDeFiプロトコルの開発のみに特化している","Morpho vault v2アダプターとNatSpecドキュメントの知識が必要"],"ko":["구조와 인터페이스만을 중점으로 하고 있으며, 동작이나 테스트는 고려하지 않는다","Solidity와 DeFi 프로토콜 개발에만 특화되어 있다","Morpho vault v2 어댑터와 NatSpec 문서에 대한 지식이 필요"],"es":["Se centra únicamente en la estructura y las interfaces, no en el comportamiento o las pruebas","Específico para el desarrollo de Solidity y protocolos DeFi","Requiere familiaridad con los adaptadores de Morpho vault v2 y la documentación NatSpec"],"fr":["Se concentre uniquement sur la structure et les interfaces, pas sur le comportement ou les tests","Spécifique au développement Solidity et des protocoles DeFi","Nécessite une familiarité avec les adaptateurs Morpho vault v2 et la documentation NatSpec"],"de":["Konzentriert sich nur auf Struktur und Schnittstellen, nicht auf Verhalten oder Tests","Spezifisch für die Solidity- und DeFi-Protokollentwicklung","Erfordert Vertrautheit mit Morpho Vault v2-Adaptern und NatSpec-Dokumentation"],"pt":["Concentra-se apenas na estrutura e interfaces, não no comportamento ou testes","Específico para desenvolvimento de protocolo DeFi e Solidity","Requer familiaridade com adaptadores Morpho vault v2 e documentação NatSpec"],"ru":["Фокусируется только на структуре и интерфейсах, а не на поведении или тестах","Специфичен для разработки протокола DeFi и Solidity","Требует знакомства с адаптерами Morpho vault v2 и документацией NatSpec"],"ar":["يركز فقط على الهيئة والواجهات وليس على السلوك أو الاختبارات","محدد لبروتوكول DeFi وتطوير Solidity","يتطلب إتقان المحولات Morpho vault v2 وتوثيق NatSpec"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"875a02b5e84738c28b665a16f275b6297685516dba04ae787bff908b966fb6d1","qualityScore":42}');
