I代码审查工具","AutoHotkey配置指南","MCP协议设置","Windows 11开发自动化","如何设置开发热键","AI编程助手","代码审查自动化脚本","开发工作站优化"],"ja":["AIエージェントコードレビュー","AutoHotkey設定方法","MCPプロトコル構成","Windows 11開発自動化","ホットキーカスタマイズ","AIプログラミング支援","コードレビュー自動化","開発環境最適化"],"ko":["AI 에이전트 코드 리뷰","AutoHotkey 설정 가이드","MCP 프로토콜 구성","Windows 11 개발 자동화","핫키 커스터마이징 방법","AI 프로그래밍 도우미","코드 리뷰 자동화 스크립트","개발 워크스테이션 최적화"],"es":["automatización Windows 11 desarrollo","cómo usar AutoHotkey","configurar MCP server","herramientas de IA para desarrolladores","scripts de automatización","estación de desarrollo IA","AutoHotkey vs AutoIt","instalar AutoHotkey Windows 11","autohotkey hotkey setup guide","model context protocol config"],"fr":["automatisation Windows 11 développement","comment utiliser AutoHotkey","configurer serveur MCP","outils d''IA pour développeurs","scripts d''automatisation","station de développement IA","AutoHotkey alternative","installer AutoHotkey Windows 11","guide configuration raccourcis AutoHotkey","model context protocol configuration"],"de":["Automatisierung Windows 11 Entwicklung","AutoHotkey如何使用","MCP Server einrichten","KI-Tools für Entwickler","Automatisierungsskripte","KI-Entwicklungsstation","AutoHotkey Installationsanleitung","AutoHotkey vs andere Tools","AutoHotkey Hotkey Setup Guide","Model Context Protocol Konfiguration"],"pt":["como usar Code Review","o que é Code Review","ferramentas de IA para desenvolvedores","Code Review alternativa","Code Review vs outras ferramentas","instalar Code Review","guia de configuração do Code Review"],"ru":["как использовать Code Review","что такое Code Review","инструменты ИИ для разработчиков","Code Review альтернатива","Code Review vs другие инструменты","установить Code Review","руководство по настройке Code Review"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام مراجعة الكود","ما هي مراجعة الكود","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين","مراجعة الكود بديل","مراجعة الكود مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت مراجعة الكود","دليل إعداد مراجعة الكود"]}},"owner":"FinesseAC","repo":"windows-ai-dev-station","repoPath":"FinesseAC/windows-ai-dev-station","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.018Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"Code Review","description":"Thorough code review with security, performance, and maintainability analysis","bodyPreview":"# Code Review Protocol\n\nA comprehensive code review methodology that catches issues before they reach production.\n\n## Review Checklist\n\n### 1. Correctness\n\n- [ ] Does the code do what it''s supposed to do?\n- [ ] Are all edge cases handled?\n- [ ] Are error conditions handled properly?\n- [ ] Is the logic correct for all inputs?\n\n### 2. Security\n\n- [ ] No hardcoded secrets or credentials\n- [ ] Input validation present\n- [ ] SQL injection prevention (parameterized queries)\n- [ ] XSS prevention (outpu","body":"# Code Review Protocol\n\nA comprehensive code review methodology that catches issues before they reach production.\n\n## Review Checklist\n\n### 1. Correctness\n\n- [ ] Does the code do what it''s supposed to do?\n- [ ] Are all edge cases handled?\n- [ ] Are error conditions handled properly?\n- [ ] Is the logic correct for all inputs?\n\n### 2. Security\n\n- [ ] No hardcoded secrets or credentials\n- [ ] Input validation present\n- [ ] SQL injection prevention (parameterized queries)\n- [ ] XSS prevention (output encoding)\n- [ ] CSRF protection where needed\n- [ ] Proper authentication/authorization checks\n- [ ] Sensitive data properly protected\n\n### 3. Performance\n\n- [ ] No obvious N+1 query issues\n- [ ] Appropriate data structures used\n- [ ] No unnecessary loops or iterations\n- [ ] Database queries optimized\n- [ ] Caching considered where appropriate\n- [ ] Memory leaks prevented (cleanup handlers)\n\n### 4. Maintainability\n\n- [ ] Code is readable and self-documenting\n- [ ] Functions are focused and not too long\n- [ ] No excessive nesting\n- [ ] Consistent naming conventions\n- [ ] Appropriate abstractions used\n- [ ] No code duplication\n\n### 5. Testing\n\n- [ ] New code has corresponding tests\n- [ ] Edge cases tested\n- [ ] Error paths tested\n- [ ] Tests are meaningful (not just coverage)\n\n### 6. Documentation\n\n- [ ] Complex logic is explained\n- [ ] Public APIs are documented\n- [ ] Non-obvious decisions are commented\n- [ ] README updated if needed\n\n## Review Output Format\n\n```markdown\n## Code Review Summary\n\n**Files Reviewed**: [list]\n**Overall Assessment**: [APPROVE / REQUEST_CHANGES / NEEDS_DISCUSSION]\n\n### Critical Issues (Must Fix)\n- [ ] Issue 1: Description - Location - Suggested fix\n\n### Important Issues (Should Fix)\n- [ ] Issue 1: Description - Location - Suggested fix\n\n### Suggestions (Consider)\n- [ ] Suggestion 1: Description - Location - Rationale\n\n### Positive Observations\n- Good practice 1: Description\n- Good practice 2: Description\n```\n\n## Severity Levels\n\n- **Critical**: Security vulnerabilities, data loss risks, crashes\n- **Important**: Bugs, performance issues, maintainability problems\n- **Suggestion**: Style improvements, minor optimizations, nice-to-haves\n\n## Review Best Practices\n\n1. Be specific and actionable in feedback\n2. Explain the \"why\" not just the \"what\"\n3. Suggest alternatives, don''t just criticize\n4. Acknowledge good code, not just problems\n5. Focus on the code, not the person\n6. Prioritize feedback by severity\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:11:12.774Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents like Claude Code and AutoGPT needing rigorous code validation and security audits.","zh":"非常适合需要严格代码验证和安全审核的AI Agent，如Claude Code和AutoGPT。","ja":"Claude CodeやAutoGPTなど、厳格なコード検証とセキュリティ監査を必要とするAI Agentに最適です。","ko":"Claude Code 및 AutoGPT와 같이 엄격한 코드 검증 및 보안 감사가 필요한 AI 에이전트에 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de IA como Claude Code y AutoGPT que necesitan una validación de código rigurosa y auditorías de seguridad.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''IA comme Claude Code et AutoGPT nécessitant une validation de code rigoureuse et des audits de sécurité.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents wie Claude Code und AutoGPT, die eine strengen Code-Validierung und Sicherheitsaudits benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA como Claude Code e AutoGPT que necessitam de validação rigorosa de código e auditorias de segurança.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, таких как Claude Code и AutoGPT, требующих тщательной проверки кода и аудита безопасности.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكيين مثل Claude Code و AutoGPT الذين يحتاجون إلى التحقق الدقيق من الشفرة وعمليات التدقيق الأمني."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to scrutinize code correctness, handling edge cases and error conditions, while ensuring security protocols like input validation and SQL injection prevention are in place, utilizing parameterized queries and output encoding for XSS prevention.","zh":"使Agent能够审查代码正确性，处理边缘情况和错误条件，同时确保实施输入验证和SQL注入预防等安全协议，利用参数化查询和输出编码来预防XSS攻击。","ja":"Agentがコードの正確性を精査し、エッジケースとエラー条件を処理することを可能にし、パラメータ化されたクエリとXSS防止のための出力エンコーディングを利用して、入力検証やSQLインジェクション防止などのセキュリティプロトコルが確実に実施されるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 코드 정확성을 검토하고 엣지 케이스 및 오류 조건을 처리할 수 있도록 하며, 매개변수화된 쿼리와 XSS 방지를 위한 출력 인코딩을 활용하여 입력 검증 및 SQL 인젝션 방지와 같은 보안 프로토콜이 구현되도록 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a examinar la corrección del código, manejar casos límite y condiciones de error, mientras garantiza que los protocolos de seguridad como la validación de entrada y la prevención de inyección SQL estén en lugar, utilizando consultas parametrizadas y codificación de salida para la prevención de XSS.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''examiner la correction du code, de gérer les cas limites et les conditions d''erreur, tout en garantissant que les protocoles de sécurité tels que la validation des entrées et la prévention des injections SQL soient en place, en utilisant des requêtes paramétrées et un codage de sortie pour la prévention de XSS.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, die Richtigkeit des Codes zu überprüfen, Randfälle und Fehlerzustände zu behandeln, während es sicherstellt, dass Sicherheitsprotokolle wie Eingabevalidierung und SQL-Injektionsschutz in Kraft sind, indem parameterisierte Abfragen und Ausgabecodierung zur Verhinderung von XSS verwendet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a examinar a correção do código, lidar com casos limites e condições de erro, garantindo que os protocolos de segurança, como validação de entrada e prevenção de injeção SQL, estejam em vigor, utilizando consultas parametrizadas e codificação de saída para prevenção de XSS.","ru":"Позволяет агентам проверять правильность кода, обрабатывать граничные случаи и условия ошибок, обеспечивая наличие протоколов безопасности, таких как проверка вводимых данных и предотвращение SQL-инъекций, с использованием параметризованных запросов и кодирования вывода для предотвращения XSS.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من فحص صحة الشفرة وتحديد الحالات الشائبة والاستثناءات، مع ضمان تطبيق بروتوكولات الأمان مثل التحقق من المدخلات ومنع الحقن SQL، باستخدام استفسارات معلمة وتشفير الإخراج لمنع XSS."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating code reviews for correctness and security","Debugging edge cases and error handling","Validating input data and preventing SQL injection and XSS attacks"],"zh":["自动化代码审查以确保正确性和安全性","调试边缘情况和错误处理","验证输入数据并预防SQL注入和XSS攻击"],"ja":["正確性とセキュリティのためのコードレビューの自動化","エッジケースとエラー処理のデバッグ","入力データの検証とSQLインジェクションおよびXSS攻撃の防止"],"ko":["정확성과 보안을 위한 코드 리뷰 자동화","엣지 케이스 및 오류 처리 디버깅","입력 데이터 검증 및 SQL 인젝션과 XSS 공격 방지"],"es":["Automatización de revisiones de código para corrección y seguridad","Depuración de casos límite y manejo de errores","Validación de datos de entrada y prevención de ataques de inyección SQL y XSS"],"fr":["Automatisation des examens de code pour la correction et la sécurité","Débogage des cas limites et des conditions d''erreur","Validation des données d''entrée et prévention des attaques d''injection SQL et XSS"],"de":["Automatisierung von Code-Reviews für Korrektheit und Sicherheit","Fehlerbehebung von Randfällen und Fehlerzuständen","Validierung von Eingabedaten und Verhinderung von SQL-Injektions- und XSS-Angriffen"],"pt":["Automatizar análises de código para correção e segurança","Depurar casos limites e tratamento de erros","Validar dados de entrada e prevenir ataques de injeção SQL e XSS"],"ru":["Автоматизировать проверку кода на правильность и безопасность","Отлаживать граничные случаи и обработку ошибок","Проверять вводимые данные и предотвращать атаки типа SQL-инъекции и XSS"],"ar":["تأتمة مراجعة الشفرة لصحتها وأمانها","تصحيح الحالات الشائبة ومعالجة الأخطاء","التحقق من صحة البيانات المدخلة ومنع الهجمات مثل حقن SQL و XSS"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to codebase","Limited to programming languages with defined security protocols"],"zh":["需要访问代码库","仅限于具有已定义安全协议的编程语言"],"ja":["コードベースへのアクセスが必要","定義されたセキュリティプロトコルを持つプログラミング言語に限定される"],"ko":["코드베이스에 대한 액세스 필요","정의된 보안 프로토콜이 있는 프로그래밍 언어로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la base de código","Limitado a lenguajes de programación con protocolos de seguridad definidos"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à la base de code","Limité aux langages de programmation avec des protocoles de sécurité définis"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf den Codebasis","Begrenzt auf Programmiersprachen mit definierten Sicherheitsprotokollen"],"pt":["Exige acesso ao código-fonte","Limitado a linguagens de programação com protocolos de segurança definidos"],"ru":["Требует доступа к базе кода","Ограничен языками программирования с определенными протоколами безопасности"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى شفرة المصدر","محدود بلغات البرمجة التي تم تعريف بروتوكولات أمان فيها"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"997cbd1f97e88dd31df3f82fc698b08ced8d2eb4379ad98b7d9c2a2118aaccfe","qualityScore":42}');
