티فز للواجهة البشرية","en":"primitives"},"description":{"zh":"primitives 是一种重新思考人机交互界面的 AI 智能代理技术，旨在提升用户体验","ja":"primitives は、ユーザーインターフェースを再考した AI エージェント技術で、ユーザーエクスペリエンスを向上させることを目的としています","ko":"primitives는 사용자 인터페이스를 재정의하는 AI 에이전트 기술로, 사용자 경험을 개선하는 것을 목표로 합니다","es":"Primitives redefine la interfaz de usuario de la inteligencia artificial para desarrolladores, mejorando la interacción y el rendimiento","fr":"Primitives réinvente l''interface utilisateur de l''intelligence artificielle pour les développeurs, améliorant l''interaction et les performances","de":"Primitives gestaltet die Benutzeroberfläche von KI-Tools für Entwickler neu, verbessert die Interaktion und Leistung","pt":"As primitivas são uma abordagem inovadora para a criação de interfaces de usuário de IA. Aprenda como elas podem melhorar a experiência do usuário","ru":"Примитивы - это новаторский подход к созданию интерфейсов пользователя ИИ. Узнайте, как они могут улучшить пользовательский опыт","ar":"البريميتیفز هي مقاربة مبتكرة لإنشاء واجهات المستخدم لآلة الذكاء الاصطناعي. تعلم كيف يمكنها تحسين تجربة المستخدم","en":"Rethinking the User Interface of AI"},"definition":{"en":"Rethinking the User Interface of AI"},"features":{"zh":["重新定义人机交互界面","提升用户体验","支持多种开发框架（如 React、Python、Node.js）","提供 CLI 和 Agent 两种接入方式","集成多种 AI 算法和模型"],"ja":["ユーザーインターフェースの再考","ユーザーエクスペリエンスの向上","React、Python、Node.js などの開発フレームワークのサポート","CLI と Agent の 2 つのアクセス方法","多種多様な AI アルゴリズムとモデルの一体化"],"ko":["사용자 인터페이스의 재정의","사용자 경험의 개선","React, Python, Node.js 등의 개발 프레임워크 지원","CLI와 Agent의 2가지 접근 방법","다양한 AI 알고리즘과 모델의 통합"],"es":["Mejora de la interfaz de usuario","Integración con React y Node.js","Compatibilidad con CLI","Desarrollo de aplicaciones de inteligencia artificial","Optimización del rendimiento"],"fr":["Amélioration de l''interface utilisateur","Intégration avec React et Node.js","Compatibilité avec CLI","Développement d''applications d''intelligence artificielle","Optimisation des performances"],"de":["Verbesserung der Benutzeroberfläche","Integration mit React und Node.js","Kompatibilität mit CLI","Entwicklung von KI-Anwendungen","Leistungsoptimierung"],"pt":["Criação de interfaces de usuário personalizadas","Melhoria da experiência do usuário","Integração com ferramentas de IA existentes","Desenvolvimento de aplicações de IA inovadoras","Otimização do desempenho de IA"],"ru":["Создание индивидуальных интерфейсов пользователя","Улучшение пользовательского опыта","Интеграция с существующими ИИ инструментами","Разработка инновационных ИИ приложений","Оптимизация производительности ИИ"],"ar":["إنشاء واجهات مستخدم مخصصة","تحسين تجربة المستخدم","التكامل مع أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي الحالية","تطوير تطبيقات الذكاء الاصطناعي المبتكرة","تحسين أداء الذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","人机交互界面","primitives 使用方法","AI工具比较","React 和 primitives","如何安装 primitives","primitives 安装指南"],"ja":["AIエージェント","ユーザーインターフェース","primitives の使い方","AIツールの比較","React と primitives","primitives のインストール方法","primitives インストールガイド"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","사용자 인터페이스","primitives 사용법","AI 툴 비교","React와 primitives","primitives 설치 방법","primitives 설치 가이드"],"es":["herramientas de inteligencia artificial","primitives para desarrolladores","cómo usar primitives","alternativas a primitives","primitives vs otros herramientas de ia","instalación de primitives","guía de configuración de primitives"],"fr":["outils d''intelligence artificielle","primitives pour développeurs","comment utiliser primitives","alternatives à primitives","primitives vs autres outils d''ia","installation de primitives","guide de configuration de primitives"],"de":["ki-tools","primitives für entwickler","wie man primitives verwendet","alternativen zu primitives","primitives vs andere ki-tools","installation von primitives","konfigurationsanleitung für primitives"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia","primitivas de ia","interfaces de usuário de ia","como usar primitivas","o que são primitivas","primitivas vs componentes de ia","instalar primitivas","guia de configuração de primitivas"],"ru":["ИИ агенты","примитивы ИИ","интерфейсы пользователя ИИ","как использовать примитивы","что такое примитивы","примитивы vs компоненты ИИ","установить примитивы","руководство по настройке примитивов"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","بريميتیفز الذكاء الاصطناعي","واجهات المستخدم لآلة الذكاء الاصطناعي","كيفية استخدام البريميتیفز","ما هي البريميتیفز","البريميتیفز مقابل مكونات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تثبيت البريميتیفز","دليل إعداد البريميتیفز"]}},"owner":"ThinkEx-OSS","repo":"thinkex","repoPath":"ThinkEx-OSS/thinkex","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.019Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"primitives","description":"Guide for assistant-ui UI primitives - ThreadPrimitive, ComposerPrimitive, MessagePrimitive. Use when customizing chat UI components.","version":"0.0.1","bodyPreview":"# assistant-ui Primitives\n\n**Always consult [assistant-ui.com/llms.txt](https://assistant-ui.com/llms.txt) for latest API.**\n\nComposable, unstyled components following Radix UI patterns.\n\n## References\n\n- [./references/thread.md](./references/thread.md) -- ThreadPrimitive deep dive\n- [./references/composer.md](./references/composer.md) -- ComposerPrimitive deep dive\n- [./references/message.md](./references/message.md) -- MessagePrimitive deep dive\n- [./references/action-bar.md](./references/acti","body":"# assistant-ui Primitives\n\n**Always consult [assistant-ui.com/llms.txt](https://assistant-ui.com/llms.txt) for latest API.**\n\nComposable, unstyled components following Radix UI patterns.\n\n## References\n\n- [./references/thread.md](./references/thread.md) -- ThreadPrimitive deep dive\n- [./references/composer.md](./references/composer.md) -- ComposerPrimitive deep dive\n- [./references/message.md](./references/message.md) -- MessagePrimitive deep dive\n- [./references/action-bar.md](./references/action-bar.md) -- ActionBarPrimitive deep dive\n\n## Import\n\n```tsx\nimport {\n  ThreadPrimitive,\n  ComposerPrimitive,\n  MessagePrimitive,\n  ActionBarPrimitive,\n  BranchPickerPrimitive,\n  AttachmentPrimitive,\n  ThreadListPrimitive,\n  ThreadListItemPrimitive,\n} from \"@assistant-ui/react\";\n```\n\n## Primitive Parts\n\n| Primitive | Key Parts |\n|-----------|-----------|\n| `ThreadPrimitive` | `.Root`, `.Viewport`, `.Messages`, `.Empty`, `.ScrollToBottom` |\n| `ComposerPrimitive` | `.Root`, `.Input`, `.Send`, `.Cancel`, `.Attachments` |\n| `MessagePrimitive` | `.Root`, `.Content`, `.Avatar`, `.If` |\n| `ActionBarPrimitive` | `.Copy`, `.Edit`, `.Reload`, `.Speak` |\n| `BranchPickerPrimitive` | `.Previous`, `.Next`, `.Number`, `.Count` |\n\n## Custom Thread Example\n\n```tsx\nfunction CustomThread() {\n  return (\n    <ThreadPrimitive.Root className=\"flex flex-col h-full\">\n      <ThreadPrimitive.Empty>\n        <div className=\"flex-1 flex items-center justify-center\">\n          Start a conversation\n        </div>\n      </ThreadPrimitive.Empty>\n\n      <ThreadPrimitive.Viewport className=\"flex-1 overflow-y-auto p-4\">\n        <ThreadPrimitive.Messages components={{\n          UserMessage: CustomUserMessage,\n          AssistantMessage: CustomAssistantMessage,\n        }} />\n      </ThreadPrimitive.Viewport>\n\n      <ComposerPrimitive.Root className=\"border-t p-4 flex gap-2\">\n        <ComposerPrimitive.Input className=\"flex-1 rounded-lg border px-4 py-2\" />\n        <ComposerPrimitive.Send className=\"bg-blue-500 text-white px-4 py-2 rounded-lg\">\n          Send\n        </ComposerPrimitive.Send>\n      </ComposerPrimitive.Root>\n    </ThreadPrimitive.Root>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## Conditional Rendering\n\n```tsx\n<MessagePrimitive.If user>User only</MessagePrimitive.If>\n<MessagePrimitive.If assistant>Assistant only</MessagePrimitive.If>\n<MessagePrimitive.If running>Generating...</MessagePrimitive.If>\n<MessagePrimitive.If hasBranches>Has edit history</MessagePrimitive.If>\n\n<ComposerPrimitive.If submitting>\n  <ComposerPrimitive.Cancel>Stop</ComposerPrimitive.Cancel>\n</ComposerPrimitive.If>\n\n<ThreadPrimitive.If empty>No messages</ThreadPrimitive.If>\n```\n\n## Content Parts\n\n```tsx\n<MessagePrimitive.Content components={{\n  Text: ({ part }) => <p>{part.text}</p>,\n  Image: ({ part }) => <img src={part.image} alt=\"\" />,\n  ToolCall: ({ part }) => <div>Tool: {part.toolName}</div>,\n  Reasoning: ({ part }) => <details><summary>Thinking</summary>{part.text}</details>,\n}} />\n```\n\n## Branch Picker\n\n```tsx\n<MessagePrimitive.If hasBranches>\n  <BranchPickerPrimitive.Root className=\"flex items-center gap-1\">\n    <BranchPickerPrimitive.Previous>←</BranchPickerPrimitive.Previous>\n    <span><BranchPickerPrimitive.Number /> / <BranchPickerPrimitive.Count /></span>\n    <BranchPickerPrimitive.Next>→</BranchPickerPrimitive.Next>\n  </BranchPickerPrimitive.Root>\n</MessagePrimitive.If>\n```\n\n## Common Gotchas\n\n**Primitives not rendering**\n- Wrap in `AssistantRuntimeProvider`\n- Ensure parent primitive provides context\n\n**Styles not applying**\n- Primitives are unstyled by default\n- Add className or use `@assistant-ui/styles`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:11:42.453Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing customizable, composable UI components following Radix UI patterns.","zh":"非常适合需要可定制、可组合UI组件的前端代理，遵循Radix UI模式。","ja":"Radix UIパターンに従ったカスタマイズ可能で構成可能なUIコンポーネントを必要とするフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Radix UI 패턴을 따르는 사용자 정의 및 구성 가능한 UI 구성 요소가 필요한 프론트 엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Frontend que necesitan componentes de UI personalizables y componibles que siguen los patrones de Radix UI.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend qui ont besoin de composants d''interface utilisateur personnalisables et composable suivant les modèles de Radix UI.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die benutzerdefinierte, komponierbare Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten benötigen, die den Radix-UI-Mustern folgen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de componentes de UI personalizáveis e componíveis seguindo os padrões do Radix UI.","ru":"Идеально подходит для фронтенд-агентов, которым требуются настраиваемые, компонуемые компоненты пользовательского интерфейса, следующие принципам Radix UI.","ar":"مثالي لوكلات الواجهة الأمامية التي تحتاج إلى مكونات واجهة مستخدم قابلة للتخصيص والتركيب تتبع أنماط Radix UI."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build intuitive interfaces with unstyled, modular components, leveraging Radix UI and API references from assistant-ui.com for seamless integration with ThreadPrimitive, ComposerPrimitive, and MessagePrimitive.","zh":"赋予代理构建直观界面的能力，使用无样式的模块化组件，利用Radix UI和assistant-ui.com的API参考，实现与ThreadPrimitive、ComposerPrimitive和MessagePrimitive的无缝集成。","ja":"エージェントが直感的なインターフェイスを構築できるようにします。スタイル付けされていないモジュラー コンポーネントを使用し、Radix UIとassistant-ui.comのAPIリファレンスを活用して、ThreadPrimitive、ComposerPrimitive、MessagePrimitiveとのシームレスな統合を実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 직관적인 인터페이스를 구축할 수 있도록 하며, 스타일이 지정되지 않은 모듈식 구성 요소를 사용하여 Radix UI 및 assistant-ui.com의 API 참조를 활용하여 ThreadPrimitive, ComposerPrimitive 및 MessagePrimitive과无缝한 통합을 구현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear interfaces intuitivas con componentes modulares sin estilo, aprovechando Radix UI y referencias de API de assistant-ui.com para una integración fluida con ThreadPrimitive, ComposerPrimitive y MessagePrimitive.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des interfaces intuitives avec des composants modulaires sans style, en exploitant Radix UI et les références d''API de assistant-ui.com pour une intégration fluide avec ThreadPrimitive, ComposerPrimitive et MessagePrimitive.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, intuitive Schnittstellen mit ungestylten, modularen Komponenten zu erstellen, indem Radix UI und API-Referenzen von assistant-ui.com für eine nahtlose Integration mit ThreadPrimitive, ComposerPrimitive und MessagePrimitive genutzt werden.","pt":"Capacita os agentes a construir interfaces intuitivas com componentes modulares sem estilo, aproveitando o Radix UI e as referências de API de assistant-ui.com para uma integração perfeita com ThreadPrimitive, ComposerPrimitive e MessagePrimitive.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать интуитивно понятные интерфейсы с использованием нестилизованных модульных компонентов, используя Radix UI и ссылки на API с assistant-ui.com для беспрепятственной интеграции с ThreadPrimitive, ComposerPrimitive и MessagePrimitive.","ar":"يمكن الوكلات من بناء واجهات بديهية باستخدام مكونات معيارية غير مصممة، والاستفادة من Radix UI ومراجع API من assistant-ui.com لدمج سلس مع ThreadPrimitive و ComposerPrimitive و MessagePrimitive."},"useCases":{"en":["Composing reusable UI elements for threaded conversations","Customizing message layouts with MessagePrimitive","Enhancing user experience with ActionBar components"],"zh":["为线程式会话组合可重用UI元素","使用MessagePrimitive自定义消息布局","使用ActionBar组件增强用户体验"],"ja":["スレッド会話用の再利用可能なUI要素の構成","MessagePrimitiveを使用したメッセージレイアウトのカスタマイズ","ActionBarコンポーネントを使用したユーザーエクスペリエンスの強化"],"ko":["스레드 대화에 대한 재사용 가능한 UI 요소의 구성","MessagePrimitive를 사용한 메시지 레이아웃 사용자 정의","ActionBar 구성 요소를 사용한 사용자 경험 향상"],"es":["Componer elementos de UI reutilizables para conversaciones encadenadas","Personalizar diseños de mensaje con MessagePrimitive","Mejorar la experiencia del usuario con componentes de ActionBar"],"fr":["Composer des éléments d''interface utilisateur réutilisables pour les conversations enfilées","Personnaliser les dispositions de message avec MessagePrimitive","Améliorer l''expérience utilisateur avec des composants de ActionBar"],"de":["Wiederverwendbare UI-Elemente für verkettete Konversationen zusammensetzen","Nachrichtenlayouts mit MessagePrimitive anpassen","Benutzererfahrung mit ActionBar-Komponenten verbessern"],"pt":["Compor elementos de UI reutilizáveis para conversas em thread","Personalizar layouts de mensagem com MessagePrimitive","Aprimorar a experiência do usuário com componentes ActionBar"],"ru":["Компоновка повторно используемых элементов пользовательского интерфейса для ветвящихся бесед","Настройка макетов сообщений с помощью MessagePrimitive","Улучшение пользовательского опыта с помощью компонентов ActionBar"],"ar":["تكوين عناصر واجهة مستخدم قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام للمحادثات ذات الخيوط","تخصيص تخطيطات الرسائل باستخدام MessagePrimitive","تعزيز تجربة المستخدم باستخدام مكونات ActionBar"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires consultation of latest API at assistant-ui.com/llms.txt","Limited to components following Radix UI patterns"],"zh":["需要查阅assistant-ui.com/llms.txt的最新API","仅限遵循Radix UI模式的组件"],"ja":["最新のAPIをassistant-ui.com/llms.txtで参照する必要がある","Radix UIパターンに従ったコンポーネントのみ"],"ko":["assistant-ui.com/llms.txt의 최신 API를 참조해야 함","Radix UI 패턴을 따르는 구성 요소만 해당"],"es":["Requiere la consulta de la última API en assistant-ui.com/llms.txt","Limitado a componentes que siguen los patrones de Radix UI"],"fr":["Nécessite la consultation de la dernière API sur assistant-ui.com/llms.txt","Limité aux composants suivant les modèles de Radix UI"],"de":["Erfordert die Konsultation der neuesten API unter assistant-ui.com/llms.txt","Begrenzt auf Komponenten, die den Radix-UI-Mustern folgen"],"pt":["Requer consulta à API mais recente em assistant-ui.com/llms.txt","Limitado a componentes que seguem os padrões do Radix UI"],"ru":["Требует обращения к последней версии API на assistant-ui.com/llms.txt","Ограничено компонентами, следующими принципам Radix UI"],"ar":["يتطلب الرجوع إلى أحدث API على assistant-ui.com/llms.txt","مقصور على المكونات التي تتبع أنماط Radix UI"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"6fd1f89b86e7bc95754de6961dc9ec241310c5eb88623782e0977065f7c81e79","qualityScore":42}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Bald0Wang/DeepSeek-Oracle/oracle-actionizer', 'community', 'Bald0Wang', 'DeepSeek-Oracle', 'Bald0Wang/DeepSeek-Oracle', 'oracle-actionizer', 0, 0, 42, '2026-03-02T01:56:11.021Z', '2026-03-02T03:12:30.204Z', '5a62220f3715ce649707e0071171168538a8abf294c42c41969cff6ad13ca9ea', '{"id":"Bald0Wang/DeepSeek-Oracle/oracle-actionizer","name":"oracle-actionizer","description":{"zh":"基于紫微斗数的命理分析系统，使用deepseek等大语言模型进行解读，目前支持姻缘推算","ja":"AIエージェントは、紫微斗数に基づく命理分析システムで、DeepSeekなどの大規模言語モデルを使用して解釈します","ko":"자미두수 기반의 사주 분석 시스템으로 DeepSeek 등의 대규모 언어 모델을 사용하여 해석하며 현재는姻缘 추측을 지원합니다","es":"Oracle Actionizer es un sistema de análisis de destino basado en el modelo de deepseek, que utiliza IA para interpretar el destino y las relaciones","fr":"Oracle Actionizer est un système d''analyse du destin basé sur le modèle de deepseek, qui utilise l''IA pour interpréter le destin et les relations","de":"Oracle Actionizer ist ein Schicksalsanalyse-System basierend auf dem deepseek-Modell, das KI verwendet, um das Schicksal und die Beziehungen zu interpretieren","pt":"O oracle-actionizer é uma ferramenta de IA que realiza análise de destino baseada em astrologia chinesa, utilizando modelos de linguagem avançados","ru":"ИИ агент oracle-actionizer - система анализа судьбы на основе китайской астрологии, использующая продвинутые языковые модели","ar":"أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي oracle-actionizer هي نظام تحليل المصير بالاستناد إلى علم الفلك الصيني، يستخدم نماذج لغة متقدمة","en":"基于紫微斗数的命理分析系统，使用deepseek等大语言模型进行解读。目前是情人节版本，支持姻缘推算。"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"AIエージェント - 基于紫微斗数的命理分析系统","ja":"AIエージェント - 命理分析システム","ko":"AI 에이전트 - 자미두수 기반의 사주 분석 시스템","es":"Oracle Actionizer: Herramientas de IA para Análisis de De...","fr":"Oracle Actionizer: Outils d''IA pour l''Analyse du Destin","de":"Oracle Actionizer: KI-Tools für Schicksalsanalyse","pt":"Ferramentas de IA: or