alisierung","Echtzeit-Interaktion","Intuitive Benutzeroberfläche"],"pt":["Refatoração do painel de infraestrutura do túnel DISAL","Otimização do fluxo de usuário","Consolidação de componentes","Experiência web imersiva e interativa em 3D","Tecnologia de ponta para desenvolvedores"],"ru":["Рефакторинг панели инфраструктуры тоннеля DISAL","Оптимизация потока пользователя","Консолидация компонентов","Иммерсивный и интерактивный веб-опыт в 3D","Передовая технология для разработчиков"],"ar":["إعادة هيكلة لوحة تحكم بنية تحتية نفق DISAL","تحسين تدفق المستخدم","توحيد المكونات","تجربة ويب غامرة وتفاعلية ثلاثية الأبعاد","تكنولوجيا متقدمة للمطورين"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用3D网页体验","什么是AI智能体","3D网页体验工具","DISAL隧道基础设施仪表板原型","AI智能体技术","3D网页体验安装","3D网页体验设置指南"],"ja":["3D Web Experienceの使い方","AIエージェントとは","3D Web Experienceツール","DISALトンネルインフラダッシュボードプロトタイプ","AIエージェント技術","3D Web Experienceのインストール","3D Web Experienceの設定ガイド"],"ko":["3D 웹 경험 사용 방법","AI 에이전트란","3D 웹 경험 도구","DISAL 터널 인프라 대시보드 프로토タイプ","AI 에이전트 기술","3D 웹 경험 설치","3D 웹 경험 설정 가이드"],"es":["cómo usar herramientas de AI","qué es la experiencia 3D en la web","alternativas a la experiencia 3D en la web","experiencia 3D en la web vs realidad aumentada","instalación de la experiencia 3D en la web","guía de configuración de la experiencia 3D en la web","desarrollo de aplicaciones 3D en la web","tecnologías de visualización 3D"],"fr":["comment utiliser les outils d''IA","qu''est-ce que l''expérience 3D sur le web","alternatives à l''expérience 3D sur le web","expérience 3D sur le web vs réalité augmentée","installation de l''expérience 3D sur le web","guide de configuration de l''expérience 3D sur le web","développement d''applications 3D sur le web","technologies de visualisation 3D"],"de":["wie man KI-Tools verwendet","was ist das 3D-Web-Erlebnis","alternativen zum 3D-Web-Erlebnis","3D-Web-Erlebnis vs erweiterte Realität","installation des 3D-Web-Erlebnis","einrichtungsanleitung für das 3D-Web-Erlebnis","entwicklung von 3D-anwendungen im web","3D-visualisierungstechnologien"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia","3d web experience","refatoração de código","otimização de fluxo","consolidação de componentes","desenvolvimento web","tecnologia de ponta","guias de instalação","configuração de ferramentas"],"ru":["ИИ агенты","3d веб-опыт","рефакторинг кода","оптимизация потока","консолидация компонентов","веб-разработка","передовая технология","руководства по установке","настройка инструментов"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تجربة الويب ثلاثية الأبعاد","إعادة هيكلة الكود","تحسين التدفق","توحيد المكونات","تطوير الويب","تكنولوجيا متقدمة","دلائل التثبيت","إعداد أدوات"]}},"owner":"Dwamenachrist","repo":"DISAL-Tunnel-Refactored","repoPath":"Dwamenachrist/DISAL-Tunnel-Refactored","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.104Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"3d-web-experience","description":"Expert in building 3D experiences for the web - Three.js, React Three Fiber, Spline, WebGL, and interactive 3D scenes. Covers product configurators, 3D portfolios, immersive websites, and bringing depth to web experiences. Use when: 3D website, three.js, WebGL, react three fiber, 3D experience.","bodyPreview":"# 3D Web Experience\n\n**Role**: 3D Web Experience Architect\n\nYou bring the third dimension to the web. You know when 3D enhances\nand when it''s just showing off. You balance visual impact with\nperformance. You make 3D accessible to users who''ve never touched\na 3D app. You create moments of wonder without sacrificing usability.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n- Three.js implementation\n- React Three Fiber\n- WebGL optimization\n- 3D model integration\n- Spline workflows\n- 3D product configurators\n- Interactive 3D sc","body":"# 3D Web Experience\n\n**Role**: 3D Web Experience Architect\n\nYou bring the third dimension to the web. You know when 3D enhances\nand when it''s just showing off. You balance visual impact with\nperformance. You make 3D accessible to users who''ve never touched\na 3D app. You create moments of wonder without sacrificing usability.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n- Three.js implementation\n- React Three Fiber\n- WebGL optimization\n- 3D model integration\n- Spline workflows\n- 3D product configurators\n- Interactive 3D scenes\n- 3D performance optimization\n\n## Patterns\n\n### 3D Stack Selection\n\nChoosing the right 3D approach\n\n**When to use**: When starting a 3D web project\n\n```python\n## 3D Stack Selection\n\n### Options Comparison\n| Tool | Best For | Learning Curve | Control |\n|------|----------|----------------|---------|\n| Spline | Quick prototypes, designers | Low | Medium |\n| React Three Fiber | React apps, complex scenes | Medium | High |\n| Three.js vanilla | Max control, non-React | High | Maximum |\n| Babylon.js | Games, heavy 3D | High | Maximum |\n\n### Decision Tree\n```\nNeed quick 3D element?\n└── Yes → Spline\n└── No → Continue\n\nUsing React?\n└── Yes → React Three Fiber\n└── No → Continue\n\nNeed max performance/control?\n└── Yes → Three.js vanilla\n└── No → Spline or R3F\n```\n\n### Spline (Fastest Start)\n```jsx\nimport Spline from ''@splinetool/react-spline'';\n\nexport default function Scene() {\n  return (\n    <Spline scene=\"https://prod.spline.design/xxx/scene.splinecode\" />\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### React Three Fiber\n```jsx\nimport { Canvas } from ''@react-three/fiber'';\nimport { OrbitControls, useGLTF } from ''@react-three/drei'';\n\nfunction Model() {\n  const { scene } = useGLTF(''/model.glb'');\n  return <primitive object={scene} />;\n}\n\nexport default function Scene() {\n  return (\n    <Canvas>\n      <ambientLight />\n      <Model />\n      <OrbitControls />\n    </Canvas>\n  );\n}\n```\n```\n\n### 3D Model Pipeline\n\nGetting models web-ready\n\n**When to use**: When preparing 3D assets\n\n```python\n## 3D Model Pipeline\n\n### Format Selection\n| Format | Use Case | Size |\n|--------|----------|------|\n| GLB/GLTF | Standard web 3D | Smallest |\n| FBX | From 3D software | Large |\n| OBJ | Simple meshes | Medium |\n| USDZ | Apple AR | Medium |\n\n### Optimization Pipeline\n```\n1. Model in Blender/etc\n2. Reduce poly count (< 100K for web)\n3. Bake textures (combine materials)\n4. Export as GLB\n5. Compress with gltf-transform\n6. Test file size (< 5MB ideal)\n```\n\n### GLTF Compression\n```bash\n# Install gltf-transform\nnpm install -g @gltf-transform/cli\n\n# Compress model\ngltf-transform optimize input.glb output.glb \\\n  --compress draco \\\n  --texture-compress webp\n```\n\n### Loading in R3F\n```jsx\nimport { useGLTF, useProgress, Html } from ''@react-three/drei'';\nimport { Suspense } from ''react'';\n\nfunction Loader() {\n  const { progress } = useProgress();\n  return <Html center>{progress.toFixed(0)}%</Html>;\n}\n\nexport default function Scene() {\n  return (\n    <Canvas>\n      <Suspense fallback={<Loader />}>\n        <Model />\n      </Suspense>\n    </Canvas>\n  );\n}\n```\n```\n\n### Scroll-Driven 3D\n\n3D that responds to scroll\n\n**When to use**: When integrating 3D with scroll\n\n```python\n## Scroll-Driven 3D\n\n### R3F + Scroll Controls\n```jsx\nimport { ScrollControls, useScroll } from ''@react-three/drei'';\nimport { useFrame } from ''@react-three/fiber'';\n\nfunction RotatingModel() {\n  const scroll = useScroll();\n  const ref = useRef();\n\n  useFrame(() => {\n    // Rotate based on scroll position\n    ref.current.rotation.y = scroll.offset * Math.PI * 2;\n  });\n\n  return <mesh ref={ref}>...</mesh>;\n}\n\nexport default function Scene() {\n  return (\n    <Canvas>\n      <ScrollControls pages={3}>\n        <RotatingModel />\n      </ScrollControls>\n    </Canvas>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### GSAP + Three.js\n```javascript\nimport gsap from ''gsap'';\nimport ScrollTrigger from ''gsap/ScrollTrigger'';\n\ngsap.to(camera.position, {\n  scrollTrigger: {\n    trigger: ''.section'',\n    scrub: true,\n  },\n  z: 5,\n  y: 2,\n});\n```\n\n### Common Scroll Effects\n- Camera movement through scene\n- Model rotation on scroll\n- Reveal/hide elements\n- Color/material changes\n- Exploded view animations\n```\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n### ❌ 3D For 3D''s Sake\n\n**Why bad**: Slows down the site.\nConfuses users.\nBattery drain on mobile.\nDoesn''t help conversion.\n\n**Instead**: 3D should serve a purpose.\nProduct visualization = good.\nRandom floating shapes = probably not.\nAsk: would an image work?\n\n### ❌ Desktop-Only 3D\n\n**Why bad**: Most traffic is mobile.\nKills battery.\nCrashes on low-end devices.\nFrustrated users.\n\n**Instead**: Test on real mobile devices.\nReduce quality on mobile.\nProvide static fallback.\nConsider disabling 3D on low-end.\n\n### ❌ No Loading State\n\n**Why bad**: Users think it''s broken.\nHigh bounce rate.\n3D takes time to load.\nBad first impression.\n\n**Instead**: Loading progress indicator.\nSkeleton/placeholder.\nLoad 3D after page is interactive.\nOptimize model size.\n\n## Related Skills\n\nWorks well with: `scroll-experience`, `interactive-portfolio`, `frontend`, `landing-page-design`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:35:14.563Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Visual AI Agents needing immersive 3D web experience capabilities with Three.js and React Three Fiber.","zh":"非常适合需要沉浸式 3D 网页体验能力的视觉 AI 代理，具有 Three.js 和 React Three Fiber。","ja":"Three.js と React Three Fiber を使用したイマーシブ 3D ウェブ体験機能が必要なビジュアル AI エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Three.js와 React Three Fiber를 사용하여 몰입형 3D 웹 경험 기능이 필요한 시각 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Inteligencia Artificial Visuales que necesitan capacidades de experiencia web 3D inmersiva con Three.js y React Three Fiber.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''intelligence artificielle visuelle ayant besoin de capacités d''expérience web 3D immersive avec Three.js et React Three Fiber.","de":"Perfekt für visuelle KI-Agents, die immersive 3D-Web-Erfahrungen mit Three.js und React Three Fiber benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA Visuais que precisam de capacidades de experiência web 3D imersiva com Three.js e React Three Fiber.","ru":"Идеально для Визуальных ИИ-агентов, требующих погружающего 3D-веб-опыта с помощью Three.js и React Three Fiber.","ar":"مثالي لموكلات الذكاء الاصطناعي البصرية التي تحتاج إلى إمكانيات تجربة الويب ثلاثية الأبعاد الغامرة مع Three.js و React Three Fiber."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create interactive 3D scenes with WebGL optimization, integrate 3D models, and design immersive 3D product configurators using Spline workflows and Three.js implementation.","zh":"赋予代理创建具有 WebGL 优化的交互式 3D 场景、集成 3D 模型以及使用 Spline 工作流和 Three.js 实现设计沉浸式 3D 产品配置器的能力。","ja":"WebGL 最適化を使用したインタラクティブ 3D シーンの作成、3D モデルの統合、Spline ワークフローと Three.js 実装を使用したイマーシブ 3D 製品コンフィギュレータの設計をエージェントに可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가 WebGL 최적화를 사용하여 대화형 3D 장면을 생성하고 3D 모델을 통합하며 Spline 워크플로 및 Three.js 구현을 사용하여 몰입형 3D 제품 구성을 설계할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear escenas 3D interactivas con optimización de WebGL, integrar modelos 3D y diseñar configuradores de productos 3D inmersivos utilizando flujos de trabajo de Spline y implementación de Three.js.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des scènes 3D interactives avec optimisation de WebGL, d''intégrer des modèles 3D et de concevoir des configurateurs de produits 3D immersifs en utilisant des flux de travail Spline et une implémentation de Three.js.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, interaktive 3D-Szenen mit WebGL-Optimierung zu erstellen, 3D-Modelle zu integrieren und immersive 3D-Produktkonfiguratoren mit Spline-Workflows und Three.js-Implementierung zu entwerfen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criarem cenas 3D interativas com otimização do WebGL, integrar modelos 3D e projetar configuradores de produtos 3D imersivos usando fluxos de trabalho do Spline e implementação do Three.js.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать интерактивные 3D-сцены с оптимизацией WebGL, интегрировать 3D-модели и разрабатывать иммерсивные 3D-конфигураторы продуктов, используя рабочие процессы Spline и реализацию Three.js.","ar":"تمكّن الموكلات من إنشاء مشاهد 3D تفاعلية مع تحسين WebGL، ودمج نماذج 3D، وتصميم مع hiểnات منتجات 3D غامرة باستخدام سلاسل عمل Spline وتنفيذ Three.js."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating interactive 3D product demonstrations","Creating immersive 3D web experiences with React Three Fiber","Optimizing 3D model integration for web applications"],"zh":["生成交互式 3D 产品演示","使用 React Three Fiber 创建沉浸式 3D 网页体验","为网页应用程序优化 3D 模型集成"],"ja":["インタラクティブ 3D 製品デモの生成","React Three Fiber を使用したイマーシブ 3D ウェブ体験の作成","Web アプリケーション向け 3D モデル統合の最適化"],"ko":["대화형 3D 제품 시연 생성","React Three Fiber를 사용하여 몰입형 3D 웹 경험 생성","웹 애플리케이션을 위한 3D 모델 통합 최적화"],"es":["Generación de demostraciones de productos 3D interactivas","Creación de experiencias web 3D inmersivas con React Three Fiber","Optimización de la integración de modelos 3D para aplicaciones web"],"fr":["Génération de démonstrations de produits 3D interactives","Création d''expériences web 3D immersives avec React Three Fiber","Optimisation de l''intégration de modèles 3D pour les applications web"],"de":["Erzeugung interaktiver 3D-Produkt-Demonstrationen","Erstellung immersiver 3D-Web-Erfahrungen mit React Three Fiber","Optimierung der 3D-Modell-Integration für Webanwendungen"],"pt":["Geração de demonstrações de produtos 3D interativas","Criação de experiências web 3D imersivas com React Three Fiber","Otimização da integração de modelos 3D para aplicações web"],"ru":["Генерация интерактивных 3D-демонстраций продуктов","Создание иммерсивных 3D-веб-опытов с помощью React Three Fiber","Оптимизация интеграции 3D-моделей для веб-приложений"],"ar":["توليد عروض منتجات 3D تفاعلية","إنشاء تجارب ويب 3D غامرة مع React Three Fiber","تحسين دمج نماذج 3D لتطبيقات الويب"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires WebGL support","Performance dependent on hardware capabilities"],"zh":["需要 WebGL 支持","性能取决于硬件能力"],"ja":["WebGL サポートが必要","パフォーマンスはハードウェアの能力に依存"],"ko":["WebGL 지원이 필요하다","성능은 하드웨어 기능에 의존"],"es":["Requiere soporte de WebGL","El rendimiento depende de las capacidades del hardware"],"fr":["Nécessite un support de WebGL","Les performances dépendent des capacités du matériel"],"de":["Benötigt WebGL-Unterstützung","Die Leistung hängt von den Hardware-Fähigkeiten ab"],"pt":["Requer suporte ao WebGL","Desempenho dependente das capacidades de hardware"],"ru":["Требует поддержки WebGL","Производительность зависит от возможностей аппаратного обеспечения"],"ar":["يتطلب دعمًا لـ WebGL","الأداء يعتمد على إمكانيات الأجهزة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"1329eaa8a9d12f7a56a275960f95185d5cabc83f3261f1d6cacb87b250f15741","qualityScore":42}');
