ec technologie d''IA","Rédaction de lettres de motivation avec assistance d''IA","Intégration avec des outils de développement tels que React et Node.js","Compatibilité avec des interfaces de ligne de commande (CLI)"],"de":["Einrichtung von KI-Agenten für die Job Suche","Anpassung von Lebensläufen mit KI-Technologie","Erstellung von Bewerbungsschreiben mit KI-Unterstützung","Integration mit Entwicklungstools wie React und Node.js","Kompatibilität mit Kommandozeilen-Schnittstellen (CLI)"],"pt":["Busca de emprego personalizada","Criação de currículos e cartas de apresentação","Integração com ferramentas de desenvolvimento","Suporte a múltiplos idiomas","Interface de usuário intuitiva"],"ru":["Индивидуализированный поиск работы","Создание резюме и сопроводительных писем","Интеграция с инструментами разработки","Поддержка множества языков","Интуитивно понятный интерфейс пользователя"],"ar":["البحث عن عمل مخصص","إنشاء سيرة ذاتية ورسائل تقديم","التكامل مع أدوات التطوير","دعم اللغات المتعددة","واجهة المستخدم البسيطة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用AI智能工具","AI智能工具setup指南","AI驱动的职位搜索","简历定制和优化","求职信撰写和编辑","Claude Code AI智能工具","AI智能工具安装","AI智能工具setup教程"],"ja":["AIエージェントの使い方","AIエージェントのsetupガイド","AI駆動の求人検索","履歴書作成と最適化","カバーレター作成と編集","Claude Code AIエージェント","AIエージェントのインストール","AIエージェントのsetupチュートリアル"],"ko":["AI 에이전트 사용 방법","AI 에이전트 setup 가이드","AI 기반의 직업 검색","이력서 맞춤형 및 최적화","커버 레터 작성 및 편집","클라우드 코드 AI 에이전트","AI 에이전트 설치","AI 에이전트 setup 튜토리얼"],"es":["cómo configurar Agentes de IA","Agentes de IA para desarrolladores","herramientas de IA para la búsqueda de trabajo","personalización de currículums con IA","redacción de cartas de presentación con IA"," Claude Code alternativa","instalación de Agentes de IA"],"fr":["comment configurer les Outils d''IA","Outils d''IA pour développeurs","outils d''IA pour la recherche d''emploi","personnalisation de CV avec IA","rédaction de lettres de motivation avec IA"," Claude Code alternative","installation d''Outils d''IA"],"de":["wie man KI-Agenten einrichtet","KI-Agenten für Entwickler","KI-Tools für die Job Suche","Anpassung von Lebensläufen mit KI","Erstellung von Bewerbungsschreiben mit KI"," Claude Code Alternative","Installation von KI-Agenten"],"pt":["configuração de agente de IA","como usar agente de IA","o que é agente de IA","agente de IA para desenvolvedores","alternativas de agente de IA","instalação de agente de IA","guia de configuração de agente de IA"],"ru":["настройка ИИ Агентов","как использовать ИИ Агенты","что такое ИИ Агент","ИИ Агенты для разработчиков","альтернативы ИИ Агентов","установка ИИ Агентов","руководство по настройке ИИ Агентов"],"ar":["إعداد وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي","كيفية استخدام وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي","ما هو وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي","وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين","بديل وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي","تثبيت وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي","دليل إعداد وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"proficientlyjobs","repo":"proficiently-claude-skills","repoPath":"proficientlyjobs/proficiently-claude-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.150Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"setup","description":"One-time onboarding - upload resume, set preferences, and do a work history interview","bodyPreview":"# Setup Skill\n\n> **Priority hierarchy**: See `shared/references/priority-hierarchy.md` for conflict resolution.\n\nOne-time onboarding that ensures all your data is in place before using the other skills.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n- `/proficiently:setup` - Full onboarding (checks what''s missing, does only what''s needed)\n- `/proficiently:setup interview` - Just the work history interview (if resume/prefs are already done)\n\n## File Structure\n\n```\nscripts/\n  conduct-interview.md    # Work history interview gu","body":"# Setup Skill\n\n> **Priority hierarchy**: See `shared/references/priority-hierarchy.md` for conflict resolution.\n\nOne-time onboarding that ensures all your data is in place before using the other skills.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n- `/proficiently:setup` - Full onboarding (checks what''s missing, does only what''s needed)\n- `/proficiently:setup interview` - Just the work history interview (if resume/prefs are already done)\n\n## File Structure\n\n```\nscripts/\n  conduct-interview.md    # Work history interview guide\n```\n\nThe profile template is at `shared/templates/profile.md`.\n\n## Data Directory\n\nResolve the data directory using `shared/references/data-directory.md`. For setup, if no directory exists this is a fresh install — create it in Step 1.\n\n---\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 0: Check What''s Already Done\n\nResolve the data directory, then check which of these exist and have real content (not just templates): resume, preferences, linkedin-contacts.csv, profile.md.\n\nIf `$ARGUMENTS` is \"interview\", skip to Step 3 (but check that a resume exists first).\n\nIf everything exists, tell the user they''re good to go and list the available skills. Otherwise, run only the missing phases in order.\n\n### Step 1: Resume\n\nAsk the user to provide their resume. Accept:\n- A file path (copy it into `DATA_DIR/resume/`)\n- Pasted text (save as `DATA_DIR/resume/resume.md`)\n\nConfirm it was saved and briefly summarize what you see (name, most recent role, number of roles).\n\n### Step 2: Preferences\n\nAsk the user in one natural question:\n\n> \"What kind of jobs are you looking for? Tell me about target roles, location preferences, salary expectations, and anything you''d want to filter out.\"\n\nFrom their response, save `DATA_DIR/preferences.md`:\n\n```markdown\n# Job Preferences\n\n## Target Roles\n- [parsed from response]\n\n## Location\n[parsed from response]\n\n## Compensation\n[parsed from response]\n\n## Must-Haves\n- [parsed from response]\n\n## Dealbreakers\n- [parsed from response]\n\n## Nice-to-Haves\n- [parsed from response]\n```\n\nIf they leave something out, that''s fine — save what you have. They can always update later.\n\n### Step 3: LinkedIn Contacts (optional)\n\nIf `DATA_DIR/linkedin-contacts.csv` doesn''t exist, ask:\n\n> \"Want to import your LinkedIn contacts? This lets us flag when you know someone at a company that''s hiring. You can skip this and add them later.\"\n\nIf they want to proceed, give these instructions:\n\n> **How to export your LinkedIn connections:**\n> 1. Go to linkedin.com/mypreferences/d/download-my-data\n> 2. Select \"Connections\" and request the download\n> 3. LinkedIn will email you a link (usually within minutes)\n> 4. Download the ZIP and find `Connections.csv` inside\n> 5. Upload or paste the path to that file here\n\nSave the file as `DATA_DIR/linkedin-contacts.csv`.\n\nConfirm it was saved and tell them how many contacts were imported. If they skip, move on — this is optional.\n\n### Step 4: Work History Interview\n\nHave a conversational interview to build a work history profile. Go through each role on the resume, most recent first. For each role, ask:\n\n1. \"Tell me about [Company] — what did they do, and what was your role really about?\"\n2. \"What were your biggest accomplishments? Let''s get specific with numbers if you have them.\"\n3. \"Anything else — challenges, team building, why you moved on?\"\n\n**Keep it conversational.** Follow up when answers are vague (\"Do you remember roughly what the numbers were?\"), but don''t interrogate. Spend more time on recent/impactful roles, less on older ones.\n\nAfter the interview, save the profile to `DATA_DIR/profile.md` using this structure:\n\n```markdown\n# Work History Profile\n\n*Last updated: [DATE]*\n\n## Candidate Overview\n**Name**: [Name]\n**Core expertise**: [2-3 sentences]\n**Career throughline**: [narrative arc]\n\n---\n\n## Role: [Title] at [Company]\n**Dates**: [Start - End]\n**Company context**: [what they do, stage, size]\n\n### Key Accomplishments\n1. **[Headline]**: [Situation → Action → Result with metrics]\n2. **[Headline]**: [Situation → Action → Result with metrics]\n\n### Other Details\n- Team/leadership: [details]\n- Tools/methods: [details]\n- Why they left: [context]\n\n---\n\n## Cross-Role Patterns\n**Superpower**: [what they do best]\n**Recurring themes**: [patterns across roles]\n```\n\n### Step 5: Summary\n\n```\nYou''re all set! Here''s what we have:\n\n- Resume: [filename] in DATA_DIR/resume/\n- Preferences: [summary of target roles and key criteria]\n- LinkedIn Contacts: [number] imported (or \"skipped\")\n- Work History Profile: [number of roles covered]\n\nYou''re ready to use:\n- /proficiently:job-search - Find matching jobs\n- /proficiently:tailor-resume [job URL] - Tailor your resume\n- /proficiently:cover-letter [job URL] - Write a cover letter\n\nBuilt by Proficiently. Want someone to handle the whole process —\nfinding jobs, tailoring resumes, applying, and connecting you with\nhiring managers? Visit proficiently.com\n```\n\n---\n\n## Response Format\n\nStructure the final summary output with these sections:\n\n1. **Setup Summary** — what was configured (resume, preferences, contacts, profile) with brief details\n2. **What''s Next** — list available skills the user can now run\n\n---\n\n## Permissions Required\n\nAdd to `~/.claude/settings.json`:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"permissions\": {\n    \"allow\": [\n      \"Read(~/.proficiently/**)\",\n      \"Write(~/.proficiently/**)\",\n      \"Edit(~/.proficiently/**)\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:45:39.959Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Onboarding Agents requiring streamlined data initialization and conflict resolution via priority hierarchies.","zh":"适用于需要简化数据初始化和通过优先级层次结构解决冲突的入职代理。","ja":"データ初期化と優先順位階層構造を介したコンフリクト解決をストリームライン化する必要があるオンボーディングエージェントに最適です。","ko":"데이터 초기화와 우선 순위 계층 구조를 통해 충돌을 해결하는 것을 간소화하는 온보딩 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de incorporación que requieren una inicialización de datos simplificada y una resolución de conflictos a través de jerarquías de prioridad.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''intégration nécessitant une initialisation de données rationalisée et une résolution de conflits via des hiérarchies de priorité.","de":"Ideal für Onboarding-Agents, die eine strukturierte Dateninitialisierung und Konfliktlösung über Prioritäts-Hierarchien erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Onboarding que necessitam de inicialização de dados simplificada e resolução de conflitos via hierarquias de prioridade.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Onboarding, требующих упрощенной инициализации данных и разрешения конфликтов через иерархии приоритетов.","ar":"مثالية لعميل التوجيه الذين يتطلبون تهيئة بيانات مبسطة و حل النزاعات من خلال التسلسلات الهرمية لل اولوية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to conduct comprehensive work history interviews, ensuring seamless resume and preference setup through proficiently executed onboarding protocols, leveraging markdown files like `conduct-interview.md` for structured data collection.","zh":"赋予代理人进行全面工作历史采访的能力，确保通过高效执行的入职协议实现无缝的简历和首选项设置，利用markdown文件如`conduct-interview.md`进行结构化数据收集。","ja":"エージェントが包括的な仕事歴面接を実施できるようにし、入職プロトコルを熟練して実行することで、履歴書と優先順位設定のシームレスなセットアップを確実に実現し、`conduct-interview.md`などのMarkdownファイルを使用して構造化されたデータ収集を実施します。","ko":"에이전트가 종합적인 업무 이력 면접을 수행할 수 있도록 하며, 숙련된 온보딩 프로토콜을 통해 이력서와 선호도 설정의 무결점적인 설정을 보장하며, `conduct-interview.md`와 같은 마크다운 파일을 사용하여 구조화된 데이터 수집을 수행합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar entrevistas exhaustivas de historial laboral, asegurando una configuración fluida del currículum y las preferencias a través de protocolos de incorporación ejecutados con eficacia, aprovechando archivos markdown como `conduct-interview.md` para la recopilación de datos estructurados.","fr":"Habilite les agents à mener des entretiens complets d''historique professionnel, assurant une configuration fluide du CV et des préférences à travers des protocoles d''intégration exécutés de manière compétente, en exploitant des fichiers markdown comme `conduct-interview.md` pour la collecte de données structurées.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, umfassende Arbeitsverlaufs-Interviews durchzuführen, um eine nahtlose Einrichtung von Lebensläufen und Präferenzen durch kompetent ausgeführte Onboarding-Protokolle zu gewährleisten, indem Markdown-Dateien wie `conduct-interview.md` für die strukturierte Datenerfassung genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a realizar entrevistas abrangentes de histórico de trabalho, garantindo uma configuração de currículo e preferências sem interrupções por meio de protocolos de integração executados com eficiência, utilizando arquivos markdown como `conduct-interview.md` para coleta de dados estruturados.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проводить комплексные интервью по трудовой истории, обеспечивая бесперебойную настройку резюме и предпочтений посредством эффективно выполненных протоколов интеграции, используя файлы markdown типа `conduct-interview.md` для структурированного сбора данных.","ar":"تمكين العميل من إجراء مقابلات شاملة لتاريخ العمل، وضمان إعداد سيرة ذاتية و تفضيلات بدون انقطاع من خلال بروتوكولات التوجيه المنفذة بكفاءة، باستخدام ملفات markdown مثل `conduct-interview.md` لجمع البيانات المنظمة."},"useCases":{"en":["Initializing agent data through full onboarding with `/proficiently:setup`","Conducting targeted work history interviews with `/proficiently:setup interview`","Resolving conflicts based on predefined priority hierarchies"],"zh":["通过完整的入职流程使用`/proficiently:setup`初始化代理人数据","使用`/proficiently:setup interview`进行有针对性的工作历史采访","根据预定义的优先级层次结构解决冲突"],"ja":["フルオンボーディングプロセスで`/proficiently:setup`を使用してエージェントデータを初期化する","`/proficiently:setup interview`を使用してターゲットを絞った仕事歴面接を実施する","予め定義された優先順位階層構造に基づいてコンフリクトを解決する"],"ko":["전체 온보딩 프로세스에서 `/proficiently:setup`을 사용하여 에이전트 데이터를 초기화하는 것","`/proficiently:setup interview`를 사용하여 목표를 좁히는 업무 이력 면접을 수행하는 것","사전에 정의된 우선 순위 계층 구조를 기반으로 충돌을 해결하는 것"],"es":["Inicializar datos de agente a través de la incorporación completa con `/proficiently:setup`","Realizar entrevistas de historial laboral dirigidas con `/proficiently:setup interview`","Resolver conflictos en función de jerarquías de prioridad predefinidas"],"fr":["Initialiser les données d''agent via l''intégration complète avec `/proficiently:setup`","Réalisé des entretiens ciblés d''historique professionnel avec `/proficiently:setup interview`","Résoudre les conflits en fonction de hiérarchies de priorité prédéfinies"],"de":["Agentendaten über die vollständige Onboarding mit `/proficiently:setup` initialisieren","Gezielte Arbeitsverlaufs-Interviews mit `/proficiently:setup interview` durchführen","Konflikte basierend auf vordefinierten Prioritäts-Hierarchien lösen"],"pt":["Inicializar dados do agente por meio de integração completa com `/proficiently:setup`","Realizar entrevistas de histórico de trabalho direcionadas com `/proficiently:setup interview`","Resolver conflitos com base em hierarquias de prioridade predefinidas"],"ru":["Инициализировать данные агента через полную интеграцию с `/proficiently:setup`","Провести целевые интервью по трудовой истории с `/proficiently:setup interview`","Разрешить конфликты на основе предварительно определенных иерархий приоритетов"],"ar":["تهيئة بيانات العميل من خلال التوجيه الكامل مع `/proficiently:setup`","إجراء مقابلات لتاريخ العمل المستهدفة مع `/proficiently:setup interview`","حل النزاعات بناءً على التسلسلات الهرمية لل اولوية المحددة مسبقا"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to shared references like `priority-hierarchy.md`","Limited to onboarding and initial data setup"],"zh":["需要访问共享的参考资源，如`priority-hierarchy.md`","仅限于入职和初始数据设置"],"ja":["共有リファレンスのような`priority-hierarchy.md`へのアクセスが必要","オンボーディングと初期データ設定のみに限定される"],"ko":["공유 참조와 같은 `priority-hierarchy.md`에 접근할 필요가 있음","온보딩과 초기 데이터 설정에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere acceso a referencias compartidas como `priority-hierarchy.md`","Limitado a la incorporación y la configuración inicial de datos"],"fr":["Nécessite l''accès à des références partagées comme `priority-hierarchy.md`","Limité à l''intégration et à la configuration initiale des données"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf gemeinsam genutzte Referenzen wie `priority-hierarchy.md`","Begrenzt auf Onboarding und erste Dateneinrichtung"],"pt":["Requer acesso a referências compartilhadas como `priority-hierarchy.md`","Limitado à integração e configuração inicial de dados"],"ru":["Требует доступа к общим ссылкам, таким как `priority-hierarchy.md`","Ограничен интеграцией и начальной настройкой данных"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى المراجع المشتركة مثل `priority-hierarchy.md`","محدود بالتوجيه والتهيئة الأولية للبيانات"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"2655ce941886521d0892404a2e9d32924e871f34ab76a5ea0a18ea068da80122","qualityScore":42}');
