ión de bump-version","guía de configuración de bump-version"],"fr":["comment utiliser bump-version","qu''est-ce que bump-version","outils d''intelligence artificielle pour les crypto","bump-version vs autres outils","installation de bump-version","guide de configuration de bump-version"],"de":["wie man bump-version verwendet","was ist bump-version","künstliche Intelligenz-Tools für Kryptowährungen","bump-version vs andere Tools","Installation von bump-version","Konfigurationsanleitung für bump-version"],"pt":["como usar bump-version","o que é bump-version","bump-version alternativa","bump-version vs outras ferramentas","instalar bump-version","guia de configuração do bump-version","otimizar portfólio de criptomoedas","rastrear portfólio de criptomoedas"],"ru":["как использовать bump-version","что такое bump-version","бмп-версия альтернатива","бмп-версия vs другие инструменты","установить бмп-версию","руководство по настройке бмп-версии","оптимизировать крипто-портфель","отслеживать крипто-портфель"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام bump-version","ما هو bump-version","بамп-فيرشن بديل","بамп-فيرشن مقارنة بالادوات الاخرى","تثبيت bump-version","دليل إعداد bump-version","تحسين المحفظة المشفرة","تعقب المحفظة المشفرة"]}},"owner":"PaulRBerg","repo":"cryptfolio-scripts","repoPath":"PaulRBerg/cryptfolio-scripts","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.922Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"bump-version","description":"This skill should be used when the user asks to bump version, release a new version, bump the version, prepare a release, update version numbers, what version should this be, or mentions version bumping, semver analysis, or release preparation.","version":"0.1.0","bodyPreview":"# Bump Version\n\nAnalyze changes since the last version tag, determine the correct semver bump, and update all version references in the codebase.\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Identify the Latest Version Tag\n\n```bash\ngit tag --sort=-v:refname | head -1\n```\n\nThe tag format is `vMAJOR.MINOR.PATCH` (e.g. `v2.1.1`).\n\n### Step 2: Analyze Changes Since the Last Tag\n\nGather the commit log and diff since the tag:\n\n```bash\ngit log <tag>..HEAD --oneline\ngit diff <tag>..HEAD --stat\n```\n\n### Step 3: Classify th","body":"# Bump Version\n\nAnalyze changes since the last version tag, determine the correct semver bump, and update all version references in the codebase.\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Identify the Latest Version Tag\n\n```bash\ngit tag --sort=-v:refname | head -1\n```\n\nThe tag format is `vMAJOR.MINOR.PATCH` (e.g. `v2.1.1`).\n\n### Step 2: Analyze Changes Since the Last Tag\n\nGather the commit log and diff since the tag:\n\n```bash\ngit log <tag>..HEAD --oneline\ngit diff <tag>..HEAD --stat\n```\n\n### Step 3: Classify the Semver Bump\n\nApply [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/) rules to the changes:\n\n| Bump    | Criteria                                                                                     |\n| ------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `patch` | Bug fixes, dependency bumps, formatting, docs, refactors with no behavioral change           |\n| `minor` | New features, new functions, new chain/token support, non-breaking additions                  |\n| `major` | Breaking changes: renamed/removed public functions, changed function signatures, schema moves |\n\n**Context-specific guidance for this codebase:**\n\n- Adding a new custom function (e.g. `GET_BALANCE_V2`) &rarr; **minor**\n- Adding a new chain or token to `data.gs` &rarr; **minor**\n- Renaming or removing an existing custom function &rarr; **major**\n- Changing the parameters of an existing custom function &rarr; **major**\n- Fixing a bug in price fetching or balance calculation &rarr; **patch**\n- Updating RPC URLs, API endpoints, or constants &rarr; **patch**\n- Reformatting, linting, dependency bumps &rarr; **patch**\n\nPresent the analysis and proposed version to the user for confirmation before making changes.\n\n### Step 4: Update Version References\n\nAfter the user confirms the bump, update exactly two locations:\n\n#### 1. `package.json` &mdash; `version` field\n\nUpdate the `\"version\"` field to the new semver string (without the `v` prefix):\n\n```json\n\"version\": \"X.Y.Z\"\n```\n\n#### 2. `src/cryptfolio.gs` &mdash; `VERSION` constant\n\nThe `VERSION` constant near line 13 is a monotonically incrementing integer string used by Google Apps Script for library deployment. Increment it by 1 from the current value:\n\n```js\nconst VERSION = \"N\";  // increment N by 1\n```\n\nThis is **not** the semver version. It is a separate deployment counter that always increments by exactly 1 regardless of the semver bump type.\n\n### Step 5: Summary\n\nAfter updating, display a summary:\n\n```\nVersion bump: vOLD -> vNEW\n  package.json:       \"OLD\" -> \"NEW\"\n  src/cryptfolio.gs:  VERSION \"N\" -> \"N+1\"\n```\n\nDo **not** create a git tag or commit. The user handles that separately.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:26:21.822Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Version Control Agents needing automated semantic versioning updates.","zh":"非常适合需要自动化语义版本更新的版本控制代理。","ja":"バージョン管理エージェントが自動的なセマンティックバージョニングの更新を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"자동화된 의미 버전 업데이트가 필요한 버전 제어 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de control de versión que necesitan actualizaciones de versionado semántico automatizado.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de contrôle de version nécessitant des mises à jour de versionnage sémantique automatisées.","de":"Perfekt für Version Control Agents, die automatisierte semantische Versionierungsaufgaben benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Controle de Versão que precisam de atualizações de versionamento semântico automatizadas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов контроля версий, которым требуются автоматические обновления семантического версионирования.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التحكم في الإصدارات الذي يحتاج إلى تحديثات الإصدارات الدلالية الآلية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to analyze Git commit logs and diffs, determining the correct semver bump and updating version references in the codebase using Git tags and semantic versioning protocols.","zh":"赋予代理分析 Git 提交日志和差异，确定正确的 semver 跳转并使用 Git 标签和语义版本协议更新代码库中的版本引用。","ja":"エージェントが Git コミットログと差分を分析し、正しい semver バンプを決定し、Git タグとセマンティックバージョニングプロトコルを使用してコードベースのバージョン参照を更新する機能を提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 Git 커밋 로그와 차이를 분석하여 올바른 semver 버мп를 결정하고 Git 태그 및 의미 버전 프로토콜을 사용하여 코드베이스의 버전 참조를 업데이트하는 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a analizar los registros de confirmación de Git y las diferencias, determinando el aumento de semver correcto y actualizando las referencias de versión en el código base utilizando etiquetas de Git y protocolos de versionado semántico.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''analyser les journaux de validation Git et les différences, déterminant le bon incrément de semver et mettant à jour les références de version dans le codebase à l''aide de balises Git et de protocoles de versionnage sémantique.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Git-Commit-Logs und -Diffs zu analysieren, den richtigen semver-Sprung zu bestimmen und Versionsverweise im Codebase mithilfe von Git-Tags und semantischen Versionierungsprotokollen zu aktualisieren.","pt":"Permite que os agentes analisem os logs e difs de commit do Git, determinando o aumento de semver correto e atualizando as referências de versão no código-fonte usando tags do Git e protocolos de versionamento semântico.","ru":"Позволяет агентам анализировать журналы и различия коммитов Git, определяя правильное увеличение semver и обновляя ссылки на версию в кодовой базе с помощью тегов Git и протоколов семантического версионирования.","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء تحليل سجلات Commit وفرق Git ، وتحديد زيادة semver الصحيحة وتحديث مراجع الإصدار في قاعدة الشفرة باستخدام علامات Git وبروتوكولات الإصدار الدلالي."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating version updates after code changes","Analyzing commit history for versioning decisions","Updating version references in codebases"],"zh":["代码更改后自动更新版本","分析提交历史以进行版本决策","更新代码库中的版本引用"],"ja":["コードの変更後バージョンを自動更新する","バージョン決定のためにコミット履歴を分析する","コードベースのバージョン参照を更新する"],"ko":["코드 변경 후 버전 자동 업데이트하기","버전 결정에 대한 커밋 기록 분석하기","코드베이스의 버전 참조 업데이트하기"],"es":["Automatizar las actualizaciones de versión después de los cambios de código","Analizar el historial de confirmaciones para la toma de decisiones de versionado","Actualizar las referencias de versión en los codebases"],"fr":["Automatiser les mises à jour de version après les modifications de code","Analyser l''historique des validations pour les décisions de versionnage","Mettre à jour les références de version dans les codebases"],"de":["Automatisierung von Versionsaktualisierungen nach Codeänderungen","Analyse des Commit-Historie für Versionsentscheidungen","Aktualisierung von Versionsverweisen in Codebases"],"pt":["Automatizar atualizações de versão após alterações de código","Analizar histórico de commit para decisões de versionamento","Atualizar referências de versão em código-fonte"],"ru":["Автоматизация обновлений версий после изменений кода","Анализ истории коммитов для принятия решений о версионировании","Обновление ссылок на версию в кодовой базе"],"ar":["توفير تحديثات الإصدار بعد تغييرات الشفرة","تحليل تاريخ Commit لاتخاذ قرارات الإصدار","تحديث مراجع الإصدار في قاعدة الشفرة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Git repository access","Semantic versioning format compliance (MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH)"],"zh":["需要 Git 存储库访问","遵守语义版本格式（MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH）"],"ja":["Git リポジトリへのアクセスが必要","セマンティックバージョニング形式（MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH）に準拠"],"ko":["Git 저장소 액세스가 필요함","의미 버전 형식 준수（MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH）"],"es":["Requiere acceso al repositorio de Git","Cumplimiento del formato de versionado semántico (MAYOR.MENOR.PARCHES)"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au référentiel Git","Conformité au format de versionnage sémantique (MAJEUR.MINEUR.CORRECTION)"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf das Git-Repository","Einhaltung des semantischen Versionierungsformats (MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH)"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao repositório Git","Conformidade com o formato de versionamento semântico (MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH)"],"ru":["Требуется доступ к репозиторию Git","Соответствие формату семантического версионирования (MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH)"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى مستودع Git","امتثال لتنسيق الإصدار الدلالي (MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH)"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"61a57af2abae43367af1ac80f8e66f183f50ee5e6b232d57c85b77aa9549e25a","qualityScore":41}');
