rdad global","alternativas a herramientas de cálculo de jabones","herramientas de cálculo de jabones vs competidores","instalación de herramientas de seguridad de verdad global","guía de configuración de herramientas de inteligencia artificial","mejora de la calidad de los jabones","análisis de datos para la fabricación de jabones","soluciones de inteligencia artificial para la industria de la cosmética"],"fr":["comment utiliser les outils d''intelligence artificielle","qu''est-ce que la sécurité de vérité globale","alternatives aux outils de calcul de savons","outils de calcul de savons vs concurrents","installation des outils de sécurité de vérité globale","guide de configuration des outils d''intelligence artificielle","amélioration de la qualité des savons","analyse de données pour la fabrication de savons","solutions d''intelligence artificielle pour l''industrie cosmétique"],"de":["wie man KI-Tools verwendet","was ist Global Truth Safety","Alternativen zu Seifenberechnungstools","Seifenberechnungstools vs Wettbewerber","Installation von Global Truth Safety Tools","Einrichtungsanleitung für KI-Tools","Verbesserung der Seifenqualität","Datenanalyse für die Seifenherstellung","KI-Lösungen für die Kosmetikindustrie"],"pt":["ferramentas de IA","calculadora de sabão","otimização da qualidade","aditivos para sabão","tecnologia de IA para produtos","como usar calculadora de sabão","melhores práticas para sabão","alternativas para calculadora de sabão"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты","калькулятор мыла","оптимизация качества","добавки для мыла","технология ИИ для продуктов","как использовать калькулятор мыла","лучшие практики для мыла","альтернативы для калькулятора мыла"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","حاسبة الصابون","تحسين الجودة","إضافات للصابون","تكنولوجيا الذكاء الاصطناعي للمنتجات","كيفية استخدام حاسبة الصابون","أفضل الممارسات للصابون","بديلات لحاسبة الصابون"]}},"owner":"grimmolf","repo":"mga-soap-calculator","repoPath":"grimmolf/mga-soap-calculator","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.940Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"Global Truth Safety","description":"Practice radical candor by delivering only verified, tested code with data-backed decisions, immediate problem flagging, and honest status communication. Use this skill when making claims about code behavior, reporting system status, identifying risks, documenting missing coverage, or challenging assumptions. Applies to all development activities requiring factual accuracy, evidence-based assertions, gap ownership, and closing the loop on delivered work through validation and independent review.","bodyPreview":"# Global Truth Safety\n\n## When to use this skill\n\n- When delivering code, tests, or operational changes and ensuring they are real, running, and verified\n- When communicating facts about system behavior that you have personally observed or tested\n- When surfacing blockers, regressions, risks, or problems immediately upon discovery\n- When making technical assertions and linking them to logs, test output, benchmarks, or specs\n- When discovering missing test coverage, flaky tests, or undocumented b","body":"# Global Truth Safety\n\n## When to use this skill\n\n- When delivering code, tests, or operational changes and ensuring they are real, running, and verified\n- When communicating facts about system behavior that you have personally observed or tested\n- When surfacing blockers, regressions, risks, or problems immediately upon discovery\n- When making technical assertions and linking them to logs, test output, benchmarks, or specs\n- When discovering missing test coverage, flaky tests, or undocumented behavior requiring documentation\n- When questioning requirements, dependencies, or implementations based on contradictory evidence\n- When reporting project status, timelines, or completion estimates with verified data\n- When writing documentation or comments that must be factually accurate and verifiable\n- When validating delivered work personally and requesting independent review when appropriate\n- When summarizing what was proven versus what remains uncertain after completing work\n- When avoiding unverified claims, guesses, or \"probably fine\" statements about code behavior\n- When owning identified gaps by documenting them and creating tasks before moving forward\n- When practicing intellectual honesty and saying \"I don''t know\" when uncertain\n\n# Global Truth Safety\n\nThis Skill provides Claude Code with specific guidance on how to adhere to coding standards as they relate to how it should handle global truth safety.\n\n## Instructions\n\nFor details, refer to the information provided in this file:\n[global truth safety](../../../agent-os/standards/global/truth-safety.md)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:38:31.996Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Code Review Agents requiring rigorous verification and validation of system behavior","zh":"适用于需要严格验证和验证系统行为的代码审查代理的理想选择","ja":"システムの動作の厳密な検証と検証を必要とするコードレビューエージェントに最適","ko":"시스템 동작에 대한 엄격한 검증 및 확인이 필요한 코드 리뷰 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para Code Review Agents que requieren verificación y validación rigurosas del comportamiento del sistema","fr":"Idéal pour les Code Review Agents nécessitant une vérification et une validation rigoureuses du comportement du système","de":"Ideal für Code Review Agents, die eine strenge Überprüfung und Validierung des Systemverhaltens erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Revisão de Código que exigem verificação e validação rigorosas do comportamento do sistema","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов проверки кода, требующих тщательной верификации и валидации поведения системы","ar":"مثالي لعميل مراجعة الشفرة الذي يتطلب التحقق والتحقق الصارم من سلوك النظام"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to ensure code reliability by linking technical assertions to logs, test output, benchmarks, or specs, thereby enhancing Global Truth Safety through real-time verification and validation of operational changes","zh":"通过将技术断言链接到日志、测试输出、基准或规格，增强全局真实性安全，实时验证和验证操作更改，从而赋予代理确保代码可靠性的能力","ja":"技術的主張をログ、テスト出力、ベンチマーク、または仕様にリンクすることで、グローバル・トゥルース・セーフティを強化し、リアルタイムで操作の変更を検証および検証することで、コードの信頼性を確保するエージェントの能力を付与する","ko":"기술적断언을 로그, 테스트 출력, 벤치마크 또는 규격에 연결하여 글로벌 트루스 세이프티를 강화하고 실시간으로 운영 변경을 검증 및 확인함으로써 코드의 신뢰성을 보장하는 에이전트의 능력을 부여","es":"Empodera a los agentes para garantizar la confiabilidad del código al vincular afirmaciones técnicas con logs, test de salida, benchmarks o especificaciones, mejorando así la Global Truth Safety a través de la verificación y validación en tiempo real de los cambios operativos","fr":"Empodera les agents pour garantir la fiabilité du code en reliant les affirmations techniques aux logs, test de sortie, benchmarks ou spécifications, améliorant ainsi la Global Truth Safety à travers la vérification et la validation en temps réel des changements opérationnels","de":"Empodera los agentes para garantizar la confiabilidad del código al vincular afirmaciones técnicas con logs, test de salida, benchmarks o especificaciones, mejorando así la Global Truth Safety a través de la verificación y validación en tiempo real de los cambios operativos","pt":"Habilita os agentes a garantir a confiabilidade do código, vinculando asserções técnicas a logs, saída de teste, benchmarks ou especificações, melhorando assim a Segurança da Verdade Global por meio da verificação e validação em tempo real das alterações operacionais","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обеспечить надежность кода, связывая технические утверждения с журналами, выходными данными тестов, эталонами или спецификациями, тем самым повышая Глобальную Безопасность Истины за счет реального времени верификации и валидации операционных изменений","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على ضمان موثوقية الشفرة من خلال ربط الافتراضات الفنية بالسجلات وخرج الاختبار والأدلة أو المواصفات، وبالتالي تعزيز سلامة الحقيقة العالمية من خلال التحقق والتحقق في الوقت الفعلي للتغييرات التشغيلية"},"useCases":{"en":["Verifying code changes against system specifications","Surfacing blockers and regressions immediately upon discovery","Validating test coverage and identifying flaky tests"],"zh":["验证代码更改是否符合系统规格","立即发现阻塞器和回归","验证测试覆盖率并识别不稳定的测试"],"ja":["コード変更をシステム仕様に対して検証する","ブロッッカーとリグレッションをすぐに発見する","テストカバレッジを検証し、不安定なテストを特定する"],"ko":["코드 변경을 시스템 사양에 대해 검증","블로커와 회귀를 즉시 발견","테스트 커버리지 확인 및 불안정한 테스트 식별"],"es":["Verificar cambios de código contra las especificaciones del sistema","Mostrar bloqueadores y regresiones inmediatamente después de su descubrimiento","Validar la cobertura de test e identificar pruebas flaky"],"fr":["Verificar les changements de code contre les spécifications du système","Mostrar les bloqueurs et les régressions immédiatement après leur découverte","Valider la couverture de test et identifier les tests flaky"],"de":["Verificar cambios de código contra las especificaciones del sistema","Mostrar bloqueadores y regresiones inmediatamente después de su descubrimiento","Validar la cobertura de test e identificar pruebas flaky"],"pt":["Verificar alterações de código contra especificações do sistema","Expor bloqueadores e regressões imediatamente após a descoberta","Validar cobertura de teste e identificar testes instáveis"],"ru":["Проверка изменений кода против системных спецификаций","Немедленное обнаружение блокировщиков и регрессий","Проверка покрытия тестирования и выявление нестабильных тестов"],"ar":["التحقق من تغييرات الشفرة ضد مواصفات النظام","الكشف الفوري عن الحواجز والانحدارات عند اكتشافها","التحقق من تغطية الاختبار وتحديد الاختبارات غير المستقرة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to system logs and test output","Limited to code review and testing scenarios"],"zh":["需要访问系统日志和测试输出","仅限代码审查和测试场景"],"ja":["システムログとテスト出力へのアクセスが必要","コードレビューとテストシナリオのみ"],"ko":["시스템 로그 및 테스트 출력에 대한 액세스가 필요","코드 리뷰 및 테스트 시나리오만"],"es":["Requiere acceso a los logs del sistema y a la salida de los tests","Limitado a escenarios de revisión y prueba de código"],"fr":["Requiere acceso a los logs del sistema y a la salida de los tests","Limitado a escenarios de revisión y prueba de código"],"de":["Requiere acceso a los logs del sistema y a la salida de los tests","Limitado a escenarios de revisión y prueba de código"],"pt":["Exige acesso a logs do sistema e saída de teste","Limitado a cenários de revisão e teste de código"],"ru":["Требует доступа к системным журналам и выходным данным тестов","Ограничен только сценариями проверки и тестирования кода"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى سجلات النظام وخرج الاختبار","محدود بمواقف مراجعة الشفرة واختبارها"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"2dca6cc7f9d742ba4f95cc2f00a763302b03ae59b23002d7f4783f3450ac3b77","qualityScore":41}');
