on","Creación de aplicaciones de escritorio con Python","Sin experiencia en frontend necesaria","Integración con Flet para aplicaciones en tiempo real"],"fr":["Création d''applications web en temps réel","Développement d''applications mobiles avec Python","Création d''applications de bureau avec Python","Pas d''expérience en frontend requise","Intégration avec Flet pour des applications en temps réel"],"de":["Erstellung von Echtzeit-Web-Anwendungen","Entwicklung von Mobile-Anwendungen mit Python","Erstellung von Desktop-Anwendungen mit Python","Keine Frontend-Erfahrung erforderlich","Integration mit Flet für Echtzeit-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Crie aplicações web, mobile e desktop em tempo real","Não requer experiência em frontend","Desenvolva em Python","Integração fácil com outras ferramentas","Suporte a aplicações em tempo real"],"ru":["Создавайте реальные веб-, мобильные и настольные приложения","Не требует опыта в frontend","Разрабатывайте на Python","Легкая интеграция с другими инструментами","Поддержка реальных приложений"],"ar":["إنشاء تطبيقات ويب و 移动 و سطح المكتب في الوقت الفعلي","لا يتطلب خبرة في الواجهة الأمامية","تطوير باستخدام Python","التكامل السهل مع أدوات أخرى","دعم التطبيقات في الوقت الفعلي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Flet扩展","AI智能工具","实时应用","Python开发","无需前端经验","如何使用Flet","Flet扩展安装","Flet扩展设置指南"],"ja":["Flet拡張機能","AIエージェント","リアルタイムアプリ","Python開発","フロントエンドの経験不要","Flet拡張機能の使用方法","Flet拡張機能のインストール","Flet拡張機能の設定ガイド"],"ko":["Flet 확장 기능","AI 에이전트","실시간 애플리케이션","Python 개발","프론트엔드 경험 필요 없음","Flet 확장 기능 사용 방법","Flet 확장 기능 설치","Flet 확장 기능 설정 가이드"],"es":["herramientas de IA","implementación de Flet","creación de aplicaciones en tiempo real","desarrollo de aplicaciones móviles con Python","alternativas a Flet","guía de instalación de Flet","configuración de Flet"],"fr":["outils d''IA","mise en œuvre de Flet","création d''applications en temps réel","développement d''applications mobiles avec Python","alternatives à Flet","guide d''installation de Flet","configuration de Flet"],"de":["KI-Tools","Implementierung der Flet-Erweiterung","Erstellung von Echtzeit-Anwendungen","Entwicklung von Mobile-Anwendungen mit Python","Alternativen zu Flet","Installationsanleitung für Flet","Einrichtung von Flet"],"pt":["como usar Flet","o que é Flet","Flet vs React","Flet alternative","instalar Flet","guia de configuração Flet","desenvolvimento de aplicações em tempo real","ferramentas de IA para desenvolvedores"],"ru":["как использовать Flet","что такое Flet","Flet vs React","альтернатива Flet","установить Flet","руководство по настройке Flet","разработка реальных приложений","инструменты ИИ для разработчиков"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام Flet","ما هو Flet","Flet مقابل React","بديل Flet","تثبيت Flet","دليل إعداد Flet","تطوير التطبيقات في الوقت الفعلي","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين"]}},"owner":"flet-dev","repo":"flet","repoPath":"flet-dev/flet","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.956Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"implement-flet-extension","description":"Implement a new Flet extension/control that wraps a third-party Flutter package end-to-end, including dependency selection, version pinning, compatibility checks, Python/Flutter integration, docs, examples, tests, and CI updates. Use when adding any flet_* package backed by an external pub.dev package.","bodyPreview":"Implement a Flet extension around an external Flutter package using existing `flet_*` packages as implementation templates.\n\n## Inputs\n\n- Control/service name and Python package name (`flet_<extension>`).\n- Target pub.dev package and intended version/range.\n- API surface to expose in Python (properties, methods, events, types/enums).\n\n## Third-party Dependency Gate\n\n1. Confirm package health: maintenance activity, null-safety, platform support, and open issue risk.\n2. Confirm license is compatib","body":"Implement a Flet extension around an external Flutter package using existing `flet_*` packages as implementation templates.\n\n## Inputs\n\n- Control/service name and Python package name (`flet_<extension>`).\n- Target pub.dev package and intended version/range.\n- API surface to expose in Python (properties, methods, events, types/enums).\n\n## Third-party Dependency Gate\n\n1. Confirm package health: maintenance activity, null-safety, platform support, and open issue risk.\n2. Confirm license is compatible with Flet distribution.\n3. Select a conservative version strategy:\n- Pin exact version when behavior stability is critical.\n- Use bounded ranges when required by ecosystem constraints.\n4. Record key constraints and reasons in PR notes/commit message.\n\n## Control/Service Classification\n\n- Classify wrapped functionality before implementation:\n1. `LayoutControl` for visual controls that participate in page/layout positioning.\n2. Base `Control` for simple visual controls that do not require page positioning or define their own positioning rules/props (for example `Draggable`, `Divider`, `MenuBar`, `NavigationRail`).\n3. Non-visual Service when functionality is not a renderable UI control.\n- Inspect the wrapped Flutter package API to determine whether it includes non-visual/service functionality.\n- For service patterns, follow existing extension examples: `sdk/python/packages/flet-audio`, `sdk/python/packages/flet-flashlight`, `sdk/python/packages/flet-secure-storage`.\n\n## API Mapping Rules\n\n- Expose only stable and useful features first; avoid mirroring every upstream option.\n- Keep Python API idiomatic and concise; avoid redundant control-name prefixes.\n- Map upstream naming inconsistencies to Flet conventions when needed.\n- Add custom enums/types only when they improve correctness and discoverability.\n\n## Python-side Rules\n\n- Use `LayoutControl`, base `Control`, or Service base class according to classification.\n- Implement typed properties, methods, and events exactly for chosen public API.\n- Reuse existing serialization/event patterns from sibling controls/services.\n\n## Flutter-side Rules\n\n- Use `parseEnum()` for enums.\n- For control attributes, prefer `widget.control.getBool()/getDouble()/...` accessors.\n- For non-control parsing, use shared `parseSomething()` helpers.\n- Do not add one-off private parser utilities when standard helpers exist.\n- Put control-specific helpers in `utils/<control>.dart`; shared helpers in `utils/<topic>.dart`.\n- Prefer `parse`-prefixed helper names when converting input to Flutter structures.\n- Avoid single-use local variables.\n\n## Integration Checklist\n\n- Add dependency and registration to Flet client app.\n- Add extension package to `sdk/python/pyproject.toml`.\n- Add extension to `sdk/python/packages/flet/pyproject.toml`.\n- Add extension to `sdk/python/examples/apps/flet_build_test/pyproject.toml`.\n- Add extension to `.github/workflows/ci.yml` in both places:\n  - `build_flet_extensions` -> `PACKAGES` list.\n  - `py_publish` -> `for pkg in ...` publish loop.\n- Add `.gitignore` to Flutter extension project if missing.\n\n## Docs, Examples, Tests\n\n- Add control/service docs under `sdk/python/packages/flet/docs/<name>`.\n- Add all custom enums/types docs and update `sdk/python/packages/flet/mkdocs.yml` navigation.\n- Use markdown filenames without underscores (`codeeditor.md`, not `code_editor.md`).\n- Add examples under `sdk/python/examples` in the appropriate category for control vs service.\n- Add integration tests under `packages/flet/integration_tests` in the appropriate category for control vs service.\n- Ensure generated screenshots are suitable for docs usage when visual examples are added.\n\n## Upgrade and Compatibility Guardrails\n\n- Add at least one test that catches upstream behavioral changes likely to break wrapper mapping.\n- Avoid exposing experimental upstream APIs unless explicitly requested.\n- Keep wrapper surface narrow enough to maintain backwards compatibility across upstream updates.\n\n## Validation\n\n- Run relevant Python and integration tests for touched areas.\n- Verify Python import paths, client runtime registration, and docs navigation.\n- Verify dependency resolution and lockfile updates are intentional.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:46:32.953Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Python Development Agents needing to build realtime web, mobile, and desktop apps with Flet extensions","zh":"非常适合需要构建实时Web、移动和桌面应用程序的Python开发代理，使用Flet扩展","ja":"Python開発エージェントがFlet拡張機能を使用してリアルタイムWeb、モバイル、デスクトップアプリを構築するのに最適","ko":"Flet 확장을 사용하여 실시간 웹, 모바일, 데스크톱 앱을 구축해야 하는 Python 개발 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo de Python que necesitan crear aplicaciones web, móviles y de escritorio en tiempo real con extensiones de Flet","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement Python qui ont besoin de créer des applications web, mobiles et de bureau en temps réel avec des extensions Flet","de":"Perfekt für Python-Entwicklungsagenten, die Echtzeit-Web-, Mobile- und Desktop-Apps mit Flet-Erweiterungen erstellen müssen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Python que precisam criar aplicativos web, móveis e de área de trabalho em tempo real com extensões Flet","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки Python, которым необходимо создавать веб-, мобильные и настольные приложения в реальном времени с помощью расширений Flet","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الناشئين بالبايثون الذين يحتاجون إلى بناء تطبيقات ويب و移动 و سطح مكتب في الوقت الفعلي مع ملحقات Flet"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create custom Flet extensions around external Flutter packages, exposing API surfaces in Python and leveraging existing `flet_*` packages as templates, while ensuring package health and license compatibility","zh":"使代理能够创建外部Flutter包的自定义Flet扩展，暴露Python中的API表面，并利用现有的`flet_*`包作为模板，同时确保包的健康和许可兼容性","ja":"エージェントが外部のFlutterパッケージのカスタムFlet拡張機能を作成できるようにし、PythonでAPIサーフェスを公開し、既存の`flet_*`パッケージをテンプレートとして利用しながら、パッケージのヘルスとライセンスの互換性を確保する","ko":"에이전트가 외부 Flutter 패키지의 사용자 정의 Flet 확장을 만들 수 있도록 하여 Python에서 API 표면을 노출하고 기존의 `flet_*` 패키지를 템플릿으로 사용하면서 패키지의 건강과 라이선스 호환성을 보장","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear extensiones de Flet personalizadas alrededor de paquetes de Flutter externos, exponiendo superficies de API en Python y aprovechando los paquetes existentes `flet_*` como plantillas, asegurando al mismo tiempo la salud y la compatibilidad de licencias del paquete","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des extensions Flet personnalisées autour de packages Flutter externes, en exposant des surfaces d''API en Python et en exploitant les packages existants `flet_*` comme modèles, tout en assurant la santé et la compatibilité des licences du package","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, benutzerdefinierte Flet-Erweiterungen um externe Flutter-Pakete herum zu erstellen, indem API-Oberflächen in Python freigegeben und bestehende `flet_*`-Pakete als Vorlagen genutzt werden, während die Paketgesundheit und Lizenzkompatibilität sichergestellt werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar extensões Flet personalizadas em torno de pacotes Flutter externos, expondo superfícies de API em Python e aproveitando pacotes existentes `flet_*` como modelos, garantindo a saúde e a compatibilidade de licença do pacote","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать пользовательские расширения Flet вокруг внешних пакетов Flutter,开放 API-интерфейсы в Python и использует существующие пакеты `flet_*` в качестве шаблонов, обеспечивая здоровье и совместимость лицензий пакета","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إنشاء ملحقات Flet مخصصة حول حزم Flutter الخارجية ، وإظهار أسطح واجهة برمجة التطبيقات في Python واستخدام الحزم الموجودة `flet_*` كقوالب ، مع ضمان صحة الحزمة وcompatibilidade ترخيص"},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing Flet extensions for third-party Flutter packages","Exposing API surfaces in Python for custom Flet controls","Validating package health and license compatibility for Flet extensions"],"zh":["为第三方Flutter包实现Flet扩展","在Python中为自定义Flet控件暴露API表面","验证Flet扩展的包健康和许可兼容性"],"ja":["サードパーティのFlutterパッケージのためのFlet拡張の実装","カスタムFletコントロールのためのPythonでのAPIサーフェスの公開","Flet拡張のパッケージヘルスとライセンスの互換性の検証"],"ko":["第三자 Flutter 패키지의 Flet 확장 구현","사용자 정의 Flet 컨트롤의 Python에서 API 표면 노출","Flet 확장의 패키지 건강 및 라이선스 호환성 확인"],"es":["Implementar extensiones de Flet para paquetes de Flutter de terceros","Exponer superficies de API en Python para controles de Flet personalizados","Validar la salud y la compatibilidad de licencias del paquete para extensiones de Flet"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre des extensions Flet pour des packages Flutter tiers","Exposer des surfaces d''API en Python pour des contrôles Flet personnalisés","Valider la santé et la compatibilité des licences du package pour les extensions Flet"],"de":["Implementierung von Flet-Erweiterungen für Flutter-Pakete von Drittanbietern","Freigabe von API-Oberflächen in Python für benutzerdefinierte Flet-Steuerungselemente","Überprüfung der Paketgesundheit und Lizenzkompatibilität für Flet-Erweiterungen"],"pt":["Implementação de extensões Flet para pacotes Flutter de terceiros","Exposição de superfícies de API em Python para controles Flet personalizados","Validação da saúde do pacote e da compatibilidade de licença para extensões Flet"],"ru":["Реализация расширений Flet для пакетов Flutter третьих лиц","Открытие API-интерфейсов в Python для пользовательских элементов управления Flet","Проверка здоровья пакета и совместимости лицензий для расширений Flet"],"ar":["تنفيذ ملحقات Flet لحزم Flutter من جهات خارجية","إظهار أسطح واجهة برمجة التطبيقات في Python لعناصر التحكم Flet المخصصة","تحقق من صحة الحزمة وcompatibilidade ترخيص لملحقات Flet"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python and Flet environment","Dependent on package health and maintenance activity of target pub.dev package","Limited to Flet and Flutter ecosystem"],"zh":["需要Python和Flet环境","依赖于目标pub.dev包的包健康和维护活动","仅限于Flet和Flutter生态系统"],"ja":["PythonとFlet環境が必要","対象のpub.devパッケージのパッケージヘルスとメンテナンスアクティビティに依存","FletとFlutterのエコシステムに限定"],"ko":["Python 및 Flet 환경 필요","대상 pub.dev 패키지의 패키지 건강 및 유지 관리 활동에 의존","Flet 및 Flutter 생태계에 한정"],"es":["Requiere un entorno de Python y Flet","Dependiente de la salud y la actividad de mantenimiento del paquete objetivo de pub.dev","Limitado al ecosistema de Flet y Flutter"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Python et Flet","Dépend de la santé et de l''activité de maintenance du package cible de pub.dev","Limité à l''écosystème Flet et Flutter"],"de":["Benötigt eine Python- und Flet-Umgebung","Abhängig von der Paketgesundheit und der Wartungsaktivität des Ziel-Paketes von pub.dev","Begrenzt auf das Flet- und Flutter-Ökosystem"],"pt":["Requer ambiente Python e Flet","Dependente da saúde do pacote e da atividade de manutenção do pacote pub.dev de destino","Limitado ao ecossistema Flet e Flutter"],"ru":["Требует среды Python и Flet","Зависит от здоровья пакета и активности по обслуживанию целевого пакета pub.dev","Ограничен экосистемой Flet и Flutter"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة Python و Flet","يعتمد على صحة الحزمة ونشاط الصيانة للحزمة الهدف pub.dev","محدود بنظام Flet و Flutter"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"d8e77695ce90118a51c5be7399fb767a2b745842f1f665fa10426c74fbf54622","qualityScore":41}');
