وهات تطوير الألعاب","قدرة على العمل مع Claude Code","دعم المطورين لإنشاء ألعاب مخصصة","التكامل مع أدوات تطوير الألعاب الشهيرة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI 智能代理","游戏开发工作流","AI 工具","如何使用 AI 代理","AI 代理团队发布","Claude Code","游戏开发效率","AI 技术"],"ja":["AI エージェント","ゲーム開発ワークフロー","AI ツール","AI エージェントの使い方","AI エージェントを使用したゲーム開発","Claude Code","ゲーム開発効率","AI 技術"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","게임 개발 워크플ロー","AI 도구","AI 에이전트 사용법","AI 에이전트를 사용한 게임 개발","Claude Code","게임 개발 효율성","AI 기술"],"es":["cómo usar agentes de IA","herramientas de agente de IA para desarrolladores","alternativas a Claude Code"," Claude Code vs otros estudios de desarrollo de juegos","guía de instalación de agentes de IA","configuración de habilidades de flujo de trabajo","desarrollo de juegos con agentes de IA","mejora de la eficiencia en el desarrollo de software"],"fr":["comment utiliser des agents IA","outils d''agents IA pour développeurs","alternatives à Claude Code","Claude Code vs autres studios de développement de jeux","guide d''installation des agents IA","configuration des compétences de workflow","développement de jeux avec des agents IA","amélioration de l''efficacité dans le développement de logiciels"],"de":["wie man AI-Agents verwendet","AI-Agenten-Tools für Entwickler","Alternativen zu Claude Code","Claude Code vs andere Spielentwicklungsstudios","Installationsanleitung für AI-Agents","Konfiguration von Workflow-Fähigkeiten","Spielentwicklung mit AI-Agents","Verbesserung der Effizienz in der Softwareentwicklung"],"pt":["como usar agente de ia","o que é agente de ia","ferramentas de agente de ia para desenvolvedores","alternativas ao team-release","team-release vs outros agentes de ia","instalar team-release","guia de configuração do team-release"],"ru":["как использовать ИИ агент","что такое ИИ агент","инструменты ИИ агентов для разработчиков","альтернативы team-release","team-release vs другие ИИ агенты","установить team-release","руководство по настройке team-release"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي","ما هو وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي","أدوات وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي للطورين","بديل team-release","team-release مقابل وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الآخرين","تثبيت team-release","دليل إعداد team-release"]}},"owner":"Donchitos","repo":"Claude-Code-Game-Studios","repoPath":"Donchitos/Claude-Code-Game-Studios","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.097Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"team-release","description":"Orchestrate the release team: coordinates release-manager, qa-lead, devops-engineer, and producer to execute a release from candidate to deployment.","bodyPreview":"When this skill is invoked, orchestrate the release team through a structured pipeline.\n\n**Decision Points:** At each phase transition, use `AskUserQuestion` to present\nthe user with the subagent''s proposals as selectable options. Write the agent''s\nfull analysis in conversation, then capture the decision with concise labels.\nThe user must approve before moving to the next phase.\n\n## Team Composition\n- **release-manager** — Release branch, versioning, changelog, deployment\n- **qa-lead** — Test si","body":"When this skill is invoked, orchestrate the release team through a structured pipeline.\n\n**Decision Points:** At each phase transition, use `AskUserQuestion` to present\nthe user with the subagent''s proposals as selectable options. Write the agent''s\nfull analysis in conversation, then capture the decision with concise labels.\nThe user must approve before moving to the next phase.\n\n## Team Composition\n- **release-manager** — Release branch, versioning, changelog, deployment\n- **qa-lead** — Test sign-off, regression suite, release quality gate\n- **devops-engineer** — Build pipeline, artifacts, deployment automation\n- **producer** — Go/no-go decision, stakeholder communication, scheduling\n\n## How to Delegate\n\nUse the Task tool to spawn each team member as a subagent:\n- `subagent_type: release-manager` — Release branch, versioning, changelog, deployment\n- `subagent_type: qa-lead` — Test sign-off, regression suite, release quality gate\n- `subagent_type: devops-engineer` — Build pipeline, artifacts, deployment automation\n- `subagent_type: producer` — Go/no-go decision, stakeholder communication\n\nAlways provide full context in each agent''s prompt (version number, milestone status, known issues). Launch independent agents in parallel where the pipeline allows it (e.g., Phase 3 agents can run simultaneously).\n\n## Pipeline\n\n### Phase 1: Release Planning\nDelegate to **producer**:\n- Confirm all milestone acceptance criteria are met\n- Identify any scope items deferred from this release\n- Set the target release date and communicate to team\n- Output: release authorization with scope confirmation\n\n### Phase 2: Release Candidate\nDelegate to **release-manager**:\n- Cut release branch from the agreed commit\n- Bump version numbers in all relevant files\n- Generate the release checklist using `/release-checklist`\n- Freeze the branch — no feature changes, bug fixes only\n- Output: release branch name and checklist\n\n### Phase 3: Quality Gate (parallel)\nDelegate in parallel:\n- **qa-lead**: Execute full regression test suite. Test all critical paths. Verify no S1/S2 bugs. Sign off on quality.\n- **devops-engineer**: Build release artifacts for all target platforms. Verify builds are clean and reproducible. Run automated tests in CI.\n\n### Phase 4: Localization and Performance\nDelegate (can run in parallel with Phase 3 if resources available):\n- Verify all strings are translated (delegate to localization-lead if available)\n- Run performance benchmarks against targets (delegate to performance-analyst if available)\n- Output: localization and performance sign-off\n\n### Phase 5: Go/No-Go\nDelegate to **producer**:\n- Collect sign-off from: qa-lead, release-manager, devops-engineer, technical-director\n- Evaluate any open issues — are they blocking or can they ship?\n- Make the go/no-go call\n- Output: release decision with rationale\n\n### Phase 6: Deployment (if GO)\nDelegate to **release-manager** + **devops-engineer**:\n- Tag the release in version control\n- Generate changelog using `/changelog`\n- Deploy to staging for final smoke test\n- Deploy to production\n- Monitor for 48 hours post-release\n\n### Phase 7: Post-Release\n- **release-manager**: Generate release report (what shipped, what was deferred, metrics)\n- **producer**: Update milestone tracking, communicate to stakeholders\n- **qa-lead**: Monitor incoming bug reports for regressions\n- Schedule post-release retrospective if issues occurred\n\n## Output\nA summary report covering: release version, scope, quality gate results, go/no-go decision, deployment status, and monitoring plan.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:32:35.527Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI agents like Claude Code, AutoGPT, and LangChain needing structured team coordination and release management capabilities.","zh":"适用于Claude Code、AutoGPT和LangChain等需要结构化团队协调和发布管理功能的AI代理。","ja":"Claude Code、AutoGPT、LangChainなどの構造化されたチームの調整とリリース管理機能が必要なAIエージェントに適しています。","ko":"클로드 코드, AutoGPT, LangChain 등의 구조화된 팀 조정 및 릴리즈 관리 기능이 필요한 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Claude Code, AutoGPT y LangChain que necesitan capacidades de coordinación de equipo estructurada y gestión de lanzamientos.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA comme Claude Code, AutoGPT et LangChain ayant besoin d''une coordination d''équipe structurée et de capacités de gestion de versions.","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents wie Claude Code, AutoGPT und LangChain, die eine strukturierte Teamkoordination und Release-Management-Funktionen benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Claude Code, AutoGPT e LangChain que necessitam de coordenação de equipe estruturada e capacidades de gerenciamento de lançamento.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, таких как Claude Code, AutoGPT и LangChain, требующих структурированной координации команд и возможностей управления выпусками.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكيين مثل Claude Code و AutoGPT و LangChain الذين يحتاجون إلى تنسيق فريق منظم وقدرات إدارة الإصدار."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to orchestrate release teams through a structured pipeline, utilizing workflow skills and a coordination system, while leveraging AskUserQuestion for decision points and approvals, all within a mirrored real studio hierarchy, incorporating release branch management, versioning, and changelog deployment.","zh":"赋予代理通过结构化管道编排发布团队的能力，利用工作流技能和协调系统，同时利用AskUserQuestion进行决策点和批准，所有这些都在镜像的真实工作室层次结构中，纳入发布分支管理、版本控制和更改日志部署。","ja":"エージェントに、構造化されたパイプラインを通じてリリースチームをオーケストレーションする能力を与え、ワークフロー技能と調整システムを利用し、AskUserQuestionを利用して意思決定ポイントと承認を行い、すべてをミラーされたリアルスタジオの階層構造の中で、リリースブランチ管理、バージョニング、チェンジログのデプロイを含む。","ko":"에이전트가 구조화된 파이프라인을 통해 릴리즈 팀을 오케스트레이션할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, 워크플로우 스킬과 조정 시스템을 활용하고, AskUserQuestion를 통해 의사 결정 지점과 승인을 모두镜像된 실제 스튜디오 계층 구조 내에서 릴리즈 브랜치 관리, 버저닝 및 체인지로그 배포를 포함하여 수행할 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes para orquestar equipos de lanzamiento a través de una canalización estructurada, utilizando habilidades de flujo de trabajo y un sistema de coordinación, mientras aprovecha AskUserQuestion para puntos de decisión y aprobaciones, todo dentro de una jerarquía de estudio real reflejada, incorporando gestión de ramas de lanzamiento, control de versiones y despliegue de registro de cambios.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''orchestrer les équipes de version à travers une canalisation structurée, en utilisant des compétences de flux de travail et un système de coordination, tout en exploitant AskUserQuestion pour les points de décision et les approbations, le tout dans une hiérarchie de studio réel miroir, incorporant la gestion des branches de version, la gestion de versions et le déploiement du journal des modifications.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, Release-Teams über eine strukturierte Pipeline zu orchestrieren, indem sie Workflow-Fähigkeiten und ein Koordinationssystem nutzen und AskUserQuestion für Entscheidungspunkte und Genehmigungen nutzen, all dies innerhalb einer realen Studio-Hierarchie, die Release-Branch-Management, Versionierung und Changelog-Bereitstellung umfasst.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a orquestrar equipes de lançamento por meio de um pipeline estruturado, utilizando habilidades de fluxo de trabalho e um sistema de coordenação, aproveitando AskUserQuestion para pontos de decisão e aprovações, tudo dentro de uma hierarquia de estúdio real espelhada, incorporando gerenciamento de branch de lançamento, versionamento e implantação de changelog.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оркестрировать команды выпуска через структурированный конвейер, используя навыки рабочего процесса и систему координации, а также использует AskUserQuestion для точек принятия решений и утверждений, все это в рамках зеркальной иерархии реального студия, включая управление ветвью выпуска, версионирование и развертывание журнала изменений.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تنسيق فرق الإصدار من خلال خط أنابيب منظم، باستخدام مهارات سير العمل ونظام تنسيق، واستخدام AskUserQuestion لنقاط اتخاذ القرار والموافقات، كل ذلك داخل هرمية استوديو حقيقية معكوسة، وتضم إدارة فرع الإصدار، وتحديد الإصدار، ونشر سجل التغييرات."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating release branch management and versioning","Coordinating quality assurance testing with qa-lead subagents","Streamlining deployment processes through a structured pipeline"],"zh":["自动化发布分支管理和版本控制","协调质量保证测试与qa-lead子代理","通过结构化管道简化部署流程"],"ja":["リリースブランチ管理とバージョニングの自動化","QAリードサブエージェントとの質保証テストの調整","構造化されたパイプラインを通じたデプロイプロセスの簡素化"],"ko":["릴리즈 브랜치 관리 및 버저닝 자동화","QA 리드 서브 에이전트와의 품질 보증 테스트 조정","구조화된 파이프라인을 통한 배포 프로세스 간소화"],"es":["Automatización de la gestión de ramas de lanzamiento y control de versiones","Coordinación de pruebas de aseguramiento de la calidad con subagentes qa-lead","Optimización de los procesos de despliegue a través de una canalización estructurada"],"fr":["Automatisation de la gestion des branches de version et de la version","Coordination des tests de qualité avec des sous-agents qa-lead","Optimisation des processus de déploiement via une canalisation structurée"],"de":["Automatisierung des Release-Branch-Managements und der Versionierung","Koordinierung von Qualitätsprüfungen mit qa-lead-Subagenten","Optimierung der Bereitstellungsprozesse durch eine strukturierte Pipeline"],"pt":["Automatizar gerenciamento de branch de lançamento e versionamento","Coordenar testes de garantia de qualidade com subagentes qa-lead","Otimizar processos de implantação por meio de um pipeline estruturado"],"ru":["Автоматизировать управление ветвью выпуска и версионирование","Координировать тестирование качества с субагентами qa-lead","Оптимизировать процессы развертывания через структурированный конвейер"],"ar":["توفير автоматиّة لإدارة فرع الإصدار وتحديد الإصدار","تنسيق اختبارات ضمان الجودة مع الوكلاء الفرعيين qa-lead","تحسين عمليات النشر من خلال خط أنابيب منظم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires user approval at each phase transition","Dependent on AskUserQuestion functionality for decision points","Mirrors real studio hierarchy, which may require customization for unique team structures"],"zh":["需要在每个阶段转换时获得用户批准","依赖于AskUserQuestion功能进行决策点","镜像实际工作室层次结构，可能需要为独特的团队结构进行自定义"],"ja":["各フェーズの遷移ごとにユーザーの承認が必要","意思決定ポイントでAskUserQuestion機能に依存","実際のスタジオ階層構造をミラー化するため、独自のチーム構造に対してはカスタマイズが必要となる"],"ko":["각 단계 전환 시 사용자 승인이 필요","의사 결정 지점에서 AskUserQuestion 기능에 의존","실제 스튜디오 계층 구조를鏡像화하므로, 고유의 팀 구조에 대해서는 사용자 지정이 필요할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere aprobación del usuario en cada transición de fase","Dependiente de la funcionalidad AskUserQuestion para puntos de decisión","Refleja la jerarquía de estudio real, lo que puede requerir personalización para estructuras de equipo únicas"],"fr":["Nécessite l''approbation de l''utilisateur à chaque transition de phase","Dépend de la fonctionnalité AskUserQuestion pour les points de décision","Reflette la hiérarchie de studio réel, ce qui peut nécessiter une personnalisation pour des structures d''équipe uniques"],"de":["Benötigt Benutzerzustimmung bei jedem Phasenübergang","Hängt von der Funktionalität AskUserQuestion für Entscheidungspunkte ab","Spiegelt die reale Studio-Hierarchie wider, was eine Anpassung für einzigartige Teamstrukturen erfordern kann"],"pt":["Exige aprovação do usuário em cada transição de fase","Depende da funcionalidade AskUserQuestion para pontos de decisão","Espelha a hierarquia de estúdio real, o que pode exigir personalização para estruturas de equipe únicas"],"ru":["Требует утверждения пользователя на каждом этапе перехода","Зависит от функциональности AskUserQuestion для точек принятия решений","Зеркалит реальную иерархию студия, что может потребовать настройки для уникальных структур команд"],"ar":["يتطلب موافقة المستخدم في كل مرحلة انتقالية","يعتمد على وظيفة AskUserQuestion لنقاط اتخاذ القرار","يعكس هرمية الاستوديو الحقيقي، والتي قد تتطلب تخصيصًا للهياكل الفريدة للفريق"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"dd8ccc92195c4e8ecbbea7a3482ae5d8b87ba252f697a84ddff1b015a8225bde","qualityScore":41}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('alekspetrov/navigator/nav-stats', 'community', 'alekspetrov', 'navigator', 'alekspetrov/navigator', 'nav-stats', 0, 0, 41, '2026-03-02T01:56:11.149Z', '2026-03-02T03:45:28.500Z', '534fdddf7028538dba06aebd55a07bf26a7587bc151eb4c4ff8737c19678f3c8', '{"id":"alekspetrov/navigator/nav-stats","name":"nav-stats","description":{"zh":"nav-stats AI智能工具，通过优化会话稳定性，实现会话次数从7次增加到20+，为开发者提供更好的体验","ja":"nav-stats AIエージェントは、会話の安定性を高め、開発者に優れた体験を提供する","ko":"nav-stats AI 에이전트는 세션 안정성을 최적화하여 개발자에게 더好的 경험을 제공합니다","es":"Nav-Stats es una herramienta de AI que permite sesiones más largas y estables, mejorando la experiencia del usuario","fr":"Nav-Stats est un outil d''IA qui permet des sessions plus longues et plus stables, améliorant l''expérience utilisateur","de":"Nav-Stats ist ein KI-Tool, das längere und stabilere Sitzungen ermöglicht und die Benutzererfahrung verbessert","pt":"Nav-Stats é uma ferramenta de IA que aprimora a engenharia de contexto para Claude Code, permitindo sessões mais longas e estáveis","ru":"Nav-Stats - это инструмент ИИ, который улучшает контекстную инженерию для Claude Code, позволяя более длинным и стабильным сессиям","ar":"Nav-Stats هي أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي التي تحسن هندسة السياق ل Claude Code، مما يسمح بالجلسات الأطول والأكثر استقرارا","en":"Finish What You Start — Context engineering for Claude Code.         Sessions last 20+ exchanges instead of crashing at 7."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI智能工具nav-stats：优化会话稳定性","ja":"AIエージェントnav-stats：会話の安定性を高める","ko":"AI 에이전트nav-stats：세션 안정성 최적화","es":"Herramientas de AI: Nav-Stats para Desarrolladores","fr":"Outils d''IA: Nav-Stats pour les Développeurs","de":"KI-Tools: Nav-Stats für Entwickler","pt":"Ferramentas de IA: Nav-Stats para Desenvolvedores","ru":"ИИ Агенты: Nav-Stats для Разработчиков","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: Nav-Stats للdevelopers","en":"nav-stats"},"description":{"zh":"nav-stats AI智能工具，通过优化会话稳定性，实现会话次数从7次增加到20+，为开发者提供更好的体验","ja":"nav-stats AIエージェントは、会話の安定性を高め、開発者に優れた体験を提供する","ko":"nav-stats AI 에이전트는 세션 안정성을 최적화하여 개발자에게 더好的 경험을 제공합니다","es":"Nav-Stats es una herramienta de AI que permite sesiones más largas y estables, mejorando la experiencia del usuario","fr":"Nav-Stats est un outil d''IA qui permet des sessions plus longues et plus stables, améliorant l''expérience utilisateur","de":"Nav-Stats ist ein KI-Tool, das längere und stabilere Sitzungen ermöglicht und die Benutzererfahrung verbessert","pt":"Nav-Stats é uma ferramenta de IA que aprimora a engenharia de contexto para Claude Code, permitindo sessões mais longas e estáveis","ru":"Nav-Stats - это инструмент ИИ, который улучшает контекстную инженерию для Claude Code, позволяя более длинным и стабильным сессиям","ar":"Nav-Stats هي أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي التي تحسن هندسة السياق ل Claude Code، مما يسمح بالجلسات الأطول والأكثر استقرارا","en":"Finish What You Start — Context engineering for Claude Code.         Sessions last 20+ exchanges instead of crashing at 7."},"definition":{"en":"Finish What You Start — Context engineering for Claude Code.         Sessions last 20+ exchanges instead of crashing at 7."},"features":{"zh":["会话次数从7次增加到20+","优化会话稳定性","提高用户体验","适用于Claude Code","支持多轮会话"],"ja":["会話の安定性を高める","会話数を7回から20回以上に増やす","ユーザーエクスペリエンスを向上させる","Claude Codeに対応","マルチラウンド会話をサポート"],"ko":["세션 안정성을 최적화","세션次数를 7회에서 20회 이상으로 증가","사용자 경험을 개선","Claude Code 지원","다중 라운드 세션 지원"],"es":["Sesiones más largas y estables","Ingeniería de contexto para mejorar la experiencia del usuario","Compatibilidad con Claude Code","Mejora de la estabilidad de las sesiones","Soporte para desarrolladores"],"fr":["Sessions plus longues et plus stables","Ingénierie de contexte pour améliorer l''expérience utilisateur","Compatibilité avec Claude Code","Amélioration de la stabilité des sessions","Support pour les développeurs"],"de":["Längere und stabilere Sitzungen","Kontext-Engineering zur Verbesserung der Benutzererfahrung","Kompatibilität mit Claude Code","Verbesserung der Stabilität von Sitzungen","Unterstützung für Entwickler"],"pt":["Melhora a engenharia de contexto para Claude Code","Permite sessões mais longas e estáveis","Compatível com Claude Code","Ferramenta de IA para desenvolvedores","Aumenta a produtividade e a eficiência"],"ru":["Улучшает контекстную инженерию для Claude Code","Позволяет более длинным и стабильным сессиям","Совместим с Claude Code","Инструмент ИИ для разработчиков","Увеличивает производительность и эффективность"],"ar":["تحسن هندسة السياق ل Claude Code","السماح بالجلسات الأطول والأكثر استقرارا","متوافق مع Claude Code","أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي للdeveloppers","زيادة الإنتاجية والكفاءة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能工具","nav-stats","会话稳定性","Claude Code","会话次数优化","用户体验优化","AI工具安装","nav-stats设置指南"],"ja":["AIエージェント","nav-stats","会話の安定性","Claude Code","会話数の最適化","ユーザーエクスペリエンスの最適化","AIエージェントのインストール","nav-statsの設定ガイド"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","nav-stats","세션 안정성","Claude Code","세션次数 최적화","사용자 경험 최적화","AI 에이전트 설치","nav-stats 설정 가이드"],"es":["herramientas de AI","Nav-Stats","Claude Code","ingeniería de contexto","sesiones más largas","estabilidad de sesiones","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo","IA para desarrolladores"],"fr":["outils d''IA","Nav-Stats","Claude Code","ingénierie de contexte","sessions plus longues","stabilité des sessions","développement de logiciels","outils de développement","IA pour les développeurs"],"de":["KI-Tools","Nav-Stats","Claude Code","Kontext-Engineering","längere Sitzungen","Stabilität von Sitzungen","Software-Entwicklung","Entwickler-Tools","KI für Entwickler"],"pt":["como usar Nav-Stats","o que é Nav-Stats","Nav-Stats alternative","Nav-Stats vs Claude Code","instalar Nav-Stats","guia de configuração do Nav-Stats","desenvolvimento de IA","ferramentas de IA para desenvolvedores"],"ru":["как использовать Nav-Stats","что такое Nav-Stats","Nav-Stats альтернатива","Nav-Stats vs Claude Code","установить Nav-Stats","руководство по настройке Nav-Stats","разработка ИИ","инструменты ИИ для разработчиков"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام Nav-Stats","ما هي Nav-Stats","بديل Nav-Stats","Nav-Stats مقابل Claude Code","تثبيت Nav-Stats","دليل إعداد Nav-Stats","تطوير الذكاء الاصطناعي","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للdeveloppers"]}},"owner":"alekspetrov","repo":"navigator","repoPath":"alekspetrov/navigator","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.149Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"nav-stats","description":"Display session efficiency report showing token savings, cache performance, and optimization recommendations. Use when user asks show my stats, how efficient am I?, show session metrics, or wants to see Navigators impact.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Navigator Session Statistics Skill\n\nShow real-time efficiency reporting with baseline comparisons, making Navigator''s value quantifiable and shareable.\n\n## When to Invoke\n\nInvoke this skill when the user:\n- Says \"show my stats\", \"show session stats\", \"show metrics\"\n- Asks \"how efficient am I?\", \"how much did I save?\"\n- Says \"show my Navigator report\", \"efficiency report\"\n- Wants to see token savings or session performance\n- Says \"show impact\", \"prove Navigator works\"\n\n**DO NOT invoke** if:\n- U","body":"# Navigator Session Statistics Skill\n\nShow real-time efficiency reporting with baseline comparisons, making Navigator''s value quantifiable and shareable.\n\n## When to Invoke\n\nInvoke this skill when the user:\n- Says \"show my stats\", \"show session stats\", \"show metrics\"\n- Asks \"how efficient am I?\", \"how much did I save?\"\n- Says \"show my Navigator report\", \"efficiency report\"\n- Wants to see token savings or session performance\n- Says \"show impact\", \"prove Navigator works\"\n\n**DO NOT invoke** if:\n- User just started session (< 5 messages)\n- Navigator not initialized in project\n- User asking about specific metrics only (answer directly)\n\n## Execution Steps\n\n### Step 1: Check Navigator Initialized\n\nVerify Navigator is set up:\n\n```bash\nif [ ! -f \".agent/DEVELOPMENT-README.md\" ]; then\n  echo \"❌ Navigator not initialized in this project\"\n  echo \"Run ''Initialize Navigator'' first\"\n  exit 1\nfi\n```\n\n### Step 2: Run Enhanced Session Stats\n\nExecute the enhanced session statistics script:\n\n```bash\n# Check if enhanced script exists\nif [ ! -f \"scripts/session-stats.sh\" ]; then\n  echo \"❌ Session stats script not found\"\n  echo \"This feature requires Navigator v3.5.0+\"\n  exit 1\nfi\n\n# Run stats script\nbash scripts/session-stats.sh\n```\n\nThis script outputs shell-parseable variables:\n- `BASELINE_TOKENS` - Total size of all .agent/ docs\n- `LOADED_TOKENS` - Actually loaded in session (estimated)\n- `TOKENS_SAVED` - Difference\n- `SAVINGS_PERCENT` - Percentage saved\n- `EFFICIENCY_SCORE` - 0-100 score\n- `CACHE_EFFICIENCY` - From OpenTelemetry\n- `CONTEXT_USAGE_PERCENT` - Estimated context fill\n- `TIME_SAVED_MINUTES` - Estimated time saved\n\n### Step 3: Calculate Efficiency Score\n\nUse predefined function to calculate score:\n\n```bash\n# Extract metrics from session-stats.sh\nsource <(bash scripts/session-stats.sh)\n\n# Calculate efficiency score using predefined function\nEFFICIENCY_SCORE=$(python3 skills/nav-stats/functions/efficiency_scorer.py \\\n  --tokens-saved-percent ${SAVINGS_PERCENT} \\\n  --cache-efficiency ${CACHE_EFFICIENCY} \\\n  --context-usage ${CONTEXT_USAGE_PERCENT})\n```\n\n### Step 4: Format and Display Report\n\nUse predefined function to format visual report:\n\n```bash\n# Generate formatted report\npython3 skills/nav-stats/functions/report_formatter.py \\\n  --baseline ${BASELINE_TOKENS} \\\n  --loaded ${LOADED_TOKENS} \\\n  --saved ${TOKENS_SAVED} \\\n  --savings-percent ${SAVINGS_PERCENT} \\\n  --cache-efficiency ${CACHE_EFFICIENCY} \\\n  --context-usage ${CONTEXT_USAGE_PERCENT} \\\n  --efficiency-score ${EFFICIENCY_SCORE} \\\n  --time-saved ${TIME_SAVED_MINUTES}\n```\n\n**Output Format**:\n```\n╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗\n║          NAVIGATOR EFFICIENCY REPORT                 ║\n╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝\n\n📊 TOKEN USAGE\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nDocumentation loaded:        12,000 tokens\nBaseline (all docs):        150,000 tokens\nTokens saved:               138,000 tokens (92% ↓)\n\n💾 CACHE PERFORMANCE\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nCache efficiency:              100.0% (perfect)\n\n📈 SESSION METRICS\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nContext usage:                      35% (excellent)\nEfficiency score:                94/100 (excellent)\n\n⏱️  TIME SAVED\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nEstimated time saved:          ~42 minutes\n\n💡 WHAT THIS MEANS\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nNavigator loaded 92% fewer tokens than loading all docs.\nYour context window is 65% available for actual work.\n\n🎯 RECOMMENDATIONS\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n✅ Excellent efficiency - keep using lazy-loading strategy\n✅ Context usage healthy - plenty of room for work\n\nShare your efficiency: Take a screenshot! #ContextEfficiency\n```\n\n### Step 5: Add Context-Specific Recommendations\n\nBased on efficiency score, provide actionable advice:\n\n**If efficiency_score < 70**:\n```\n⚠️  RECOMMENDATIONS\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n⚠️  Token savings below target (70%+)\n→ Check: Are you loading more docs than needed?\n→ Tip: Use navigator to find docs, don''t load all upfront\n\nRead more: .agent/philosophy/CONTEXT-EFFICIENCY.md\n```\n\n**If context_usage > 80%**:\n```\n⚠️  RECOMMENDATIONS\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n⚠️  Context usage high (80%+)\n→ Consider: Create context marker and compact\n→ Tip: Compact after completing sub-tasks\n\nRead more: .agent/philosophy/ANTI-PATTERNS.md\n```\n\n**If cache_efficiency < 80%**:\n```\n⚠️  RECOMMENDATIONS\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n⚠️  Cache efficiency low (<80%)\n→ Check: CLAUDE.md properly configured?\n→ Tip: Ensure prompt caching enabled\n\nRead more: .agent/philosophy/PATTERNS.md (Caching pattern)\n```\n\n## Predefined Functions\n\n### `efficiency_scorer.py`\n\nCalculate Navigator efficiency score (0-100) based on:\n- Token savings (40 points)\n- Cache efficiency (30 points)\n- Context usage (30 points)\n\n**Usage**:\n```bash\npython3 skills/nav-stats/functions/efficiency_scorer.py \\\n  --tokens-saved-percent 92 \\\n  --cache-efficiency 100 \\\n  --context-usage 35\n```\n\n**Output**: `94` (integer score)\n\n### `report_formatter.py`\n\nFormat efficiency metrics into visual, shareable report.\n\n**Usage**:\n```bash\npython3 skills/nav-stats/functions/report_formatter.py \\\n  --baseline 150000 \\\n  --loaded 12000 \\\n  --saved 138000 \\\n  --savings-percent 92 \\\n  --cache-efficiency 100 \\\n  --context-usage 35 \\\n  --efficiency-score 94 \\\n  --time-saved 42\n```\n\n**Output**: Formatted ASCII report (see Step 4)\n\n## Philosophy Integration\n\n**Context Engineering Principle**: Measurement validates optimization\n\nFrom `.agent/philosophy/PATTERNS.md`:\n> \"Measure to validate. Navigator tracks real metrics, not estimates.\"\n\nThis skill proves:\n- **Token savings** are real (baseline comparison)\n- **Cache efficiency** works (OpenTelemetry data)\n- **Context usage** is healthy (window not overloaded)\n- **Time saved** is quantifiable (6s per 1k tokens)\n\n## User Experience\n\n**User says**: \"Show my stats\"\n\n**Skill displays**:\n1. Visual efficiency report\n2. Clear metrics (tokens, cache, context)\n3. Interpretation (\"What this means\")\n4. Actionable recommendations\n\n**User can**:\n- Screenshot and share (#ContextEfficiency)\n- Understand Navigator''s impact\n- Optimize workflow based on recommendations\n- Validate context engineering principles\n\n## Example Output Scenarios\n\n### Scenario 1: Excellent Efficiency (Score 94)\n\nUser following lazy-loading pattern, cache working perfectly:\n- 92% token savings ✅\n- 100% cache efficiency ✅\n- 35% context usage ✅\n- Score: 94/100\n\n**Recommendation**: Keep it up! Share your efficiency.\n\n### Scenario 2: Fair Efficiency (Score 72)\n\nUser loading too many docs upfront:\n- 65% token savings ⚠️\n- 95% cache efficiency ✅\n- 55% context usage ✅\n- Score: 72/100\n\n**Recommendation**: Review lazy-loading strategy. Load docs on-demand.\n\n### Scenario 3: Poor Efficiency (Score 48)\n\nUser not using Navigator patterns:\n- 45% token savings ❌\n- 70% cache efficiency ⚠️\n- 85% context usage ❌\n- Score: 48/100\n\n**Recommendation**: Read philosophy docs. Consider /nav:compact. Review CLAUDE.md.\n\n## Success Metrics\n\n**After using this skill, users should**:\n- Understand their efficiency score\n- See quantified token savings\n- Know what to improve (if anything)\n- Feel motivated to share results\n\n**Long-term impact**:\n- Users screenshot reports and share\n- \"Navigator saved me 138k tokens\" becomes common\n- Efficiency becomes visible, not abstract\n- Continuous improvement through measurement\n\n---\n\n**This skill makes Navigator''s value tangible and shareable.**\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:45:28.500Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Conversational Agents like Claude Code needing real-time efficiency reporting and session statistics analysis.","zh":"非常适合需要实时效率报告和会话统计分析的对话式代理，如Claude Code。","ja":"Claude Codeのようなリアルタイムの効率性レポートとセッション統計分析が必要な会話エージェントに最適です。","ko":"클라우드 코드와 같은 실시간 효율성 보고 및 세션 통계 분석이 필요한 대화형 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Conversacionales como Claude Code que necesitan informes de eficiencia en tiempo real y análisis de estadísticas de sesión.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents Conversationnels comme Claude Code nécessitant des rapports d''efficacité en temps réel et une analyse de statistiques de session.","de":"Perfekt für Conversational Agents wie Claude Code, die Echtzeit-Effizienzberichte und Sitzungsstatistikenanalyse benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de conversação como Claude Code que necessitam de relatórios de eficiência em tempo real e análise de estatísticas de sessão.","ru":"Идеально подходит для разговорных агентов, таких как Claude Code, требующих отчетов о эффективности в реальном времени и анализа статистики сессий.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الحواريين مثل Claude Code الذي يحتاج إلى تقارير عن الكفاءة في الوقت الفعلي وتحليل إحصائيات الجلسة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to provide quantifiable value through baseline comparisons and token savings metrics, utilizing natural language processing to generate shareable Navigator reports and efficiency metrics via protocols like HTTP or WebSocket.","zh":"使代理能够通过基线比较和令牌节省指标提供可量化的价值，利用自然语言处理生成可共享的Navigator报告和通过HTTP或WebSocket等协议的效率指标。","ja":"エージェントがベースライン比較やトークン節約メトリクスを通じて定量化可能な価値を提供できるようにし、自然言語処理を利用して共有可能なNavigatorレポートやHTTPまたはWebSocketなどのプロトコルを介した効率メトリクスを生成します。","ko":"에이전트가 기준선 비교 및 토큰 절약 지표를 통해 정량화 가능한 가치를 제공할 수 있도록 하며, 자연어 처리를 사용하여 공유 가능한 Navigator 보고서 및 HTTP 또는 WebSocket와 같은 프로토콜을 통해 효율성 지표를 생성합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a proporcionar un valor cuantificable a través de comparaciones de referencia y métricas de ahorro de tokens, utilizando el procesamiento de lenguaje natural para generar informes de Navigator compartibles y métricas de eficiencia a través de protocolos como HTTP o WebSocket.","fr":"Permet aux agents de fournir une valeur quantifiable grâce à des comparaisons de référence et des métriques d''économie de jetons, en utilisant le traitement du langage naturel pour générer des rapports de Navigator partageables et des métriques d''efficacité via des protocoles tels que HTTP ou WebSocket.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, einen quantifizierbaren Wert durch Referenzvergleiche und Token-Sparmetriken zu bieten, indem sie die Verarbeitung von natürlicher Sprache nutzen, um teilbare Navigator-Berichte und Effizienzmetriken über Protokolle wie HTTP oder WebSocket zu generieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a fornecer valor quantificável por meio de comparações de linha de base e métricas de economia de tokens, utilizando processamento de linguagem natural para gerar relatórios do Navigator compartilháveis e métricas de eficiência por meio de protocolos como HTTP ou WebSocket.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью предоставлять количественную ценность посредством сравнений базовой линии и метрик экономии токенов, используя обработку естественного языка для генерации отчетов Navigator, которые можно共делить, и метрик эффективности через протоколы, такие как HTTP или WebSocket.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تقديم قيمة قابلة للقياس من خلال مقارنات الخط الأساسي وأرقام توفير الرموز، باستخدام معالجة اللغة الطبيعية لتوليد تقارير Navigator قابلة للمشاركة وأرقام الكفاءة من خلال بروتوكولات مثل HTTP أو WebSocket."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating real-time session performance reports","Calculating token savings for Navigator sessions","Comparing baseline efficiency metrics"],"zh":["生成实时会话性能报告","计算Navigator会话的令牌节省","比较基线效率指标"],"ja":["リアルタイムのセッションパフォーマンスレポートを生成する","Navigatorセッションのトークン節約を計算する","ベースライン効率メトリクスを比較する"],"ko":["실시간 세션 성능 보고서를 생성하는 것","Navigator 세션의 토큰 절약을 계산하는 것","기준선 효율성 지표를 비교하는 것"],"es":["Generación de informes de rendimiento de sesión en tiempo real","Cálculo de ahorro de tokens para sesiones de Navigator","Comparación de métricas de eficiencia de referencia"],"fr":["Génération de rapports de performance de session en temps réel","Calcul de l''économie de jetons pour les sessions de Navigator","Comparaison des métriques d''efficacité de référence"],"de":["Generierung von Echtzeit-Sitzungsleistungsberichten","Berechnung von Token-Einsparungen für Navigator-Sitzungen","Vergleich von Referenz-Effizienzmetriken"],"pt":["Gerar relatórios de desempenho de sessão em tempo real","Calcular economia de tokens para sessões do Navigator","Comparar métricas de eficiência de linha de base"],"ru":["Генерировать отчеты о производительности сессий в реальном времени","Рассчитывать экономию токенов для сессий Navigator","Сравнивать метрики эффективности базовой линии"],"ar":["توليد تقارير أداء الجلسة في الوقت الفعلي","حساب توفير الرموز للجلسات Navigator","مقارنة معايير الكفاءة الأساسية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires integration with Navigator''s context engineering","Limited to text-based input and output"],"zh":["需要与Navigator的上下文工程集成","仅限于基于文本的输入和输出"],"ja":["Navigatorのコンテキストエンジニアリングとの統合が必要","テキストベースの入力と出力のみに限定される"],"ko":["Navigator의 컨텍스트 엔지니어링과 통합해야 함","텍스트 기반 입력 및 출력만으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere integración con la ingeniería de contexto de Navigator","Limitado a entrada y salida de texto"],"fr":["Nécessite une intégration avec l''ingénierie de contexte de Navigator","Limité à l''entrée et à la sortie de texte"],"de":["Erfordert Integration mit der Kontext-Engineering von Navigator","Begrenzt auf textbasierte Eingabe und Ausgabe"],"pt":["Requer integração com a engenharia de contexto do Navigator","Limitado a entrada e saída baseadas em texto"],"ru":["Требует интеграции с контекстной инженерией Navigator","Ограничен вводом и выводом на основе текста"],"ar":["يتطلب التكامل مع هندسة السياق Navigator","محدود بالمدخلات والمخرجات القائمة على النص"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"534fdddf7028538dba06aebd55a07bf26a7587bc151eb4c4ff8737c19678f3c8","qualityScore":41}');
