Prefect CLI ","ja":"Prefect CLI","ko":"Prefect CLI ","es":"La CLI de Prefect se utiliza con el servidor MCP para realizar operaciones de lectura y escritura. Es ideal para desarrolladores que necesitan interactuar co...","fr":"La CLI Prefect est utilisée avec le serveur MCP pour effectuer des opérations de lecture et d''écriture. Elle est idéale pour les développeurs qui ont besoin ...","de":"Die Prefect-CLI wird mit dem MCP-Server verwendet, um Lese- und Schreiboperationen durchzuführen. Sie ist ideal für Entwickler, die den Server programmgesteu...","pt":"A CLI do Prefect é uma ferramenta poderosa para gerenciar fluxos de trabalho e implantações. Ela oferece recursos avançados para desenvolvedores.","ru":"Prefect CLI - это мощный инструмент для управления рабочими процессами и развертываний. Он предлагает расширенные возможности для разработчиков.","ar":"واجهة سطر الأوامر Prefect هي أداة قوية لإدارة تدفقات العمل والتركيبات. وهي توفر ميزات متقدمة للمطورين.","en":"Prefect MCP server"},"definition":{"en":"Prefect MCP server"},"features":{"zh":["Prefect CLI","MCP","JSON","UUID","prefect api"],"ja":["Prefect CLI","MCP","JSON","UUID","prefect api"],"ko":["Prefect CLI","MCP","JSON","UUID","prefect api"],"es":["Soporte para operaciones de lectura y escritura","Uso de la bandera --no-prompt para deshabilitar confirmaciones","Compatibilidad con herramientas MCP para lecturas","Devuelve JSON estructurado con UUID completos","Uso de la CLI para mutaciones en el servidor MCP"],"fr":["Prise en charge des opérations de lecture et d''écriture","Utilisation du drapeau --no-prompt pour désactiver les confirmations","Compatibilité avec les outils MCP pour les lectures","Renvoi de JSON structuré avec des UUID complets","Utilisation de la CLI pour les mutations sur le serveur MCP"],"de":["Unterstützung für Lese- und Schreiboperationen","Verwendung der --no-prompt-Flagge zur Deaktivierung von Bestätigungen","Kompatibilität mit MCP-Tools für Lesevorgänge","Rückgabe von strukturiertem JSON mit vollständigen UUIDs","Verwendung der CLI für Mutationen auf dem MCP-Server"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de fluxos de trabalho","Implantações eficientes","Recursos avançados para desenvolvedores","Suporte a UUIDs completos","Opção --no-prompt para uso não interativo"],"ru":["Управление рабочими процессами","Эффективные развертывания","Расширенные возможности для разработчиков","Поддержка полных UUID","Опция --no-prompt для неинтерактивного использования"],"ar":["إدارة تدفقات العمل","تركيبات فعالة","ميزات متقدمة للمطورين","دعم UUIDs كاملة","خيار --no-prompt للاستخدام غير التفاعلي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Prefect CLI","MCP","JSON","UUID","prefect api","CLI","Agent","Developer"],"ja":["Prefect CLI","MCP","JSON","UUID","prefect api","CLI","Agent","Developer"],"ko":["Prefect CLI","MCP","JSON","UUID","prefect api","CLI","Agent","Developer"],"es":["CLI de Prefect","Servidor MCP","Desarrollo de software","Lectura y escritura de datos","Herramientas de desarrollo","Programación","UUID","JSON","Mutaciones en el servidor"],"fr":["CLI Prefect","Serveur MCP","Développement de logiciels","Lecture et écriture de données","Outils de développement","Programmation","UUID","JSON","Mutations sur le serveur"],"de":["Prefect-CLI","MCP-Server","Software-Entwicklung","Lese- und Schreiboperationen","Entwicklungstools","Programmierung","UUID","JSON","Mutationen auf dem Server"],"pt":["CLI do Prefect","gerenciamento de fluxos de trabalho","implantações eficientes","desenvolvedores","UUIDs completos","opção --no-prompt"],"ru":["Prefect CLI","управление рабочими процессами","эффективные развертывания","разработчики","полные UUID","опция --no-prompt"],"ar":["واجهة سطر الأوامر Prefect","إدارة تدفقات العمل","تركيبات فعالة","مطورين","UUIDs كاملة","خيار --no-prompt"]}},"owner":"PrefectHQ","repo":"prefect-mcp-server","repoPath":"PrefectHQ/prefect-mcp-server","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.877Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"cli","description":"Prefect CLI commands for mutations. The MCP server is read-only - use this skill when you need to trigger deployments, cancel flow runs, create automations, or modify Prefect resources.","bodyPreview":"# Prefect CLI\n\nThe MCP server is read-only. For mutations, use the CLI.\n\n**Prefer MCP tools for reads** (e.g., `get_flow_runs`, `get_deployments`). They return structured JSON with full UUIDs. Use `prefect api` only if MCP doesn''t expose what you need.\n\n## Critical: Agent-Friendly Usage\n\nThe CLI is designed for interactive terminal use. For non-interactive (agent) use:\n\n```bash\n# ALWAYS use --no-prompt as a TOP-LEVEL flag to disable confirmations\nprefect --no-prompt flow-run delete <uuid>\nprefec","body":"# Prefect CLI\n\nThe MCP server is read-only. For mutations, use the CLI.\n\n**Prefer MCP tools for reads** (e.g., `get_flow_runs`, `get_deployments`). They return structured JSON with full UUIDs. Use `prefect api` only if MCP doesn''t expose what you need.\n\n## Critical: Agent-Friendly Usage\n\nThe CLI is designed for interactive terminal use. For non-interactive (agent) use:\n\n```bash\n# ALWAYS use --no-prompt as a TOP-LEVEL flag to disable confirmations\nprefect --no-prompt flow-run delete <uuid>\nprefect --no-prompt deployment delete <name>\n```\n\n### Avoiding Truncated Output\n\nRich table output truncates IDs and names, making them useless. Solutions:\n\n```bash\n# Use `prefect api` for raw JSON (preferred for agents)\nprefect api POST /flow_runs/filter --data ''{\"limit\": 5}''\n\n# Use inspect with -o json for single resources\nprefect flow-run inspect <uuid> -o json\nprefect deployment inspect <name> -o json\n```\n\n### IDs Must Be Complete UUIDs\n\nPartial IDs don''t work. Always get full UUIDs from JSON output:\n\n```bash\n# Get full flow run ID\nprefect api POST /flow_runs/filter --data ''{\"limit\": 1}'' | jq -r ''.[0].id''\n```\n\n## Common Mutations\n\n| Task | Command |\n|------|---------|\n| Trigger deployment | `prefect deployment run ''flow-name/deployment-name''` |\n| Trigger by ID | `prefect deployment run --id <deployment-uuid>` |\n| Cancel flow run | `prefect --no-prompt flow-run cancel <uuid>` |\n| Delete flow run | `prefect --no-prompt flow-run delete <uuid>` |\n| Delete deployment | `prefect --no-prompt deployment delete <name>` |\n\n## Direct API Access\n\n`prefect api` gives full API access with JSON output:\n\n```bash\n# List flow runs (with filters)\nprefect api POST /flow_runs/filter --data ''{\"limit\": 10}''\n\n# Filter by state\nprefect api POST /flow_runs/filter --data ''{\"flow_runs\": {\"state\": {\"type\": {\"any_\": [\"FAILED\"]}}}}''\n\n# Delete a flow run\nprefect api DELETE /flow_runs/<uuid>\n\n# Cancel a flow run\nprefect api POST /flow_runs/<uuid>/set_state --data ''{\"state\": {\"type\": \"CANCELLING\"}}''\n```\n\n## Automation Creation\n\nCreate from JSON string (inline):\n\n```bash\nprefect automation create --from-json ''{\n  \"name\": \"notify-on-failure\",\n  \"trigger\": {\n    \"posture\": \"Reactive\",\n    \"expect\": [\"prefect.flow-run.Failed\"],\n    \"match\": {\"prefect.resource.id\": \"prefect.flow-run.*\"}\n  },\n  \"actions\": [{\"type\": \"send-notification\", ...}]\n}''\n```\n\nOr from file:\n\n```bash\nprefect automation create --from-file automation.yaml\n```\n\nUse `get_automations()` from the MCP server to inspect existing automation schemas.\n\n## Efficient Inspection\n\nThe `get_flow_runs` tool returns summarized data to save tokens:\n- It omits full deployment and work pool schemas.\n- If you see a \"Late\" run or need concurrency details, follow up with:\n  - `get_work_pools(filter={\"name\": ...})`\n  - `get_deployments(filter={\"id\": ...})`\n  - `get_dashboard()`\n\n<!-- ref: https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic-ai/pull/3780 -->\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:07:16.586Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Automation Agents needing to interact with the Prefect MCP server via command-line interface","zh":"非常适合需要通过命令行界面与Prefect MCP服务器交互的自动化代理","ja":"Prefect MCPサーバーとコマンドラインインターフェース経由でやりとりする必要がある自動化エージェントに最適","ko":"Prefect MCP 서버와 명령줄 인터페이스를 통해 상호 작용해야 하는 자동화 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Automatización que necesitan interactuar con el servidor Prefect MCP a través de la interfaz de línea de comandos","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''automatisation qui ont besoin d''interagir avec le serveur Prefect MCP via l''interface de ligne de commande","de":"Perfekt für Automatisierungsagenten, die mit dem Prefect-MCP-Server über die Kommandozeilenoberfläche interagieren müssen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Automação que precisam interagir com o servidor Prefect MCP por meio de interface de linha de comando","ru":"Идеально для агентов автоматизации, которым необходимо взаимодействовать с сервером Prefect MCP через командную строку","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الآليين الذين يحتاجون إلى التفاعل مع خادم Prefect MCP من خلال واجهة سطر الأوامر"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to execute Prefect CLI commands with structured JSON output, utilizing flags like --no-prompt for non-interactive use, and leveraging tools like get_flow_runs and get_deployments for read operations","zh":"赋予代理执行Prefect CLI命令的能力，带有结构化的JSON输出，利用--no-prompt等标志实现非交互式使用，并利用get_flow_runs和get_deployments等工具进行读取操作","ja":"エージェントがPrefect CLIコマンドを実行し、構造化されたJSON出力を利用できるようにし、--no-promptなどのフラグを使用して非対話式で使用し、get_flow_runsやget_deploymentsなどのツールを使用して読み取り操作を実行する","ko":"에이전트가 Prefect CLI 명령을 실행하고 구조화된 JSON 출력을 활용할 수 있도록 하며, --no-prompt와 같은 플래그를 사용하여 비대화식 사용을 가능하게 하고, get_flow_runs 및 get_deployments와 같은 도구를 사용하여 읽기 작업을 수행","es":"Habilita a los agentes a ejecutar comandos de Prefect CLI con salida JSON estructurada, utilizando indicadores como --no-prompt para uso no interactivo, y aprovechando herramientas como get_flow_runs y get_deployments para operaciones de lectura","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter des commandes Prefect CLI avec une sortie JSON structurée, en utilisant des indicateurs tels que --no-prompt pour une utilisation non interactive, et en exploitant des outils tels que get_flow_runs et get_deployments pour les opérations de lecture","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Prefect-CLI-Befehle mit strukturierter JSON-Ausgabe auszuführen, unter Verwendung von Flags wie --no-prompt für nicht-interaktive Verwendung und unter Ausnutzung von Tools wie get_flow_runs und get_deployments für Leseoperationen","pt":"Habilita agentes a executar comandos do Prefect CLI com saída JSON estruturada, utilizando flags como --no-prompt para uso não interativo, e aproveitando ferramentas como get_flow_runs e get_deployments para operações de leitura","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выполнять команды Prefect CLI со структурированным выводом JSON, используя флаги как --no-prompt для неинтерактивного использования, и используя инструменты как get_flow_runs и get_deployments для операций чтения","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من تنفيذ أوامر Prefect CLI مع إخراج JSON منظم، باستخدام أعلام مثل --no-prompt للاستخدام غير التفاعلي، وتوظيف أدوات مثل get_flow_runs و get_deployments للعمليات القرائية"},"useCases":{"en":["Deleting flow runs by UUID","Retrieving deployment information","Automating Prefect workflow management"],"zh":["通过UUID删除流运行","检索部署信息","自动化Prefect工作流管理"],"ja":["UUIDによるフロー実行の削除","デプロイメント情報の取得","Prefectワークフローの自動化"],"ko":["UUID로 흐름 실행 삭제","배포 정보检索","Prefect 워크플로 자동화"],"es":["Eliminar ejecuciones de flujo por UUID","Recuperar información de implementación","Automatizar la administración de flujos de trabajo de Prefect"],"fr":["Supprimer les exécutions de flux par UUID","Récupérer des informations de déploiement","Automatiser la gestion des flux de travail Prefect"],"de":["Löschen von Flow-Ausführungen nach UUID","Abrufen von Bereitstellungsinformationen","Automatisieren der Prefect-Workflow-Verwaltung"],"pt":["Excluir execuções de fluxo por UUID","Recuperar informações de implantação","Automatizar gerenciamento de fluxo de trabalho do Prefect"],"ru":["Удаление запусков потока по UUID","Получение информации о развертывании","Автоматизация управления рабочим процессом Prefect"],"ar":["حذف تشغيلات التدفق بواسطة UUID","استرجاع معلومات التوزيع","توفير إدارة تدفق عمل Prefect"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Prefect MCP server setup","Designed for non-interactive use with --no-prompt flag"],"zh":["需要Prefect MCP服务器设置","设计为非交互式使用，使用--no-prompt标志"],"ja":["Prefect MCPサーバーの設定が必要","--no-promptフラグを使用した非対話式での使用を前提として設計"],"ko":["Prefect MCP 서버 설정 필요","--no-prompt 플래그를 사용한 비대화식 사용을 위한 설계"],"es":["Requiere configuración del servidor Prefect MCP","Diseñado para uso no interactivo con la marca --no-prompt"],"fr":["Nécessite la configuration du serveur Prefect MCP","Conçu pour une utilisation non interactive avec le flag --no-prompt"],"de":["Benötigt die Einrichtung des Prefect-MCP-Servers","Für nicht-interaktive Verwendung mit dem Flag --no-prompt konzipiert"],"pt":["Exige configuração do servidor Prefect MCP","Projetado para uso não interativo com a flag --no-prompt"],"ru":["Требует настройки сервера Prefect MCP","Разработан для неинтерактивного использования с флагом --no-prompt"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد خادم Prefect MCP","مصمم للاستخدام غير التفاعلي مع علم --no-prompt"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"3b98f89e79940ef4d7811cfbf3a541531053d3cbeb343c210b37f770b1e49751","qualityScore":40}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('czlonkowski/n8n-skills/n8n-mcp-tools-expert', 'community', 'czlonkowski', 'n8n-skills', 'czlonkowski/n8n-skills', 'n8n-mcp-tools-expert', 0, 0, 40, '2026-03-02T01:56:10.879Z', '2026-03-02T02:08:08.024Z', 'abb7737f1ef3e7087c840b8bb8c1e5315414a7fb503c539c6b117e79852c2114', '{"id":"czlonkowski/n8n-skills/n8n-mcp-tools-expert","name":"n8n-mcp-tools-expert","description":{"zh":"n8n MCP 工具专家为您提供构建无缝 n8n 工作流的解决方案，包括节点发现、配置验证、工作流管理等","ja":"n8n MCP ツールエキスパートは、ノードの検出、構成の検証、ワークフローの管理など、完全な n8n ワークフローを構築するためのソリューションを提供","ko":"n8n MCP 툴 전문가는 노드 검색, 구성 유효성 검사, 워크플로우 관리 등을 포함한 완벽한 n8n 워크플로우 구축을 위한 솔루션을 제공","es":"Guía experta para utilizar herramientas de n8n MCP para crear flujos de trabajo perfectos. Incluye categorías de herramientas y guías detalladas","fr":"Guide expert pour utiliser les outils n8n MCP pour créer des flux de travail parfaits. Inclut des catégories d''outils et des guides détaillés","de":"Experte-Anleitung zur Verwendung von n8n-MCP-Tools für die Erstellung perfekter Workflows. Enthält Toolkategorien und detaillierte Anleitungen","pt":"O n8n-mcp é um conjunto de ferramentas para criar fluxos de trabalho perfeitos. Aprenda a usar as ferramentas de descoberta de nós, validação de configuração e gerenciamento de fluxos de trabalho","ru":"n8n-mcp - это набор инструментов для создания безупречных рабочих процессов. Узнайте, как использовать инструменты обнаружения узлов, проверки конфигурации и управления рабочими процессами","ar":"n8n-mcp هو مجموعة من الأدوات لإنشاء سير عمل مثالية. تعلم كيفية استخدام أدوات اكتشاف العقد، التحقق من الصحة والتكوين وإدارة سير العمل","en":"n8n skillset for Claude Code to build flawless n8n workflows"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"n8n MCP 工具专家 - 构建无缝 n8n 工作流","ja":"n8n MCP ツールエキスパート - 完全な n8n ワークフローを構築","ko":"n8n MCP 툴 전문가 - 완벽한 n8n 워크플로우 구축","es":"Herramientas de n8n MCP: Guía experta para flujos de trabajo","fr":"Outils n8n MCP : Guide expert pour les flux de travail","de":"n8n-MCP-Tools: Experte-Anleitung für Workflows","pt":"Ferramentas n8n-mcp: Guia de Especialista","ru":"n8n-mcp инструменты: Руководство эксперта","ar":"أدوات n8n-mcp: دليل الخبير","en":"n8n-mcp-tools-expert"},"description":{"zh":"n8n MCP 工具专家为您提供构建无缝 n8n 工作流的解决方案，包括节点发现、配置验证、工作流管理等","ja":"n8n MCP ツールエキスパートは、ノードの検出、構成の検証、ワークフローの管理など、完全な n8n ワークフローを構築するためのソリューションを提供","ko":"n8n MCP 툴 전문가는 노드 검색, 구성 유효성 검사, 워크플로우 관리 등을 포함한 완벽한 n8n 워크플로우 구축을 위한 솔루션을 제공","es":"Guía experta para utilizar herramientas de n8n MCP para crear flujos de trabajo perfectos. Incluye categorías de herramientas y guías detalladas","fr":"Guide expert pour utiliser les outils n8n MCP pour créer des flux de travail parfaits. Inclut des catégories d''outils et des guides détaillés","de":"Experte-Anleitung zur Verwendung von n8n-MCP-Tools für die Erstellung perfekter Workflows. Enthält Toolkategorien und detaillierte Anleitungen","pt":"O n8n-mcp é um conjunto de ferramentas para criar fluxos de trabalho perfeitos. Aprenda a usar as ferramentas de descoberta de nós, validação de configuração...","ru":"n8n-mcp - это набор инструментов для создания безупречных рабочих процессов. Узнайте, как использовать инструменты обнаружения узлов, проверки конфигурации и...","ar":"n8n-mcp هو مجموعة من الأدوات لإنشاء سير عمل مثالية. تعلم كيفية استخدام أدوات اكتشاف العقد، التحقق من الصحة والتكوين وإدارة سير العمل","en":"n8n skillset for Claude Code to build flawless n8n workflows"},"definition":{"en":"n8n skillset for Claude Code to build flawless n8n workflows"},"features":{"zh":["节点发现","配置验证","工作流管理","模板库","文档和指南"],"ja":["ノードの検出","構成の検証","ワークフローの管理","テンプレートライブラリ","ドキュメントとガイド"],"ko":["노드 검색","구성 유효성 검사","워크플로우 관리","템플릿 라이브러리","문서 및 가이드"],"es":["Descubrimiento de nodos","Validación de configuración","Gestión de flujos de trabajo","Biblioteca de plantillas","Documentación y guías"],"fr":["Découverte de nœuds","Validation de configuration","Gestion de flux de travail","Bibliothèque de modèles","Documentation et guides"],"de":["Knoten-Entdeckung","Konfigurations-Validierung","Workflow-Management","Vorlagen-Bibliothek","Dokumentation und Anleitungen"],"pt":["Descoberta de nós","Validação de configuração","Gerenciamento de fluxos de trabalho","Biblioteca de modelos","Documentação e guias"],"ru":["Обнаружение узлов","Проверка конфигурации","Управление рабочими процессами","Библиотека шаблонов","Документация и руководства"],"ar":["اكتشاف العقد","التحقق من الصحة والتكوين","إدارة سير العمل","مكتبة النماذج","التعليمات والدليل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["n8n","MCP","工作流","节点发现","配置验证","工作流管理","模板库"],"ja":["n8n","MCP","ワークフロー","ノードの検出","構成の検証","ワークフローの管理","テンプレートライブラリ"],"ko":["n8n","MCP","워크플로우","노드 검색","구성 유효성 검사","워크플로우 관리","템플릿 라이브러리"],"es":["n8n MCP","flujos de trabajo","herramientas de desarrollo","automatización de procesos","integración de sistemas","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["n8n MCP","flux de travail","outils de développement","automatisation de processus","intégration de systèmes","développement de logiciels"],"de":["n8n-MCP","Workflows","Entwicklungstools","Prozessautomatisierung","Systemintegration","Software-Entwicklung"],"pt":["n8n-mcp","ferramentas de fluxo de trabalho","servidor MCP","automatização de tarefas","desenvolvimento de software","integração de sistemas"],"ru":["n8n-mcp","инструменты рабочего процесса","сервер MCP","автоматизация задач","разработка программного обеспечения","интеграция систем"],"ar":["n8n-mcp","أدوات سير العمل","خادم MCP","تأتمتة المهام","تطوير البرمجيات","التكامل بين الأنظمة"]}},"owner":"czlonkowski","repo":"n8n-skills","repoPath":"czlonkowski/n8n-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.879Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"n8n-mcp-tools-expert","description":"Expert guide for using n8n-mcp MCP tools effectively. Use when searching for nodes, validating configurations, accessing templates, managing workflows, or using any n8n-mcp tool. Provides tool selection guidance, parameter formats, and common patterns.","bodyPreview":"# n8n MCP Tools Expert\n\nMaster guide for using n8n-mcp MCP server tools to build workflows.\n\n---\n\n## Tool Categories\n\nn8n-mcp provides tools organized into categories:\n\n1. **Node Discovery** → [SEARCH_GUIDE.md](SEARCH_GUIDE.md)\n2. **Configuration Validation** → [VALIDATION_GUIDE.md](VALIDATION_GUIDE.md)\n3. **Workflow Management** → [WORKFLOW_GUIDE.md](WORKFLOW_GUIDE.md)\n4. **Template Library** - Search and deploy 2,700+ real workflows\n5. **Documentation & Guides** - Tool docs, AI agent guide, Co","body":"# n8n MCP Tools Expert\n\nMaster guide for using n8n-mcp MCP server tools to build workflows.\n\n---\n\n## Tool Categories\n\nn8n-mcp provides tools organized into categories:\n\n1. **Node Discovery** → [SEARCH_GUIDE.md](SEARCH_GUIDE.md)\n2. **Configuration Validation** → [VALIDATION_GUIDE.md](VALIDATION_GUIDE.md)\n3. **Workflow Management** → [WORKFLOW_GUIDE.md](WORKFLOW_GUIDE.md)\n4. **Template Library** - Search and deploy 2,700+ real workflows\n5. **Documentation & Guides** - Tool docs, AI agent guide, Code node guides\n\n---\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Most Used Tools (by success rate)\n\n| Tool | Use When | Speed |\n|------|----------|-------|\n| `search_nodes` | Finding nodes by keyword | <20ms |\n| `get_node` | Understanding node operations (detail=\"standard\") | <10ms |\n| `validate_node` | Checking configurations (mode=\"full\") | <100ms |\n| `n8n_create_workflow` | Creating workflows | 100-500ms |\n| `n8n_update_partial_workflow` | Editing workflows (MOST USED!) | 50-200ms |\n| `validate_workflow` | Checking complete workflow | 100-500ms |\n| `n8n_deploy_template` | Deploy template to n8n instance | 200-500ms |\n\n---\n\n## Tool Selection Guide\n\n### Finding the Right Node\n\n**Workflow**:\n```\n1. search_nodes({query: \"keyword\"})\n2. get_node({nodeType: \"nodes-base.name\"})\n3. [Optional] get_node({nodeType: \"nodes-base.name\", mode: \"docs\"})\n```\n\n**Example**:\n```javascript\n// Step 1: Search\nsearch_nodes({query: \"slack\"})\n// Returns: nodes-base.slack\n\n// Step 2: Get details\nget_node({nodeType: \"nodes-base.slack\"})\n// Returns: operations, properties, examples (standard detail)\n\n// Step 3: Get readable documentation\nget_node({nodeType: \"nodes-base.slack\", mode: \"docs\"})\n// Returns: markdown documentation\n```\n\n**Common pattern**: search → get_node (18s average)\n\n### Validating Configuration\n\n**Workflow**:\n```\n1. validate_node({nodeType, config: {}, mode: \"minimal\"}) - Check required fields\n2. validate_node({nodeType, config, profile: \"runtime\"}) - Full validation\n3. [Repeat] Fix errors, validate again\n```\n\n**Common pattern**: validate → fix → validate (23s thinking, 58s fixing per cycle)\n\n### Managing Workflows\n\n**Workflow**:\n```\n1. n8n_create_workflow({name, nodes, connections})\n2. n8n_validate_workflow({id})\n3. n8n_update_partial_workflow({id, operations: [...]})\n4. n8n_validate_workflow({id}) again\n5. n8n_update_partial_workflow({id, operations: [{type: \"activateWorkflow\"}]})\n```\n\n**Common pattern**: iterative updates (56s average between edits)\n\n---\n\n## Critical: nodeType Formats\n\n**Two different formats** for different tools!\n\n### Format 1: Search/Validate Tools\n```javascript\n// Use SHORT prefix\n\"nodes-base.slack\"\n\"nodes-base.httpRequest\"\n\"nodes-base.webhook\"\n\"nodes-langchain.agent\"\n```\n\n**Tools that use this**:\n- search_nodes (returns this format)\n- get_node\n- validate_node\n- validate_workflow\n\n### Format 2: Workflow Tools\n```javascript\n// Use FULL prefix\n\"n8n-nodes-base.slack\"\n\"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest\"\n\"n8n-nodes-base.webhook\"\n\"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent\"\n```\n\n**Tools that use this**:\n- n8n_create_workflow\n- n8n_update_partial_workflow\n\n### Conversion\n\n```javascript\n// search_nodes returns BOTH formats\n{\n  \"nodeType\": \"nodes-base.slack\",          // For search/validate tools\n  \"workflowNodeType\": \"n8n-nodes-base.slack\"  // For workflow tools\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Common Mistakes\n\n### Mistake 1: Wrong nodeType Format\n\n**Problem**: \"Node not found\" error\n\n```javascript\n// WRONG\nget_node({nodeType: \"slack\"})  // Missing prefix\nget_node({nodeType: \"n8n-nodes-base.slack\"})  // Wrong prefix\n\n// CORRECT\nget_node({nodeType: \"nodes-base.slack\"})\n```\n\n### Mistake 2: Using detail=\"full\" by Default\n\n**Problem**: Huge payload, slower response, token waste\n\n```javascript\n// WRONG - Returns 3-8K tokens, use sparingly\nget_node({nodeType: \"nodes-base.slack\", detail: \"full\"})\n\n// CORRECT - Returns 1-2K tokens, covers 95% of use cases\nget_node({nodeType: \"nodes-base.slack\"})  // detail=\"standard\" is default\nget_node({nodeType: \"nodes-base.slack\", detail: \"standard\"})\n```\n\n**When to use detail=\"full\"**:\n- Debugging complex configuration issues\n- Need complete property schema with all nested options\n- Exploring advanced features\n\n**Better alternatives**:\n1. `get_node({detail: \"standard\"})` - for operations list (default)\n2. `get_node({mode: \"docs\"})` - for readable documentation\n3. `get_node({mode: \"search_properties\", propertyQuery: \"auth\"})` - for specific property\n\n### Mistake 3: Not Using Validation Profiles\n\n**Problem**: Too many false positives OR missing real errors\n\n**Profiles**:\n- `minimal` - Only required fields (fast, permissive)\n- `runtime` - Values + types (recommended for pre-deployment)\n- `ai-friendly` - Reduce false positives (for AI configuration)\n- `strict` - Maximum validation (for production)\n\n```javascript\n// WRONG - Uses default profile\nvalidate_node({nodeType, config})\n\n// CORRECT - Explicit profile\nvalidate_node({nodeType, config, profile: \"runtime\"})\n```\n\n### Mistake 4: Ignoring Auto-Sanitization\n\n**What happens**: ALL nodes sanitized on ANY workflow update\n\n**Auto-fixes**:\n- Binary operators (equals, contains) → removes singleValue\n- Unary operators (isEmpty, isNotEmpty) → adds singleValue: true\n- IF/Switch nodes → adds missing metadata\n\n**Cannot fix**:\n- Broken connections\n- Branch count mismatches\n- Paradoxical corrupt states\n\n```javascript\n// After ANY update, auto-sanitization runs on ALL nodes\nn8n_update_partial_workflow({id, operations: [...]})\n// → Automatically fixes operator structures\n```\n\n### Mistake 5: Not Using Smart Parameters\n\n**Problem**: Complex sourceIndex calculations for multi-output nodes\n\n**Old way** (manual):\n```javascript\n// IF node connection\n{\n  type: \"addConnection\",\n  source: \"IF\",\n  target: \"Handler\",\n  sourceIndex: 0  // Which output? Hard to remember!\n}\n```\n\n**New way** (smart parameters):\n```javascript\n// IF node - semantic branch names\n{\n  type: \"addConnection\",\n  source: \"IF\",\n  target: \"True Handler\",\n  branch: \"true\"  // Clear and readable!\n}\n\n{\n  type: \"addConnection\",\n  source: \"IF\",\n  target: \"False Handler\",\n  branch: \"false\"\n}\n\n// Switch node - semantic case numbers\n{\n  type: \"addConnection\",\n  source: \"Switch\",\n  target: \"Handler A\",\n  case: 0\n}\n```\n\n### Mistake 6: Not Using intent Parameter\n\n**Problem**: Less helpful tool responses\n\n```javascript\n// WRONG - No context for response\nn8n_update_partial_workflow({\n  id: \"abc\",\n  operations: [{type: \"addNode\", node: {...}}]\n})\n\n// CORRECT - Better AI responses\nn8n_update_partial_workflow({\n  id: \"abc\",\n  intent: \"Add error handling for API failures\",\n  operations: [{type: \"addNode\", node: {...}}]\n})\n```\n\n---\n\n## Tool Usage Patterns\n\n### Pattern 1: Node Discovery (Most Common)\n\n**Common workflow**: 18s average between steps\n\n```javascript\n// Step 1: Search (fast!)\nconst results = await search_nodes({\n  query: \"slack\",\n  mode: \"OR\",  // Default: any word matches\n  limit: 20\n});\n// → Returns: nodes-base.slack, nodes-base.slackTrigger\n\n// Step 2: Get details (~18s later, user reviewing results)\nconst details = await get_node({\n  nodeType: \"nodes-base.slack\",\n  includeExamples: true  // Get real template configs\n});\n// → Returns: operations, properties, metadata\n```\n\n### Pattern 2: Validation Loop\n\n**Typical cycle**: 23s thinking, 58s fixing\n\n```javascript\n// Step 1: Validate\nconst result = await validate_node({\n  nodeType: \"nodes-base.slack\",\n  config: {\n    resource: \"channel\",\n    operation: \"create\"\n  },\n  profile: \"runtime\"\n});\n\n// Step 2: Check errors (~23s thinking)\nif (!result.valid) {\n  console.log(result.errors);  // \"Missing required field: name\"\n}\n\n// Step 3: Fix config (~58s fixing)\nconfig.name = \"general\";\n\n// Step 4: Validate again\nawait validate_node({...});  // Repeat until clean\n```\n\n### Pattern 3: Workflow Editing\n\n**Most used update tool**: 99.0% success rate, 56s average between edits\n\n```javascript\n// Iterative workflow building (NOT one-shot!)\n// Edit 1\nawait n8n_update_partial_workflow({\n  id: \"workflow-id\",\n  intent: \"Add webhook trigger\",\n  operations: [{type: \"addNode\", node: {...}}]\n});\n\n// ~56s later...\n\n// Edit 2\nawait n8n_update_partial_workflow({\n  id: \"workflow-id\",\n  intent: \"Connect webhook to processor\",\n  operations: [{type: \"addConnection\", source: \"...\", target: \"...\"}]\n});\n\n// ~56s later...\n\n// Edit 3 (validation)\nawait n8n_validate_workflow({id: \"workflow-id\"});\n\n// Ready? Activate!\nawait n8n_update_partial_workflow({\n  id: \"workflow-id\",\n  intent: \"Activate workflow for production\",\n  operations: [{type: \"activateWorkflow\"}]\n});\n```\n\n---\n\n## Detailed Guides\n\n### Node Discovery Tools\nSee [SEARCH_GUIDE.md](SEARCH_GUIDE.md) for:\n- search_nodes\n- get_node with detail levels (minimal, standard, full)\n- get_node modes (info, docs, search_properties, versions)\n\n### Validation Tools\nSee [VALIDATION_GUIDE.md](VALIDATION_GUIDE.md) for:\n- Validation profiles explained\n- validate_node with modes (minimal, full)\n- validate_workflow complete structure\n- Auto-sanitization system\n- Handling validation errors\n\n### Workflow Management\nSee [WORKFLOW_GUIDE.md](WORKFLOW_GUIDE.md) for:\n- n8n_create_workflow\n- n8n_update_partial_workflow (17 operation types!)\n- Smart parameters (branch, case)\n- AI connection types (8 types)\n- Workflow activation (activateWorkflow/deactivateWorkflow)\n- n8n_deploy_template\n- n8n_workflow_versions\n\n---\n\n## Template Usage\n\n### Search Templates\n\n```javascript\n// Search by keyword (default mode)\nsearch_templates({\n  query: \"webhook slack\",\n  limit: 20\n});\n\n// Search by node types\nsearch_templates({\n  searchMode: \"by_nodes\",\n  nodeTypes: [\"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest\", \"n8n-nodes-base.slack\"]\n});\n\n// Search by task type\nsearch_templates({\n  searchMode: \"by_task\",\n  task: \"webhook_processing\"\n});\n\n// Search by metadata (complexity, setup time)\nsearch_templates({\n  searchMode: \"by_metadata\",\n  complexity: \"simple\",\n  maxSetupMinutes: 15\n});\n```\n\n### Get Template Details\n\n```javascript\nget_template({\n  templateId: 2947,\n  mode: \"structure\"  // nodes+connections only\n});\n\nget_template({\n  templateId: 2947,\n  mode: \"full\"  // complete workflow JSON\n});\n```\n\n### Deploy Template Directly\n\n```javascript\n// Deploy template to your n8n instance\nn8n_deploy_template({\n  templateId: 2947,\n  name: \"My Weather to Slack\",  // Custom name (optional)\n  autoFix: true,  // Auto-fix common issues (default)\n  autoUpgradeVersions: true  // Upgrade node versions (default)\n});\n// Returns: workflow ID, required credentials, fixes applied\n```\n\n---\n\n## Self-Help Tools\n\n### Get Tool Documentation\n\n```javascript\n// Overview of all tools\ntools_documentation()\n\n// Specific tool details\ntools_documentation({\n  topic: \"search_nodes\",\n  depth: \"full\"\n})\n\n// Code node guides\ntools_documentation({topic: \"javascript_code_node_guide\", depth: \"full\"})\ntools_documentation({topic: \"python_code_node_guide\", depth: \"full\"})\n```\n\n### AI Agent Guide\n\n```javascript\n// Comprehensive AI workflow guide\nai_agents_guide()\n// Returns: Architecture, connections, tools, validation, best practices\n```\n\n### Health Check\n\n```javascript\n// Quick health check\nn8n_health_check()\n\n// Detailed diagnostics\nn8n_health_check({mode: \"diagnostic\"})\n// → Returns: status, env vars, tool status, API connectivity\n```\n\n---\n\n## Tool Availability\n\n**Always Available** (no n8n API needed):\n- search_nodes, get_node\n- validate_node, validate_workflow\n- search_templates, get_template\n- tools_documentation, ai_agents_guide\n\n**Requires n8n API** (N8N_API_URL + N8N_API_KEY):\n- n8n_create_workflow\n- n8n_update_partial_workflow\n- n8n_validate_workflow (by ID)\n- n8n_list_workflows, n8n_get_workflow\n- n8n_test_workflow\n- n8n_executions\n- n8n_deploy_template\n- n8n_workflow_versions\n- n8n_autofix_workflow\n\nIf API tools unavailable, use templates and validation-only workflows.\n\n---\n\n## Unified Tool Reference\n\n### get_node (Unified Node Information)\n\n**Detail Levels** (mode=\"info\", default):\n- `minimal` (~200 tokens) - Basic metadata only\n- `standard` (~1-2K tokens) - Essential properties + operations (RECOMMENDED)\n- `full` (~3-8K tokens) - Complete schema (use sparingly)\n\n**Operation Modes**:\n- `info` (default) - Node schema with detail level\n- `docs` - Readable markdown documentation\n- `search_properties` - Find specific properties (use with propertyQuery)\n- `versions` - List all versions with breaking changes\n- `compare` - Compare two versions\n- `breaking` - Show only breaking changes\n- `migrations` - Show auto-migratable changes\n\n```javascript\n// Standard (recommended)\nget_node({nodeType: \"nodes-base.httpRequest\"})\n\n// Get documentation\nget_node({nodeType: \"nodes-base.webhook\", mode: \"docs\"})\n\n// Search for properties\nget_node({nodeType: \"nodes-base.httpRequest\", mode: \"search_properties\", propertyQuery: \"auth\"})\n\n// Check versions\nget_node({nodeType: \"nodes-base.executeWorkflow\", mode: \"versions\"})\n```\n\n### validate_node (Unified Validation)\n\n**Modes**:\n- `full` (default) - Comprehensive validation with errors/warnings/suggestions\n- `minimal` - Quick required fields check only\n\n**Profiles** (for mode=\"full\"):\n- `minimal` - Very lenient\n- `runtime` - Standard (default, recommended)\n- `ai-friendly` - Balanced for AI workflows\n- `strict` - Most thorough (production)\n\n```javascript\n// Full validation with runtime profile\nvalidate_node({nodeType: \"nodes-base.slack\", config: {...}, profile: \"runtime\"})\n\n// Quick required fields check\nvalidate_node({nodeType: \"nodes-base.webhook\", config: {}, mode: \"minimal\"})\n```\n\n---\n\n## Performance Characteristics\n\n| Tool | Response Time | Payload Size |\n|------|---------------|--------------|\n| search_nodes | <20ms | Small |\n| get_node (standard) | <10ms | ~1-2KB |\n| get_node (full) | <100ms | 3-8KB |\n| validate_node (minimal) | <50ms | Small |\n| validate_node (full) | <100ms | Medium |\n| validate_workflow | 100-500ms | Medium |\n| n8n_create_workflow | 100-500ms | Medium |\n| n8n_update_partial_workflow | 50-200ms | Small |\n| n8n_deploy_template | 200-500ms | Medium |\n\n---\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Do\n- Use `get_node({detail: \"standard\"})` for most use cases\n- Specify validation profile explicitly (`profile: \"runtime\"`)\n- Use smart parameters (`branch`, `case`) for clarity\n- Include `intent` parameter in workflow updates\n- Follow search → get_node → validate workflow\n- Iterate workflows (avg 56s between edits)\n- Validate after every significant change\n- Use `includeExamples: true` for real configs\n- Use `n8n_deploy_template` for quick starts\n\n### Don''t\n- Use `detail: \"full\"` unless necessary (wastes tokens)\n- Forget nodeType prefix (`nodes-base.*`)\n- Skip validation profiles\n- Try to build workflows in one shot (iterate!)\n- Ignore auto-sanitization behavior\n- Use full prefix (`n8n-nodes-base.*`) with search/validate tools\n- Forget to activate workflows after building\n\n---\n\n## Summary\n\n**Most Important**:\n1. Use **get_node** with `detail: \"standard\"` (default) - covers 95% of use cases\n2. nodeType formats differ: `nodes-base.*` (search/validate) vs `n8n-nodes-base.*` (workflows)\n3. Specify **validation profiles** (`runtime` recommended)\n4. Use **smart parameters** (`branch=\"true\"`, `case=0`)\n5. Include **intent parameter** in workflow updates\n6. **Auto-sanitization** runs on ALL nodes during updates\n7. Workflows can be **activated via API** (`activateWorkflow` operation)\n8. Workflows are built **iteratively** (56s avg between edits)\n\n**Common Workflow**:\n1. search_nodes → find node\n2. get_node → understand config\n3. validate_node → check config\n4. n8n_create_workflow → build\n5. n8n_validate_workflow → verify\n6. n8n_update_partial_workflow → iterate\n7. activateWorkflow → go live!\n\nFor details, see:\n- [SEARCH_GUIDE.md](SEARCH_GUIDE.md) - Node discovery\n- [VALIDATION_GUIDE.md](VALIDATION_GUIDE.md) - Configuration validation\n- [WORKFLOW_GUIDE.md](WORKFLOW_GUIDE.md) - Workflow management\n\n---\n\n**Related Skills**:\n- n8n Expression Syntax - Write expressions in workflow fields\n- n8n Workflow Patterns - Architectural patterns from templates\n- n8n Validation Expert - Interpret validation errors\n- n8n Node Configuration - Operation-specific requirements\n- n8n Code JavaScript - Write JavaScript in Code nodes\n- n8n Code Python - Write Python in Code nodes\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:08:08.024Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Workflow Automation Agents needing advanced n8n workflow management capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级n8n工作流管理功能的工作流自动化代理。","ja":"n8nワークフローの高度な管理機能を必要とするワークフローオートメーションエージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 n8n 워크플로 관리 기능이 필요한 워크플로 자동화 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Automatización de Flujo de Trabajo que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de gestión de flujo de trabajo n8n.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''automatisation de flux de travail nécessitant des capacités avancées de gestion de flux de travail n8n.","de":"Perfekt für Workflow-Automatisierungsagenten, die erweiterte n8n-Workflow-Managementfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Automação de Fluxo de Trabalho que precisam de capacidades avançadas de gerenciamento de fluxo de trabalho n8n.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов автоматизации рабочих процессов, требующих передовых возможностей управления рабочим процессом n8n.","ar":"مثالي للعملاء آليين لتنفيذ سير العمل الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة لإدارة سير العمل n8n."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build flawless n8n workflows using Node Discovery, Configuration Validation, and Workflow Management tools, while leveraging a vast Template Library of 2,700+ real workflows and extensive documentation.","zh":"能够使代理构建完美的n8n工作流，使用节点发现、配置验证和工作流管理工具，同时利用2,700+个真实工作流和大量文档的模板库。","ja":"エージェントがノードの検出、設定の検証、ワークフローの管理ツールを使用して、完璧なn8nワークフローを構築できるようにします。また、2,700以上の実際のワークフローと大量のドキュメントからなるテンプレートライブラリを活用します。","ko":"에이전트가 노드 검색, 구성 유효성 검사 및 워크플로우 관리 도구를 사용하여 완벽한 n8n 워크플로우를 구축할 수 있도록 하며, 2,700개 이상의 실제 워크플로우와大量의 문서가 포함된 템플릿 라이브러리를 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear flujos de trabajo n8n impecables utilizando la herramienta de Descubrimiento de Nodos, Validación de Configuración y herramientas de Gestión de Flujo de Trabajo, aprovechando una vasta Biblioteca de Plantillas de 2,700+ flujos de trabajo reales y una extensa documentación.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des flux de travail n8n sans faille en utilisant l''outil de découverte de nœuds, la validation de configuration et les outils de gestion de flux de travail, tout en exploitant une vaste bibliothèque de modèles de 2 700+ flux de travail réels et une documentation extensive.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, fehlerfreie n8n-Workflows mit Hilfe der Node-Erkennung, Konfigurationsvalidierung und Workflow-Management-Tools zu erstellen, während sie auf eine umfangreiche Vorlagenbibliothek mit 2.700+ realen Workflows und einer ausführlichen Dokumentation zurückgreifen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar fluxos de trabalho n8n impecáveis usando a Descoberta de Nós, Validação de Configuração e Ferramentas de Gerenciamento de Fluxo de Trabalho, aproveitando uma vasta Biblioteca de Modelos de 2.700+ fluxos de trabalho reais e documentação extensa.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать безупречные рабочие процессы n8n, используя Обнаружение узлов, Валидацию конфигурации и Инструменты управления рабочим процессом, а также использует обширную библиотеку шаблонов из 2 700+ реальных рабочих процессов и подробную документацию.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء سير عمل n8n متكامل باستخدام اكتشاف العقد والتحقق من صحة التهيئة وأدوات إدارة سير العمل، مع الاستفادة من مكتبة قوالب واسعة تضم أكثر من 2,700 سير عمل حقيقي وتوثيق موسّع."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating workflow configuration validation","Generating workflows from predefined templates","Debugging n8n workflows using MCP server tools"],"zh":["自动化工作流配置验证","从预定义模板生成工作流","使用MCP服务器工具调试n8n工作流"],"ja":["ワークフローの設定検証の自動化","予め定義されたテンプレートからワークフローを生成する","MCPサーバーツールを使用してn8nワークフローをデバッグする"],"ko":["워크플로우 구성 유효성 검사의 자동화","사전 정의된 템플릿에서 워크플로우 생성","MCP 서버 도구를 사용하여 n8n 워크플로우 디버깅"],"es":["Automatización de la validación de configuración del flujo de trabajo","Generación de flujos de trabajo a partir de plantillas predefinidas","Depuración de flujos de trabajo n8n utilizando herramientas del servidor MCP"],"fr":["Automatisation de la validation de configuration du flux de travail","Génération de flux de travail à partir de modèles prédéfinis","Débogage de flux de travail n8n en utilisant les outils du serveur MCP"],"de":["Automatisierung der Konfigurationsvalidierung des Workflows","Erstellung von Workflows aus vordefinierten Vorlagen","Fehlerbehebung von n8n-Workflows unter Verwendung von MCP-Server-Tools"],"pt":["Automação da validação de configuração do fluxo de trabalho","Geração de fluxos de trabalho a partir de modelos predefinidos","Depuração de fluxos de trabalho n8n usando ferramentas do servidor MCP"],"ru":["Автоматизация проверки конфигурации рабочего процесса","Генерация рабочих процессов из предопределенных шаблонов","Отладка рабочих процессов n8n с помощью инструментов сервера MCP"],"ar":["أتمتة التحقق من صحة تهيئة سير العمل","إنشاء سير العمل من القوالب المحددة مسبقًا","تصحيح سير العمل n8n باستخدام أدوات خادم MCP"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires n8n-mcp MCP server setup","Limited to n8n workflow automation"],"zh":["需要n8n-mcp MCP服务器设置","仅限n8n工作流自动化"],"ja":["n8n-mcp MCPサーバーの設定が必要","n8nワークフローの自動化のみ"],"ko":["n8n-mcp MCP 서버 설정이 필요","n8n 워크플로우 자동화만 지원"],"es":["Requiere configuración del servidor MCP n8n-mcp","Limitado a la automatización del flujo de trabajo n8n"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration du serveur MCP n8n-mcp","Limité à l''automatisation du flux de travail n8n"],"de":["Erfordert n8n-mcp-MCP-Server-Setup","Begrenzt auf n8n-Workflow-Automatisierung"],"pt":["Requer configuração do servidor MCP n8n-mcp","Limitado à automação de fluxo de trabalho n8n"],"ru":["Требуется настройка сервера MCP n8n-mcp","Ограничен автоматизацией рабочего процесса n8n"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد خادم MCP n8n-mcp","محدود بالتحكم الآلي في سير العمل n8n"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"abb7737f1ef3e7087c840b8bb8c1e5315414a7fb503c539c6b117e79852c2114","qualityScore":40}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('openclaw/openclaw/coding-agent', 'community', 'openclaw', 'openclaw', 'openclaw/openclaw', 'coding-agent', 0, 0, 40, '2026-03-02T01:56:10.885Z', '2026-03-02T02:09:02.611Z', '98e98a9e1a09f45bb596fb8399c7bcb508a3cca13e6b8f1a70a9ff9d410a69c1', '{"id":"openclaw/openclaw/coding-agent","name":"coding-agent","description":{"zh":"您的个人AI助手，支持任何操作系统和平台。通过Lobster Way实现AI代理工具的便捷使用","ja":"Any OS、Any Platformで動作する個人用AIアシスタント。Lobster WayでAIエージェントをご利用いただけます","ko":"개인용 AI 도구로 모든 운영 체제와 플랫폼에서 작동합니다. Lobster Way를 통해 AI 에이전트를 쉽게 사용하십시오","es":"El agente de codificación AI es un asistente personal para desarrolladores, compatible con cualquier sistema operativo y plataforma","fr":"L''agent de codage IA est un assistant personnel pour les développeurs, compatible avec tout système d''exploitation et plateforme","de":"Der AI-Coding-Agent ist ein persönlicher Assistent für Entwickler, kompatibel mit jedem Betriebssystem und jeder Plattform","pt":"O Agente de Codificação AI é um assistente pessoal para desenvolvedores, permitindo codificar em qualquer OS e plataforma","ru":"ИИ Агент - личный помощник для разработчиков, позволяющий кодировать на любой ОС и платформе","ar":"وكيل الترميز الذكي هو مساعد شخصي للمطورين، يسمح بالترميز على أي نظام تشغيل ومنصة","en":"Your own personal AI assistant. Any OS. Any Platform. The lobster way. 🦞 "},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI代理工具 - 个人AI助手","ja":"AIエージェント - Lobster Way","ko":"AI 에이전트 - 개인용 AI 도구","es":"Agente de codificación AI: Asistente personal","fr":"Agent de codage IA: Assistant personnel","de":"AI-Coding-Agent: Persönlicher Assistent","pt":"Agente de Codificação AI: Assistente Pessoal","ru":"ИИ Агент: Личный Помощник для Кодирования","ar":"وكيل الترميز الذكي: مساعد شخصي","en":"coding-agent"},"description":{"zh":"您的个人AI助手，支持任何操作系统和平台。通过Lobster Way实现AI代理工具的便捷使用","ja":"Any OS、Any Platformで動作する個人用AIアシスタント。Lobster WayでAIエージェントをご利用いただけます","ko":"개인용 AI 도구로 모든 운영 체제와 플랫폼에서 작동합니다. Lobster Way를 통해 AI 에이전트를 쉽게 사용하십시오","es":"El agente de codificación AI es un asistente personal para desarrolladores, compatible con cualquier sistema operativo y plataforma","fr":"L''agent de codage IA est un assistant personnel pour les développeurs, compatible avec tout système d''exploitation et plateforme","de":"Der AI-Coding-Agent ist ein persönlicher Assistent für Entwickler, kompatibel mit jedem Betriebssystem und jeder Plattform","pt":"O Agente de Codificação AI é um assistente pessoal para desenvolvedores, permitindo codificar em qualquer OS e plataforma","ru":"ИИ Агент - личный помощник для разработчиков, позволяющий кодировать на любой ОС и платформе","ar":"وكيل الترميز الذكي هو مساعد شخصي للمطورين، يسمح بالترميز على أي نظام تشغيل ومنصة","en":"Your own personal AI assistant. Any OS. Any Platform. The lobster way. 🦞 "},"definition":{"en":"Your own personal AI assistant. Any OS. Any Platform. The lobster way. 🦞 "},"features":{"zh":["支持任何操作系统和平台","个人AI助手","Lobster Way集成","跨平台兼容性","易于使用的界面"],"ja":["Any OS、Any Platformに対応","個人用AIアシスタント","Lobster Wayとの統合","クロスプラットフォームの互換性","使いやすいインターフェース"],"ko":["모든 운영 체제와 플랫폼 지원","개인용 AI 도구","Lobster Way 통합","크로스 플랫폼 호환성","사용자 친화적 인터페이스"],"es":["Compatibilidad con cualquier sistema operativo","Soporte para múltiples plataformas","Asistencia personalizada para desarrolladores","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo populares","Capacidades de codificación avanzadas"],"fr":["Compatibilité avec tout système d''exploitation","Prise en charge de plusieurs plateformes","Assistant personnel pour les développeurs","Intégration avec des outils de développement populaires","Capacités de codage avancées"],"de":["Kompatibilität mit jedem Betriebssystem","Unterstützung für mehrere Plattformen","Persönlicher Assistent für Entwickler","Integration mit beliebten Entwicklungstools","Erweiterte Codierungsfähigkeiten"],"pt":["Compatível com qualquer OS","Suporte a múltiplas plataformas","Codificação personalizada","Integração com ferramentas de desenvolvimento","Suporte a linguagens de programação populares"],"ru":["Поддерживает любую ОС","Работает на любой платформе","Персональное кодирование","Интеграция с инструментами разработки","Поддержка популярных языков программирования"],"ar":["متوافق مع أي نظام تشغيل","دعم لمختلف المنصات","ترميز مخصص","التكامل مع أدوات التطوير","دعم للغات البرمجة الشائعة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI代理工具","个人AI助手","Lobster Way","AI工具安装","AI代理工具教程","如何使用AI代理工具","AI代理工具替代品","AI工具与AI代理工具的区别"],"ja":["AIエージェント","個人用AIアシスタント","Lobster Way","AIツールのインストール","AIエージェントのチュートリアル","AIエージェントの使い方","AIエージェントの代替","AIツールとAIエージェントの違い"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","개인용 AI 도구","Lobster Way","AI 도구 설치","AI 에이전트 가이드","AI 에이전트 사용법","AI 에이전트 대안","AI 도구와 AI 에이전트의 차이점"],"es":["agente de codificación AI","herramientas de inteligencia artificial","desarrollo de software","codificación asistida","agente de codificación para desarrolladores","cómo usar agente de codificación AI","alternativas a agente de codificación AI","agente de codificación AI vs otros agentes"],"fr":["agent de codage IA","outils d''intelligence artificielle","développement de logiciels","codage assisté","agent de codage pour développeurs","comment utiliser agent de codage IA","alternatives à agent de codage IA","agent de codage IA vs autres agents"],"de":["AI-Coding-Agent","Werkzeuge der künstlichen Intelligenz","Software-Entwicklung","assistierte Codierung","AI-Coding-Agent für Entwickler","wie man AI-Coding-Agent verwendet","Alternativen zu AI-Coding-Agent","AI-Coding-Agent vs andere Agenten"],"pt":["como usar agente de codificação ai","o que é agente de codificação ai","agente de codificação ai alternativa","agente de codificação ai vs competitor","instalar agente de codificação ai","guia de configuração do agente de codificação ai","desenvolvimento de software com agente de codificação ai"],"ru":["как использовать ИИ агент","что такое ИИ агент","ИИ агент альтернатива","ИИ агент vs конкурент","установить ИИ агент","руководство по настройке ИИ агента","разработка программного обеспечения с ИИ агентом"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام وكيل الترميز الذكي","ما هو وكيل الترميز الذكي","وكيل الترميز الذكي بديل","وكيل الترميز الذكي مقابل منافس","تثبيت وكيل الترميز الذكي","دليل إعداد وكيل الترميز الذكي","تطوير البرمجيات مع وكيل الترميز الذكي"]}},"owner":"openclaw","repo":"openclaw","repoPath":"openclaw/openclaw","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.885Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"coding-agent","description":"Delegate coding tasks to Codex, Claude Code, or Pi agents via background process. Use when: (1) building/creating new features or apps, (2) reviewing PRs (spawn in temp dir), (3) refactoring large codebases, (4) iterative coding that needs file exploration. NOT for: simple one-liner fixes (just edit), reading code (use read tool), thread-bound ACP harness requests in chat (for example spawn/run Codex or Claude Code in a Discord thread; use sessions_spawn with runtime:acp), or any work in ~/clawd workspace (never spawn agents here). Requires a bash tool that supports pty:true.","bodyPreview":"# Coding Agent (bash-first)\n\nUse **bash** (with optional background mode) for all coding agent work. Simple and effective.\n\n## ⚠️ PTY Mode Required!\n\nCoding agents (Codex, Claude Code, Pi) are **interactive terminal applications** that need a pseudo-terminal (PTY) to work correctly. Without PTY, you''ll get broken output, missing colors, or the agent may hang.\n\n**Always use `pty:true`** when running coding agents:\n\n```bash\n# ✅ Correct - with PTY\nbash pty:true command:\"codex exec ''Your prompt''\"\n\n#","body":"# Coding Agent (bash-first)\n\nUse **bash** (with optional background mode) for all coding agent work. Simple and effective.\n\n## ⚠️ PTY Mode Required!\n\nCoding agents (Codex, Claude Code, Pi) are **interactive terminal applications** that need a pseudo-terminal (PTY) to work correctly. Without PTY, you''ll get broken output, missing colors, or the agent may hang.\n\n**Always use `pty:true`** when running coding agents:\n\n```bash\n# ✅ Correct - with PTY\nbash pty:true command:\"codex exec ''Your prompt''\"\n\n# ❌ Wrong - no PTY, agent may break\nbash command:\"codex exec ''Your prompt''\"\n```\n\n### Bash Tool Parameters\n\n| Parameter    | Type    | Description                                                                 |\n| ------------ | ------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `command`    | string  | The shell command to run                                                    |\n| `pty`        | boolean | **Use for coding agents!** Allocates a pseudo-terminal for interactive CLIs |\n| `workdir`    | string  | Working directory (agent sees only this folder''s context)                   |\n| `background` | boolean | Run in background, returns sessionId for monitoring                         |\n| `timeout`    | number  | Timeout in seconds (kills process on expiry)                                |\n| `elevated`   | boolean | Run on host instead of sandbox (if allowed)                                 |\n\n### Process Tool Actions (for background sessions)\n\n| Action      | Description                                          |\n| ----------- | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n| `list`      | List all running/recent sessions                     |\n| `poll`      | Check if session is still running                    |\n| `log`       | Get session output (with optional offset/limit)      |\n| `write`     | Send raw data to stdin                               |\n| `submit`    | Send data + newline (like typing and pressing Enter) |\n| `send-keys` | Send key tokens or hex bytes                         |\n| `paste`     | Paste text (with optional bracketed mode)            |\n| `kill`      | Terminate the session                                |\n\n---\n\n## Quick Start: One-Shot Tasks\n\nFor quick prompts/chats, create a temp git repo and run:\n\n```bash\n# Quick chat (Codex needs a git repo!)\nSCRATCH=$(mktemp -d) && cd $SCRATCH && git init && codex exec \"Your prompt here\"\n\n# Or in a real project - with PTY!\nbash pty:true workdir:~/Projects/myproject command:\"codex exec ''Add error handling to the API calls''\"\n```\n\n**Why git init?** Codex refuses to run outside a trusted git directory. Creating a temp repo solves this for scratch work.\n\n---\n\n## The Pattern: workdir + background + pty\n\nFor longer tasks, use background mode with PTY:\n\n```bash\n# Start agent in target directory (with PTY!)\nbash pty:true workdir:~/project background:true command:\"codex exec --full-auto ''Build a snake game''\"\n# Returns sessionId for tracking\n\n# Monitor progress\nprocess action:log sessionId:XXX\n\n# Check if done\nprocess action:poll sessionId:XXX\n\n# Send input (if agent asks a question)\nprocess action:write sessionId:XXX data:\"y\"\n\n# Submit with Enter (like typing \"yes\" and pressing Enter)\nprocess action:submit sessionId:XXX data:\"yes\"\n\n# Kill if needed\nprocess action:kill sessionId:XXX\n```\n\n**Why workdir matters:** Agent wakes up in a focused directory, doesn''t wander off reading unrelated files (like your soul.md 😅).\n\n---\n\n## Codex CLI\n\n**Model:** `gpt-5.2-codex` is the default (set in ~/.codex/config.toml)\n\n### Flags\n\n| Flag            | Effect                                             |\n| --------------- | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| `exec \"prompt\"` | One-shot execution, exits when done                |\n| `--full-auto`   | Sandboxed but auto-approves in workspace           |\n| `--yolo`        | NO sandbox, NO approvals (fastest, most dangerous) |\n\n### Building/Creating\n\n```bash\n# Quick one-shot (auto-approves) - remember PTY!\nbash pty:true workdir:~/project command:\"codex exec --full-auto ''Build a dark mode toggle''\"\n\n# Background for longer work\nbash pty:true workdir:~/project background:true command:\"codex --yolo ''Refactor the auth module''\"\n```\n\n### Reviewing PRs\n\n**⚠️ CRITICAL: Never review PRs in OpenClaw''s own project folder!**\nClone to temp folder or use git worktree.\n\n```bash\n# Clone to temp for safe review\nREVIEW_DIR=$(mktemp -d)\ngit clone https://github.com/user/repo.git $REVIEW_DIR\ncd $REVIEW_DIR && gh pr checkout 130\nbash pty:true workdir:$REVIEW_DIR command:\"codex review --base origin/main\"\n# Clean up after: trash $REVIEW_DIR\n\n# Or use git worktree (keeps main intact)\ngit worktree add /tmp/pr-130-review pr-130-branch\nbash pty:true workdir:/tmp/pr-130-review command:\"codex review --base main\"\n```\n\n### Batch PR Reviews (parallel army!)\n\n```bash\n# Fetch all PR refs first\ngit fetch origin ''+refs/pull/*/head:refs/remotes/origin/pr/*''\n\n# Deploy the army - one Codex per PR (all with PTY!)\nbash pty:true workdir:~/project background:true command:\"codex exec ''Review PR #86. git diff origin/main...origin/pr/86''\"\nbash pty:true workdir:~/project background:true command:\"codex exec ''Review PR #87. git diff origin/main...origin/pr/87''\"\n\n# Monitor all\nprocess action:list\n\n# Post results to GitHub\ngh pr comment <PR#> --body \"<review content>\"\n```\n\n---\n\n## Claude Code\n\n```bash\n# With PTY for proper terminal output\nbash pty:true workdir:~/project command:\"claude ''Your task''\"\n\n# Background\nbash pty:true workdir:~/project background:true command:\"claude ''Your task''\"\n```\n\n---\n\n## OpenCode\n\n```bash\nbash pty:true workdir:~/project command:\"opencode run ''Your task''\"\n```\n\n---\n\n## Pi Coding Agent\n\n```bash\n# Install: npm install -g @mariozechner/pi-coding-agent\nbash pty:true workdir:~/project command:\"pi ''Your task''\"\n\n# Non-interactive mode (PTY still recommended)\nbash pty:true command:\"pi -p ''Summarize src/''\"\n\n# Different provider/model\nbash pty:true command:\"pi --provider openai --model gpt-4o-mini -p ''Your task''\"\n```\n\n**Note:** Pi now has Anthropic prompt caching enabled (PR #584, merged Jan 2026)!\n\n---\n\n## Parallel Issue Fixing with git worktrees\n\nFor fixing multiple issues in parallel, use git worktrees:\n\n```bash\n# 1. Create worktrees for each issue\ngit worktree add -b fix/issue-78 /tmp/issue-78 main\ngit worktree add -b fix/issue-99 /tmp/issue-99 main\n\n# 2. Launch Codex in each (background + PTY!)\nbash pty:true workdir:/tmp/issue-78 background:true command:\"pnpm install && codex --yolo ''Fix issue #78: <description>. Commit and push.''\"\nbash pty:true workdir:/tmp/issue-99 background:true command:\"pnpm install && codex --yolo ''Fix issue #99 from the approved ticket summary. Implement only the in-scope edits and commit after review.''\"\n\n# 3. Monitor progress\nprocess action:list\nprocess action:log sessionId:XXX\n\n# 4. Create PRs after fixes\ncd /tmp/issue-78 && git push -u origin fix/issue-78\ngh pr create --repo user/repo --head fix/issue-78 --title \"fix: ...\" --body \"...\"\n\n# 5. Cleanup\ngit worktree remove /tmp/issue-78\ngit worktree remove /tmp/issue-99\n```\n\n---\n\n## ⚠️ Rules\n\n1. **Always use pty:true** - coding agents need a terminal!\n2. **Respect tool choice** - if user asks for Codex, use Codex.\n   - Orchestrator mode: do NOT hand-code patches yourself.\n   - If an agent fails/hangs, respawn it or ask the user for direction, but don''t silently take over.\n3. **Be patient** - don''t kill sessions because they''re \"slow\"\n4. **Monitor with process:log** - check progress without interfering\n5. **--full-auto for building** - auto-approves changes\n6. **vanilla for reviewing** - no special flags needed\n7. **Parallel is OK** - run many Codex processes at once for batch work\n8. **NEVER start Codex in ~/.openclaw/** - it''ll read your soul docs and get weird ideas about the org chart!\n9. **NEVER checkout branches in ~/Projects/openclaw/** - that''s the LIVE OpenClaw instance!\n\n---\n\n## Progress Updates (Critical)\n\nWhen you spawn coding agents in the background, keep the user in the loop.\n\n- Send 1 short message when you start (what''s running + where).\n- Then only update again when something changes:\n  - a milestone completes (build finished, tests passed)\n  - the agent asks a question / needs input\n  - you hit an error or need user action\n  - the agent finishes (include what changed + where)\n- If you kill a session, immediately say you killed it and why.\n\nThis prevents the user from seeing only \"Agent failed before reply\" and having no idea what happened.\n\n---\n\n## Auto-Notify on Completion\n\nFor long-running background tasks, append a wake trigger to your prompt so OpenClaw gets notified immediately when the agent finishes (instead of waiting for the next heartbeat):\n\n```\n... your task here.\n\nWhen completely finished, run this command to notify me:\nopenclaw system event --text \"Done: [brief summary of what was built]\" --mode now\n```\n\n**Example:**\n\n```bash\nbash pty:true workdir:~/project background:true command:\"codex --yolo exec ''Build a REST API for todos.\n\nWhen completely finished, run: openclaw system event --text \\\"Done: Built todos REST API with CRUD endpoints\\\" --mode now''\"\n```\n\nThis triggers an immediate wake event — Skippy gets pinged in seconds, not 10 minutes.\n\n---\n\n## Learnings (Jan 2026)\n\n- **PTY is essential:** Coding agents are interactive terminal apps. Without `pty:true`, output breaks or agent hangs.\n- **Git repo required:** Codex won''t run outside a git directory. Use `mktemp -d && git init` for scratch work.\n- **exec is your friend:** `codex exec \"prompt\"` runs and exits cleanly - perfect for one-shots.\n- **submit vs write:** Use `submit` to send input + Enter, `write` for raw data without newline.\n- **Sass works:** Codex responds well to playful prompts. Asked it to write a haiku about being second fiddle to a space lobster, got: _\"Second chair, I code / Space lobster sets the tempo / Keys glow, I follow\"_ 🦞\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:09:02.611Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Coding Agents like Codex, Claude Code, and Pi requiring interactive terminal applications with pseudo-terminal support","zh":"适用于像 Codex、Claude Code 和 Pi 这样的编码代理，需要交互式终端应用程序并支持伪终端","ja":"Codex、Claude Code、Pi などのコーディングエージェントに適しています。インタラクティブなターミナルアプリケーションと疑似端末サポートが必要です","ko":"코덱스, 클로드 코드, 파이와 같은 코딩 에이전트에 적합합니다. 상호 작용 터미널 응용 프로그램 및 가상 터미널 지원이 필요합니다","es":"Ideal para agentes de codificación como Codex, Claude Code y Pi que requieren aplicaciones de terminal interactivas con soporte de pseudo-terminal","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de codage tels que Codex, Claude Code et Pi nécessitant des applications de terminal interactif avec prise en charge du pseudo-terminal","de":"Ideal für Codierungsagenten wie Codex, Claude Code und Pi, die interaktive Terminalanwendungen mit Pseudo-Terminal-Unterstützung erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Codificação como Codex, Claude Code e Pi que exigem aplicações de terminal interativas com suporte a pseudo-terminal","ru":"Идеально подходит для Кодировочных Агентов, таких как Codex, Claude Code и Pi, требующих интерактивных терминальных приложений с поддержкой псевдотерминала","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء البرمجيون مثل Codex و Claude Code و Pi الذين يتطلبون تطبيقات طرفية تفاعلية مع دعم طرفية وهمية"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to execute commands in bash with optional background mode, utilizing pseudo-terminals for correct output and color rendering, and supports PTY mode for seamless interaction","zh":"赋予代理在 bash 中执行命令的能力，具有可选的后台模式，利用伪终端实现正确的输出和颜色渲染，并支持 PTY 模式以实现无缝交互","ja":"エージェントにbashでコマンドを実行する能力を与え、オプションのバックグラウンドモードを提供し、疑似端末を使用して正しい出力と色のレンダリングを行い、シームレスなインタラクションのためのPTYモードをサポートします","ko":"에이전트가 배시에서 명령을 실행할 수 있는 기능을 제공하며, 선택적 백그라운드 모드, 가상 터미널을 사용한 올바른 출력 및 색상 렌더링, 무선 상호 작용을 위한 PTY 모드 지원","es":"Permite a los agentes ejecutar comandos en bash con modo de fondo opcional, utilizando pseudo-terminales para una salida correcta y renderizado de colores, y admite el modo PTY para una interacción sin problemas","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter des commandes dans bash avec un mode d''arrière-plan facultatif, en utilisant des pseudo-terminaux pour une sortie correcte et un rendu de couleurs, et prend en charge le mode PTY pour une interaction transparente","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Befehle in bash mit optionaler Hintergrundmodus auszuführen, wobei Pseudo-Terminals für korrekte Ausgabe und Farbdarstellung verwendet werden, und unterstützt den PTY-Modus für eine nahtlose Interaktion","pt":"Habilita os agentes a executar comandos em bash com modo de segundo plano opcional, utilizando pseudo-terminais para saída correta e renderização de cores, e suporta o modo PTY para interação sem problemas","ru":"Позволяет агентам выполнять команды в bash с опциональным фоновым режимом, используя псевдотерминалы для правильного вывода и цветового рендеринга, и поддерживает режим PTY для бесшовного взаимодействия","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء تشغيل أوامر في bash مع وضع الخلفية الإختياري، باستخدام طرفيات وهمية للخروج الصحيح وتحويل الألوان، ودعم وضع PTY للتفاعل السلس"},"useCases":{"en":["Executing complex bash scripts","Debugging coding agent interactions","Running coding agents like Codex with PTY support"],"zh":["执行复杂的 bash 脚本","调试编码代理交互","使用 PTY 支持运行编码代理如 Codex"],"ja":["複雑なbashスクリプトの実行","コーディングエージェントの相互作用のデバッグ","PTYサポートを使用したコーディングエージェントの実行、たとえばCodex"],"ko":["복잡한 배시 스크립트 실행","코딩 에이전트 상호 작용 디버깅","PTY 지원을 사용하여 코딩 에이전트 실행, 예를 들어 코덱스"],"es":["Ejecutar scripts de bash complejos","Depurar interacciones de agentes de codificación","Ejecutar agentes de codificación como Codex con soporte PTY"],"fr":["Exécuter des scripts bash complexes","Déboguer les interactions des agents de codage","Exécuter des agents de codage comme Codex avec prise en charge PTY"],"de":["Komplexe bash-Skripte ausführen","Interaktionen von Codierungsagenten debuggen","Codierungsagenten wie Codex mit PTY-Unterstützung ausführen"],"pt":["Execução de scripts bash complexos","Depuração de interações de agente de codificação","Execução de agentes de codificação como Codex com suporte PTY"],"ru":["Выполнение сложных скриптов bash","Отладка взаимодействия кодировочных агентов","Выполнение кодировочных агентов, таких как Codex, с поддержкой PTY"],"ar":["تشغيل نصوص برمجة bash معقدة","تصحيح أخطاء تفاعلات وكلاء البرمجة","تشغيل وكلاء برمجة مثل Codex مع دعم PTY"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires PTY mode enabled","Bash environment required"],"zh":["需要启用 PTY 模式","需要 bash 环境"],"ja":["PTYモードを有効にする必要があります","bash環境が必要です"],"ko":["PTY 모드를 활성화해야 함","배시 환경이 필요함"],"es":["Requiere el modo PTY habilitado","Entorno de bash requerido"],"fr":["Nécessite le mode PTY activé","Environnement bash requis"],"de":["Benötigt den aktivierten PTY-Modus","Bash-Umgebung erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer modo PTY habilitado","Ambiente bash necessário"],"ru":["Требуется включенный режим PTY","Требуется среда bash"],"ar":["يتطلب وضع PTY مفعل","بيئة bash مطلوبة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"98e98a9e1a09f45bb596fb8399c7bcb508a3cca13e6b8f1a70a9ff9d410a69c1","qualityScore":40}');
