ras ferramentas","instalar Thoroughness","guias de configuração para Thoroughness","desenvolvimento de aplicativos com Thoroughness"],"ru":["инструменты кодирования ИИ Агентов","как использовать Thoroughness","что такое Thoroughness","Thoroughness vs другие инструменты","установить Thoroughness","руководства по настройке для Thoroughness","разработка приложений с Thoroughness"],"ar":["أدوات الترميز الإلكتروني للأجنتات الذكية","كيفية استخدام Thoroughness","ما هو Thoroughness","Thoroughness مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت Thoroughness","دلائل إعداد Thoroughness","تطوير التطبيقات باستخدام Thoroughness"]}},"owner":"pr-pm","repo":"prpm","repoPath":"pr-pm/prpm","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.898Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"thoroughness","description":"Use when implementing complex multi-step tasks, fixing critical bugs, or when quality and completeness matter more than speed - ensures comprehensive implementation without shortcuts through systematic analysis, implementation, and verification phases","bodyPreview":"# Thoroughness\n\n## Purpose\nThis skill ensures comprehensive, complete implementation of complex tasks without shortcuts. Use this when quality and completeness matter more than speed.\n\n## When to Use\n- Fixing critical bugs or compilation errors\n- Implementing complex multi-step features\n- Debugging test failures\n- Refactoring large codebases\n- Production deployments\n- Any task where shortcuts could cause future problems\n\n## Methodology\n\n### Phase 1: Comprehensive Analysis (20% of time)\n1. **Iden","body":"# Thoroughness\n\n## Purpose\nThis skill ensures comprehensive, complete implementation of complex tasks without shortcuts. Use this when quality and completeness matter more than speed.\n\n## When to Use\n- Fixing critical bugs or compilation errors\n- Implementing complex multi-step features\n- Debugging test failures\n- Refactoring large codebases\n- Production deployments\n- Any task where shortcuts could cause future problems\n\n## Methodology\n\n### Phase 1: Comprehensive Analysis (20% of time)\n1. **Identify All Issues**\n   - List every error, warning, and failing test\n   - Group related issues together\n   - Prioritize by dependency order\n   - Create issue hierarchy (what blocks what)\n\n2. **Root Cause Analysis**\n   - Don''t fix symptoms, find root causes\n   - Trace errors to their source\n   - Identify patterns in failures\n   - Document assumptions that were wrong\n\n3. **Create Detailed Plan**\n   - Break down into atomic steps\n   - Estimate time for each step\n   - Identify dependencies between steps\n   - Plan verification for each step\n   - Schedule breaks/checkpoints\n\n### Phase 2: Systematic Implementation (60% of time)\n1. **Fix Issues in Dependency Order**\n   - Start with foundational issues\n   - Fix one thing completely before moving on\n   - Test after each fix\n   - Document what was changed and why\n\n2. **Verify Each Fix**\n   - Write/run tests for the specific fix\n   - Check for side effects\n   - Verify related functionality still works\n   - Document test results\n\n3. **Track Progress**\n   - Mark issues as completed\n   - Update plan with new discoveries\n   - Adjust time estimates\n   - Note any blockers immediately\n\n### Phase 3: Comprehensive Verification (20% of time)\n1. **Run All Tests**\n   - Unit tests\n   - Integration tests\n   - E2E tests\n   - Manual verification\n\n2. **Cross-Check Everything**\n   - Review all changed files\n   - Verify compilation succeeds\n   - Check for console errors/warnings\n   - Test edge cases\n\n3. **Documentation**\n   - Update relevant docs\n   - Add inline comments for complex fixes\n   - Document known limitations\n   - Create issues for future work\n\n## Anti-Patterns to Avoid\n- ❌ Fixing multiple unrelated issues at once\n- ❌ Moving on before verifying a fix works\n- ❌ Assuming similar errors have the same cause\n- ❌ Skipping test writing \"to save time\"\n- ❌ Copy-pasting solutions without understanding\n- ❌ Ignoring warnings \"because it compiles\"\n- ❌ Making changes without reading existing code first\n\n## Quality Checkpoints\n- [ ] Can I explain why this fix works?\n- [ ] Have I tested this specific change?\n- [ ] Are there any side effects?\n- [ ] Is this the root cause or a symptom?\n- [ ] Will this prevent similar issues in the future?\n- [ ] Is the code readable and maintainable?\n- [ ] Have I documented non-obvious decisions?\n\n## Example Workflow\n\n### Bad Approach (Shortcut-Driven)\n```\n1. See 24 TypeScript errors\n2. Add @ts-ignore to all of them\n3. Hope tests pass\n4. Move on\n```\n\n### Good Approach (Thoroughness-Driven)\n```\n1. List all 24 errors systematically\n2. Group by error type (7 missing types, 10 unknown casts, 7 property access)\n3. Find root causes:\n   - Missing @types/tar package\n   - No type assertions on fetch responses\n   - Implicit any types in callbacks\n4. Fix by category:\n   - Install @types/tar (fixes 7 errors)\n   - Add proper type assertions to registry-client.ts (fixes 10 errors)\n   - Add explicit parameter types (fixes 7 errors)\n5. Test after each category\n6. Run full test suite\n7. Document what was learned\n```\n\n## Time Investment\n- Initial: 2-3x slower than shortcuts\n- Long-term: 10x faster (no debugging later, no rework)\n- Quality: Near-perfect first time\n- Maintenance: Minimal\n\n## Success Metrics\n- ✅ 100% of tests passing\n- ✅ Zero warnings in production build\n- ✅ All code has test coverage\n- ✅ Documentation is complete and accurate\n- ✅ No known issues or TODOs left behind\n- ✅ Future developers can understand the code\n\n## Mantras\n- \"Slow is smooth, smooth is fast\"\n- \"Do it right the first time\"\n- \"Test everything, assume nothing\"\n- \"Document for your future self\"\n- \"Root causes, not symptoms\"\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:11:43.323Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Debugging Agents needing meticulous code review and testing capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要精确代码审查和测试能力的调试代理。","ja":"デバッグエージェントが徹底的なコードレビューとテスト機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"정밀한 코드 리뷰 및 테스트 기능이 필요한 디버깅 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de depuración que necesitan una revisión y pruebas de código minuciosas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de débogage nécessitant une revue et des tests de code minutieux.","de":"Perfekt für Debugging-Agents, die eine sorgfältige Code-Überprüfung und -Testfähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Depuração que necessitam de revisão e teste de código meticulosos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов отладки, требующих тщательного обзора и тестирования кода.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تصحيح الأخطاء الذي يحتاج إلى مراجعة واختبار شديد للرمز البرمجي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to perform exhaustive analysis of complex tasks, ensuring comprehensive implementation without shortcuts, leveraging methodologies like Comprehensive Content Analysis and Phase 1: Comprehensive Analysis for critical bug fixing and production deployments.","zh":"赋予代理执行复杂任务的彻底分析，确保在不采用捷径的情况下实现全面实施，利用全面内容分析和第一阶段：全面分析等方法进行关键的错误修复和生产部署。","ja":"エージェントが複雑なタスクの徹底的な分析を実行できるようにし、ショートカットを使用せずに包括的な実装を確実に行うことを可能にし、包括的なコンテンツ分析や第1段階：包括的な分析などの方法論を使用して重要なバグの修正や生産デプロイを行う。","ko":"에이전트가 복잡한 작업에 대한 철저한 분석을 수행할 수 있도록 하여, 단축기를 사용하지 않고 포괄적인 구현을 보장하고, 포괄적인 콘텐츠 분석 및 1단계: 포괄적인 분석과 같은 방법론을 사용하여 중요한 버그 수정 및 생산 배포를 수행한다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar un análisis exhaustivo de tareas complejas, garantizando una implementación integral sin atajos, aprovechando metodologías como Análisis de Contenido Integral y Fase 1: Análisis Integral para la corrección de errores críticos y despliegues de producción.","fr":"Permet aux agents de réaliser une analyse exhaustive de tâches complexes, assurant une mise en œuvre complète sans raccourcis, en exploitant des méthodologies comme Analyse de Contenu Complet et Phase 1 : Analyse Complète pour la correction de bogues critiques et les déploiements de production.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, eine umfassende Analyse komplexer Aufgaben durchzuführen, wodurch eine umfassende Implementierung ohne Abkürzungen gewährleistet wird, indem Methoden wie Umfassende Inhaltsanalyse und Phase 1: Umfassende Analyse für die Korrektur kritischer Fehler und Produktionsbereitstellungen genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a realizar uma análise exaustiva de tarefas complexas, garantindo uma implementação abrangente sem atalhos, utilizando metodologias como Análise de Conteúdo Abrangente e Fase 1: Análise Abrangente para correção crítica de bugs e implantações de produção.","ru":"Наделяет агентов способностью проводить исчерпывающий анализ сложных задач, обеспечивая полную реализацию без обходных путей, используя методологии như Комплексный Анализ Контента и Фаза 1: Комплексный Анализ для критического исправления ошибок и развертывания в производство.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على إجراء تحليل شامل للمهام المعقدة، مما يضمن تنفيذاً شاملاً بدون أخذ طرق مختصرة، مستخدماً منهجيات مثل تحليل المحتوى الشامل والمرحلة 1: التحليل الشامل لتصحيح الأخطاء الحرجة ونشر الإنتاج."},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging test failures in multi-step features","Refactoring large codebases for quality and completeness","Implementing complex features without compromising future reliability"],"zh":["调试多步骤功能中的测试失败","重构大型代码库以确保质量和完整性","在不损害未来可靠性的情况下实现复杂功能"],"ja":["マルチステップ機能のテスト失敗のデバッグ","品質と完全性のために大規模なコードベースのリファクタリング","将来の信頼性を損なわずに複雑な機能を実装する"],"ko":["다단계 기능의 테스트 실패 디버깅","품질 및 완전성을 위해 대규모 코드베이스 리팩토링","미래의 신뢰성을 손상하지 않고 복잡한 기능을 구현하는"],"es":["Depuración de fallos de prueba en características de varios pasos","Reestructuración de grandes bases de código para calidad y exhaustividad","Implementación de características complejas sin comprometer la fiabilidad futura"],"fr":["Débogage des échecs de test dans les fonctionnalités multi-étapes","Réorganisation de grandes bases de code pour la qualité et l''exhaustivité","Mise en œuvre de fonctionnalités complexes sans compromettre la fiabilité future"],"de":["Fehlerbehebung bei Testfehlern in Funktionen mit mehreren Schritten","Neustrukturierung großer Codebasen für Qualität und Vollständigkeit","Implementierung komplexer Funktionen ohne Kompromisse bei der zukünftigen Zuverlässigkeit"],"pt":["Depuração de falhas de teste em recursos de várias etapas","Reestruturação de grandes bases de código para qualidade e completude","Implementação de recursos complexos sem comprometer a confiabilidade futura"],"ru":["Отладка неудач тестирования в функциях с несколькими шагами","Рефакторинг больших кодовых баз для качества и полноты","Реализация сложных функций без ущерба для будущей надежности"],"ar":["تصحيح أخطاء اختبار الفشل في الميزات متعددة الخطوات","إعادة هيكلة قواعد التعليمات البرمجية الكبيرة لجودة واكتمال","تنفيذ ميزات معقدة دون المساس بالموثوقية المستقبلية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires significant computational resources for exhaustive analysis","May increase development time due to meticulous testing and review"],"zh":["需要大量的计算资源进行彻底的分析","可能由于严格的测试和审查而增加开发时间"],"ja":["徹底的な分析を行うために大量の計算リソースが必要","厳格なテストとレビューにより開発時間が増加する可能性"],"ko":["철저한 분석을 수행하기 위해大量의 계산 리소스가 필요","엄격한 테스트 및 검토로 인해 개발 시간이 증가할 가능성"],"es":["Requiere recursos computacionales significativos para un análisis exhaustivo","Puede aumentar el tiempo de desarrollo debido a las pruebas y revisiones minuciosas"],"fr":["Nécessite des ressources computationnelles significatives pour une analyse exhaustive","Peut augmenter le temps de développement en raison des tests et des revues minutieux"],"de":["Benötigt erhebliche Rechenressourcen für eine umfassende Analyse","Kann die Entwicklungszeit aufgrund der sorgfältigen Tests und Überprüfungen verlängern"],"pt":["Requer recursos computacionais significativos para análise exaustiva","Pode aumentar o tempo de desenvolvimento devido a testes e revisões meticulosos"],"ru":["Требует значительных вычислительных ресурсов для исчерпывающего анализа","Может увеличить время разработки из-за тщательных тестов и обзоров"],"ar":["يتطلب موارد حسابية كبيرة لتحليل شامل","قد يزيد من وقت التطوير بسبب الاختبارات والمراجعات المeticulous"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"431a3d830b5ac4806020aead6a1bfece3929ec5b8cd5a5e106398508ffa0d097","qualityScore":40}');
